ast Night in Soho</td><td>en</td><td>A young girl, passionate about fashion design, is mysteriously able to enter the 1960s where she encounters her idol, a dazzling wannabe singer. But 1960s London is not what it seems, and time seems to be falling apart with shady consequences.</td><td>When the past lets you in, the truth will come out.</td><td>2021-10-21</td><td>/9BzKsxBZNlqyGSpvPFqK9kTJSPV.jpg</td><td>81.785</td><td>2031</td><td>7.5</td><td>4.3E7</td><td>2.2957625E7</td><td>117</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7OcRErUXXdAVAHg6y5cjn56ivtu.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>158015</td><td>The Purge</td><td>The Purge</td><td>en</td><td>Given the country's overcrowded prisons, the U.S. government begins to allow 12-hour periods of time in which all illegal activity is legal. During one of these free-for-alls, a family must protect themselves from a home invasion.</td><td>One night a year, all crime is legal.</td><td>2013-05-31</td><td>/x6hwbnR2nGacSzljqYaXY25w1Me.jpg</td><td>81.585</td><td>7386</td><td>6.3</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>8.9328627E7</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9J3HHP3kQ5ZStyirJyWPWtvvrHY.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>256322</td><td>The Purge Collection</td></tr><tr><td>396422</td><td>Annabelle: Creation</td><td>Annabelle: Creation</td><td>en</td><td>Several years after the tragic death of their little girl, a doll maker and his wife welcome a nun and several girls from a shuttered orphanage into their home, soon becoming the target of the doll maker's possessed creation—Annabelle.</td><td>You don't know the real story</td><td>2017-08-03</td><td>/snYI6TDLkB8wL7SHFyBV6qkJuPx.jpg</td><td>81.021</td><td>4859</td><td>6.6</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>3.06515884E8</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/o8u0NyEigCEaZHBdCYTRfXR8U4i.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>402074</td><td>Annabelle Collection</td></tr><tr><td>754934</td><td>Son</td><td>Son</td><td>en</td><td>When a young boy contracts a mysterious illness, his mother must decide how far she will go to protect him from terrifying forces in her past.</td><td>You can't outrun a family secret.</td><td>2021-03-18</td><td>/4fl6EdtMp6p0RKJgESdFti1J3dC.jpg</td><td>80.972</td><td>206</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ele7aCoLBYKagh3LSS6qGTGdyCi.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>786300</td><td>Tentacles</td><td>Tentacles</td><td>en</td><td>A young Los Angeles couple Tara and Sam fall head over heels into a new romance, entwining their lives—until their intimacy transforms into something terrifying.</td><td>How well do you know the one you love?</td><td>2021-02-12</td><td>/rRfcH0jg9X8czKJhXCnny45NSWt.jpg</td><td>78.121</td><td>90</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iID0at69rWzZOIarUIFrfDOFJA.jpg</td><td>Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>57084</td><td>Satánico pandemonium: la sexorcista</td><td>Satanic Pandemonium</td><td>es</td><td>Sister Maria is known in the convent for her good works and charity, but, in the secret depths of her sexual fantasies, she is tormented by visions of another world - a world where her forbidden passions are allowed to run free. In this world Satan is her master. As her acts of violence and blasphemy mount, Maria realizes that she has been chosen by the Devil to destroy the convent and lead her sister nuns into hell!</td><td>From bride of Christ to slave of Satan!</td><td>1975-06-26</td><td>/k6LZn3greNmaYhySVnwUkkDmlpo.jpg</td><td>77.918</td><td>55</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xAX7sJncIG9ZS8mgbjlw3sildpO.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>636879</td><td>A Nun's Curse</td><td>A Nun's Curse</td><td>en</td><td>A group of travelers are forced to seek shelter inside an abandoned jail where a notorious nun named Sister Monday had once been assigned and was suspected of murdering prisoners.</td><td>She will PREY for you!</td><td>2020-05-12</td><td>/eutNRwSguV0NCx7BNAXOibWzjP6.jpg</td><td>77.424</td><td>93</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>73</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/edXuLjxjYu1SkyMHd55hRasME8b.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>6537</td><td>El orfanato</td><td>The Orphanage</td><td>es</td><td>A woman brings her family back to her childhood home, which used to be an orphanage, intent on reopening it. Before long, her son starts to communicate with a new invisible friend.</td><td>A tale of love.  A story of horror.</td><td>2007-05-20</td><td>/vIpi1KtHLXUOfSVC2m6MqpjSPgL.jpg</td><td>76.355</td><td>2442</td><td>7.2</td><td>3400000.0</td><td>7.8638987E7</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ljDBlVJXicjh3TwsECxQwY6Ts3l.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>607383</td><td>Aquaslash</td><td>Aquaslash</td><td>en</td><td>To celebrate their graduation, the teenagers from Valley Hills High School have organized an ’80s-themed party at the old Wet Valley water park. Things turn gruesome when it's revealed that a mysterious maniac has inserted giant razor blades into one of the water slides. The water park thus becomes the backdrop for a bloodbath (literally), and everyone is a suspect...</td><td>Blood is slicker than water</td><td>2019-07-29</td><td>/wB8qqLIaYDkYEnjbS5hAJiTuYU6.jpg</td><td>75.81</td><td>124</td><td>4.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>72</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eqVgQwv8HfDN2tv4XWhqW5GryV4.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>60304</td><td>Hansel & Gretel: Witch Hunters</td><td>Hansel & Gretel: Witch Hunters</td><td>en</td><td>After getting a taste for blood as children, Hansel and Gretel have become the ultimate vigilantes, hell-bent on retribution. Now, unbeknownst to them, Hansel and Gretel have become the hunted, and must face an evil far greater than witches... their past.</td><td>Classic tale. New twist.</td><td>2013-01-17</td><td>/j343Rpj3WeNvP0SV80zveve70io.jpg</td><td>75.4</td><td>6015</td><td>6.0</td><td>5.0E7</td><td>2.26349749E8</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mJSe5dxKu8Sq0GfdjdWVqdGvzfV.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>751237</td><td>Umma</td><td>Umma</td><td>en</td><td>Amanda and her daughter live a quiet life on an American farm, but when the remains of her estranged mother arrive from Korea, Amanda becomes haunted by the fear of turning into her own mother.</td><td>A mother’s love never dies.</td><td>2022-03-18</td><td>/moLnqJmZ00i2opS0bzCVcaGC0iI.jpg</td><td>74.957</td><td>162</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>2118582.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8DHvtmF15wGwkMOW3nqZmpEzEaq.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>565</td><td>The Ring</td><td>The Ring</td><td>en</td><td>Rachel Keller is a journalist investigating a videotape that may have killed four teenagers. There is an urban legend about this tape: the viewer will die seven days after watching it. Rachel tracks down the video... and watches it. Now she has just seven days to unravel the mystery of the Ring so she can save herself and her son.</td><td>Before you die, you see…</td><td>2002-10-18</td><td>/e2t5CKMox7tjv3iD3Ko7NdFa5lJ.jpg</td><td>73.898</td><td>5208</td><td>6.6</td><td>4.8E7</td><td>2.49348933E8</td><td>115</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6TBaTZCq0FdjrXcj9mKdHGpcr2D.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>14563</td><td>The Ring Collection</td></tr><tr><td>55779</td><td>Final Destination 5</td><td>Final Destination 5</td><td>en</td><td>In this fifth installment, Death is just as omnipresent as ever, and is unleashed after one man’s premonition saves a group of coworkers from a terrifying suspension bridge collapse. But this group of unsuspecting souls was never supposed to survive, and, in a terrifying race against time, the ill-fated group frantically tries to discover a way to escape Death’s sinister agenda.</td><td>We all share a common destination.</td><td>2011-08-12</td><td>/Akx1Po4ZLetOWfYJhQf75tbhTtK.jpg</td><td>73.733</td><td>2809</td><td>6.1</td><td>4.7E7</td><td>1.57887643E8</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5cG2XcylxUIclQsGPBKTtfoqcBV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>8864</td><td>Final Destination Collection</td></tr><tr><td>126889</td><td>Alien: Covenant</td><td>Alien: Covenant</td><td>en</td><td>Bound for a remote planet on the far side of the galaxy, the crew of the colony ship 'Covenant' discovers what is thought to be an uncharted paradise, but is actually a dark, dangerous world—which has a sole inhabitant: the 'synthetic', David, survivor of the doomed Prometheus expedition.</td><td>The path to paradise begins in hell.</td><td>2017-05-09</td><td>/zecMELPbU5YMQpC81Z8ImaaXuf9.jpg</td><td>73.672</td><td>7298</td><td>6.1</td><td>9.7E7</td><td>2.40891763E8</td><td>122</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6jajFcaY2YsfGQstJ5HaqZNVseX.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction</td><td>135416</td><td>Prometheus Collection</td></tr><tr><td>49018</td><td>Insidious</td><td>Insidious</td><td>en</td><td>A family discovers that dark spirits have invaded their home after their son inexplicably falls into an endless sleep. When they reach out to a professional for help, they learn things are a lot more personal than they thought.</td><td>It's not the House that's Haunted.</td><td>2010-09-13</td><td>/tmlDFIUpGRKiuWm9Ixc6CYDk4y0.jpg</td><td>73.643</td><td>5689</td><td>6.9</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>9.700915E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bylGn5OC2h3BWfGLYFtIcxlYxLy.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>228446</td><td>Insidious Collection</td></tr><tr><td>440</td><td>Aliens vs Predator: Requiem</td><td>Aliens vs Predator: Requiem</td><td>en</td><td>The iconic creatures from two of the scariest film franchises in movie history wage their most brutal battle ever—in our own backyard. The small town of Gunnison, Colorado becomes a war zone between two of the deadliest extra-terrestrial life forms—the Alien and the Predator. When a Predator scout ship crash-lands in the hills outside the town, Alien Facehuggers and a hybrid Alien/Predator are released and begin to terrorize the town.</td><td>The Last Place On Earth We Want To Be Is In The Middle</td><td>2007-12-25</td><td>/jCyJN1vj8jqJJ0vNw4hDH2KlySO.jpg</td><td>73.039</td><td>2334</td><td>5.1</td><td>4.0E7</td><td>1.30290885E8</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ezIpXeWRd43inL5AOaaBbT4jaf2.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>115762</td><td>AVP Collection</td></tr><tr><td>227348</td><td>Paranormal Activity: The Marked Ones</td><td>Paranormal Activity: The Marked Ones</td><td>en</td><td>Seventeen-year-old Jesse has been hearing terrifying sounds coming from his neighbor’s apartment, but when he turns on his camera and sets out to uncover their source, he encounters an ancient evil that won’t rest until it’s claimed his very soul.</td><td>Once Marked It Is Already Too Late.</td><td>2014-01-01</td><td>/4srdg5SoxREXha5kibwZBvsqNtV.jpg</td><td>73.028</td><td>1235</td><td>5.4</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>8.6362372E7</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eAISoFMi29BVBKH1VRpne4mJ26K.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>41437</td><td>Paranormal Activity Collection</td></tr><tr><td>257445</td><td>Goosebumps</td><td>Goosebumps</td><td>en</td><td>After moving to a small town, Zach Cooper finds a silver lining when he meets next door neighbor Hannah, the daughter of bestselling Goosebumps series author R.L. Stine. When Zach unintentionally unleashes real monsters from their manuscripts and they begin to terrorize the town, it’s suddenly up to Stine, Zach and Hannah to get all of them back in the books where they belong.</td><td>The stories are alive.</td><