n Egor, together with his friends, goes in search, during which it turns out that the nanny is an ancient Slavic demon, popularly known as Baba Yaga.</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-02-27</td><td>/8m5HTXzwewlfXhtZtLlLts53YTW.jpg</td><td>59.92</td><td>187</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rc8WAwoTTZ5HDUDBiKhIohbl57A.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>524251</td><td>I See You</td><td>I See You</td><td>en</td><td>When a 12-year-old boy goes missing, lead investigator Greg Harper struggles to balance the pressure of the investigation and troubles with his wife, Jackie. Facing a recent affair, great strain is put on the family that slowly gnaws away at Jackie's grip on reality. But after a malicious presence manifests itself in their home and puts their son, Connor, in mortal danger, the cold, hard truth about evil in the Harper household is finally uncovered.</td><td>Evil Hides In Plain Sight</td><td>2019-09-11</td><td>/2LwamrHAmxqEHsT9JViFJxT08Ek.jpg</td><td>59.919</td><td>1041</td><td>7.0</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oIJenVsuK42zgfJd8E1hZqId3s5.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24150</td><td>Halloween II</td><td>Halloween II</td><td>en</td><td>Laurie Strode struggles to come to terms with her brother Michael's deadly return to Haddonfield, Illinois. Meanwhile, Michael prepares for another reunion with his sister.</td><td>Family Is Forever</td><td>2009-08-28</td><td>/vSHPM4LQDpWdQrD5KZWK6wNqSOD.jpg</td><td>59.789</td><td>1120</td><td>5.4</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>3.9421467E7</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4UiNo0vUAKLgO9xq1JKYsGQ9avo.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>126209</td><td>Halloween (Rob Zombie Series) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>340382</td><td>進撃の巨人 ATTACK ON TITAN エンド オブ ザ ワールド</td><td>Attack on Titan II: End of the World</td><td>ja</td><td>Eren leaves to restore a break in the wall destroyed by a Titan. He comes under attack by the Titans and is cornered. Shikishima comes to his aid. The titans never stops attacking.  Eren is now injured and tries to protect Armin, but is swallowed by a titan. A Titan with black hair appears and begins to expel the other titans.</td><td>The world is merciless.</td><td>2015-09-01</td><td>/dwsoUEJvDpN00rJJ1bR6DrJ5JjF.jpg</td><td>59.771</td><td>232</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bnuBhHLzsRapDWheh9kwNn6qZnp.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>370411</td><td>Attack on Titan Collection</td></tr><tr><td>16871</td><td>Drag Me to Hell</td><td>Drag Me to Hell</td><td>en</td><td>After denying a woman the extension she needs to keep her home, loan officer Christine Brown sees her once-promising life take a startling turn for the worse. Christine is convinced she's been cursed by a Gypsy, but her boyfriend is skeptical. Her only hope seems to lie in a psychic who claims he can help her lift the curse and keep her soul from being dragged straight to hell.</td><td>Christine Brown has a good job, a great boyfriend, and a bright future. But in three days, she's going to hell.</td><td>2009-03-15</td><td>/oSzWs398C1TYvFvXoA9eEAqPwuX.jpg</td><td>59.708</td><td>3052</td><td>6.4</td><td>3.0E7</td><td>9.0810892E7</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3tvwsRSIDgwJuaGdh67XZ942UMy.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>839440</td><td>Dinosaur Hotel</td><td>Dinosaur Hotel</td><td>en</td><td>Sienna is desperate to win a large cash prize in a secret underground game show. However, Dinosaur's begin to hunt her down for the entertainment of the rich and wealthy. Can she be the last to survive the horrific night to win the prize?</td><td>The hunt is on. And you're the prey.</td><td>2021-06-11</td><td>/qISzj26R3LnsChQcXQKnuyxQQhK.jpg</td><td>59.573</td><td>63</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>77</td><td>Release