o Night</td><td>ja</td><td>Koichi takes care of his sister, who has recently returned from a trip abroad in the United States as she is not well. While caring for her, he records evidence of ghosts in their home.</td><td>The nightmare continue...</td><td>2010-11-20</td><td>/mh7j7XlYWo82UnQGhsxcuyolzp.jpg</td><td>50.297</td><td>360</td><td>6.0</td><td>1350000.0</td><td>4160000.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1S6HTRZ8HwuIM8KVNOaycN5WxwX.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>270303</td><td>It Follows</td><td>It Follows</td><td>en</td><td>When carefree teenager Jay sleeps with her older boyfriend for the first time, she learns that she is the latest recipient of a fatal curse that is passed from victim to victim via sexual intercourse. Death, Jay learns, will creep inexorably toward her as either a friend or a stranger. Jay's friends don't believe her seemingly paranoid ravings, until they too begin to see the phantom assassins and band together to help her defend herself.</td><td>It doesn’t think, it doesn’t feel, it doesn’t give up.</td><td>2014-09-24</td><td>/iwnQ1JH1wdWrGYkgWySptJ5284A.jpg</td><td>50.294</td><td>5456</td><td>6.6</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>1.4674076E7</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/keEWjA5ykLJo851tIBFdmkxPxxh.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>119278</td><td>Smiley</td><td>Smiley</td><td>en</td><td>After learning of an urban legend in which a demented serial killer named SMILEY can be summoned through the internet, mentally fragile Ashley must decide whether she is losing her mind or becoming Smiley's next victim.</td><td>Evil Wears a Smile</td><td>2012-10-12</td><td>/rO8jANmASmul1tWi53mudn1V9IA.jpg</td><td>50.224</td><td>330</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/j6TwiWW0ksLWCc8cRMeKE5Py616.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>347548</td><td>Containment</td><td>Containment</td><td>en</td><td>Neighbors in a block wake one morning to find they have been sealed inside their apartments. Can they work together to find out why? Or will they destroy each other in their fight to escape?</td><td>No water. No power. No explanation. No escape.</td><td>2015-07-09</td><td>/jMyudM6LM9VfIsR8ZRghlSpAdfv.jpg</td><td>50.172</td><td>156</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>77</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xVV8JrQKuHVjBS4CfwIMNktf70G.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11281</td><td>Halloween II</td><td>Halloween II</td><td>en</td><td>After failing to kill stubborn survivor Laurie and taking a bullet or six from former psychiatrist Dr. Sam Loomis, Michael Myers has followed Laurie to the Haddonfield Memorial Hospital, where she's been admitted for Myers' attempt on her life. The institution proves to be particularly suited to serial killers, however, as Myers cuts, stabs and slashes his way through hospital staff to reach his favorite victim.</td><td>The nightmare isn't over!</td><td>1981-10-30</td><td>/xyBX7rFmNB4nM2RBW3042RQPFG2.jpg</td><td>50.085</td><td>1591</td><td>6.5</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>2.5533818E7</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fDhUxDHgjXzLZEzHNgIS75SzaCA.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>91361</td><td>Halloween Collection</td></tr><tr><td>109428</td><td>Evil Dead</td><td>Evil Dead</td><td>en</td><td>Mia, a young woman struggling with sobriety, heads to a remote cabin with a group of friends where the discovery of a Book of the Dead unwittingly summon up dormant demons which possess the youngsters one-by-one.</td><td>The Most Terrifying Film You Will Ever Experience.</td><td>2013-04-05</td><td>/1gDV0Lm9y8ufIKzyf0h0GBgb9Zj.jpg</td><td>49.982</td><td>3758</td><td>6.5</td><td>1.7E7</td><td>9.7542952E7</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/c0rYFlL76pAg6zExn0etOWOofjr.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>1960</td><td>Evil Dead Collection</td></tr><tr><td>779202<