and Stray Bullet loot the local hip-hop mogul's studio to fund their demo album, the threesome unwittingly ends up with the secret of Mack Daddy's success: a magical flute. Their gigs instantly turn golden but a blood-thristy Leprechaun and an angry Mack Daddy are hot on their trail, leaving a wake of destruction tainted by politically incorrect limericks.</td><td>Evil's in the house.</td><td>2000-03-28</td><td>/lCRwtuxnJWkZ04gwtfYF9h1GUkl.jpg</td><td>26.911</td><td>167</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8HgPnuTTsyLNw7oeLFwP79NMfip.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>19285</td><td>Leprechaun Collection</td></tr><tr><td>13510</td><td>Eden Lake</td><td>Eden Lake</td><td>en</td><td>Eden Lake is a relentlessly tense and immaculately paced horror-thriller about modern youth gone wild. When a young couple goes to a remote wooded lake for a romantic getaway, their quiet weekend is shattered by an aggressive group of local kids. Rowdiness quickly turns to rage as the teens terrorize the couple in unimaginable ways, and a weekend outing becomes a bloody battle for survival.</td><td>A weekend by the lake, with views to die for.</td><td>2008-09-12</td><td>/lotoZbXMJxyoxx4AS48bNMp5BjS.jpg</td><td>26.874</td><td>1388</td><td>6.8</td><td>1.285099E7</td><td>3984669.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/s9v1QZMVhwShQ7415jPhtfqzyjG.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>287903</td><td>Krampus</td><td>Krampus</td><td>en</td><td>When his dysfunctional family clashes over the holidays, young Max is disillusioned and turns his back on Christmas.  Little does he know, this lack of festive spirit has unleashed the wrath of Krampus: a demonic force of ancient evil intent on punishing non-believers.</td><td>You don't want to be on his list.</td><td>2015-11-26</td><td>/dxnRNv9GL5tupUoVPE5lT2RdO9q.jpg</td><td>26.847</td><td>1709</td><td>6.1</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>6.1788393E7</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vpip36rKLNonjYAZkJSPxM5RCn8.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>83899</td><td>You're Next</td><td>You're Next</td><td>en</td><td>When the Davison family comes under attack during their wedding anniversary getaway, the gang of mysterious killers soon learns that one of their victims harbors a secret talent for fighting back.</td><td>Did You Remember To Lock Your Door?</td><td>2011-09-10</td><td>/fuVVOSyXW4kFiK6M5zLsDMIjTa1.jpg</td><td>26.774</td><td>2041</td><td>6.6</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>1.4347E7</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/okjEw4GrEqn4seWkvUHIUXogQZD.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>34004</td><td>Children of the Living Dead</td><td>Children of the Living Dead</td><td>en</td><td>Starting a new life in a quiet Pennsylvania town, Matthew Michaels only thought is to turn an old farm property into a profitable car dealership. He soon discovers that beneath the gentle surface, this small town is anything but calm and peaceful.  Firstly, he learns that his new property is located on the site of a graveyard, which all the townsfolk regard as an evil place that must never be visited.  He then discovers that years earlier the town had suffered an infestation of the living dead ...zombies who prey on human flesh. One zombie, the infamous Abbot Hayes, escaped destruction.  As the construction team begin degging, they unleash the thing the townsfolk fear the most, the wrath of Abbot Hayes and the awakening of ... The Children of the Living Dead.</td><td>Thirty years later and they're walking again...</td><td>2001-06-11</td><td>/6TFP297jwagAf7Qa6CIkO2bVxrN.jpg</td><td>26.773</td><td>17</td><td>3.6</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h2dwxFG4UFYjXKSE47VYWCKBr1M.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>306947</td><td>The Invitation</td><td>The Invitation</td><td>en</td><td>Will and his new girlfriend Kira are invited to a dinner with old friends at the house of Will’s ex Eden and her new partner David. Although the evening appears to be relaxed, Will soon gets a creeping suspicion that their charming host David is up to something.</td><td>There is nothing to be afraid of.</td><td>2015-08-05</td><td>/4gxZW8AHg9kIOh5BgaSrq5gO1KB.jpg</td><td>26.766</td><td>2195</td><td>6.5</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>354835.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/y4WHHWMdIPoUrU68qrVb5VMLPU.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>681429</td><td>Cuidado con lo que deseas</td><td>Be Careful What You Wish For</td><td>es</td><td>Pamela is an eight-year-old girl who loves horror movies and fairy tales. When his uncle gives her away a doll named \"Hellequin\" as a birthday gift, a tale of betrayal begins to unfold before her eyes.</td><td>Evil went hunting.</td><td>2020-04-24</td><td>/lG6Wx5tWOEHkOuexEvNYha3ofvM.jpg</td><td>26.742</td><td>102</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2it7SlRcp5UE0G38nL6oLMuqcAx.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11415</td><td>House</td><td>House</td><td>en</td><td>Roger Cobb is an author who has just separated from his wife. He moves into a new house and tries to work on a novel based on his experiences in the Vietnam War. Strange things start happening around him; little things at first, but as they become more frequent, Cobb becomes aware that the house resents his presence.</td><td>Ding dong, You’re dead.</td><td>1986-02-27</td><td>/ysIPmxLVYYvTUaOwEsLjF7nEf4C.jpg</td><td>26.73</td><td>433</td><td>6.1</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>1.9444631E7</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/dQ1NwW8LE4PR8UfLEf8eAQpgTpG.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>102782</td><td>House Collection</td></tr><tr><td>833339</td><td>Speak No Evil</td><td>Speak No Evil</td><td>da</td><td>A Danish family visits a Dutch family they met on a holiday. What was supposed to be an idyllic weekend slowly starts unraveling as the Danes try to stay polite in the face of unpleasantness.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-03-17</td><td>/7tekR9z2DFWJ1ZWfZE0sl3SQf5A.jpg</td><td>26.723</td><td>77</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/akmMZoh4QN2INFwgDiHLo33rFVv.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>277685</td><td>Unfriended</td><td>Unfriended</td><td>en</td><td>While video chatting one night, six high school friends receive a Skype message from a classmate who killed herself exactly one year ago. At first they think it's a prank, but when the girl starts revealing the friends' darkest secrets, they realize they are dealing with something out of this world, something that wants them dead.</td><td>Online, your memories last forever. But so do your mistakes.</td><td>2014-10-22</td><td>/jS2KDUROSaAxBqerik7mopMCG8v.jpg</td><td>26.72</td><td>2994</td><td>5.5</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>6.288209E7</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tv1cMZ3fmVTKH1FiNljjMrCvyz9.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>506355</td><td>Unfriended Collection</td></tr><tr><td>496704</td><td>Tremors: A Cold Day in Hell</td><td>Tremors: A Cold Day in Hell</td><td>en</td><td>Burt Gummer (Michael Gross) and his son Travis Welker (Jamie Kennedy) find themselves up to their ears in Graboids and Ass-Blasters when they head to Canada to investigate a series of deadly giant-worm attacks. Arriving at a remote research facility in the artic tundra, Burt begins to suspect that Graboids are secretly being weaponized, but before he can prove his theory, he is sidelined by Graboid venom. With just 48 hours to live, the only hope is to create an antidote from fresh venom — but to do that, someone will have to figure out how to milk a Graboid!</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-05-01</td><td>/aFOdiHaRjeTmHG67e5B7md2Q1cq.jpg</td><td>26.682</td><td>312</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>9