ow up at her doorstep. She offers them a room and in doing so invites an imaginable evil into her home.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-10-07</td><td>/gJzlCwduziZk8GTXKofWbdaOHe9.jpg</td><td>25.835</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>460885</td><td>Mandy</td><td>Mandy</td><td>en</td><td>The Shadow Mountains, 1983. Red and Mandy lead a loving and peaceful existence; but when their pine-scented haven is savagely destroyed, Red is catapulted into a phantasmagoric journey filled with bloody vengeance and laced with fire.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-09-13</td><td>/m0yf7J7HsKeK6E81SMRcX8vx6mH.jpg</td><td>25.83</td><td>1537</td><td>6.2</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>1214525.0</td><td>122</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vv1l1WzwED9r6ZVUw1xTfvaSiPW.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>755</td><td>From Dusk Till Dawn</td><td>From Dusk Till Dawn</td><td>en</td><td>Seth Gecko and his younger brother Richard are on the run after a bloody bank robbery in Texas. They escape across the border into Mexico and will be home-free the next morning, when they pay off the local kingpin. They just have to survive 'from dusk till dawn' at the rendezvous point, which turns out to be a Hell of a strip joint.</td><td>One night is all that stands between them and freedom. But it's going to be a hell of a night.</td><td>1996-01-19</td><td>/sV3kIAmvJ9tPz4Lq5fuf9LLMxte.jpg</td><td>25.818</td><td>4977</td><td>7.0</td><td>1.9E7</td><td>2.5836616E7</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/phiRQhfwZZeMMn3osvQUmGYmJbp.jpg</td><td>Action, Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>10924</td><td>From Dusk Till Dawn Collection</td></tr><tr><td>9885</td><td>Wolf Creek</td><td>Wolf Creek</td><td>en</td><td>Stranded backpackers in remote Australia fall prey to a murderous bushman, who offers to fix their car, then takes them captive.</td><td>The thrill is in the hunt.</td><td>2005-09-16</td><td>/8NiRpqO3vx7ny6jagrEN61hu7qG.jpg</td><td>25.809</td><td>908</td><td>6.2</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>2.7762648E7</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3EqlGktjkisbJjMnCCBsQf6GCDb.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>268098</td><td>Wolf Creek Collection</td></tr><tr><td>728791</td><td>Playhouse</td><td>Playhouse</td><td>en</td><td>Reckless Jack Travis is an irreverent horror writer notorious for scaring audiences. But as he obsesses over creating a new theatre show set in a haunted Scottish castle, demonic disturbances from deep within the walls begin to prey on his troubled daughter. When the alarming supernatural forces start to close in on him too, Jack is forced to reckon with the terrifying consequences of creating such a dark and macabre play. But will he realise the danger of unearthing a historic curse and stop writing before he damns himself, his personal sanity and those he loves forever?</td><td>Some stories should never be told</td><td>2020-11-17</td><td>/cF4tZH8VQ6Lic3bi4WKwWDJODQf.jpg</td><td>25.754</td><td>24</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uu4L7SR5xpGyZZPIUlxKRTW1CUi.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11026</td><td>Exorcist: The Beginning</td><td>Exorcist: The Beginning</td><td>en</td><td>Having lived through traumatizing events during WWII, Father Lankester Merrin takes a sabbatical from the Church to conduct archaeological excavations in British-administered East Africa. Merrin unearths an ancient Byzantine church believed have been built and then immediately buried to keep down evil from the crypt below. The natives are convinced that uncovering the church has unleashed a demon, and begin to violently clash with the British military troops. As the village rapidly disintegrates into chaos and war, Merrin must face-off with the demon which has taken possession of somebody close to him.</td><td>Go back to where the horror began.</td><td>2004-08-20</td><td>/phXWlfOuTxzOnO96BNZ8CiSJqZk.jpg</td><td>25.745</td><td>621</td><td>5.4</td><td>8.0E7</td><td>7.8000586E7</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hz4Tzv4jac2usrCpMUGJp4akkoK.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>12263</td><td>The Exorcist Collection</td></tr><tr><td>678489</td><td>女鬼橋</td><td>The Bridge Curse</td><td>zh</td><td>Four years after five students mysteriously committed suicide after taking part in a courage test on the ghost bridge in Donghu university, a reporter and a cinematographer are back to that place and try to get everything clear.</td><td>NEVER LOOK BACK</td><td>2020-02-27</td><td>/iUEu2FZLWZlLKoFqifK5o33mBHk.jpg</td><td>25.721</td><td>61</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2sOzZQ1O87z9FTI0zukmWaJaGmH.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>999097</td><td>女鬼橋（系列）</td></tr><tr><td>768</td><td>From Hell</td><td>From Hell</td><td>en</td><td>Frederick Abberline is an opium-huffing inspector from Scotland Yard who falls for one of Jack the Ripper's prostitute targets in this Hughes brothers adaption of a graphic novel that posits the Ripper's true identity.</td><td>Only the legend will survive.</td><td>2001-02-08</td><td>/t2WpWM8nBO4sULXr2bDfNEt4qgr.jpg</td><td>25.656</td><td>2380</td><td>6.7</td><td>3.5E7</td><td>7.4558115E7</td><td>122</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xo2S7gRwCvWdVqM0Swv37yA2rzw.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13885</td><td>Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street</td><td>Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street</td><td>en</td><td>The infamous story of Benjamin Barker, a.k.a Sweeney Todd, who sets up a barber shop down in London which is the basis for a sinister partnership with his fellow tenant, Mrs. Lovett. Based on the hit Broadway musical.</td><td>Never Forget. Never Forgive.</td><td>2007-01-25</td><td>/gAW4J1bkRjZKmFsJsIiOBASeoAp.jpg</td><td>25.646</td><td>5091</td><td>7.2</td><td>5.0E7</td><td>1.52E8</td><td>116</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/obYVvi6eD4rjFeC7g4uoZQPIh7F.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>611489</td><td>Initiation</td><td>Initiation</td><td>en</td><td>During a Whiton University's pledge week, the carefree partying turns deadly when brutal murders start befalling the students, sending Ellery into a race against time to uncover the truth behind the school's dark secrets and the horrifying meaning of a recurring symbol: a single exclamation mark.</td><td>He pledges to hunt you down.</td><td>2020-10-08</td><td>/oT3q1gClsLyDS6kI15FYISy4arw.jpg</td><td>25.637</td><td>91</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4qdalDaJDy6LSBNapxmCc4Wvpls.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9966</td><td>The Messengers</td><td>The Messengers</td><td>en</td><td>When the Solomons trade in the craziness of big-city life for the quiet of a North Dakota farm, little do they expect the nightmare that follows. Soon after arriving, teenage Jess (Kristen Stewart) and her younger brother see terrifying apparitions and endure attacks from a supernatural source. Jess must warn her disbelieving family before it is too late to save them.</td><td>There is evidence to suggest that children are highly susceptible to paranormal phenomena. They see what adults cannot. They believe what adults deny. And they are trying to warn us.</td><td>2007-02-02</td><td>/kLmurNcnkmdPahLc6HKQjX3EHed.jpg</td><td>25.592</td><td>677</td><td>5.7</td><td>1.6E7</td><td>5.5060212E7</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7S6lCJ9ztPUY63mztz0g6toufsj.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>164395</td><td>The Messengers Collection</td></tr><tr><td>37707</td><td>Splice</td><td>Splice</td><td>en</td><td>Elsa and Clive, two young rebellious scientists, defy legal and ethical boundaries and forge ahead with a dangerous experiment: splicing together human and animal DNA to create a new organism. Named \"Dren\", the creature rapidly develops from a deformed female infant into a beautiful but dangerous winged human-chimera, who forges a bond with both of her creators - only to have that bond turn deadly.</td><td>Science's newest miracle...is a mistake.</td><td>2009-10-06</td><td>/4oqaWnO3dKYAt3vZWAD4oLfOXOC.jpg</td><td>25.577</td><td>1825</td><td>5.8</td><td>2.6E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1Qall5wH3teJEYUvf8XZ9eltPvx.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>480105</td><td>47 Meters Down: Uncaged</td><td>47 Meters Down: Uncaged</td><td>en</td><td>Four teenage girls go on a diving adventure to explore a submerged Mayan city. Once inside, their rush of excitement turns into a jolt of terror as they discover the sunken ruins are a hunting ground for deadly great white sharks. With their air supply steadily dwindling, the friends must navigate the underwater labyrinth of claustrophobic caves and eerie tunnels in search of a way out of their watery hell.</td><td>Fear runs deep.</td><td>2019-08-15</td><td>/g4z7mDmJmx23vsVg6XNWcnXb6gc.jpg</td><td>25.522</td><td>1157</td><td>5.7</td><td>1.2E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3uG3aOhEzFCjcQulsJQiAzLSrw8.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Drama, Horror</td><td>635922</td><td>47 Meters Down Collection</td></tr><tr><td>1577</td><td>Resident Evil: Apocalypse</td><td>Resident Evil: Apocalypse</td><td>en</td><td>As the city is locked down under quarantine, Alice finds out that the people that died from the previous incident at the Umbrella Corporation have turned into zombies. She then joins a small band of elite soldiers, who are enlisted to rescue the missing daughter of the creator of the mutating T-virus.  Once lack of luck and resources happen, they begin to wage an exhilarating battle to survive and escape before the Umbrella Corporation erases its experiment from the face of the earth.</td><td>You're all going to die.</td><td>2004-09-10</td><td>/yzNQSLlZb7NAkA4C5uADfNDJ7hm.jpg</td><td>25.504</td><td>3635</td><td>6.3</td><td>4.5E7</td><td>1.29394835E8</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/48RFr2WhpVgLSQGS3ugaXlX2Ykx.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>17255</td><td>Resident Evil Collection</td></tr><tr><td>282813</td><td>The Pyramid</td><td>The Pyramid</td><td>en</td><td>An archaeological team attempt to unlock the secrets of a lost pyramid only to find themselves hunted by an insidious creature.</td><td>You Only Enter Once.</td><td>2014-12-04</td><td>/7oZdP70fQcCiajv7SVmy6ZXYYrs.jpg</td><td>25.486</td><td>857</td><td>5.2</td><td>6500000.0</td><td>1.6861137E7</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9wmzKxkmnsoW5gdvW7Iq1mBcKNJ.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>792678</td><td>CUBE 一度入ったら、最後</td><td>Cube</td><td>ja</td><td>Six complete strangers with widely varying personalities are involuntarily placed in an endless maze of interlocking cube-shaped rooms containing deadly traps.</td><td>Once you're in, It's over.</td><td>2021-10-22</td><td>/npcWz1YMEESjhgkdNY11M34PfcT.jpg</td><td>25.435</td><td>42</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wgbch1xH2OezrMKnol8Ze9UghPT.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9529</td><td>Candyman</td><td>Candyman</td><td>en</td><td>The Candyman, a murderous soul with a hook for a hand, is accidentally summoned to reality by a skeptic grad student researching the monster's myth.</td><td>You don't have to believe... just beware.</td><td>1992-10-16</td><td>/n38YbNqUf5KWpMJFc4X3t0rlhg5.jpg</td><td>25.43</td><td>1269</td><td>6.6</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>2.579231E7</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vPDtur0rXAnEMqdYAnLO41aSDoO.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>98580</td><td>Candyman Collection</td></tr><tr><td>49017</td><td>Dracula Untold</td><td>Dracula Untold</td><td>en</td><td>Vlad Tepes is a great hero, but when he learns the Sultan is preparing for battle and needs to form an army of 1,000 boys, he vows to find a way to protect his family. Vlad turns to dark forces in order to get the power to destroy his enemies and agrees to go from hero to monster as he's turned into the mythological vampire, Dracula.</td><td>Every bloodline has a beginning</td><td>2014-10-01</td><td>/m5h3NtZ2ZfryIHl1MvatmANvIqQ.jpg</td><td>25.427</td><td>5364</td><td>6.4</td><td>7.0E7</td><td>2.1712428E8</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/f02FFv77Rh62633YEjimv7C6JM3.jpg</td><td>Action, Drama, Fantasy, Horror, War</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>409582</td><td>7 Guardians of the Tomb</td><td>7 Guardians of the Tomb</td><td>en</td><td>An innocent discovery of a well-preserved mummified Emperor from 200 BC China unearths a 2000 year old nightmare - a secret that should have remained buried.</td><td>Unearth the legend. Unleash the curse.</td><td>2018-01-19</td><td>/lBW7Aq7RzsFbrnmn9RCkpd6GbXf.jpg</td><td>25.397</td><td>161</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>7910928.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2CjY7TiNDKhuI0rk8K0Vq0UvIHZ.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17609</td><td>Antichrist</td><td>Antichrist</td><td>en</td><td>A grieving couple retreats to their cabin 'Eden' in the woods, hoping to repair their broken hearts and troubled marriage. But nature takes its course and things go from bad to worse.</td><td>When nature turns evil, true terror awaits.</td><td>2009-05-20</td><td>/ulF9B5G4Np7Lwchpwpyul7NMzt1.jpg</td><td>25.395</td><td>2138</td><td>6.7</td><td>1.1E7</td><td>791867.0</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lqL9EnG9okK0rcBl5a89qiCU9vO.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13515</td><td>Mirrors</td><td>Mirrors</td><td>en</td><td>An ex-cop and his family are the target of an evil force that is using mirrors as a gateway into their home.</td><td>There is evil...On the other side.</td><td>2008-08-15</td><td>/bt5a4ThyLpLTsia2e2ZTLzQjXO0.jpg</td><td>25.389</td><td>1520</td><td>6.2</td><td>3.5E7</td><td>7.2436439E7</td><td>111</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pDjZE6hTt4YN2cC1Z1bYZfmH9bs.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>105324</td><td>Mirrors Collection</td></tr><tr><td>474764</td><td>The Lodge</td><td>The Lodge</td><td>en</td><td>When a father is forced to abruptly depart for work, he leaves his children, Aidan and Mia, at their holiday home in the care of his new girlfriend, Grace. Isolated and alone, a blizzard traps them inside the lodge as terrifying events summon specters from Grace's dark past.</td><td>You're not welcome here.</td><td>2020-01-16</td><td>/k5E8RCvDY08TntH6Ujxmq1gbOZB.jpg</td><td>25.369</td><td>942</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>2679585.0</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/23IeumCWwWE7u2d2FDNSGPsNRbl.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>633604</td><td>Yummy</td><td>Yummy</td><td>nl</td><td>A young couple travels to a shabby Eastern European hospital for plastic surgery. The young woman wants a breast reduction. Her mother comes along for yet another face-lift. Wandering through an abandoned ward the boyfriend stumbles upon a young woman, gagged and strapped to an operating table; she is the result of an experimental rejuvenation treatment. He frees her, but does not realize he just caused the outbreak of a virus that will change doctors, patients and his mother-in-law into bloodthirsty zombies.</td><td>Facelifts, boob jobs and zombies</td><td>2019-12-13</td><td>/9U80sW0NNOenmfxWWlPoo8TokJ5.jpg</td><td>25.345</td><td>209</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5Rd9Po7kbOO4fapY7zVShen9QlU.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10552</td><td>Cat's Eye</td><td>Cat's Eye</td><td>en</td><td>Three short stories by shock-meister Stephen King are linked by a stray cat that roams from one tale to the next in this creepy triptych that begins as Dick (James Woods) tries to quit smoking by any means necessary. Next, we meet Johnny, an adulterous man who's forced by his lover's husband onto a building's hazardous ledge. Finally, Amanda is threatened by an evil gnome who throws suspicion on the family cat.</td><td>Follow the newest cat-and-creature game as played through</td><td>1985-04-12</td><td>/kKyq7izpMkmr8sT2nLic5qAuJPo.jpg</td><td>25.297</td><td>508</td><td>6.7</td><td>7000000.0</td><td>1.31E7</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hxUM806p8SeOwdsYamUOrTYc07E.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>580</td><td>Jaws: The Revenge</td><td>Jaws: The Revenge</td><td>en</td><td>After another deadly shark attack, Ellen Brody decides she has had enough of New England's Amity Island and moves to the Caribbean to join her son, Michael, and his family. But a great white shark has followed her there, hungry for more lives.</td><td>This time, it’s personal.</td><td>1987-07-17</td><td>/kGiaOztahZV2x7bil7sbk7fb6ob.jpg</td><td>25.29</td><td>817</td><td>4.1</td><td>2.3E7</td><td>5.1881013E7</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cJyQfwSEa5IjOdeNTuiWjciVbou.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror, Thriller</td><td>2366</td><td>Jaws Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10331</td><td>Night of the Living Dead</td><td>Night of the Living Dead</td><td>en</td><td>A disparate group of individuals takes refuge in an abandoned house when corpses begin to leave the graveyard in search of fresh human bodies to devour. The pragmatic Ben does his best to control the situation, but when the murderous zombies surround the house, the other survivors begin to panic.</td><td>If it doesn't scare you, you're already dead!</td><td>1968-10-04</td><td>/inNUOa9WZGdyRXQlt7eqmHtCttl.jpg</td><td>25.289</td><td>1935</td><td>7.6</td><td>114000.0</td><td>3.0E7</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/d0NwvSRJQQzkubWKsidX4caQ6Yi.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>261590</td><td>Living Dead Collection</td></tr><tr><td>615017</td><td>47 Hours to Live</td><td>47 Hours to Live</td><td>en</td><td>Two socially awkward teenage girls, are bored one night and turn to the internet for scary stories. They find a game on a creepy website that claims you can use your phone to summon the supernatural...and if you lose the game...you lose your life.</td><td>Pass on the curse within 47 hours... or die...</td><td>2019-05-04</td><td>/qeOoky7Xj7EevC7SGiJcIft0Ids.jpg</td><td>25.275</td><td>44</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pXWU6JTBLnSmyKEBWdyaFpaT4lF.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>432130</td><td>青鬼 THE ANIMATION</td><td>Ao Oni The Animation</td><td>ja</td><td>Based on the horror game Ao Oni by noprops.  Five members of the cultural anthropology club at an old western-style school are trying to come up with ideas for their presentation at the school's culture festival, when they find a collection of folk tales gathered by a student in their club 40 years ago. They realize that the mysterious Bellflower Oni that appears in the folk tales may be the basis for the popular free game Ao Oni, and decide to make that their theme. They manage to make contact with the author of the Ao Oni game, but he dies mysteriously soon afterward. The club members become suspicious at the author's death and began to investigate on their own, but encounter a secret they never should have touched: a secret underground prison in the school.  For some reason all the fire doors at the school are locked, and they are trapped in the school. The sound of the strange footsteps they hear soon turn to their screams...A new tragedy of the Ao Oni is about to begin.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-02-11</td><td>/foxtnszGOgV26wWcYuaF1TPCLnI.jpg</td><td>25.253</td><td>10</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>60</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/r1zZddN8h5nRCNrxEOhom7C0HGS.jpg</td><td>Animation, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>923</td><td>Dawn of the Dead</td><td>Dawn of the Dead</td><td>en</td><td>During an ever-growing epidemic of zombies that have risen from the dead, two Philadelphia SWAT team members, a traffic reporter, and his television-executive girlfriend seek refuge in a secluded shopping mall.</td><td>When there’s no more room in HELL, the dead will walk the EARTH!</td><td>1978-09-02</td><td>/9kGESwH451kRgm1h6Q0svAVK60N.jpg</td><td>25.198</td><td>1674</td><td>7.5</td><td>650000.0</td><td>5.5E7</td><td>127</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9OKzKuCfcMwpHVp56pjNI7J4xXR.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>261590</td><td>Living Dead Collection</td></tr><tr><td>627661</td><td>Cranston Academy: Monster Zone</td><td>Cranston Academy: Monster Zone</td><td>en</td><td>An intelligent 15-year-old high school student is unexpectedly transferred to a boarding school where he opens a portal of monsters from another dimension.</td><td>Keep the door closed...</td><td>2020-04-29</td><td>/maBFNvaxae6IgLL4qwz7hvz19EZ.jpg</td><td>25.191</td><td>89</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>641308.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lvNQKZUsw7pg79CROCFlIk8PT67.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11069</td><td>Tremors 2: Aftershocks</td><td>Tremors 2: Aftershocks</td><td>en</td><td>Those supersucking desert creatures are back --- and this time they're south of the border. As the creatures worm their way through the oil fields of Mexico, the only people who can wrangle them are veteran Earl Bassett and survivalist Burt Gummer. Add to that team a young punk out for cash and a fearless scientist, and the critters don't stand a chance.</td><td>The Worms have turned.</td><td>1996-04-09</td><td>/meIuuXHhuDg1iUVOp8fr14XOXR1.jpg</td><td>25.188</td><td>746</td><td>6.2</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/AbdOKg1YvPD5TsisOCUhZN7oLiH.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>91799</td><td>Tremors Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10307</td><td>Stigmata</td><td>Stigmata</td><td>en</td><td>A young woman with no strong religious beliefs, Frankie Paige begins having strange and violent experiences, showing signs of the wounds that Jesus received when crucified. When the Vatican gets word of Frankie's situation, a high-ranking cardinal requests that the Rev. Andrew Kiernan investigate her case. Soon Kiernan realizes that very sinister forces are at work, and tries to rescue Frankie from the entity that is plaguing her.</td><td>The messenger must be silenced.</td><td>1999-09-10</td><td>/q1ubP9C8HgDa9XgyJurfE3OdiPu.jpg</td><td>25.137</td><td>877</td><td>6.2</td><td>2.9E7</td><td>5.0041732E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/t1wXPJuhUXCcv5X2Wl615nmIvtk.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>213646</td><td>挡不住的风情</td><td>Don't Stop My Crazy Love for You</td><td>cn</td><td>Fred Suen is fan of TV news reporter Kitty Wong. It is an obsession that will eventually result in rape and murder.</td><td>NA</td><td>1993-04-28</td><td>/7AwjpHrHZ7CoF8mkHcHt4LB7dYD.jpg</td><td>25.125</td><td>2</td><td>4.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sud1OChHez9sXVIAf39oOZdrJ6g.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1023086</td><td>Devil's Workshop</td><td>Devil's Workshop</td><td>en</td><td>Desperate for a role as a demonologist, struggling actor Clayton contacts Eliza, an expert in devil lore, to help him prepare. As he spends the weekend at her home, Eliza forces Clayton to confront his troubling past, perform dark rituals, and sacrifice a goat. Does she want to help Clayton, seduce him—or destroy him?</td><td>We all have our demons.</td><td>2022-09-30</td><td>/fJQr6E6tUwihQuQgTSDUkKsrVZA.jpg</td><td>25.084</td><td>3</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3f2xX0r2x0RbMR2spoqkdUIhuuj.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>503919</td><td>The Lighthouse</td><td>The Lighthouse</td><td>en</td><td>Two lighthouse keepers try to maintain their sanity while living on a remote and mysterious New England island in the 1890s.</td><td>There is enchantment in the light.</td><td>2019-10-18</td><td>/4SC4cyzHWWzDEdszdxHYPWd32YH.jpg</td><td>25.082</td><td>3687</td><td>7.5</td><td>1.1E7</td><td>1.8123239E7</td><td>109</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tNE9HGcFOH8EpCmzO7XCYwqguI0.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>780609</td><td>Men</td><td>Men</td><td>en</td><td>In the aftermath of a personal tragedy, Harper retreats alone to the beautiful English countryside, hoping to find a place to heal. But someone — or something — from the surrounding woods appears to be stalking her, and what begins as simmering dread becomes a fully-formed nightmare, inhabited by her darkest memories and fears.</td><td>What haunts you will find you.</td><td>2022-05-20</td><td>/jo1Kv3P3UgDVk7JnUFr2Cl8WWUM.jpg</td><td>25.063</td><td>362</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>7168717.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/utUVo1wt3i4OdrQQS3I9QeegYsM.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>340837</td><td>A Cure for Wellness</td><td>A Cure for Wellness</td><td>en</td><td>An ambitious young executive is sent to retrieve his company's CEO from an idyllic but mysterious \"wellness center\" at a remote location in the Swiss Alps but soon suspects that the spa's miraculous treatments are not what they seem.</td><td>There is a Cure</td><td>2017-02-15</td><td>/d4fXuJS3zZcAZfz2HYDtnwqtnwn.jpg</td><td>25.0</td><td>3345</td><td>6.3</td><td>4.0E7</td><td>2.6620002E7</td