end, Anna to supervise their children while the parents go out to celebrate their anniversary. At first Anna seems like a dream come true to the kids, allowing them to eat extra cookies and play with things that are usually off-limits, but as her behaviour becomes increasingly odd, the kids soon find out that her intentions are dark and twisted—and she is not who she seems to be.</td><td>I'm your new babysitter</td><td>2016-03-04</td><td>/2HSqJtos2qHVoC00StzNRVpNExe.jpg</td><td>23.982</td><td>588</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5QQ4nNfs1ANq12mvRldIzqdhiY9.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9913</td><td>The Skeleton Key</td><td>The Skeleton Key</td><td>en</td><td>A hospice nurse working at a spooky New Orleans plantation home finds herself entangled in a mystery involving the house's dark past.</td><td>Fearing Is Believing</td><td>2005-07-29</td><td>/sH7mDPlWwFTqVUg6yKRvToCMH3B.jpg</td><td>23.969</td><td>1736</td><td>6.6</td><td>4.3E7</td><td>9.3983911E7</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uqa4ObNa5Qb38HzIeWi6tyF5aRx.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>282117</td><td>Skeleton Key Collection</td></tr><tr><td>150202</td><td>The Haunting in Connecticut 2: Ghosts of Georgia</td><td>The Haunting in Connecticut 2: Ghosts of Georgia</td><td>en</td><td>A young family moves into a historic home in Georgia, only to learn they are not the house's only inhabitants. Soon they find themselves in the presence of a secret rising from underground and threatening to bring down anyone in its path.</td><td>Based on a true story</td><td>2013-02-01</td><td>/af6YNKYQsX76RSNHh3X4k2OcoQC.jpg</td><td>23.934</td><td>434</td><td>5.8</td><td>9000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jE1CpCE4tVLmU1dbVz5hC1mjmXC.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>169740</td><td>The Haunting in Connecticut Collection</td></tr><tr><td>502416</td><td>Ma</td>