all</td><td>en</td><td>On a deep space mining mission to a remote planet, an ancient religious relic - thought to be proof of the existence of God - is unearthed and brought aboard. When the unholy artifact unleashes a long-dormant alien race, its glimpse of Heaven transforms the ship into a living Hell. A prequel to the events of the 2008 video game Dead Space.</td><td>Meet Your Maker.</td><td>2008-10-27</td><td>/w8KNXRQF9UzplokFlDrNMt0FkW7.jpg</td><td>23.337</td><td>274</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>74</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aFnF8gvNedNWHoCNTjZWphebecd.jpg</td><td>Animation, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>56005</td><td>Dead Space - Collection</td></tr><tr><td>1946</td><td>eXistenZ</td><td>eXistenZ</td><td>en</td><td>A game designer on the run from assassins must play her latest virtual reality creation with a marketing trainee to determine if the game has been damaged.</td><td>Play it. Live it. Kill for it.</td><td>1999-04-14</td><td>/kETKF0JhdTPn1knci8CAdYL0d79.jpg</td><td>23.31</td><td>1548</td><td>6.8</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>2856712.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/247OkG4qeUpy3WiKjilQyqNBwnY.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11531</td><td>Book of Shadows: Blair Witch 2</td><td>Book of Shadows: Blair Witch 2</td><td>en</td><td>Young adults become fascinated by the events of the three missing filmmakers in Maryland, so they decide to go into the same woods and find out what really happened.</td><td>Evil Doesn't Die.</td><td>2000-10-27</td><td>/l1jF93S9FYbzp3Byh5VUA1KApSJ.jpg</td><td>23.306</td><td>650</td><td>4.2</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>4.7737094E7</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/unVjWj6KsRXk67pEkBfxflpbyRV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>64750</td><td>Blair Witch Collection</td></tr><tr><td>19898</td><td>Pandorum</td><td>Pandorum</td><td>en</td><td>Two crew members wake up on an abandoned spacecraft with no idea who they are, how long they've been asleep, or what their mission is. The two soon discover they're actually not alone – and the reality of their situation is more horrifying than they could have imagined.</td><td>Don't fear the end of the world. Fear what happens next.</td><td>2009-09-08</td><td>/mNMfa6r3pl0EzFIKEkVcxyr6Rc7.jpg</td><td>23.262</td><td>1952</td><td>6.5</td><td>3.3E7</td><td>2.0648328E7</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2M5V8VcK02o4R5cxe7Ew1ltaxKr.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>3600</td><td>I Still Know What You Did Last Summer</td><td>I Still Know What You Did Last Summer</td><td>en</td><td>Ever since killing the Fisherman one year ago, Julie James is still haunted by images of him after her. When her best friend Karla wins free tickets to the Bahamas, Julie finds this a perfect opportunity to finally relax. But someone is waiting for her. Someone who she thought was dead. Someone who is out again for revenge.</td><td>Someone is dying for a second chance.</td><td>1998-11-13</td><td>/motBJIO921LFZkoGKCSbmSCVHBc.jpg</td><td>23.219</td><td>1225</td><td>5.3</td><td>6.5E7</td><td>4.0002112E7</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sn5FydS63DL5KWUBQW3bHhi0Myx.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>3601</td><td>I Know What You Did Last Summer Collection</td></tr><tr><td>1021591</td><td>Desconocido</td><td>Desconocido</td><td>es</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-10-08</td><td>/XPhPeeM7F3LXwJpFgQo78mjHcj.jpg</td><td>23.139</td><td>1</td><td>2.0</td><td>3000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9980</td><td>Maximum Overdrive</td><td>Maximum Overdrive</td><td>en</td><td>When a comet passes close to the earth, machines all over the world come alive and go on homicidal rampages. A group of people at a desolate truck stop are held hostage by a gang of homicidal 18-wheelers. The frightened people set out to defeat the killer machines ... or be killed by them.</td><td>Stephen King's masterpiece of terror directed by the master himself.</td><td>1986-07-25</td><td>/cFrKCumtZMHCWwWNxgGRyaxhYu2.jpg</td><td>23.138</td><td>568</td><td>5.7</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>7433663.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/m6q0Q6bwJnzoMHWFCplDarmBtIK.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>6171</td><td>Dreamcatcher</td><td>Dreamcatcher</td><td>en</td><td>Four boyhood pals perform a heroic act and are changed by the powers they gain in return. Years later, on a hunting trip in the Maine woods, they're overtaken by a vicious blizzard that harbors an ominous presence. Challenged to stop an alien force, the friends must first prevent the slaughter of innocent civilians by a military vigilante ... and then overcome a threat to the bond that unites the four of them.</td><td>A circle of friendship. A web of mystery. A pattern of fear.</td><td>2003-03-21</td><td>/3RtOffRhVHyST1d5BDVu5dnFI04.jpg</td><td>23.125</td><td>1486</td><td>5.5</td><td>6.8E7</td><td>7.57E7</td><td>136</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2NslMU17WZqHF7AnjIBpu9VuKh0.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>382602</td><td>貞子vs伽椰子</td><td>Sadako vs. Kayako</td><td>ja</td><td>A girl, Yūri Kurahashi, after watching a cursed videotape together with her friend in a haunted house, becomes trapped in a conflict between the two murderous ghosts: Sadako Yamamura and Kayako Saeki</td><td>Who will win this curse!?</td><td>2016-06-18</td><td>/bRNL8q6utwEc2Vog5GwTFgm5NEQ.jpg</td><td>23.105</td><td>168</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>8992523.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tY9RkzUFUagcrLMriLd1fyOfG6G.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>93369</td><td>Ringu Collection</td></tr><tr><td>753453</td><td>V/H/S/94</td><td>V/H/S/94</td><td>en</td><td>A mysterious VHS tape leads a police S.W.A.T. team to the discovery of a sinister cult whose collection of pre-recorded material reveals a nightmarish conspiracy.</td><td>5 New Tapes. 1 Nightmare.</td><td>2021-09-26</td><td>/9fSogEkqDfJQTuGHsTFloQz3Tw8.jpg</td><td>23.043</td><td>268</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uWbP41poWgP0f7sgAQTf6UeRtwg.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>207621</td><td>V/H/S Collection</td></tr><tr><td>11460</td><td>Red Eye</td><td>Red Eye</td><td>en</td><td>A woman is kidnapped by a stranger on a routine flight. Threatened by the potential murder of her father, she is pulled into a plot to assist her captor in offing a politician.</td><td>Fear takes flight.</td><td>2005-08-19</td><td>/osLMnQIjDMmzLvXmOlIOlou9olp.jpg</td><td>23.036</td><td>1546</td><td>6.3</td><td>2.6E7</td><td>5.7891803E7</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/dSw8TG4RjwXut06xfc8EHzDuQ79.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>246196</td><td>レイプゾンビ3 LUST OF THE DEAD</td><td>Rape Zombie: Lust of the Dead 3</td><td>ja</td><td>The zombies that arose after the nuclear outbreak are still high in numbers. The group of girls have lost some of their comrades and are fighting off the horny zombies to stay alive themselves. Can they stop the plague for once and for all?</td><td>NA</td><td>2013-03-23</td><td>/oeo54WatPOznX3cBJbJgDvevDJN.jpg</td><td>23.014</td><td>19</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>68</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5xFIdRmd9fRV5akGGWypDZR4XOg.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>363386</td><td>Rape Zombie Series</td></tr><tr><td>316154</td><td>The Bad Batch</td><td>The Bad Batch</td><td>en</td><td>Arlen is sent to a fenced-off wasteland where undesirables are exiled to when she is kidnapped by a group of cannibals. She escapes and ends up on a journey to reunite a missing girl with her father.</td><td>Don’t play with your food.</td><td>2017-06-23</td><td>/7o14VaMphEIzPwzeW6FP3A6zb4W.jpg</td><td>22.996</td><td>895</td><td>5.2</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>180851.0</td><td>119</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aQ06MnEDLh9X3ZOtY21UD2XB197.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>250574</td><td>Creep</td><td>Creep</td><td>en</td><td>Looking for work, Aaron comes across a cryptic online ad: “$1,000 for the day. Filming service. Discretion is appreciated.” Low on cash and full of naiveté, he decides to go for it. He drives to a cabin in a remote mountain town where he meets Josef, his cinematic subject for the day. Josef is sincere and the project seems heartfelt, so Aaron begins to film. But as the day goes on, it becomes clear that Josef is not who he says, and his intentions are not at all pure.</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-06-23</td><td>/iUEpNzw0E7tOlXFL4nCpIpjcKd9.jpg</td><td>22.994</td><td>1089</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xSjp6bPUoVG7SgD6KSBnN5nCFhK.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>488990</td><td>Creep Collection</td></tr><tr><td>805</td><td>Rosemary's Baby</td><td>Rosemary's Baby</td><td>en</td><td>A young couple, Rosemary and Guy, moves into an infamous New York apartment building, known by frightening legends and mysterious events, with the purpose of starting a family.</td><td>It's not what you're expecting</td><td>1968-06-12</td><td>/s8pdaHjxNPLXIA1WjSTWm00RJTz.jpg</td><td>22.975</td><td>3211</td><td>7.8</td><td>3200000.0</td><td>3.3395426E7</td><td>138</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sd8UeAahns9ZwxI7WlSa90iUxqd.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>264338</td><td>Rosemary's Baby Collection</td></tr><tr><td>738542</td><td>The Haunting of Margam Castle</td><td>The Haunting of Margam Castle</td><td>en</td><td>A team of American parapsychologists travel to Wales to conduct a study of Margam Castle, one of the UK's most haunted buildings.</td><td>The most haunted building in the United Kingdom.</td><td>2020-09-01</td><td>/r2BlIxjAaj0WERGrIehnczNE0On.jpg</td><td>22.948</td><td>39</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8JWfh0F9PE7nvg2S3HNnrxbKjuc.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>254474</td><td>Zombeavers</td><td>Zombeavers</td><td>en</td><td>College friends find their weekend of sex and debauchery ruined when deadly zombie beavers swarm their riverside cabin.</td><td>You'll be dammed!</td><td>2014-10-20</td><td>/gdb7v5GCfijrCjOjzbziGMGs6JA.jpg</td><td>22.944</td><td>563</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>14947.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4wOoxLEvVkSFZX4lrWxokE8d3zT.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>393519</td><td>Grave</td><td>Raw</td><td>fr</td><td>In Justine’s family everyone is a vet and a vegetarian. At 16, she’s a gifted teen ready to take on her first year in vet school, where her older sister also studies. There, she gets no time to settle: hazing starts right away. Justine is forced to eat raw meat for the first time in her life. Unexpected consequences emerge as her true self begins to form.</td><td>What are you hungry for?</td><td>2016-11-11</td><td>/kc8jT1MAiKM0iwdjAwC5lQrTNry.jpg</td><td>22.941</td><td>2681</td><td>7.1</td><td>3500000.0</td><td>4100000.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vh3EWQWWVkawKgKdrJUk00zKkXn.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>396493</td><td>Creep 2</td><td>Creep 2</td><td>en</td><td>After finding an ad online for “video work,” Sara, a video artist whose primary focus is creating intimacy with lonely men, thinks she may have found the subject of her dreams. She drives to a remote house in the forest and meets a man claiming to be a serial killer. Unable to resist the chance to create a truly shocking piece of art, she agrees to spend the day with him. However, as the day goes on, she discovers she may have dug herself into a hole from which she can’t escape.</td><td>oh my god, this is going to be a good day.</td><td>2017-10-14</td><td>/a0m7WciFnBqpcyH1Yi8i4tdvk0k.jpg</td><td>22.877</td><td>615</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/DgR4K8Dw2j2S8ad7pViHMI7qtC.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>488990</td><td>Creep Collection</td></tr><tr><td>653598</td><td>Spree</td><td>Spree</td><td>en</td><td>Desperate for an online following, a rideshare driver has figured out a deadly plan to go viral and he will stop at nothing to get his five minutes of fame.</td><td>Murder is trending.</td><td>2020-08-14</td><td>/hJUA4wfvw0A6l3niOfxourqpERA.jpg</td><td>22.859</td><td>284</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>43840.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2wKOO39vOvWK1vBDb72NuNfkE55.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>65086</td><td>The Woman in Black</td><td>The Woman in Black</td><td>en</td><td>The story follows a young lawyer, Arthur Kipps, who is ordered to travel to a remote village and sort out a recently deceased client’s papers. As he works alone in the client’s isolated house, Kipps begins to uncover tragic secrets, his unease growing when he glimpses a mysterious woman dressed only in black. Receiving only silence from the locals, Kipps is forced to uncover the true identity of the Woman in Black on his own, leading to a desperate race against time when he discovers her true identity.</td><td>What did they see?</td><td>2012-02-03</td><td>/aJbeDPUwDe9MLpseTFrNTBaQPzf.jpg</td><td>22.819</td><td>3088</td><td>6.1</td><td>1.7E7</td><td>1.27730736E8</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cTmXwkukwOgaSA6zRRe9wmMnTiQ.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>315560</td><td>The Woman in Black Collection</td></tr><tr><td>241258</td><td>Incarnate</td><td>Incarnate</td><td>en</td><td>An exorcist comes up against an evil from his past when he uses his skills to enter the mind of a nine year old boy.</td><td>Faith has failed us.</td><td>2016-12-01</td><td>/8j8PL