</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>1.0175849E8</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xqJBx9a4u7pRpvrKc9sZrkPXJV1.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10361</td><td>Ginger Snaps 2: Unleashed</td><td>Ginger Snaps 2: Unleashed</td><td>en</td><td>Brigitte has escaped the confines of Bailey Downs but she's not alone. Another werewolf is tailing her closely and her sister's specter haunts her. An overdose of Monkshood - the poison that is keeping her transformation at bay - leads to her being incarcerated in a rehabilitation clinic for drug addicts where her only friend is an eccentric young girl by the name of Ghost.</td><td>It only dies if you do.</td><td>2004-01-30</td><td>/nTtyzQ1qFDJXLWvXX4wvOu0nYun.jpg</td><td>21.484</td><td>246</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lhiLBuFJcRC0wkjsj04vfAfZWPm.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>11794</td><td>Ginger Snaps Collection</td></tr><tr><td>11082</td><td>The Seventh Sign</td><td>The Seventh Sign</td><td>en</td><td>Abby is a pregnant woman with a curious new boarder in the apartment over her garage. Turns out he's heaven-sent and is speeding along the Apocalypse by bloodying rivers, egging on plagues and following scripture word for word.</td><td>The seals have been broken. The prophecies have begun. Now only one woman can halt the end of our world.</td><td>1988-04-01</td><td>/vAgVzkPmfe2pcgzkpoz8cZ9i9wm.jpg</td><td>21.47</td><td>287</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.8875011E7</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jTKsauSff9iHE4gswdnjXIJNfWN.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10069</td><td>Stay Alive</td><td>Stay Alive</td><td>en</td><td>After the mysterious, brutal death of an old friend, a group of teenagers find themselves in possession of \"Stay Alive,\" an ultra-realistic 3-D videogame based on the spine-chilling true story of a 17th century noblewoman, known as \"The Blood Countess.\" The gamers don't know anything about the game other than they're not supposed to have it... and they're dying to play it. Not able to resist temptation, the kids begin to play the grisly game but soon make a chilling connection -- they are each being murdered one-by-one in the same way as the characters they played in the game. As the line between the game world and the real world disappears, the teens must find a way to defeat the vicious and merciless Blood Countess, all the while trying to... stay alive.</td><td>You die in the game - you die for real.</td><td>2006-03-24</td><td>/hsSJwroE7jugEROB8tmyxJP91Ho.jpg</td><td>21.457</td><td>606</td><td>5.8</td><td>9000000.0</td><td>2.7105095E7</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/g2goLYvmeVXPDXatWRtvjGBrRkH.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>593643</td><td>The Menu</td><td>The Menu</td><td>en</td><td>A couple travels to a coastal island to eat at an exclusive restaurant where the chef has prepared a lavish menu, with some shocking surprises.</td><td>Painstakingly prepared. Brilliantly executed.</td><td>2022-11-17</td><td>/3R3dopFTwneJVPW3ubcrnoPfI05.jpg</td><td>21.437</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>106</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/o1k6zNKYVQuNx5DIyVpT9j6gwaQ.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>852252</td><td>The Accursed</td><td>The Accursed</td><td>en</td><td>Elly is asked by a family friend to spend a few days looking after an elderly woman living in a remote cabin. She readily agrees thinking a short trip to the woods will be a nice escape. The cabin turns out to be anything but relaxing as Elly begins hallucinating in ways that blur reality with her dreams. As the visions take over, Elly realizes that she was lured there by a demonic presence hiding inside of the woman just waiting to break free.</td><td>Are you ready to gaze into hell?</td><td>2022-10-14</td><td>/f2ecItvitaYdZDnAwBOjrCrk1Pt.jpg</td><td>21.389</td><