td>5.4</td><td>89.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iU1z474zzt0rvXDOzoipU8Lb9U0.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>707131</td><td>Polaroid</td><td>Polaroid</td><td>en</td><td>A mysterious package arrives at a doorstep. The contents inside may determine the fate of whoever opens it.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-10-26</td><td>/s2abswphACud7RsUQT65cx1FPiK.jpg</td><td>20.017</td><td>5</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>5</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>674025</td><td>Aztech</td><td>Aztech</td><td>en</td><td>Fragments of a meteor crash in Mexico and United States. Thirteen stories in different spaces and times happen in places of collisions .</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-11-20</td><td>/2aMO15yV5tH3J5AwdA7f91cgtpu.jpg</td><td>19.939</td><td>37</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yGL36gPU8fJqMwUtfoqA1qWiGOu.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>115210</td><td>Stitches</td><td>Stitches</td><td>en</td><td>The clumsy and unfunny clown Richard \"Stitches\" Grindle entertains at the 10th birthday party of little Tom, but the boy and his friends play a prank with Stitches, tying his shoelaces. Stitches slips, falls and dies. Six years later, Tom gives a birthday party for his friends at home, but Stitches revives to haunt the teenagers and revenge his death.</td><td>You'll die laughing...</td><td>2012-05-19</td><td>/krlOnkMBDYp4zgLivd4WORBnQm0.jpg</td><td>19.926</td><td>346</td><td>6.4</td><td>100000.0</td><td>95000.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oCz0Y3agbixFKUYB72uF9EC9VRt.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>8077</td><td>Alien³</td><td>Alien³</td><td>en</td><td>After escaping with Newt and Hicks from the alien planet, Ripley crash lands on Fiorina 161, a prison planet and host to a correctional facility. Unfortunately, although Newt and Hicks do not survive the crash, a more unwelcome visitor does. The prison does not allow weapons of any kind, and with aid being a long time away, the prisoners must simply survive in any way they can.</td><td>The bitch is back.</td><td>1992-05-22</td><td>/hlabk6APJUeihZDaSD9N6iI0f4g.jpg</td><td>19.883</td><td>4615</td><td>6.3</td><td>5.0E7</td><td>1.59773545E8</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nEmOmbCWBXS3tHU2N49z693KDK.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>8091</td><td>Alien Collection</td></tr><tr><td>459202</td><td>Boo 2! A Madea Halloween</td><td>Boo 2! A Madea Halloween</td><td>en</td><td>Madea and the gang encounter monsters, goblins and boogeymen at a haunted campground.</td><td>Peek-A-Boo.</td><td>2017-10-20</td><td>/5nvP4etJ8ecQv8qZM08dK4BAzdK.jpg</td><td>19.835</td><td>445</td><td>5.7</td><td>2.5E7</td><td>4.8333932E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wqxKaffqTUKI9cl8YgBIm8IAZlR.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>534673</td><td>Madea - Collection</td></tr><tr><td>14435</td><td>My Bloody Valentine</td><td>My Bloody Valentine</td><td>en</td><td>Ten years ago, a tragedy changed the town of Harmony forever. Tom Hanniger, an inexperienced coal miner, caused an accident in the tunnels that trapped and killed five men and sent the only survivor, Harry Warden, into a permanent coma. But Harry Warden wanted revenge. Exactly one year later, on Valentine’s Day, he woke up…and brutally murdered twenty-two people with a pickaxe before being killed.</td><td>He's gonna break your heart.</td><td>2009-01-16</td><td>/9biIVOMTdvv4aj4a5HClmrK5EHB.jpg</td><td>19.81</td><td>940</td><td>5.5</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>1.02836002E8</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/p1Z3ExMNc1sidmo12vgxl2pZsED.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>105814</td><td>孽欲追击档案之邪杀</td><td>The Imp</td><td>cn</td><td>Stunningly sexy Pan Dang plays a Hong Kong woman who's traveling in search of her twin sister, who disappeared leaving nothing more than a native doll, the eponymous imp. Along the way she hooks up with a mobile film crew. They discover that something isn't quite right with the boarding house in which they're staying.</td><td>NA</td><td>1996-01-01</td><td>/9eqRRc4bNiLk9JFZ5xbioGBGHHR.jpg</td><td>19.796</td><td>5</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kyrAT0kuED6n2RhuBUuENpNgimp.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>610474</td><td>Trilogy of Lust Collection</td></tr><tr><td>9946</td><td>End of Days</td><td>End of Days</td><td>en</td><td>On 28 December 1999, the citizens of New York City are getting ready for the turn of the millennium. However, Satan decides to crash the party by coming to the city, inhabiting a man's body, and searching for his chosen bride—a 20-year-old woman named Christine York. The world will end, and the only hope lies within an atheist named Jericho Cane.</td><td>Prepare for the end.</td><td>1999-11-24</td><td>/gNAhD6VdlvwxWk7CQnIvPyiItEU.jpg</td><td>19.738</td><td>1496</td><td>6.0</td><td>1.0E8</td><td>2.11989043E8</td><td>121</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5XAdUpEGyi3oX4rV1BI5IJRamKu.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>751394</td><td>100 Candles</td><td>100 Candles</td><td>en</td><td>A group of friends must confront their fears in a terrifying game. They must sit by the other players in a circle made of a hundred candles, take one of them and tell a horror story. As stories are told and candles blown out, strange events will start to happen. They will feel strange presences around them, lurking in the shadows. But they MUST NOT leave the game or else a terrible curse will fall upon them...</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-11-13</td><td>/eyGYTcTpX3QniuEgvTeM3YLcJkX.jpg</td><td>19.697</td><td>88</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nhaeqHR86ZNztAuOJNMmjEg9eXo.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>378018</td><td>The Void</td><td>The Void</td><td>en</td><td>In the middle of a routine patrol, officer Daniel Carter happens upon a blood-soaked figure limping down a deserted stretch of road. He rushes the young man to a nearby rural hospital staffed by a skeleton crew, only to discover that patients and personnel are transforming into something inhuman. As the horror intensifies, Carter leads the other survivors on a hellish voyage into the subterranean depths of the hospital in a desperate bid to end the nightmare before it's too late.</td><td>There Is a Hell. This Is Worse.</td><td>2016-09-22</td><td>/c0WLRyT0AmUi41nVXBnqmJshIBn.jpg</td><td>19.684</td><td>984</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>151042.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oZwwwezJFlHmQGBRJDLmENXwOIt.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10493</td><td>Dead Calm</td><td>Dead Calm</td><td>en</td><td>An Australian couple take a sailing trip in the Pacific to forget about a terrible accident. While on the open sea, in dead calm weather conditions, they come across a ship with one survivor who is not at all what he seems.</td><td>High seas. Deep terror. Try to stay calm.</td><td>1989-04-07</td><td>/hXpav86ZX5N1YIfVfVtzuZLNrjW.jpg</td><td>19.681</td><td>583</td><td>6.6</td><td>1.04E7</td><td>7825000.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jJj7moXpWkZm3pUgvQqriKHGfmQ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>155084</td><td>13 Sins</td><td>13 Sins</td><td>en</td><td>Drowning in debt as he's about to get married, a bright but meek salesman receives a mysterious phone call informing him that he's on a hidden-camera game show where he must execute 13 tasks to receive a multi-million dollar cash prize.</td><td>You don't play the game. It plays you.</td><td>2014-04-18</td><td>/x4tC1s6oFG9nEyxVSM0FiIsLea1.jpg</td><td>19.675</td><td>917</td><td>6.3</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>13809.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/67WVW36tcLYnY2ONzbxh7gEfohh.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>73935</td><td>Vamps</td><td>Vamps</td><td>en</td><td>The modern-day story focuses on two beautiful young vampires who are living the good nightlife in New York until love enters the picture and each has to make a choice that will jeopardize their immortality.</td><td>Dating Sucks</td><td>2012-08-25</td><td>/sW4MFTfW88Ii8TyZVD7oprzzhOU.jpg</td><td>19.664</td><td>231</td><td>5.3</td><td>1.6E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jRfYRzwE4eX1qcnMSTagL1xlxGS.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>159117</td><td>V/H/S/2</td><td>V/H/S/2</td><td>en</td><td>Inside a darkened house looms a column of TVs littered with VHS tapes, a pagan shrine to forgotten analog gods. The screens crackle and pop endlessly with monochrome vistas of static white noise permeating the brain and fogging concentration. But you must fight the urge to relax: this is no mere movie night. Those obsolete spools contain more than just magnetic tape. They are imprinted with the very soul of evil.</td><td>Who's tracking you?</td><td>2013-06-06</td><td>/o4hcWsHaHaNQ9BBReOxLvYJNRhA.jpg</td><td>19.644</td><td>831</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>21833.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aELgHEHFGDCcGslMoyg9KGiDV4v.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>207621</td><td>V/H/S Collection</td></tr><tr><td>254191</td><td>Honeymoon</td><td>Honeymoon</td><td>en</td><td>Young newlyweds Paul and Bea travel to a remote lake cottage for their honeymoon, where the promise of private romance awaits them. Shortly after arriving, Paul finds Bea wandering and disoriented in the middle of the night.</td><td>After the ceremony comes the ritual.</td><td>2014-09-12</td><td>/inVaWmQq1ItUOiMg6v2MtEC0d5l.jpg</td><td>19.58</td><td>507</td><td>5.4</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>9318.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2hRg814v8KkdkjWbXRnszcd0soc.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>30974</td><td>Vertige</td><td>High Lane</td><td>fr</td><td>A group of friends on a climbing vacation ignore warnings that the mountains are closed and start their ascent anyway. Collapsing bridges, bear traps and other dangers threaten to splinter the group… when the real hell begins and an unseen villain begins picking them off one by one.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-06-24</td><td>/sbZEfldNNGOBxEs81LFoUwLh8LV.jpg</td><td>19.573</td><td>347</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>2141798.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wMd3lJ4knva521yqjVoElPxJvdt.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>34583</td><td>The Final</td><td>The Final</td><td>en</td><td>A group of high school outcasts get revenge on the students that torment them.</td><td>This lesson can't be learned in the classroom.</td><td>2010-01-28</td><td>/3jPSvaW9veHVeaEll9DH7eoJ634.jpg</td><td>19.573</td><td>221</td><td>6.0</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/c0W5mAgFMBMhb1MIuFlUh04zQxO.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>272692</td><td>The Possession of Michael King</td><td>The Possession of Michael King</td><td>en</td><td>The film tells the story of documentary filmmaker Michael King (Shane Johnson), who doesn’t believe in God or the Devil. Following the sudden death of his wife, Michael decides to make his next film about the search for the existence of the supernatural, making himself the center of the experiment – allowing demonologists, necromancers, and various practitioners of the occult to try the deepest and darkest spells and rituals they can find on him – in the hopes that when they fail, he’ll once and for all have proof that religion, spiritualism, and the paranormal are nothing more than myth. But something does happen. An evil and horrifying force has taken over Michael King. And it will not let him go.</td><td>If you invite it in, it will never let you go.</td><td>2014-08-14</td><td>/r1LrvbUsQHn8ByJIOoeI76F6jR0.jpg</td><td>19.566</td><td>323</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>2405143.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/llGQkZIxoMtSs1IeE3X7y4W696P.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>514277</td><td>Mara</td><td>Mara</td><td>en</td><td>Criminal psychologist Kate Fuller is assigned to the murder of a man who has seemingly been strangled in his sleep by his wife and the only witness is their eight-year-old daughter, Sophie. As Kate digs into the mystery of an ancient demon which kills people in their sleep, she experiences the same petrifying symptoms as all previous victims and spirals through a chilling nightmare to save herself and Sophie before she dares fall asleep again.</td><td>Whatever You Do, Do Not Sleep.</td><td>2018-08-22</td><td>/gQDmXAef1Oc1SXci5mui2x5DJwt.jpg</td><td>19.548</td><td>313</td><td>5.7</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>470901.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5v60mZhF7nLgmPS3qZ9JUwDr33l.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>336560</td><td>Lake Placid vs. Anaconda</td><td>Lake Placid vs. Anaconda</td><td>en</td><td>A giant alligator goes head to head with a giant Anaconda. The town sheriff must find a way to destroy the two monsters before they kill the whole town.</td><td>NA</td><td>2015-04-25</td><td>/qF3TYXksv1O0zX3SIS12kNmJLmN.jpg</td><td>19.536</td><td>157</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wUXZ8KjLreDJPW3RCZTxrgJkb3i.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>97768</td><td>Lake Placid Collection</td></tr><tr><td>294963</td><td>Bone Tomahawk</td><td>Bone Tomahawk</td><td>en</td><td>During a shootout in a saloon, Sheriff Hunt injures a suspicious stranger. The doctor's assistant, wife of the local foreman, tends to him in prison. That night, the town is attacked and they both disappear—only the arrow of a cannibal tribe is found. Hunt and a few of his men go in search of the prisoner and the foreman's wife.</td><td>May the Lord have mercy and grant you a swift death</td><td>2015-10-23</td><td>/4MmTHpn2Y8emqvBgvOjufImUmKZ.jpg</td><td>19.534</td><td>1730</td><td>6.8</td><td>1800000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>133</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/orXMq2jZy8wFmePv7zXS2Kor7Ug.jpg</td><td>Horror, Western</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>465086</td><td>The Grudge</td><td>The Grudge</td><td>en</td><td>After a young mother murders her family in her own house, a detective attempts to investigate the mysterious case, only to discover that the house is cursed by a vengeful ghost. Now targeted by the demonic spirits, the detective must do anything to protect herself and her family from harm.</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-01-01</td><td>/vN7JHlHOT9rHNDU27tfYqhABBj5.jpg</td><td>19.517</td><td>975</td><td>5.6</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>4.28E7</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iuW78LWxApCvjLuMebcICwF2owQ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9599</td><td>The Blob</td><td>The Blob</td><td>en</td><td>Remake of the 1958 horror sci-fi about a deadly blob which is the spawn of a secret government germ warfare project which consumes everyone in its path. Teenagers try in vain to warn the townsfolk, who refuse to take them seriously, while government agents try to cover up the evidence and confine the creature.</td><td>Scream now, while there's still room to breathe.  Terror has no shape.</td><td>1988-08-05</td><td>/dC7KOlc8oVSgUw607E2S7P3WLwb.jpg</td><td>19.514</td><td>672</td><td>6.7</td><td>1.9E7</td><td>8247943.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/dFTVFGIeAdLfJ8oNQ1GXdWF0z5R.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>426249</td><td>Lords of Chaos</td><td>Lords of Chaos</td><td>en</td><td>A teenager's quest to launch Norwegian Black Metal in Oslo in the 1990s results in a very violent outcome.</td><td>Based on truth and lies</td><td>2018-09-20</td><td>/y2eOIfQw2lLZov6aJZ3xpPjnRHH.jpg</td><td>19.498</td><td>325</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>365353.0</td><td>118</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oaDTXNmyqeNEEBat3h4ijiu27jv.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Music, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>313922</td><td>Green Room</td><td>Green Room</td><td>en</td><td>A punk rock band becomes trapped in a secluded venue after finding a scene of violence. For what they saw, the band themselves become targets of violence from a gang of white power skinheads, who want to eliminate all evidence of the crime.</td><td>One way in. No way out.</td><td>2015-09-25</td><td>/evZicaR7nXe4LiD9G6QYTorcJGO.jpg</td><td>19.49</td><td>2272</td><td>6.7</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>3769214.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wjTNqt0RLe4aRMJHvjlKLtzw1vr.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14211</td><td>Prey</td><td>Prey</td><td>en</td><td>An American family on holiday in Africa becomes lost in a game reserve and stalked by vicious killer lions.</td><td>Out here, you're the endangered species...</td><td>2007-05-18</td><td>/8wm53EpaTLzQuJ3F19H5AwG3Fhl.jpg</td><td>19.43</td><td>286</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>3643652.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rBOb3v35qgTXkNHkOW2UYiTZjPa.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>450932</td><td>Armed Response</td><td>Armed Response</td><td>en</td><td>The story follows a team of highly trained operatives who find themselves trapped inside an isolated military compound.</td><td>No Retreat No Mercy</td><td>2017-08-04</td><td>/ozhEmqMpJMPg6Rz9lJ0AFhZaGMI.jpg</td><td>19.422</td><td>129</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>52036.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rcYoFja1KidJlTzQCHoxLHaw1AO.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>623520</td><td>Z</td><td>Z</td><td>en</td><td>A family find themselves terrorized by their eight-year-old son's imaginary friend.</td><td>Z wants to play</td><td>2019-09-19</td><td>/r7U6HTvhFV6z9bvIyPydJeVI3Ao.jpg</td><td>19.404</td><td>164</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/f7x2aH3C6u6fgpKqqXZ5mCdihaf.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>653615</td><td>Amulet</td><td>Amulet</td><td>en</td><td>Tomaz, an ex-soldier now homeless in London, is offered a place to stay at a decaying house, inhabited by a young woman and her dying mother. As he starts to fall for Magda, Tomaz cannot ignore his suspicion that something insidious might also be living alongside them.</td><td>Have faith in fear</td><td>2020-07-24</td><td>/kEVyAkEkpwpfyx4oZMg22A8ivDI.jpg</td><td>19.391</td><td>95</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zrQrXkyNaYZvLmGqMyjlrVxPs6f.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10779</td><td>The Frighteners</td><td>The Frighteners</td><td>en</td><td>Once an architect, Frank Bannister now passes himself off as an exorcist of evil spirits. To bolster his facade, he claims his \"special\" gift is the result of a car accident that killed his wife. But what he does not count on is more people dying in the small town where he lives. As he tries to piece together the supernatural mystery of these killings, he falls in love with the wife of one of the victims and deals with a crazy FBI agent.</td><td>No Rest for the Wicked.</td><td>1996-07-18</td><td>/y35gx5ElAWa9Jhq6O0QrmbiS3lz.jpg</td><td>19.365</td><td>1224</td><td>6.9</td><td>3.0E7</td><td>2.9359216E7</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/naGsxof4OVpWQJn1qd9sTwUvYPI.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>520466</td><td>Lake Placid: Legacy</td><td>Lake Placid: Legacy</td><td>en</td><td>A group of young explorers discover a secret area hidden from all maps and GPS devices. When they reach the center of the lake, they discover an abandoned facility that houses one of the largest, and deadliest apex-predators known to man.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-05-28</td><td>/eBZXrR5zlGdRAXuugtUQo9D4dCp.jpg</td><td>19.335</td><td>113</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3rIocL2KDm8d2sCVmqDI0IEK2vF.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie</td><td>97768</td><td>Lake Placid Collection</td></tr><tr><td>672761</td><td>The Candy Witch</td><td>The Candy Witch</td><td>en</td><td>Two ghost hunters are called upon a distressed family who claim they are being tormented by an evil spirit known in their local town as The Candy Witch. But as the mystery of her curse is uncovered, surprising and sinister turns are discovered around The Candy Witch's identity. Their hardest case yet, can they solve this evil curse before more people are killed by the demonic spirit?</td><td>Sweet dreams... FOREVER</td><td>2020-06-04</td><td>/egxBjIqHhpFpA4VlpZkcKZx5iTJ.jpg</td><td>19.328</td><td>26</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8vHaHNCibXXUY3iEkkGtAjidWbW.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17898</td><td>Silver Bullet</td><td>Silver Bullet</td><td>en</td><td>The small city of Tarker's Mill is startled by a series of sadistic murders. The population fears that this is the work of a maniac. During a search a mysterious, hairy creature is observed. This strange appearance is noticed once a month. People lock themselves up at night, but there's one boy who's still outside, he's preparing the barbecue.</td><td>It started in May. In a small town. And every month after that whenever the moon was full... it came back.</td><td>1985-10-10</td><td>/52CvWYuJyWcMTPvsfcmsxaVHi7f.jpg</td><td>19.296</td><td>438</td><td>6.5</td><td>7000000.0</td><td>1.24E7</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8G4HmNcSXS0vy2bdVSUARLXIgjj.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>246403</td><td>Tusk</td><td>Tusk</td><td>en</td><td>When his best friend and podcast co-host goes missing in the backwoods of Canada, a young guy joins forces with his friend's girlfriend to search for him.</td><td>Let me tell you a story...</td><td>2014-09-19</td><td>/pHghiDnQ63O7MiItD6CaSz2jjnr.jpg</td><td>19.296</td><td>1078</td><td>5.5</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>1882074.0</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/v2iXCMVGQ9ZsJAH9SVXVhaE929E.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>553902</td><td>True North Collection</td></tr><tr><td>8914</td><td>Deep Blue Sea</td><td>Deep Blue Sea</td><td>en</td><td>Researchers on the undersea lab Aquatica have genetically altered the brains of captive sharks to develop a cure for Alzheimer's disease. But there's an unexpected side effect: the sharks got smarter, faster, and more dangerous. After a big storm damages their remote research facility, they must fight for their lives.</td><td>Bigger. Smarter. Faster. Meaner.</td><td>1999-07-28</td><td>/fyn0zyCI4kIlbDoHH0Hzv09hDC5.jpg</td><td>19.294</td><td>2002</td><td>5.9</td><td>6.0E7</td><td>1.64648142E8</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/d8TIyaOwqrzWWxERxQ9fJ9jrFrb.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>518165</td><td>Deep Blue Sea Collection</td></tr><tr><td>475220</td><td>In Fabric</td><td>In Fabric</td><td>en</td><td>A haunting ghost story set against the backdrop of a busy winter sales period in a department store, following the life of a cursed dress as it passes from person to person, with devastating consequences.</td><td>A killer dress.</td><td>2018-12-06</td><td>/2ndeOYvcEgRGV0c484ocmfhtma6.jpg</td><td>19.286</td><td>222</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>118</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/97NFoAp9JdgXqBQG6aoUprF6zbS.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>8814</td><td>Doom</td><td>Doom</td><td>en</td><td>A team of space marines known as the Rapid Response Tactical Squad, led by Sarge, is sent to a science facility on Mars after somebody reports a security breach. There, they learn that the alert came after a test subject, a mass murderer purposefully injected with alien DNA, broke free and began killing people. Dr. Grimm, who is related to team member Reaper, informs them all that the chromosome can mutate humans into monsters -- and is highly infectious.</td><td>No one gets out alive.</td><td>2005-10-20</td><td>/eVjlW6aOjqEohH4Ph4PktyH4fMr.jpg</td><td>19.26</td><td>1849</td><td>5.1</td><td>6.0E7</td><td>5.8072119E7</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9EpgaLS44zlXoTSAOhGiJmkIA4B.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>634390</td><td>Doom Collection</td></tr><tr><td>27769</td><td>Sometimes They Come Back</td><td>Sometimes They Come Back</td><td>en</td><td>Based on a short story by Stephen King, a man and his family return to his home town, but he is then harassed by teenagers that died when he was a kid.</td><td>NA</td><td>1991-05-07</td><td>/cJc0hUhtWmZzIeWc1k8CVpJFVbm.jpg</td><td>19.232</td><td>174</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cnK0J2NyfTVeBuSvMa93r2EFjbF.jpg</td><td>Horror, TV Movie</td><td>168545</td><td>Sometimes They Come Back Collection</td></tr><tr><td>548473</td><td>Color Out of Space</td><td>Color Out of Space</td><td>en</td><td>The Gardner family moves to a remote farmstead in rural New England to escape the hustle of the 21st century. They are busy adapting to their new life when a meteorite crashes into their front yard, melts into the earth, and infects both the land and the properties of space-time with a strange, otherworldly colour. To their horror, the family discovers this alien force is gradually mutating every life form that it touches—including them.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-09-07</td><td>/vkwgzCBBiY3C1XEy0WakYfMOvnG.jpg</td><td>19.181</td><td>1057</td><td>6.0</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>1023510.0</td><td>111</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vj2gCvD5vZDJ865izTU0J0wJBVc.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>378485</td><td>Tenemos la carne</td><td>We Are the Flesh</td><td>es</td><td>After wandering a ruined city for years in search of food and shelter, two siblings find their way into one of the last remaining buildings. Inside, they find a man who will make them a dangerous offer to survive the outside world.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-02-02</td><td>/y4vLIUysOqY16XPiaZ1W9oeXBc1.jpg</td><td>19.159</td><td>80</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>79</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/met3Dn9mDQUf9hEyjREVwRlBe0Q.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>273511</td><td>Ghost of Goodnight Lane</td><td>Ghost of Goodnight Lane</td><td>en</td><td>When the staff inside a renovated film studio finds a co-worker dead one morning, the pieces of a forty year puzzle add up to an angry ghost who has let the last person step inside her house. But will they ever get out alive?</td><td>If she's still here, then it won't be quiet, not for you, not for anyone.</td><td>2014-06-10</td><td>/alD9mH7YYsj26Ke6hY8pElU8jYt.jpg</td><td>19.145</td><td>20</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2KWFOMjhw4iMbxbPBjK7nZk9CFg.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>403964</td><td>ClownTown</td><td>ClownTown</td><td>en</td><td>Whilst on their way to a concert four friends get sidetracked and stranded in a seemingly abandoned town and whilst looking for help find themselves stalked and terrorised by a gang of violent clown dressed psychopaths who will stop at nothing ensnaring them into their sinister blood thirsty games.</td><td>They'll rip out your funny bone</td><td>2016-06-27</td><td>/Uqx7NitLn4CO1syvTqN6Bb3F6A.jpg</td><td>19.125</td><td>108</td><td>4.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6jmArQQBcBcqz2