lurk inside its halls. Agatha must now find a way to discover the unyielding strength needed to escape and save her baby before she’s caged behind these walls forever.</td><td>Atone for your sins.</td><td>2018-04-20</td><td>/vfEn1cjQh4Mgcbnwim07hLy5aie.jpg</td><td>19.047</td><td>180</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qgy7GXZFHONsd2R9fazJha8n94z.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>532671</td><td>The Prodigy</td><td>The Prodigy</td><td>en</td><td>A mother concerned about her young son's disturbing behavior thinks something supernatural may be affecting him.</td><td>What's wrong with Miles?</td><td>2019-02-06</td><td>/yyejodyk3lWncVjVhhrEkPctY9o.jpg</td><td>19.045</td><td>847</td><td>6.2</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>2.1150265E7</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oxTgovZ3TQ8LLxifUm16ROMULP5.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12707</td><td>Orca</td><td>Orca</td><td>en</td><td>After witnessing the killing of his mate and offspring at Captain Nolan's hands, a vengeful killer whale goes on a rampage in the fisherman's Newfoundland harbor. Under pressure from the villagers, Nolan, Rachel and Umilak sail after the great beast, who will meet them on its own turf.</td><td>Terror just beneath the surface.</td><td>1977-07-22</td><td>/uSascD0pN3n5d6BlyFdce0hRVzz.jpg</td><td>19.033</td><td>310</td><td>6.2</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>1.4717854E7</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ymgXyJV2AXiHDrcV5r9kDdbLGN0.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>368031</td><td>Unfriend</td><td>Friend Request</td><td>en</td><td>Enjoying college life as a popular student, Laura shares everything with her more than 800 friends on Facebook. But one day, after accepting a friend request from a  social outcast named Marina, Laura’s life is cursed...</td><td>Be careful who you click with.</td><td>2016-01-07</td><td>/8sc2FXCczMd4lb8j5YiT0S6aQiO.jpg</td><td>19.032</td><td>1117</td><td>5.5</td><td>9900000.0</td><td>1.097539E7</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nLpdnLNue3rybD9jVwQK3GbWGMl.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>145135</td><td>Dark Skies</td><td>Dark Skies</td><td>en</td><td>From the producers of Paranormal Activity, Insidious, and Sinister comes Dark Skies: a supernatural thriller that follows a young family living in the suburbs. As husband and wife Daniel and Lacey Barret witness an escalating series of disturbing events involving their family, their safe and peaceful home quickly unravels. When it becomes clear that the Barret family is being targeted by an unimaginably terrifying and deadly force, Daniel and Lacey take matters in their own hands to solve the mystery of what is after their family.</td><td>Once you have been chosen. You belong to them.</td><td>2013-02-21</td><td>/euLgEo2kvuLjYxbfOekWF3l82t6.jpg</td><td>18.95</td><td>1532</td><td>6.3</td><td>3500000.0</td><td>2.5174316E7</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oLuAgHcYk9UrulfFJCmYfcnvmgB.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>455551</td><td>The Recall</td><td>The Recall</td><td>en</td><td>When five friends vacation at a remote lake house, they expect nothing less then a good time, unaware that Earth is under attack by an alien invasion and mass-abductions.</td><td>They've come to claim what's theirs</td><td>2017-06-02</td><td>/yq2DGzM0kNWtGwkplGAcEEM4eSH.jpg</td><td>18.926</td><td>299</td><td>4.6</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>1319566.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/AjZZVxmO6iUyYD5JS4ZuPeo78sx.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>519337</td><td>Tempus Tormentum</td><td>Tempus Tormentum</td><td>en</td><td>A drifter passing through a small town is drugged by three masked psychopaths and forced into a bizarre game of cat and mouse. He is chased through a series of more and more bizarre events until, in the end, he finds that this evening of terror has lasting consequences. It’s a feel bad film, nasty and brutish, red in tooth and claw.</td><td>Capture. Torture. Kill. Repeat.</td><td>2018-04-17</td><td>/8ZbJ7bDmcKr8GzqoKI00awhjqyH.jpg</td><td>18.916</td><td>30</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/Akdkq4k3YJc66fDTp8hztlBiCgb.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>623034</td><td>The Haunted</td><td>The Haunted</td><td>en</td><td>In a rambling, isolated house, Emily’s first night-shift as carer to an elderly dementia patient turns into a nightmare as she is tormented by a vengeful spirit and uncovers the house's dark secrets.</td><td>You see what you want to see.</td><td>2018-10-13</td><td>/1MSE3VYrosSTLL6Mze6hvKrIRyo.jpg</td><td>18.913</td><td>66</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>75</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/evHBqnuov1n2g6qCWboMOWs0Cvb.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>668343</td><td>Alien Outbreak</td><td>Alien Outbreak</td><td>en</td><td>In a small rural community, local police officers Zoe and Patrick begin their shift as normal but soon, strange events unfold. Residents begin behaving erratically, and suicidal panic spreads amongst the township they are trying to protect. Zoe and Patrick realise alien machines are taking hold, cutting their small group of survivors off from the outside world. Can the determined humans band together to save their community, and all mankind, from extinction?</td><td>No One Gets Out</td><td>2020-02-11</td><td>/5m4Gw9wTRxUdDnx7UNn1bNLN54J.jpg</td><td>18.908</td><td>23</td><td>3.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kwkAGwtwS57FckZq6n44oipW1AN.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10280</td><td>Thinner</td><td>Thinner</td><td>en</td><td>An obese lawyer finds himself growing \"Thinner\" when an old gypsy man places a hex on him. Now the lawyer must call upon his friends in organized crime to help him persuade the gypsy to lift the curse. Time is running out for the desperate lawyer as he draws closer to his own death, and grows ever thinner.</td><td>Let the curse fit the crime.</td><td>1996-10-25</td><td>/3GR7uE3zMwERu2CgwdgTbAufFzU.jpg</td><td>18.872</td><td>475</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3xLT29KkCwLqRgRRtaUHGG6OaZ5.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>84228</td><td>Julia X</td><td>Julia X</td><td>en</td><td>Meeting a man on the Internet, Julia decides to see him in person, only to get abducted and branded with the letter \"x\" by that guy. A game of cat and mouse follows, but the story has an unexpected twist.</td><td>NA</td><td>2011-09-24</td><td>/z8OrB7nM2HBAz7IQ3s8PQlKFDr2.jpg</td><td>18.868</td><td>86</td><td>5.0</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5S3WnWmCCoISSNzMjyhfBmPsIAx.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>104755</td><td>The Lords of Salem</td><td>The Lords of Salem</td><td>en</td><td>Heidi, a radio DJ, is sent a box containing a record - a \"gift from the Lords\". The sounds within the grooves trigger flashbacks of her town's violent past. Is Heidi going mad, or are the Lords back to take revenge on Salem, Massachusetts?</td><td>We've been waiting... we've always been waiting</td><td>2012-09-10</td><td>/nqZ6CGGZpQWt139YioekSYHvvkU.jpg</td><td>18.862</td><td>707</td><td>5.5</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>1165882.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lUuJPLrYFKpPFVs2Azt5QIBKaJx.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>38157</td><td>Wishmaster 4: The Prophecy Fulfilled</td><td>Wishmaster 4: The Prophecy Fulfilled</td><td>en</td><td>The unspeakable evil of the soul-devouring djinn rises again in this fourth electrifying installment of the un