e control of other people’s bodies to terminate high profile targets. As she sinks deeper into her latest assignment, Vos becomes trapped inside a mind that threatens to obliterate her.</td><td>No body is safe.</td><td>2020-10-02</td><td>/oLQlUUSlI669r1bgQ7AlnjcrrvC.jpg</td><td>18.804</td><td>580</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>841334.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1DWIdrj8Qga8N3JaDYjJ8z59k2F.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>203835</td><td>Amityville: The Awakening</td><td>Amityville: The Awakening</td><td>en</td><td>Belle, her little sister, and her comatose twin brother move into a new house with their single mother Joan in order to save money to help pay for her brother's expensive healthcare. But when strange phenomena begin to occur in the house including the miraculous recovery of her brother, Belle begins to suspect her Mother isn't telling her everything and soon realizes they just moved into the infamous Amityville house.</td><td>Every house has a history. This one has a legend.</td><td>2017-07-20</td><td>/c9Nyu8YZfLsWWbze4DEGPbnwCcT.jpg</td><td>18.767</td><td>905</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lA8r57ye1Kg30RO8PesaajzAWAM.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>397842</td><td>The Amityville Collection</td></tr><tr><td>355506</td><td>Siren</td><td>Siren</td><td>en</td><td>A bachelor party becomes a savage fight for survival when the groomsmen unwittingly unleash a fabled predator upon the festivities.</td><td>No Man Can Resist Her. All Men Should.</td><td>2016-12-02</td><td>/dAEodQQODOtOlhiQQTW7n1eS9ft.jpg</td><td>18.741</td><td>215</td><td>6.0</td><td>300000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/f0n6qT2SlQmYzQAX0tCZuG0AiSd.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>406994</td><td>Better Watch Out</td><td>Better Watch Out</td><td>en</td><td>On a quiet suburban street tucked within a 'safe ne