nt car chase in LA that unwittingly become stars of the next internet sensation.</td><td>Mayhem goes viral.</td><td>2014-10-23</td><td>/vgq9eyUMDWDugp5ZvS5UuvTCQKN.jpg</td><td>16.663</td><td>500</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>2756.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mfP8XBN3qyXVmqH4YfDnUBA1y1j.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>207621</td><td>V/H/S Collection</td></tr><tr><td>27812</td><td>カクレンボ</td><td>Kakurenbo: Hide & Seek</td><td>ja</td><td>Among the ruins of the city, there is a game only children can play. It is called “Otokoyo”; a game of hide-and-seek. But whenever children play this game, one by one they would disappear into the blinds of the buildings… The story begins when a boy enters the world of Otokoyo, to find his missing sister.</td><td>NA</td><td>2005-03-03</td><td>/u7RhGFaP1gFxZKNrm9nqZL1MNFb.jpg</td><td>16.651</td><td>37</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>25</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rr1ArzCB5rhbcuJSoItXmLPDCMu.jpg</td><td>Animation, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>377264</td><td>Morgan</td><td>Morgan</td><td>en</td><td>A corporate risk-management consultant must determine whether or not to terminate an artificial being's life that was made in a laboratory environment.</td><td>Don't let it out</td><td>2016-09-01</td><td>/v1Qb1I0wVvk8FQaNaat9DHlKFGc.jpg</td><td>16.637</td><td>1280</td><td>5.8</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>8810591.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4lC8it2HF0Ir5hyQfegCFN696oP.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>529027</td><td>Smile</td><td>Smile</td><td>en</td><td>Yuval goes to his friends’ house, where creepy things start happening. He begins to suspect that someone is out to get him when the signs keep appearing. He gets to the point in which paranoia takes over.</td><td>NA</td><td>2005-01-01</td><td>/8e01Dpy2n34Qo5HkdFWIQcamA6s.jpg</td><td>16.633</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>7</td><td>R