 of Nature</td><td>en</td><td>In the town of Dillford, humans, vampires and zombies were all living in peace - until the alien apocalypse arrived. Now three teenagers-one human, one vampire, and one zombie-have to team up to figure out how to get rid of the visitors.</td><td>Get out undead or alive.</td><td>2015-10-30</td><td>/uOfXM61tr3sDoyyAaNTDyfxxyaE.jpg</td><td>16.582</td><td>461</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>70958.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/frTXhzfhoVPVwPJKJx40svhmPeW.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>41704</td><td>Serial Killers: The Real Life Hannibal Lecters</td><td>Serial Killers: The Real Life Hannibal Lecters</td><td>en</td><td>This documentary examines a selection of real life serial killers and compares them to the fictional Hannibal Lecter.</td><td>NA</td><td>2001-01-01</td><td>/n75iTwhKA5EIrNSQn56UtnPvY9D.jpg</td><td>16.581</td><td>14</td><td>7.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>60</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tOls2x7EujSJZ4A0ArTKAvhZKKK.jpg</td><td>Crime, Documentary, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>639798</td><td>Malasaña 32</td><td>32 Malasana Street</td><td>es</td><td>Inspired by real events, the story centers around a family in the 70s who settles in the Madrid neighborhood of Malasaña where their new house will become the worst of their nightmares.</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-01-17</td><td>/DpFMAjyE6EmIknSduykVc1pB1J.jpg</td><td>16.567</td><td>577</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gjiQJWLbTs06pI9WHnCu7NKMoGK.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>426814</td><td>The Domestics</td><td>The Domestics</td><td>en</td><td>A young husband and wife must fight to return home in a post-apocalyptic mid-western landscape ravaged by gangs.</td><td>In the end, defend.</td><td>2018-06-28</td><td>/j64I3u1wwgPct3stvvKU2ikl14w.jpg</td><td>16.565</td><td>361</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><