ing slay-fest.</td><td>You will pay for your sins.</td><td>2014-10-21</td><td>/jGLfL5zg5mt3GXtJtEsk7kqTP93.jpg</td><td>15.566</td><td>248</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lMOFeHOBtS1Jg0TKEf5wAk9JrRa.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>296872</td><td>See No Evil Collection</td></tr><tr><td>730167</td><td>The Reef: Stalked</td><td>The Reef: Stalked</td><td>en</td><td>After her sister's murder, Nic, her younger sister and two friends seek solace through a Pacific island kayaking adventure. Hours into the trip the women are stalked by a shark and must band together, face their fears and save each other.</td><td>It will find you.</td><td>2022-07-14</td><td>/zDyoonhhDBGCWCkE5EZt6yqIp4M.jpg</td><td>15.533</td><td>91</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3mvV2BXwZnQdUuvGECaHoUjxB3d.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>797576</td><td>The Reef Collection</td></tr><tr><td>12521</td><td>Shocker</td><td>Shocker</td><td>en</td><td>After being sent to the electric chair, a serial killer uses electricity to come back from the dead and carry out his vengeance on the football player who turned him in to the police.</td><td>On October 2, at 6:45 AM mass murderer Horace Pinker was put to death. Now, he's really mad.</td><td>1989-10-27</td><td>/xEDmOhNGCKlWlS3mCiqLCVzBXVA.jpg</td><td>15.526</td><td>328</td><td>5.6</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>1.6554699E7</td><td>109</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1F5OOV5gipfGbfSJgQdV29xlNi.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11773</td><td>Village of the Damned</td><td>Village of the Damned</td><td>en</td><td>In a small English village everyone suddenly falls unconscious. When they awake every woman of child bearing age is pregnant. The resulting children have the same strange blond hair, eyes and a strong connection to each other.</td><td>What Demonic Force Lurks Behind Those Eyes?</td><td>1960-06-16</td><td>/qcpXud1UjQzlSe9A062w8Wqg