<td>American Weapon</td><td>American Weapon</td><td>en</td><td>American Weapon is the story of six beautiful travelers who head to the mountains for a getaway weekend, only to be terrorized by a homicidal war veteran, who has been programmed to kill without remorse.</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-01-16</td><td>/cQs4ZCllDscbSF8meQFGGRd8rOY.jpg</td><td>15.455</td><td>10</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/d61IVc4aaB1SiN6Cg5jrJ9hHlU2.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>77321</td><td>Silip</td><td>Daughters of Eve</td><td>tl</td><td>In the remote countryside of Ilongo, various women are sexually abused by local men. Two sisters meet Simon, the most attractive man in the village, and fight over him - one constantly haunted by Catholic dogma because of the abuse she suffered previously.</td><td>Raw and untamed.</td><td>1985-02-07</td><td>/pvxkCz5RFgjZWd5Ajiwx2517Nqt.jpg</td><td>15.436</td><td>11</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>125</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uBsLjwr52IP177jw5QtF8m3I1xP.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>457955</td><td>La Nuit a dévoré le monde</td><td>The Night Eats the World</td><td>fr</td><td>After waking up to find himself all alone in an apartment where a massive party was being held the night before, Sam is immediately forced to face a terrifying reality: the living dead have invaded the streets of Paris.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-03-07</td><td>/2rR2PxT0clt1Hhw5Cv0YGk5DD2H.jpg</td><td>15.435</td><td>526</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nVkI4hCEtaqPZiEc01fQNGipxC8.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17792</td><td>Omen IV: The Awakening</td><td>Omen IV: The Awakening</td><td>en</td><td>Damien Thorn is dead, but his prophecy is reborn in a girl named Delia, who is adopted by two attorneys, Gene and Karen York. When Karen realizes her baby was born under suspicious circumstances, she hires a private investigator to find Delia's real parents. A series of bizarre accidents occur, and Karen begins to suspect everyone of conspiring against her as she unravels the truth about her baby.</td><td>They said it was over. They were wrong...</td><td>1991-07-19</td><td>/hoG6DyuptlnGbXkVlnpXc4LIMkM.jpg</td><td>15.415</td><td>172</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zveMm7FoOi3jihgjlMFoyQzUXVH.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>10919</td><td>The Omen Collection</td></tr><tr><td>13022</td><td>Rogue</td><td>Rogue</td><td>en</td><td>From the director of Wolf Creek comes this terrifying look at nature's perfect killing machine. When a group of tourists stumble into the remote Australian river territory of an enormous crocodile, the deadly creature traps them on a tiny mud island with the tide quickly rising and darkness descending. As the hungry predator closes in, they must fight for survival against all odds.</td><td>How Fast Can You Swim?</td><td>2007-11-08</td><td>/x3pVvUeOgw0IPPyf0QoI8dUTcXq.jpg</td><td>15.408</td><td>526</td><td>6.4</td><td>2.0E7</td><td>4609644.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gPjvOhQmS5O0a2sYTcZRXYneEUf.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>70740</td><td>Goblin</td><td>Goblin</td><td>en</td><td>Every Halloween, a small hamlet in the deep woods is visited by a fierce goblin, intent on capturing infants and brutally murdering anyone in it's path.</td><td>He Wants You Badly</td><td>2010-07-13</td><td>/oVb74qkSDintrRVyJ85nkpUDdyR.jpg</td><td>15.399</td><td>26</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rnnJXf1bAKZDU7lVsSWzAXMqJh1.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>516850</td><td>Русалка. Озеро мертвых</td><td>The Mermaid: Lake of the Dead</td><td>ru</td><td>An evil Mermaid falls in love with Marina's fiancé Roman and aims to keep him away from Marina in her Kingdom of Death under water. The Mermaid is a young woman who drowned a few centuries ago. Marina only has one week to overcome her fear of the dark water, to remain human in the deathly fight with the monsters and not to become one herself.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-07-12</td><td>/gGFZ84plg0TPM737j8ccpseh96l.jpg</td><td>15.397</td><td>269</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4GV7v37r43vPkRNowLIFrpWAb20.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1679</td><td>ゴジラの逆襲</td><td>Godzilla Raids Again</td><td>ja</td><td>Two fishing scout pilots make a horrifying discovery when they encounter a second Godzilla alongside a new monster named Anguirus. Without the weapon that killed the original, authorities attempt to lure Godzilla away from the mainland. But Anguirus soon arrives and the two monsters make their way towards Osaka as Japan braces for tragedy.</td><td>The great story of the terrifying spirits that rampage through Japan!</td><td>1955-04-24</td><td>/bBYdh9tDCyLaArBOzE38QCA7C3y.jpg</td><td>15.389</td><td>183</td><td>6.0</td><td>800000.0</td><td>1952653.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xbKFQCZNK14gp9k6cFCwgp2OCtU.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>374509</td><td>Godzilla (Showa) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>71469</td><td>The Darkest Hour</td><td>The Darkest Hour</td><td>en</td><td>In Moscow, five young people lead the charge against an alien race which has attacked Earth via our power supply.</td><td>Survive The Holidays</td><td>2011-12-22</td><td>/5Ao4qAFbjP7fcFOOdMNvQEnl0Yr.jpg</td><td>15.358</td><td>1229</td><td>5.3</td><td>3.0E7</td><td>6.4626786E7</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ogRXgYKABTqiqmBen9hkbo3Fvz1.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>6312</td><td>Le Pacte des loups</td><td>Brotherhood of the Wolf</td><td>fr</td><td>In 18th century France, the Chevalier de Fronsac and his Native American friend Mani are sent by the King to the Gevaudan province to investigate the killings of hundreds by a mysterious beast.</td><td>NA</td><td>2001-01-31</td><td>/7E0cNopVzqCz92lCsDsr6XoNWoy.jpg</td><td>15.357</td><td>1224</td><td>6.7</td><td>2.9E7</td><td>7.0752904E7</td><td>137</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h0UUPwxnL5w0rYbKE0ZDzOhzBqO.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, History, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>83705</td><td>El páramo</td><td>The Squad</td><td>es</td><td>The air is thick with tension as a military squad proceeds to the foot of a mountain base, where they're ordered to wait for backup and hold their position. The mountain is shrouded in fog and the men are exhausted. They've been fighting guerrillas on enemy turf for some time, and they're worn down by the stress and anxiety of battle. The men don't want to wait; they want to charge up the hill, fearing that their comrades in the base have been overrun by the guerrillas. The squad's leader tries futilely to keep his men in line while dealing with his insolent second-in-command.</td><td>Something is out there</td><td>2011-10-07</td><td>/kIpFTZ3393s33nKjgsbpAtDFN36.jpg</td><td>15.352</td><td>59</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>18392</td><td>Embrace of the Vampire</td><td>Embrace of the Vampire</td><td>en</td><td>An 18-year-old college freshman is seduced by a handsome vampire lover who introduces her to a dark world of carnal desires.</td><td>Between innocence and evil lies the seduction.</td><td>1995-05-30</td><td>/3amk8h3a4xVdt3f5LG8Mo7TrAn0.jpg</td><td>15.35</td><td>100</td><td>5.0</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/489lUOmFJtQBpfrnmEgUMiZxuvK.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9542</td><td>The Hitcher</td><td>The Hitcher</td><td>en</td><td>On a stormy night, young Jim, who transports a luxury car from Chicago to California to deliver it to its owner, feeling tired and sleepy, picks up a mysterious hitchhiker, who has appeared out of nowhere, thinking that a good conversation will help him not to fall asleep. He will have enough time to deeply regret such an unmeditated decision.</td><td>Never pick-up a stranger.</td><td>1986-01-17</td><td>/jj9VF7GL3rLXHfoa8oQ4ioNT8GZ.jpg</td><td>15.342</td><td>686</td><td>7.0</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>5844868.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bPYSLsg7L7zRvhWJsQxOp8Htje9.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>476054</td><td>The Hitcher Collection</td></tr><tr><td>314405</td><td>Il racconto dei racconti</td><td>Tale of Tales</td><td>it</td><td>The Queen of Selvascura risks everything to be a mother; the King of Roccaforte falls in love with the voice of a mysterious girl; the King of Altomonte becomes obsessed with a flea and neglects his daughter.</td><td>Desire. Envy. Obsession.</td><td>2015-05-14</td><td>/ryZsoaYmcEJsye6P5uo5thEjpqB.jpg</td><td>15.329</td><td>1463</td><td>6.4</td><td>1.2E7</td><td>5500277.0</td><td>134</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/UjxHQgV5LFEOBNVhZUbBcfl5pO.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>320048</td><td>Ratter</td><td>Ratter</td><td>en</td><td>Emma is a young and beautiful graduate student just starting a new life in New York City. Like most people her age, she is always connected - her phone and laptop are constant companions, documenting her most intimate moments. What she doesn't realize is that she's sharing her life with an uninvited and dangerous guest. A hacker is following Emma’s every move. When the voyeuristic thrill of watching her digitally isn't enough, the situation escalates to a dangerous and terrifying level.</td><td>Someone who hacks personal devices to stalk their victims' lives.</td><td>2015-01-24</td><td>/vSwYyxa12OqcrVnW6qPGqIBFyh2.jpg</td><td>15.325</td><td>277</td><td>5.1</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gMJfMNctyd2DP2vEfHVj1UMBsXu.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10768</td><td>Omen III: The Final Conflict</td><td>Omen III: The Final Conflict</td><td>en</td><td>Damien Thorn has helped rescue the world from a recession, appearing to be a benign corporate benefactor. When he then becomes U.S. Ambassador to the United Kingdom, Damien fulfills a terrifying biblical prophecy. He also faces his own potential demise as an astronomical event brings about the second coming of Christ.</td><td>The power of evil is no longer in the hands of a child.</td><td>1981-03-20</td><td>/e4eOyQAKBS6ZpJWCcNldZuoSv9t.jpg</td><td>15.321</td><td>428</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>2.0471382E7</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qTBGDYCth8DgeonLJwsEgBJlpIi.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>10919</td><td>The Omen Collection</td></tr><tr><td>532973</td><td>Hell House LLC II: The Abaddon Hotel</td><td>Hell House LLC II: The Abaddon Hotel</td><td>en</td><td>The sequel picks up eight years since the opening night tragedy of HELL HOUSE LLC and still many unanswered questions remain. Thanks to an anonymous tip, an investigative journalist is convinced that key evidence is hidden inside the abandoned Abaddon Hotel - evidence that will shed light on the hotel's mysteries and many unsolved deaths and disappearances. She assembles a team to break into the hotel in hopes of discovering the truth. But the source of the tip and the secrets of the Abaddon Hotel are more horrifying than any of them could have imagined.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-09-14</td><td>/chFGqQVmEmskFKXZEbp4hYVT5IM.jpg</td><td>15.321</td><td>90</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8X2ldTImcNyBAnFs0JSDaetNnCz.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>607112</td><td>Hell House LLC Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10885</td><td>Shutter</td><td>Shutter</td><td>en</td><td>A newly married couple discovers disturbing, ghostly images in photographs they develop after a tragic accident. Fearing the manifestations may be connected, they investigate and learn that some mysteries are better left unsolved.</td><td>The most terrifying images are the ones that are real.</td><td>2008-03-21</td><td>/bft6OyITsxSZuTxu2oJipApLran.jpg</td><td>15.319</td><td>583</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xFUk2PlZY2gyCmQla7HcbEzvn4Y.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10344</td><td>The Fly II</td><td>The Fly II</td><td>en</td><td>Martin Brundle, born of the human/fly, is adopted by his father's place of employment (Bartok Inc.) while the employees simply wait for his mutant chromosomes to come out of their dormant state.</td><td>Like Father Like Son</td><td>1989-02-10</td><td>/gORksEPahEgO409HYJOZlNVyEpe.jpg</td><td>15.288</td><td>491</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>3.8903179E7</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qtYqQ7lCJPTXIRmNV6TadxFRCyI.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>109609</td><td>The Fly (1986) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>28794</td><td>Quella villa accanto al cimitero</td><td>The House by the Cemetery</td><td>it</td><td>After a doctor kills his mistress and himself while researching the mysterious previous owner of his Boston home, his colleague, Dr. Norman Boyle, takes over his research and moves his family from New York City to the Boston mansion. Soon after, Boyle's young son Bob becomes plagued by visions of a young girl, who warns him of the danger within the house.</td><td>Read the fine print. You may have just mortgaged your life.</td><td>1981-08-14</td><td>/9cX9N5ny8XtpVDfJu3Xlaap9cAA.jpg</td><td>15.266</td><td>294</td><td>6.1</td><td>786801.0</td><td>1845819.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vvtvXshMXWRshE8STd6pT1eibbj.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>923500</td><td>Gates of Hell Trilogy</td></tr><tr><td>6488</td><td>Arachnophobia</td><td>Arachnophobia</td><td>en</td><td>A large spider from the jungles of South America is accidentally transported in a crate with a dead body to America where it mates with a local spider. Soon after, the residents of a small California town disappear as the result of spider bites from the deadly spider offspring. It's up to a couple of doctors with the help of an insect exterminator to annihilate these eight legged freaks.</td><td>Eight legs, two fangs, and an attitude.</td><td>1990-07-20</td><td>/lHjpwv1Yv2RcGcTQb4Lc1cKw1y9.jpg</td><td>15.25</td><td>1126</td><td>6.4</td><td>3.1E7</td><td>5.320818E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/doM5EONCuuS6mPa83rc26QDGpS3.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>368182</td><td>Compulsion</td><td>Compulsion</td><td>en</td><td>Sadie—a young female novelist—and an enigmatic woman named Francesca, are enticed by an ex-lover to join him at his Italian villa for a weekend celebration being held to honor the release of Sadie's latest book. Once there, Sadie begins to fear his true intentions as she and Francesca become embroiled in a dangerous game of moral and sexual discovery.</td><td>There are no rules</td><td>2016-11-19</td><td>/8fPZ50FDA0J3EamkP3g371rewNg.jpg</td><td>15.242</td><td>48</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lSRHG4n5bWNVRjYEWyKpp7vIJuD.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>78383</td><td>Nurse 3-D</td><td>Nurse 3-D</td><td>en</td><td>Abby Russell, a beautiful, dedicated nurse with a sinister side, has a secret life in which she targets and punishes dishonest men.</td><td>Your pain is her pleasure.</td><td>2013-09-28</td><td>/3FSl2sSRsNuOVOJgX6HsmnM3gAo.jpg</td><td>15.225</td><td>346</td><td>5.3</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4N0V8UW8u3JhH0NteA86T5otZJL.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>21786</td><td>Fritt vilt</td><td>Cold Prey</td><td>no</td><td>When one of them breaks a leg, 5 friends snowboarding in the Norwegian mountains take shelter in a abandoned ski lodge and soon realize they’re not alone.</td><td>You'll Catch Your Death.</td><td>2006-10-13</td><td>/sxYjsslcs5FSsAkEfjr50gAQWNo.jpg</td><td>15.212</td><td>314</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1cYcF3LaYqt2dKQGv1cZyNLXbaJ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>86553</td><td>Cold Prey Collection</td></tr><tr><td>36685</td><td>The Rocky Horror Picture Show</td><td>The Rocky Horror Picture Show</td><td>en</td><td>Sweethearts Brad and Janet, stuck with a flat tire during a storm, discover the eerie mansion of Dr. Frank-N-Furter, a transvestite scientist. As their innocence is lost, Brad and Janet meet a houseful of wild characters, including a rocking biker and a creepy butler. Through elaborate dances and rock songs, Frank-N-Furter unveils his latest creation: a muscular man named 'Rockv'.</td><td>A different set of jaws.</td><td>1975-08-14</td><td>/3pyE6ZqDbuJi7zrNzzQzcKTWdmN.jpg</td><td>15.202</td><td>2326</td><td>7.5</td><td>1200000.0</td><td>1.12892319E8</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5DU39tmUzbXtD6UXgm7iZqxpwoV.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>694606</td><td>The Rocky Horror Picture Show Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10836</td><td>Dagon</td><td>Dagon</td><td>en</td><td>A boating accident off the coast of Spain sends Paul and his girlfriend Barbara to the decrepit fishing village of Imboca. As night falls, people start to disappear and things not quite human start to appear. Paul is pursued by the entire town. Running for his life, he uncovers Imboca's secret..they worship Dagon, a monstrous god of the sea...and Dagon's unholy offspring are on the loose...</td><td>NA</td><td>2001-10-12</td><td>/nstavzVn4XWkHjAGjBs2BsCZXZp.jpg</td><td>15.174</td><td>285</td><td>6.3</td><td>4800000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nO8lpaJLo1UVIXL7eM5ewwudvtY.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11495</td><td>Firestarter</td><td>Firestarter</td><td>en</td><td>As youths, Andy McGee and his future wife, Vicky, participated in secret experiments, allowing themselves to be subjected to mysterious medical tests. Years later, the couple's daughter, Charlie, begins to exhibit the ability of setting fires solely with her mind. This volatile talent makes the youngster extremely dangerous and soon she becomes a target for the enigmatic agency known as \"The Shop.\"</td><td>Will she have the power... to survive?</td><td>1984-05-11</td><td>/2ux5lqNuibd8eOkwwUhzfzAJBqD.jpg</td><td>15.134</td><td>542</td><td>6.3</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>1.7080167E7</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uPZTWjzFC1GeYDVaaqPKZgoBWgl.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>886083</td><td>Deadstream</td><td>Deadstream</td><td>en</td><td>A disgraced internet personality attempts to win back his followers by livestreaming one night alone in a haunted house. But when he accidentally pisses off a vengeful spirit, his big comeback event becomes a real-time fight for his life.</td><td>He's dying for followers.</td><td>2022-10-20</td><td>/5rsS8m61oHTjoTKfDWVMF3OHnww.jpg</td><td>15.126</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/coN9igjpIYzWtFj89MnBlkj9oIG.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>409617</td><td>Killing Ground</td><td>Killing Ground</td><td>en</td><td>A couple's camping trip turns into a frightening ordeal when they stumble across the scene of a horrific crime.</td><td>A remote campsite. An abandoned tent. A romantic getaway to die for.</td><td>2017-08-24</td><td>/u7hkfmhQ1nohbXsZ7jIEZXqPI6n.jpg</td><td