er life!</td><td>1958-07-16</td><td>/kXdBcDh2EbgSIf4Oo1dxKapZM2f.jpg</td><td>14.889</td><td>412</td><td>7.1</td><td>700000.0</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xazdzH2BsKA1bXG0MUVxbyxDuL7.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>123213</td><td>The Fly Collection</td></tr><tr><td>40041</td><td>Strange Behavior</td><td>Strange Behavior</td><td>en</td><td>When the teenagers in a small Illinois town start getting murdered, the police chief makes a connection to the mysterious scientific experiments being done at the local university and must stop them before his own son is dragged into the deadly scheme.</td><td>Town population is down... about six feet</td><td>1981-10-16</td><td>/iGCUjapkkS568KKdJUIXUQ57TK7.jpg</td><td>14.864</td><td>42</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/stFvHpXgoAB1KPqzN3XfzCPHQPh.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>535581</td><td>The Dead Don't Die</td><td>The Dead Don't Die</td><td>en</td><td>In a small peaceful town, zombies suddenly rise to terrorize the town. Now three bespectacled police officers and a strange Scottish morgue expert must band together to defeat the undead.</td><td>The Greatest Zombie Cast Ever Disassembled.</td><td>2019-05-15</td><td>/fgGzTEoNxptCRtEOpOPvIEdlxAq.jpg</td><td>14.863</td><td>2093</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.2104595E7</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sg5h0LzhJtkjOnXwT87OBVjB7qJ.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>534072</td><td>Great White</td><td>Great White</td><td>en</td><td>A sea plane is destroyed in a freak accident, five people find themselves drifting on a raft. At the mercy of the tide and with no hope of rescue, the helpless situation takes a horrifying turn when they are terrorized by a ravenous great white.</td><td>Take your final breath.</td><td>2021-05-13</td><td>/2wEVked59Y00NKK4Vj0FgzUz