n. Zoe is killed during an attempt to recreate the experiment, leading Frank to test the process on her. Zoe is revived -- but something evil is within her.</td><td>Evil will rise.</td><td>2015-01-29</td><td>/4aq0TOLvITU3iWRUfxlRc83lMz1.jpg</td><td>14.05</td><td>1226</td><td>5.3</td><td>3300000.0</td><td>6.4110728E7</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1zfWZyaoRQOKSSCbyWMxZRZWZVa.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>203101</td><td>学園黙示録 HIGHSCHOOL OF THE DEAD ドリフターズ・オブ・ザ・デッド</td><td>High School of the Dead: Drifters of the Dead</td><td>ja</td><td>In their efforts to find a safe haven from the zombie apocalypse, the gang find themselves on a deserted island. Now, they take advantage of the momentary respite to enjoy some surf, sand and bathing suits!</td><td>NA</td><td>2011-04-25</td><td>/jlRGVYItWkDIJg4OZp9S2g5lKuc.jpg</td><td>14.043</td><td>423</td><td>7.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>18</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wZW52KebGGY4NRnW8xr4LkDxkLT.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>7182</td><td>Venom</td><td>Venom</td><td>en</td><td>A group of teenagers fear for their lives in the swamps of Louisiana, chased by Mr. Jangles, a man possessed by 13 evil souls, and now relentless in his pursuit of new victims.</td><td>He never hurt a soul until the day he died.</td><td>2005-09-16</td><td>/hCMTpv1I9KK90ApxXDyaf8SwJcf.jpg</td><td>14.031</td><td>270</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>881779.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lMY3gjXj3OJ7UXH0veoEMiYQkle.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>611605</td><td>1BR</td><td>1BR</td><td>en</td><td>When Sarah lucks into a sweet one-bedroom at Asilo Del Mar Apartments in Los Angeles, she think she's hit the jackpot. It's got plenty of space, friendly tenants, group BBQs and even a cute neighbour next door. All is not what it seems: loud noises start keeping