ind a way to exorcise the spectral predator.</td><td>NA</td><td>2013-08-22</td><td>/gydvWMOAUWFd3znJU58rxuZnvkW.jpg</td><td>13.801</td><td>123</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8LoYHmYgrFno4lddbqKAtxJI6X5.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>957891</td><td>Ghost Shark Collection</td></tr><tr><td>1021056</td><td>Ringworms</td><td>Ringworms</td><td>en</td><td>After discovering her boyfriend's plan to propose on their weekend vacation, a young girl undergoes a crisis of commitment which attracts the attention of a sinister cult.</td><td>Sooner or later it will come out.</td><td>2022-10-06</td><td>/2ZHQkVUjiK4t4Md4JVkwt978VqS.jpg</td><td>13.783</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>13</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29756</td><td>13 Ghosts</td><td>13 Ghosts</td><td>en</td><td>Reclusive Dr. Zorba has died and left his mansion to his nephew Cyrus and his family. They will need to search the house to find the doctor's fortune, but along with the property they have also inherited the occultist's collection of 13 ghosts.</td><td>IT'S FUN TO BE SCARED BY 13 GHOSTS</td><td>1960-07-18</td><td>/8CyQj2VIfmGzjvdoLwYLyT8h4YS.jpg</td><td>13.765</td><td>107</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ruMcEBj1IpwdzXbeG7WAzjygAPN.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12526</td><td>Bug</td><td>Bug</td><td>en</td><td>In Oklahoma, Agnes, a lonely waitress living in an isolated and dilapidated roadside motel, meets Peter, a quiet and mysterious man with whom she establishes a peculiar relationship.</td><td>Paranoia is contagious</td><td>2006-11-11</td><td>/q1JlVNnzKOKMTfZVsu1pMpduJNP.jpg</td><td>13.742</td><td>428</td><td>6.1</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>8095658.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kcRLwkvfswAhJN30jMqAlZjNjdd.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>289416</td><td>Grace</td><td>Grace</td><td>en</td><td>A unique horror film told from the first-person perspective of Grace - a naive, virginal college freshman trying to deal with campus culture and her outgoing roommate as an evil entity takes over her body and unleashes chaos.</td><td>Innocence ends in blood</td><td>2014-10-28</td><td>/6ikvuPIo1kGuRQz70l3ecissZLS.jpg</td><td>13.732</td><td>182</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gK7abW0QK9mHtHCh62TCIPGmowf.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>21935</td><td>The Haunting Hour: Don't Think About It</td><td>The Haunting Hour: Don't Think About It</td><td>en</td><td>Cassie, a 13 year old Gothic girl, is trying to fit in at her new school. To entertain herself, she plays a series of pranks on the popular kids and her younger brother, Max. When she goes to a Halloween store looking for new tricks, she finds a little book called \"The Evil Thing\"</td><td>NA</td><td>2007-09-04</td><td>/jqQfKmqR2qXjEjJ2F0cH5DbwIGv.jpg</td><td>13.728</td><td>108</td><td>6.3</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ax6ZseXXe26LL9VjKzXf529zHfr.jpg</td><td>Family, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>782654</td><td>Toy Box</td><td>Toy Box</td><td>en</td><td>TOY BOX is a true-crime horror film about the victims and their horrifying ordeal being held captive by a sexual sadist/serial killer, David Parker Ray.</td><td>One girl. One tape. One shot.</td><td>2018-09-22</td><td>/qEFxZBFJ2Qln3t8Sva3XyAO05yY.jpg</td><td>13.71</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>250000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Crime, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>2212</td><td>Nightwatch</td><td>Nightwatch</td><td>en</td><td>A law student, who takes a job as a night watchman at a morgue, begins to discover clues that implicate him as the suspect of a series of murders.</td><td>NA</td><td>1997-01-31</td><td>/2ueCI9QX9AGa4SzJgrvK1fONCa5.jpg</td><td>13.709</td><td>320</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>1179002.0</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wHG6nBPOvJzK4UeqW9thKdoDRYf.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>19158</td><td>Graveyard Shift</td><td>Graveyard Shift</td><td>en</td><td>John Hall is a drifter who wanders into a small town in Maine. He needs a job and decides to seek employment at the community's top business: a large textile mill. He is hired to work the \"graveyard shift\" -- from around midnight to dawn -- and, along with a few others, he is charged with cleaning out the basement. This task strikes the workers as simple enough, but then, as they proceed deeper underground, they encounter an unspeakable monstrosity intent on devouring them all.</td><td>Stephen King took you to the edge with The Shining and Pet Sematary. This time... he pushes you over.</td><td>1990-10-26</td><td>/oVoY9FlZ3soX6g1Fur5jBOZsVVw.jpg</td><td>13.7</td><td>183</td><td>5.2</td><td>1.05E7</td><td>1.1582891E7</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gHbSWwczk3pipdqfTRnhOXpqQfL.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10234</td><td>Funny Games</td><td>Funny Games</td><td>de</td><td>Two psychotic young men take a mother, father, and son hostage in their vacation cabin and force them to play sadistic \"games\" with one another for their own amusement.</td><td>NA</td><td>1997-09-11</td><td>/qzweZTBnVgEROyiSP4QPBoT7uBV.jpg</td><td>13.698</td><td>1429</td><td>7.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>109</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yUmtjm5eLK7WohDtt5E2lHXx84P.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10706</td><td>Mimic 2</td><td>Mimic 2</td><td>en</td><td>When a cockroach-spread plague threatened to decimate the child population of New York City in the original Mimic, biologist Susan Tyler and her research associates developed a species of \"Judas\" bugs and introduced them into the environment, where they were to \"mimic\" the diseased roaches and infiltrate their grubby habitats. The plan worked until the bugs evolved to mimic their next prey... humans! Just when they were all thought to be dead, the giant cockroaches are back, and this time they've mutated to take on human form!</td><td>Nothing will stop them...</td><td>2001-07-17</td><td>/13tSI83ucR7XuQcr7muAjNIgH91.jpg</td><td>13.673</td><td>164</td><td>5.3</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/udlGnZ1DJSAyF0aGbjxGLSsAl3D.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>10721</td><td>Mimic Collection</td></tr><tr><td>353979</td><td>Pet</td><td>Pet</td><td>en</td><td>A man bumps into an old crush and becomes obsessed. After several failed attempts at winning her over, he kidnaps her and holds her captive underneath the animal shelter where he works.</td><td>If You Love Something, Never Let It Go.</td><td>2016-09-24</td><td>/cO5debLXk54GhgXd92GVD0Hpinv.jpg</td><td>13.671</td><td>571</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>22003.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bfKnMsPISCME2H4VxlUIb6SAOWG.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>84997</td><td>They're Playing with Fire</td><td>They're Playing with Fire</td><td>en</td><td>A married college professor decides to seduce her student, whom she hired as a handyman for her yacht. The hesitant student succumbs to his buxom professor, but their romance is interrupted by her corrupt husband and a masked murderer.</td><td>From his French maid, he got Private Lessons. Now his English professor is giving him a REAL education.</td><td>1984-04-01</td><td>/3kZqOoG3umk5mK3YHnrTLQoAFnd.jpg</td><td>13.661</td><td>20</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hih8wlrOtMZrBd4AXe6nziMvPR8.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>844380</td><td>Nix</td><td>Nix</td><td>en</td><td>When a mysterious entity manifests itself, a family finds themselves on a scary and dark journey into their own self-created madness.</td><td>Don't be afraid... It's nothing.</td><td>2022-09-27</td><td>/l4NuODRseyq0GffTyzpapwRrOe4.jpg</td><td>13.661</td><td>1</td><td>2.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eWYJJComSRrnThuN4HlMmtnP1Nt.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>312793</td><td>The Walking Deceased</td><td>The Walking Deceased</td><td>en</td><td>A group of survivors from all walks of the apocalypse – an idiotic Sheriff with definite coma-induced brain damage, his hardass son and a hobo with only a crossbow to stave off the walking dead, four squabbling friends forced to survive this zombieland together, and a lonely zombie who just needs love to fully regain his warm body – leave their once-safe mall hideout in search of the rumored Safe Haven Ranch, a refuge untouched by the zombie virus that has ravaged humanity.</td><td>NA</td><td>2015-03-20</td><td>/i7X1Z7Oo4pJghgDmDoL1rIhyGJd.jpg</td><td>13.655</td><td>159</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11804</td><td>White Noise</td><td>White Noise</td><td>en</td><td>An architect's desire to speak with his wife from beyond the grave using EVP (Electronic Voice Phenomenon), becomes an obsession with supernatural repercussions.</td><td>The line separating the living from the dead has been crossed.</td><td>2005-01-07</td><td>/8G5OKXjO5iQkuHAgysWRV1bUs1R.jpg</td><td>13.653</td><td>684</td><td>5.6</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>9.1196419E7</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/71X982Z2hHTRSc2Ez70cpgeGuVu.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>102777</td><td>White Noise Collection</td></tr><tr><td>118957</td><td>Bait</td><td>Bait</td><td>en</td><td>A freak tsunami traps shoppers at a coastal Australian supermarket inside the building ... along with a 12-foot great white shark.</td><td>A Tsunami Just Flipped The Foodchain.</td><td>2012-09-05</td><td>/e2OIr4y90ZZjIRWQ0XBOVzpBn4x.jpg</td><td>13.646</td><td>639</td><td>5.7</td><td>3.0E7</td><td>3.25E7</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/r8xotdjJLzZpdbj3Iz636bUi3oR.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11510</td><td>Repossessed</td><td>Repossessed</td><td>en</td><td>It's been some time since Father Jebedaiah Mayii exorcised the Devil from little Nancy Aglet, who is now grown up with a husband and two children of her own. But the prince of darkness wants to go a second round and has returned to repossess her! With Father Mayii unwilling to help, Father Luke Brophy tries his best to help Nancy, even when TV's Ernest Weller plans to air the exorcism live on TV.</td><td>The Devil's back. But he's never dealt with an exorcist like this!</td><td>1990-09-14</td><td>/jDTP5KgWwvuKfOyJ2PJfTqVYnxJ.jpg</td><td>13.636</td><td>224</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>1382462.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aNj3YueOCMXzhjyD3qMjLmzzTWk.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>635199</td><td>犬鳴村</td><td>Howling Village</td><td>ja</td><td>After her brother goes missing, a young psychologist visits an infamous haunted and cursed location known as ‘Howling Village’ to investigate his disappearance and uncover her family’s dark history.</td><td>Horror comes home.</td><td>2020-02-07</td><td>/doM8q4gqgLSFDbajjvJTlng4ZkN.jpg</td><td>13.636</td><td>39</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.2175665E7</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sZV8aQJlym7AiBcE1H3ISEGoVVw.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>940323</td><td>Village Collection</td></tr><tr><td>3036</td><td>Mary Shelley's Frankenstein</td><td>Mary Shelley's Frankenstein</td><td>en</td><td>Based on Mary Shelley's novel, \"Frankenstein\" tells the story of Victor Frankenstein, a promising young doctor who, devastated by the death of his mother during childbirth, becomes obsessed with bringing the dead back to life. His experiments lead to the creation of a monster, which Frankenstein has put together with the remains of corpses. It's not long before Frankenstein regrets his actions.</td><td>Be warned.</td><td>1994-11-04</td><td>/bOwCAQsZlEKrwhPi1ejY6BS8jpL.jpg</td><td>13.633</td><td>1014</td><td>6.4</td><td>4.5E7</td><td>1.12006296E8</td><td>123</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3URFkXMnqemZq8OCCylRsJr3ppw.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Romance, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>8973</td><td>Lord of Illusions</td><td>Lord of Illusions</td><td>en</td><td>During a routine case in L.A., NY private investigator Harry D'Amour stumbles over members of a fanatic cult who are preparing for the resurrection of their leader Nix, a powerful magician who was killed 13 years earlier.</td><td>Trust Nothing Except Your Fear.</td><td>1995-08-25</td><td>/miQREwapDUNwfInokjeVLt8BiNM.jpg</td><td>13.62</td><td>255</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>119</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yLfUS9nFmyrYsntznhvxpZMrdtl.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>135309</td><td>Lake Placid: The Final Chapter</td><td>Lake Placid: The Final Chapter</td><td>en</td><td>Black Lake is now a crocodile sanctuary, surrounded by an electric fence. When the fence is left open, a high-school bus unknowingly enters the park. It's up to Reba and the Sheriff to save the kids from becoming crocodile food.</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-09-29</td><td>/AiKZELy3QivFVVSuHOAJtYNAwaS.jpg</td><td>13.613</td><td>144</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5nAMgX8NR0FeQiWXvCxEASvmovF.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>97768</td><td>Lake Placid Collection</td></tr><tr><td>503706</td><td>The Haunting of Sharon Tate</td><td>The Haunting of Sharon Tate</td><td>en</td><td>Pregnant with director Roman Polanski's child and awaiting his return from Europe, 26-year-old Hollywood actress Sharon Tate becomes plagued by visions of her imminent death.</td><td>Based on a True Story of one of the most Horrific Murders in History</td><td>2019-04-05</td><td>/qzIQjfKmrTKf25y3N3VU88bFn8H.jpg</td><td>13.581</td><td>167</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>68904.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7OsMTSVI9pfurIsaOrGPW7cxqgk.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>15856</td><td>House on Haunted Hill</td><td>House on Haunted Hill</td><td>en</td><td>Frederick Loren has invited five strangers to a party of a lifetime. He is offering each of them $10,000 if they can stay the night in a house. But the house is no ordinary house. This house has a reputation for murder. Frederick offers them each a gun for protection. They all arrived in a hearse and will either leave in it $10,000 richer or leave in it dead!</td><td>Consult your doctor! Bring your seat belts!</td><td>1959-02-17</td><td>/g5kdFt3piV3w1pG65W9sSToJ7HB.jpg</td><td>13.578</td><td>376</td><td>6.8</td><td>200000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>75</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lMFZsHmBvzGwNoQ0bf38Uwmi7sU.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>46221</td><td>The Tunnel</td><td>The Tunnel</td><td>en</td><td>In 2007, in the midst of the drought and water shortages, the NSW State government has unveiled plans to tap into and recycle millions of litres of water trapped in a network of abandoned train tunnels just beneath the heart of Sydney. However the government suddenly goes cold on the plan and it is not made public why. There is talk of homeless people who use the tunnel as shelter going missing, even though the government states that there are no homeless people in there. This, and the silence from the officials and ministers, leads a journalist, Natasha to begin an investigation into a government cover-up. She and her crew Pete (Producer), 