ntuC3d20YAsJu.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14219</td><td>Skinwalkers</td><td>Skinwalkers</td><td>en</td><td>Creatures, bound by the blood of the wolf, that can kill with curses and move at lightening speed, watching the night sky for the rise of the blood-red crescent moon. They are SKINWALKERS. They feed on our flesh and thirst for the taste of human blood. The red moon signals each pack, divided by principles, hell bent to survive an ancient prophecy.</td><td>For them to live, we must die.</td><td>2006-03-20</td><td>/3wHzoF0C6taZ9gLz6NRnHdfpzTn.jpg</td><td>13.074</td><td>234</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mfbeoYC0orNRxxOGT5nwSYCMzMG.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>298584</td><td>Cabin Fever</td><td>Cabin Fever</td><td>en</td><td>In this grisly remake of the 2002 horror hit, five college chums rent an isolated woodland cabin for a party. But their fun quickly ends when the group is exposed to a hideous flesh-eating virus, and survival becomes the name of the game.</td><td>You can't run from what's inside.</td><td>2016-02-12</td><td>/yJQLWoizC5zBjVk9dr2Qo1K1TCI.jpg</td><td>13.064</td><td>354</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xZy63KVyeQy2U2GGq2KtKSBTIta.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>901418</td><td>Croc!</td><td>Croc!</td><td>en</td><td>Deep in the English countryside, Lisa and Charlie prepare for their wedding at a Tudor mansion. But an angry crocodile lies in wait, determined to ruin their big day.</td><td>It's not safe to swim anywhere.</td><td>2022-08-25</td><td>/u4Xq3M0NMAimB95tgGLblTeVThn.jpg</td><td>13.054</td><td>1</td><td>2.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iaZqpmhYs4KxNx6M89CesZiMdCv.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24920</td><td>Paura nella città dei morti viventi</td><td>City of the Living Dead</td><td>it</td><td>A psychic participates in a séance where she sees a vision of a Dunwich priest hanging himself in a church cemetery, causing her to die of fright. New York City reporter Peter Bell investigates the séance and learns that the priest's suicide has somehow opened a portal to Hell and must be sealed by All Saints Day, or else the dead will overtake humanity.</td><td>And the dead shall rise and walk the earth!</td><td>1980-08-11</td><td>/8ymAiDW9ct2GSywWkqATEiKE8OB.jpg</td><td>13.03</td><td>289</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uv5q7KtaUs6LeHPcC1eWJO5N8uI.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>923500</td><td>Gates of Hell Trilogy</td></tr><tr><td>919</td><td>Blood: The Last Vampire</td><td>Blood: The Last Vampire</td><td>ja</td><td>In Japan, the vampire-hunter Saya, who is a powerful original, is sent by her liaison with the government, David, posed as a teenage student to the Yokota High School on the eve of Halloween to hunt down vampires. Saya asks David to give a new katana to her. Soon she saves the school nurse Makiho Amano from two vampires disguised of classmates and Makiho witnesses her fight against the powerful demon.</td><td>NA</td><td>2000-11-18</td><td>/2yysSRyqa4ubIDpQcQpG8SuYcl6.jpg</td><td>13.029</td><td>246</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>48</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/17s9ojb8j8QnBGCfqDUJraXLlFi.jpg</td><td>Animation, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>157085</td><td>Il sesso della strega</td><td>Sex of the Witch</td><td>it</td><td>An old man dies and as his relatives await their dosh they start getting killed, sort of by a witch!</td><td>Almost completely without reason</td><td>1973-01-01</td><td>/rmwtO9JVVRn2t5lg5FKFBC4IQDK.jpg</td><td>13.028</td><td>14</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zaScN5oREzvxMvL0Sl4YpOHEsix.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>581531</td><td>변신</td><td>Metamorphosis</td><td>ko</td><td>An evil spirit that changes faces infiltrates one family placing one brother in danger while the other tries to save him.</td><td>Do not be deceived.</td><td>2019-08-21</td><td>/somL0rNxv9q60m9DgKhzOVNrJ3Q.jpg</td><td>13.023</td><td>154</td><td>7.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>113</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ptxMkt6fp2tbbtB4HTLKrlk8Dup.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>601844</td><td>Becky</td><td>Becky</td><td>en</td><td>A teenager's weekend at a lake house with her father takes a turn for the worse when a group of convicts wreaks havoc on their lives.</td><td>There once was a little girl...</td><td>2020-07-23</td><td>/9wqKF883Kn9c0SZV4ZmkIkFhBLh.jpg</td><td>13.017</td><td>328</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>1045873.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/Atliuc6NqnFjM34UFRV8KoA6YMq.jpg</td><td>Action, Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>986072</td><td>Becky Collection</td></tr><tr><td>9756</td><td>Half Light</td><td>Half Light</td><td>en</td><td>Rachel Carson, a best-selling crime novelist, is devastated and filled with guilt over the accidental death of her son. Hoping that a change of scenery will help alleviate her suffering, she leaves her home in the city and moves into a vacant country house owned by a friend and begins a relationship with charming local Angus. But, just as her life is taking a turn for the better, Rachel realizes she's being romanced by a ghost, leading her to doubt her own sanity.</td><td>When the darkness falls the dead will rise.</td><td>2006-01-17</td><td>/awyAxbPqKuOmQmuXSB214KObsPR.jpg</td><td>13.008</td><td>239</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9RIojJuwiCqTDLQpUWjyyXo5csp.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>2291</td><td>Jacob's Ladder</td><td>Jacob's Ladder</td><td>en</td><td>After returning home from the Vietnam War, veteran Jacob Singer struggles to maintain his sanity. Plagued by hallucinations and flashbacks, Singer rapidly falls apart as the world and people around him morph and twist into disturbing images. His girlfriend, Jezzie, and ex-wife, Sarah, try to help, but to little avail. Even Singer's chiropractor friend, Louis, fails to reach him as he descends into madness.</td><td>The most frightening thing about Jacob Singer's nightmare is that he isn't dreaming.</td><td>1990-11-02</td><td>/4GY4FsM0ZOtbSTeMpY0g4WkEuBW.jpg</td><td>13.003</td><td>1262</td><td>7.4</td><td>2.5E7</td><td>2.5965144E7</td><td>113</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/o51fkX20MoZSvhQ1coH03pc2XVG.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>33005</td><td>Mimic: Sentinel</td><td>Mimic: Sentinel</td><td>en</td><td>A man enclosed in a plastic bubble, his sister, and their best friend must defend an apartment complex from the mutant Judas Breed insects.</td><td>NA</td><td>2003-04-14</td><td>/vNAwfgBPZXprxfgx7cF5Cji4be1.jpg</td><td>13.0</td><td>108</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>77</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mG5pj5KpnUQV2rMLIIMQSsBsPEW.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>10721</td><td>Mimic Collection</td></tr><tr><td>17921</td><td>Terrore nello spazio</td><td>Planet of the Vampires</td><td>it</td><td>In the near future the two spaceships Argos and Galliot are sent to investigate the mysterious planet Aura. As the Argos lands on the planet her crew suddenly go berserk and attack each other. The strange event passes, but the crew soon discovers the crashed Galliot - and learns that her crew died fighting each other! Investigating further, the explorers come to realize the existence of a race of bodiless aliens that seek to escape from their dying world.</td><td>This was the day the universe trembled before the demon forces of the killer planet!</td><td>1965-09-15</td><td>/bPpfT4r9HtHcri0eIknqpewoewM.jpg</td><td>12.993</td><td>182</t