eleased</td><td>false</td><td>/d5tcsjdLw3uxBd318EIcTn9e35X.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Crime, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>168705</td><td>BloodRayne</td><td>BloodRayne</td><td>en</td><td>In 18th-century Romania, after spending much of her life in a traveling circus, human-vampire hybrid Rayne escapes and plots to take down her father, Kagan, the evil vampire king. When she's discovered by three vampire hunters, she manages to convince them to spare her life and join her cause. But slaying a vampire as powerful as Kagan will be no easy task.</td><td>Revenge never tasted so sweet.</td><td>2005-10-22</td><td>/1Xy9uu5INNMnyF7W6BTEQkkGOZC.jpg</td><td>12.952</td><td>419</td><td>4.2</td><td>2.5E7</td><td>3650275.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/noWdMYkuYHnti9wrDg5ufJFl9Ks.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>97307</td><td>BloodRayne Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10579</td><td>Dracula III: Legacy</td><td>Dracula III: Legacy</td><td>en</td><td>In the near future, Uffizi and Luke travel to the remote reaches of war torn Romania to rescue Elizabeth and finish the vampire once and for all. Along the way, they encounter TV news journalist and a corps of rebels trying to fight the vampire uprising which plagues their country.</td><td>You can't fight it. You can't kill it.</td><td>2005-07-12</td><td>/8oyk5bk9NiPXs6OdXnoI6RAOTq7.jpg</td><td>12.945</td><td>80</td><td>5.0</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tbascnbWrNs0MlKbiOs6m5nduxK.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>115822</td><td>Dracula 2000 Collection</td></tr><tr><td>485774</td><td>The Open House</td><td>The Open House</td><td>en</td><td>A teenager and his mother find themselves besieged by threatening forces when they move into a new house.</td><td>You can't lock out what's already inside.</td><td>2018-01-19</td><td>/7JwdoLcbFWaeUBxKaoFulRVK8Ja.jpg</td><td>12.942</td><td>1238</td><td>3.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</