 Hell demands the blood of the innocent to unleash the creatures of the damned.</td><td>Let Us Prey.</td><td>2013-09-26</td><td>/65aDPoEpgFvnAK1bgZysjxgSgyG.jpg</td><td>12.551</td><td>150</td><td>5.2</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>1675381.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/l08JyZrIauqfsKXgUIpCqsNqBkd.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>631583</td><td>Sacrifice</td><td>Sacrifice</td><td>en</td><td>Isaac and his pregnant wife visit a remote Norwegian village to claim an unexpected inheritance. The couple finds themselves caught in a nightmare when they encounter a sinister cult that worships a sea-dwelling deity.</td><td>Dream Well</td><td>2021-02-09</td><td>/xXI5Lg6mJLEesTggRJBrq50vrqU.jpg</td><td>12.542</td><td>28</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/v0bFTXnLNh9cjvpIckJpIM2t9nf.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>526052</td><td>Becoming</td><td>Becoming</td><td>en</td><td>A couple on a road trip through America encounter a terrifying dark force older than the country itself. An evil that transforms loved ones into someone terrifying, the entity has left a trail of murdered families going back hundreds of years.</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-04-16</td><td>/9NZdljsmvWcAGyPqzKgmdLvn97t.jpg</td><td>12.541</td><td>51</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/81MTnnn2ZJjpAUT26qZ4edyG3Bt.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29293</td><td>House of the Dead 2</td><td>House of the Dead 2</td><td>en</td><td>In Guesta Verde University, the deranged Professor Curien is trying to bring back the dead, killing students for the experiment. There is an outbreak of zombies in the campus, and the government sends a NSA medical research team, formed by Dr. Alexandra Morgan a.k.a. Nightingale and lieutenant Ellis, with a special force leaded by lieutenant Dalton, trying to get the zero sample from the first generation zombie. The team has a very short time to accomplish their mission and leave the place before missiles are sent to destroy the area. However, the place is crowded of hyper sapiens and the group has to fight to survive.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-02-11</td><td>/r95UYIFeCjIVKZ1MPxZwEHITAhg.jpg</td><td>12.537</td><td>99</td><td>4.7</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xK3C4HHZRnJEK275WOl0mc4njrD.jpg</td><td>Horror, TV Movie</td><td>117927</td><td>House of the Dead Collection</td></tr><tr><td>241257</td><td>Regression</td><td>Regression</td><td>en</td><td>Minnesota, 1990. Detective Bruce Kenner investigates the case of young Angela, who accuses her father, John Gray, of an unspeakable crime. When John unexpectedly and without recollection admits guilt, renowned psychologist Dr. Raines is brought in to help him relive his memories and what they discover unmasks a horrifying nationwide mystery.</td><td>Fear always finds its victim</td><td>2015-10-01</td><td>/luHpMTmU1ygtEgdOTSSj0i9nd8E.jpg</td><td>12.534</td><td>1593</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.7671101E7</td><td>106</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/82pIGwRwS0sg1hdSRvKgN5LctOX.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>617786</td><td>The Other Lamb</td><td>The Other Lamb</td><td>en</td><td>For her entire life, the cult she was born into has been all that teenage Selah has known. Along with a band of similarly cloistered young women she lives seemingly unstuck in time, cut off from modern society in a remote forest commune presided over by a man called Shepherd, a controlling, messiah-like figure with a frightening dark side. But when her insular world is rocked by a series of nightmarish visions and disturbing revelations, Selah begins to question everything about her existence—including her allegiance to the increasingly dangerous Shepherd.</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-04-03</td><td>/ynPJkpmWNi4rnDUb0PuzDnJj5JI.jpg</td><td>12.533</td><td>132</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zun99bRRcg7d8C6QrIGU3xJbk5t.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>879957</td><td>Wyrmwood: Apocalypse</td><td>Wyrmwood: Apocalypse</td><td>en</td><td>In a zombie-infested Australian wasteland, soldier Rhys has dedicated his life to tracking and capturing survivors for the Surgeon General in hopes of finding a cure.</td><td>Get ready for the fight of your bloody life.</td><td>2022-02-10</td><td>/5FejR8s7E1BYkWRFZ9sPTNHKkxT.jpg</td><td>12.521</td><td>48</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/g8GKxnKPSRwdmrIkP2mk3xMXQnq.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>927812</td><td>Wyrmwood Collection</td></tr><tr><td>347847</td><td>The Sand</td><td>The Sand</td><td>en</td><td>After an all-night graduation beach party, a group of hung-over students wakes up under the blazing sun to find their numbers somewhat depleted. An enormous alien creature has burrowed down deep and anyone foolish enough to make contact with the sand finds themselves at the mercy of a sea of flesh-eating tentacles. Will they ever be able to escape its carnivorous clutches?</td><td>This Beach is Killer</td><td>2015-08-28</td><td>/AiahhUWOvxUhH0QAj1hb5NDcWj9.jpg</td><td>12.51</td><td>190</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oLcUygjFGeB5YT6tiBX4jqxbUcV.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>6552</td><td>Idle Hands</td><td>Idle Hands</td><td>en</td><td>Anton is a cheerful but exceedingly non-ambitious 17-year-old stoner who lives to stay buzzed, watch TV, and moon over Molly, the beautiful girl who lives next door. However, it turns out that the old cliché about idle hands being the devil's playground has a kernel of truth after all.</td><td>The touching story of a boy and his right hand.</td><td>1999-04-30</td><td>/mCO4gU1lkViGXTkoRBEYrvjDIJu.jpg</td><td>12.503</td><td>525</td><td>6.1</td><td>2.5E7</td><td>4152230.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aPdLqBzNo5rBfnZxy15VTc65lO2.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>15262</td><td>Boogeyman 3</td><td>Boogeyman 3</td><td>en</td><td>When a college student witnesses the alleged suicide of her roommate, it sets into motion a series of horrific events that cause her to fear the supernatural entity. As she tries to convince the rest of her dorm that the Boogeyman does exist, the evil force grows stronger and her friends begin to pay the price. Now she must stop this ultimate evil before the entire campus falls prey.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-10-17</td><td>/iOCBPiNeQ7tPuQDwxapNYuSLKT5.jpg</td><td>12.502</td><td>189</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>156941.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jLA97pGBx2FtjNWGVq3SO8RtK6r.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>96937</td><td>Boogeyman Collection</td></tr><tr><td>808090</td><td>A House on the Bayou</td><td>A House on the Bayou</td><td>en</td><td>In an effort to reconnect and mend their relationship, a troubled couple and their preteen daughter seek an idyllic getaway to a remote mansion in rural Louisiana. But when unexpected visitors arrive, their facade of family unity starts to unravel, as terrifying secrets come to light.</td><td>NA</td><td>2021-11-19</td><td>/3qCUy997QKgZDieby5sF6mMHAsB.jpg</td><td>12.497</td><td>80</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xb4NEMXNBbWcdb3kygitvc8cPCJ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10016</td><td>Ghosts of Mars</td><td>Ghosts of Mars</td><td>en</td><td>Melanie Ballard is a hard nosed police chief in the year 2025. She and a police snatch squad are sent to Mars to apprehend dangerous criminal James Williams. Mars has been occupied by humans for some time and they have set up mining facilities. The mining activities on Mars have unleashed the spirits of alien beings who gradually possess the bodies of the workers. It soon turns out that catching the dangerous fugitive takes a back seat as the alien spirits begin to rid their planet of the 'invaders'.</td><td>Terror is the same on any planet.</td><td>2001-08-24</td><td>/i2zztssCIbahGES1fdfWFmDXian.jpg</td><td>12.495</td><td>890</td><td>5.1</td><td>2.8E7</td><td>1.4010832E7</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/anSbunnEMI0TSmizqUSRACoe18l.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>457041</td><td>Elizabeth Harvest</td><td>Elizabeth Harvest</td><td>en</td><td>The newly married Elizabeth arrives with her new husband, the scientist Henry, at a magnificent house. He tells her that she can do there anything she pleases, except to enter a certain closed room.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-08-10</td><td>/oiwY0z17ZqCPVSK1plvL11rSKuK.jpg</td><td>12.49</td><td>254</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>4973.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fHZUVfvLzM6aQ0qA7HjBlfn1EDW.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>25753</td><td>Children of the Corn: Revelation</td><td>Children of the Corn: Revelation</td><td>en</td><td>When a girl named Jamie repeatedly tries to contact her grandmother to no avail, she investigates by going to her apartment in Omaha Nebraska - only to find that it's been condemned and overtaken by possessed children. As she digs deeper, she discovers a dark secret about her grandmother and awakens a dark, demonic force that wants Jamie dead and will stop at nothing.</td><td>The All-New, Terror-Filled Chapter!</td><td>2001-10-09</td><td>/bitdcU7zarJ3jOJVtSBdmwW1h7c.jpg</td><td>12.465</td><td>81</td><td>4.0</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kJa02W8kBgXTeGlTUhG1Xhpo8Wy.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>115225</td><td>Children of the Corn Collection</td></tr><tr><td>463843</td><td>Sweetheart</td><td>Sweetheart</td><td>en</td><td>Jenn has washed ashore a small tropical island and it doesn’t take her long to realize she’s completely alone. She must spend her days not only surviving the elements, but must also fend off the malevolent force that comes out each night.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-01-28</td><td>/xyPPBPkGbZxfS6UM4PjR5bnVfwR.jpg</td><td>12.452</td><td>281</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/de51GG0AQZj8dUm00aQUi4wisBr.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9022</td><td>All the Boys Love Mandy Lane</td><td>All the Boys Love Mandy Lane</td><td>en</td><td>Beautiful Mandy Lane isn't a party girl but, when classmate Chloe invites the Texas high school student to a bash in the countryside, she reluctantly accepts. After hitching a ride with a vaguely scary older man, the teens arrive at their destination. Partying ensues, and Mandy's close pal, Emmet, keeps a watchful eye on the young males making a play for Mandy. Then two of the students are murdered.</td><td>Everyone is dying to be with her. Someone is killing for it.</td><td>2006-09-09</td><td>/9t7n7K0xqw0gMvrxyhdiyqEF3W1.jpg</td><td>12.445</td><td>538</td><td>5.5</td><td>750000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7LpFPbE1AdzGQnO5Ib7fpSRMsvd.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11482</td><td>Le locataire</td><td>The Tenant</td><td>fr</td><td>A quiet and inconspicuous man rents an apartment in France where he finds himself drawn into a rabbit hole of dangerous paranoia.</td><td>How could he escape from his nightmares?</td><td>1976-05-26</td><td>/ochT2dykUUsk7RGrJjnJItLvreO.jpg</td><td>12.444</td><td>899</td><td>7.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>5100000.0</td><td>126</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zUUlresMvmw3ckTfag7k2FEzuik.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14029</td><td>Dèmoni</td><td>Demons</td><td>it</td><td>A group of people are trapped in a West Berlin movie theater infested with ravenous demons who proceed to kill and possess the humans one-by-one, thereby multiplying their numbers.</td><td>They will make cemeteries their cathedrals and the cities will be your tombs.</td><td>1985-10-04</td><td>/h1icFFIehFjZOpzl6xueBeJYMXe.jpg</td><td>12.433</td><td>427</td><td>6.6</td><td>1800000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8FRGPCtjMSXvCQtd4tX438KwB1O.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>430201</td><td>Demons Collection</td></tr><tr><td>290999</td><td>Wyrmwood: Road of the Dead</td><td>Wyrmwood: Road of the Dead</td><td>en</td><td>Barry is a talented mechanic and family man whose life is torn apart on the eve of a zombie apocalypse. His sister, Brooke, is kidnapped by a sinister team of gas-mask wearing soldiers & experimented on by a psychotic doctor. While Brooke plans her escape Barry goes out on the road to find her & teams up with Benny, a fellow survivor - together they must arm themselves and prepare to battle their way through hordes of flesh-eating monsters in a harsh Australian bushland.</td><td>Mad Max meets Dawn Of The Dead</td><td>2014-09-19</td><td>/oyF0zNkTfvodHvkSEs9E88jvQRi.jpg</td><td>12.431</td><td>359</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/k1KP47cnuscBPS4yYTJJ6S4PDho.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror</td><td>927812</td><td>Wyrmwood Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10213</td><td>From Dusk Till Dawn 3: The Hangman's Daughter</td><td>From Dusk Till Dawn 3: The Hangman's Daughter</td><td>en</td><td>Narrowly escaping death, outlaw Johnny Madrid is on the run from the hangman, with the hangman's sensuous daughter Esmeralda by his side. Along with Madrid's gang, Johnny and Esmeralda embark on an adventure filled with colorful and unsavory characters who lead them straight into the fight of their lives!</td><td>NA</td><td>1999-10-30</td><td>/io5lQ7VRJGBCg2kTJ6BRWRclqJE.jpg</td><td>12.429</td><td>259</td><td>4.9</td><td>500