td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9694</td><td>着信アリ</td><td>One Missed Call</td><td>ja</td><td>People mysteriously start receiving voicemail messages from their future selves, in the form of the sound of them reacting to their own violent deaths, along with the exact date and time of their future death, listed on the message log. The plot thickens as the surviving characters pursue the answers to this mystery which could save their lives.</td><td>Death cannot be put on hold...</td><td>2003-11-03</td><td>/8ujSEEePCVMyi7Mt1RQMXd6SWmy.jpg</td><td>12.137</td><td>328</td><td>6.1</td><td>1700000.0</td><td>1.62E7</td><td>112</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/b2fhFhVrwgi36YCYshIrpxc2DjG.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>126580</td><td>One Missed Call Collection</td></tr><tr><td>126743</td><td>Somne</td><td>Somne</td><td>es</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td><td>2005-10-21</td><td>/xNxJVCeA0S4Wuh2Py1B985xNoWF.jpg</td><td>12.137</td><td>4</td><td>4.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>433941</td><td>Dave Made a Maze</td><td>Dave Made a Maze</td><td>en</td><td>Dave, an artist who has yet to complete anything significant in his career, builds a fort in his living room out of pure frustration, only to wind up trapped by the fantastical pitfalls, booby traps, and critters of his own creation. Ignoring his warnings, Dave’s girlfriend Annie leads a band of oddball explorers on a rescue mission. Once inside, they find themselves trapped in an ever-changing supernatural world, threatened by booby traps and pursued by a bloodthirsty Minotaur.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-08-18</td><td>/7Z5sEOC8Y7bdrg7FmIfNGkNniyX.jpg</td><td>12.136</td><td>189</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sdV2CyNro8RnFx0NFbe7OIWp1v0.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10383</td><td>Lost Souls</td><td>Lost Souls</td><td>en</td><td>A young woman who becomes aware of a conspiracy to enable the Devil to walk the earth in human form. To defeat the prophesy, she must convince a respected New York crime journalist, who is devoid of faith, that he is in fact the target of the conspiracy.</td><td>They've had their 2000 years... now it's our turn.</td><td>2000-10-13</td><td>/qmplwqJqjbWLFf1n1VQSemmR7EB.jpg</td><td>12.13</td><td>139</td><td>5.1</td><td>5.0E7</td><td>3.135591E7</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/n3ScmhnLacOJGYNr9WNfnu5mgOB.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>339547</td><td>Jeruzalem</td><td>Jeruzalem</td><td>en</td><td>When a couple of American young adults fly to Israel to visit the city of Jerusalem, a biblical nightmare falls upon the city.</td><td>On Judgement Day, Hell Shall Inherit The Earth.</td><td>2016-01-22</td><td>/eR5kXLDRy4TJD7SkHMLo7FRiSvN.jpg</td><td>12.123</td><td>494</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/p2y3RhQZZfzLY1xFGHaXTpqWkhI.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>639250</td><td>The Voices</td><td>The Voices</td><td>en</td><td>Angry and upset after a sudden breakup with her fiancé, Grace Crawford seeks sanctuary at the remote home of her sister, Catherine. It becomes clear that Catherine is suffering from paranoid schizophrenia, much like their late mother, who had taken her own life. While coming to terms with this heavy realization, Grace also uncovers another terrible little secret that has her struggling to maintain her own sanity and ultimately scurrying to save herself and her family from further harm.</td><td>Being alone helps.</td><td>2020-07-03</td><td>/vFV4GnGheaTRpe5FHHbxyWsOpsp.jpg</td><td>12.116</td><td>17</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iaPdWPtmQXn8JxyPhum72D1yT43.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><