3</td><td>/fi7yCzIPFek5tLY4coe4178SANJ.jpg</td><td>11.534</td><td>69</td><td>7.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xqcBwu29Q6fgVBEDtbRktkfXJy6.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14237</td><td>Brainscan</td><td>Brainscan</td><td>en</td><td>A lonely teenage horror-movie fan discovers a mysterious computer game that uses hypnosis to custom-tailor the game into the most terrifying experience imaginable. When he emerges from the hypnotic trance he is horrified to find evidence that the brutal murder depicted in the game actually happened -- and he's the killer.</td><td>Wanna play? I dare you.</td><td>1994-04-22</td><td>/5JqamPZC7W5rzRNweMGhqltcsIV.jpg</td><td>11.528</td><td>183</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>4352094.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pPwaps60xs9GvnCBG9KqcTXt7iF.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>22137</td><td>Riget</td><td>The Kingdom</td><td>da</td><td>The first part of a Danish miniseries that has been edited into two massive films, \"Riget\" is set in the neurosurgical ward of Copenhagen's Rigshospitalet, the city and country's main hospital, nicknamed \"Riget\". The show follows a number of characters, both staff and patients, as they encounter bizarre phenomena, both human and supernatural.</td><td>NA</td><td>1994-11-23</td><td>/zfXVe3dSvkR3YAp3g6E5q2R5swy.jpg</td><td>11.521</td><td>194</td><td>7.7</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>272</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nQ1woqbLcKjkpfEbfAEoAey6W3n.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, TV Movie</td><td>205977</td><td>The Kingdom</td></tr><tr><td>16061</td><td>東京残酷警察</td><td>Tokyo Gore Police</td><td>ja</td><td>Set in a future-world vision of Tokyo where the police have been privatized and bitter self-mutilation is so casual that advertising is often specially geared to the “cutter” demographic, this is the story of samurai-sword-wielding Ruka and her mission to avenge her father’s assassination. Ruka is a cop from a squad whose mission is to destroy homicidal mutants known as “engineers” possessing the ability to transform any injury into a weapon.</td><td>Tokyo Is Burning</td><td>2008-10-03</td><td>/smQV5DgyUVho8d1R67XnU1BkJAV.jpg</td><td>11.52</td><td>237</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uM1JjhcmL0l4x3bu2YLCWTQOLom.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>595216</td><td>Play or Die</td><td>Play or Die</td><td>en</td><td>Welcome to Paranoia, the ultimate escape game. Rule #1: Nothing is real. Rule #2: One of you will die. Lucas and Chloe, two passionate gamers, decide to participate to Paranoia, a very exclusive escape game. After solving a first riddle, they make it to the location of the finale in an abandoned mental hospital, lost in a frightening forest. There, four other participants are waiting on them. They soon realize that only one of them will get out of there alive.</td><td>Rule # 1: Whatever happens, nothing is true: it's just a game. Rule # 2: One of you is going to die.</td><td>2019-05-10</td><td>/lBT6UQX3qpNz9VAqk40CU5fOzJ1.jpg</td><td>11.513</td><td>130</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rU3Jizu1Q57Y4LdgWlOhCCiwYrV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>8997</td><td>Hollow Man II</td><td>Hollow Man II</td><td>en</td><td>After the mysterious death of scientist, Dr. Devin Villiers, Det. Frank Turner and his partner are assigned to protect Villiers' colleague, who revealed that  a veteran soldier was subjected to an experiment with the objective of creating the ultimate national security weapon... an undetectable soldier. The experiment failed – with disastrous side effects.</td><td>There's More to Terror Than Meets The Eye</td><td>2006-05-23</td><td>/c6Ga1AUGPe3GwlpX3qDYrD9y3EZ.jpg</td><td>11.509</td><td>202</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/b1C1hwq0RnOoYkrpMEUl153bxlb.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>166376</td><td>Hollow Man Collection</td></tr><tr><td>49787</td><td>The Reef</td><td>The Reef</td><td>en</td><td>A great white shark hunts the crew of a capsized sailboat along the Great Barrier Reef.</td><td>Pray that you drown first.</td><td>2010-05-15</td><td>/s5JGAqmdv1cHlDjMqsmQUkVo2lW.jpg</td><td>11.506</td><td>460</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mBVAMPzTr4nfArc4Afa3qwjXoKy.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>797576</td><td>The Reef Collection</td></tr><tr><td>25998</td><td>黑太陽731</td><td>Men Behind the Sun</td><td>cn</td><td>The film is a graphic depiction of the war atrocities committed by the Japanese at Unit 731, the secret biological weapons experimentation unit of the Imperial Japanese Army during World War II. The film details the various cruel medical experiments Unit 731 inflicted upon the Chinese and Soviet prisoners at the tail-end of the war.</td><td>NA</td><td>1988-12-01</td><td>/7GXtPuJ5wcrJNqPwwmvZIForY0C.jpg</td><td>11.505</td><td>148</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8yscpKDJQnMz2O98bZKiHyknn64.jpg</td><td>Drama, History, Horror, War</td><td>633245</td><td>Unit 731</td></tr><tr><td>22536</td><td>박쥐</td><td>Thirst</td><td>ko</td><td>Sang-hyun, a respected priest, volunteers for an experimental procedure that may lead to a cure for a deadly virus. He gets infected and dies, but a blood transfusion of unknown origin brings him back to life as a vampire. Now, Sang-hyun is torn between faith and bloodlust, and has a newfound desire for Tae-ju, the wife of his childhood friend.</td><td>Lusting after sinful pleasures.</td><td>2009-04-30</td><td>/sFgvkGpXLTydvHqBCXw54OB8R0h.jpg</td><td>11.497</td><td>686</td><td>7.0</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>1.3085023E7</td><td>134</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oNdO2VSonWIZFZNC7O4bkuFTNOh.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14372</td><td>Leviathan</td><td>Leviathan</td><td>en</td><td>Underwater deep-sea miners encounter a Soviet wreck and bring back a dangerous cargo to their base on the ocean floor with horrifying results. The crew of the mining base must fight to survive against a genetic mutation that hunts them down one by one.</td><td>The true meaning of fear</td><td>1989-03-17</td><td>/sJNcoyKsqYGEFCCNsYsccikGePV.jpg</td><td>11.492</td><td>380</td><td>6.0</td><td>2.5E7</td><td>1.5704614E7</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/akrHPmxEoi5CRKioJlCrf95jpjq.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>410988</td><td>The Stakelander</td><td>The Stakelander</td><td>en</td><td>When his home of New Eden is destroyed by a revitalized Brotherhood and its new Vamp leader, Martin finds himself alone in the badlands of America with only the distant memory of his mentor and legendary vampire hunter, Mister, to guide him.</td><td>Death is no escape.</td><td>2016-10-14</td><td>/3K9sca6hMxVzCtE7EnAxTjdKWpM.jpg</td><td>11.492</td><td>129</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zkSyYKTK88mQQG01qKx2MGm2K0D.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>473843</td><td>Stake Land Collection</td></tr><tr><td>505063</td><td>Await Further Instructions</td><td>Await Further Instructions</td><td>en</td><td>A dysfunctional family awake on Christmas morning to discover they’re sealed inside their house by a mysterious black substance. On television, a single line of text reads: “Stay Indoors and Await Further Instructions.”</td><td>Contain. Corrupt. Control.</td><td>2018-08-26</td><td>/afvi5tVi5S3Ux9faZaI32SmPRkj.jpg</td><td>11.482</td><td>212</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/AmT9r8QHiTvINxCMNN2IRV3Vz8x.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9424</td><td>Disturbing Behavior</td><td>Disturbing Behavior</td><td>en</td><td>Steve Clark is a newcomer in the town of Cradle Bay, and he quickly realizes that there's something odd about his high school classmates. The clique known as the \"Blue Ribbons\" are the eerie embodiment of academic excellence and clean living. But, like the rest of the town, they're a little too perfect. When Steve's rebellious friend Gavin mysteriously joins their ranks, Steve searches for the truth with fellow misfit Rachel.</td><td>In Cradle Bay it doesn’t matter if you’re not perfect.  You will be.</td><td>1998-07-24</td><td>/lbvTh4l0o5lJgMKnziQELT8M50b.jpg</td><td>11.478</td><td>273</td><td>5.7</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>1.7507368E7</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yrs0179uk2aUwfxJ3aHlNbSeGJo.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>23966</td><td>Deadgirl</td><td>Deadgirl</td><td>en</td><td>When high school misfits Rickie and JT decide to ditch school and find themselves lost in the crumbling facility of a nearby abandoned hospital, they come face-to-face with a gruesome discovery: a body of a woman stripped naked, chained to a table and covered in plastic and soon realize she is anything but dead. Quickly the boys find themselves embarking on a twisted yet poignant journey testing the limits of their friendship, and forces both to decide just how far they're willing to stretch their understanding of right and wrong.</td><td>You’ll never have anything better.</td><td>2008-09-06</td><td>/ff00BtvdnSHO8qoblBhiXmJKvCm.jpg</td><td>11.47</td><td>282</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cG4OFBOr6ZYdXYwC5CC9l1nwxkt.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>477033</td><td>Errementari</td><td>Errementari: The Blacksmith and the Devil</td><td>eu</td><td>Basque Country, Spain, 1843. A police constable arrives at a small village in Álava to investigate a mysterious blacksmith who lives alone deep in the woods.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-03-02</td><td>/ltpi1uLkvx2BKHWwbpMjqdAtdHn.jpg</td><td>11.466</td><td>451</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sP3xtGBYcQejqkTn22aZz8c3U8v.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>969701</td><td>They Crawl Beneath</td><td>They Crawl Beneath</td><td>en</td><td>After an earthquake leaves Danny trapped and alone, his claustrophobic nightmare only gets worse when something truly horrifying emerges from the fissures in the ground, forcing him to engage in a brutal fight for his life and his sanity.</td><td>Something terrible has been unleashed.</td><td>2022-10-04</td><td>/ek7VDiwmIO6fLrGyJo1ZvAsQYFs.jpg</td><td>11.466</td><td>2</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zqeJdwsPcsIq9FmrAEUXzRVRCRM.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>480403</td><td>Stickman</td><td>Stickman</td><td>en</td><td>The thing that waits under your bed, hides in the closet, stalks your dreams… is waiting for you. At least Emma Wright knew that at the age of 7 when she was wrongly accused of murdering her sister. Emma knew it was the Stickman. After years of isolation she finally has her demons under control and is released.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-10-21</td><td>/brlxFn8t5ez5KAGDjQuC1bGp1Fk.jpg</td><td>11.46</td><td>48</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cSnLtdMbdxsZwXQAscpTzNGwYGN.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>25756</td><td>Clownhouse</td><td>Clownhouse</td><td>en</td><td>Just before Halloween, three young brothers alone in a big house are menaced by three escaped mental patients who have murdered some traveling circus clowns and taken their identities.</td><td>Welcome To A Circus Of Terror!</td><td>1989-01-01</td><td>/l8D1gJCR4zxtgY52TLpzZbMbLBc.jpg</td><td>11.451</td><td>142</td><td>6.2</td><td>200000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/c26CQTrAyEu8mjVqaAXv2upfzMv.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10873</td><td>Shadow of the Vampire</td><td>Shadow of the Vampire</td><td>en</td><td>Director F.W. Murnau makes a Faustian pact with a vampire to get him to star in his 1922 film \"Nosferatu.\"</td><td>An Unspeakable Horror. A Creative Genius. Captured For Eternity.</td><td>2000-05-15</td><td>/ooe8qfwSvmFdlf6FtSFaqErdM8g.jpg</td><td>11.449</td><td>459</td><td>6.7</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>8279017.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cKKhk85c1TZSYy6ZF94QpUH8bRw.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>346671</td><td>Little Evil</td><td>Little Evil</td><td>en</td><td>Gary, who has just married Samantha, the woman of his dreams, discovers that her six-year-old son may be the Antichrist.</td><td>Samantha is his dream. Lucas is his nightmare.</td><td>2017-08-08</td><td>/r3Trvfd5td7JUrIUr5xsDqwNWXJ.jpg</td><td>11.445</td><td>809</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8ufJoW3aI2VSFRNr7y1F4ntw21B.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>388440</td><td>The Curse of Sleeping Beauty</td><td>The Curse of Sleeping Beauty</td><td>en</td><td>Thomas Kaiser inherits an ancestral mansion that has been in his family for generations — only to learn that he has also inherited an ancient curse stemming back to the Crusades. Forced into his new role as “protector” — the guardian appointed to keep the evil demons in the house at bay — Thomas teams with an ambitious local realtor and paranormal cleric to unravel the mystery of the house, while struggling to awaken the beautiful Briar Rose, held captive in a terrifying netherworld seen previously in his dreams.</td><td>The fairytale was only the beginning</td><td>2016-05-05</td><td>/wO6If1l2Uv5RIngEyZmcAcI2k28.jpg</td><td>11.435</td><td>180</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4cxxnXQyTu4hHQpJsxU9FcT8vDy.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>342657</td><td>경성학교: 사라진 소녀들</td><td>The Silenced</td><td>ko</td><td>A sickly girl Ju-ran transfers to a new sanitorium boarding school to regain health. But she discovers that students are disappearing and notices abnormal changes happening to her body. She suspects the school for what's happening and tries to discover what secret is hidden.</td><td>The lost girls, suspicious school, and abnormal changes...</td><td>2015-06-18</td><td>/hNXiG7fYDwnnpBU2qPlwEI84SLS.jpg</td><td>11.427</td><td>144</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qr8OBQScXnYISZSWsOZeQFAgQzq.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>421049</td><td>The Watcher</td><td>The Watcher</td><td>en</td><td>Unaware of its terrible history, a young couple purchases their dream home. But it soon becomes clear that they may not be alone in the house... and that someone -- or something -- is determined to drive them out.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-10-01</td><td>/mVQYgAZCgkRRSWC2gnj71Ndj19T.jpg</td><td>11.425</td><td>72</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/QmXlDcbNAcCvsXcCsw0tMgRaG2.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>500535</td><td>Seven in Heaven</td><td>Seven in Heaven</td><td>en</td><td>Sixteen year old Jude discovers each and every one of his fears is true.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-10-05</td><td>/elReufFR4NYFiBVRsD0wB2F6FDf.jpg</td><td>11.42</td><td>81</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ysk5RKNDEOEjR96dPnDid2PbB1T.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27632</td><td>La maschera del demonio</td><td>Black Sunday</td><td>it</td><td>A vengeful witch and her fiendish servant return from the grave and begin a bloody campaign to possess the body of the witch's beautiful look-alike descendant. Only the girl's brother and a handsome doctor stand in her way.</td><td>STARE INTO THESE EYES... discover deep within them the unspeakable terrifying secret of BLACK SUNDAY... it will paralyze you with fright!</td><td>1960-08-11</td><td>/wpwETIDNFZQrWYvPjAqv8xOaHtK.jpg</td><td>11.419</td><td>389</td><td>7.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mAHAzfkE28F0f6YfZpzhKXTUNW4.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>137145</td><td>247°F</td><td>247°F</td><td>en</td><td>Four friends travel to a lakeside cabin for a carefree weekend, but the fun turns into a nightmare when 3 of them end up locked in a hot sauna. Every minute counts and every degree matters as they fight for their lives in the heat up to 247°F.</td><td>Every Degree Matters</td><td>2011-09-01</td><td>/1lkaFSVU0tN3z21CJV98P9dseMe.jpg</td><td>11.418</td><td>228</td><td>5.7</td><td>650000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9vcrXXvT1GL8fretawyiCBaKT8u.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>33521</td><td>Dracula</td><td>Dracula</td><td>en</td><td>Romanticized adaptation of Bram Stoker's 1897 classic. Count Dracula is a subject of fatal attraction to more than one English maiden lady, as he seeks an immortal bride.</td><td>Throughout history he has filled the hearts of men with terror, and the hearts of women with desire.</td><td>1979-07-20</td><td>/1PpwPzMJGR4FmKunEYcB0kW0uAj.jpg</td><td>11.414</td><td>194</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>109</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/65PfXgwlHQBljFjouwdehy2eAlI.jpg</td><td>Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>57812</td><td>51</td><td>51</td><td>en</td><td>Due to political pressure from the American public, the Air Force has decided to allow two well-known reporters limited access to the most secretive base on the planet. But when one of the base’s “long-term visitors” exploits this unprecedented visit as a chance to liberate himself and his fellow alien captives, Area 51 turns from a secure government base to a horrifying destination of terror.</td><td>Welcome to the Future</td><td>2011-02-26</td><td>/p6NvaDusl8urJUlglYgPVSnJjFN.jpg</td><td>11.413</td><td>84</td><td>4.3</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/toG4f7W9EEsBrHrbRJaYADnfoqm.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>117942</td><td>Girls Gone Dead</td><td>Girls Gone Dead</td><td>en</td><td>A group of six ex-high school cheerleaders are stalked by a killer with a medieval war hammer and battle axe during their first Spring Break from college.</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-03-28</td><td>/h4fkp6KuY55vocpkInbFeXOSrgT.jpg</td><td>11.411</td><td>47</td><td>4.6</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h7iaGqbi7FJBwp76T3tSHLiYGNU.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13567</td><td>Sleepaway Camp</td><td>Sleepaway Camp</td><td>en</td><td>Slightly disturbed and painfully shy Angela Baker is sent away to summer camp with her cousin. Not long after Angela's arrival, things start to go horribly wrong for anyone with sinister or less than honorable intentions.</td><td>…you won't be coming home!</td><td>1983-11-18</td><td>/qCQo7okJCHYMMagt6kC0YfhoVVt.jpg</td><td>11.407</td><td>504</td><td>6.3</td><td>350000.0</td><td>1.1E7</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/92FqObwOmcJeOpAXhr0U568Gay2.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>47391</td><td>Sleepaway Camp Collection</td></tr><tr><td>548178</td><td>El Silbón: Orígenes</td><td>The Whistler: Origins</td><td>es</td><td>In the mid-nineteenth century, in a small Venezuelan village, Father Giovanni and a clerk write the story of a supernatural case that they have witnessed, is the story of a mysterious specter, which the people of the