 to the Grave</td><td>en</td><td>A college student creates and sells a drug called 'Z' on campus which resurrects the living dead, who wreak havoc at a Halloween rave.</td><td>Dance till you drop... dead.</td><td>2005-10-15</td><td>/f91aC7oOAhD1OejJRbHvN83d80T.jpg</td><td>11.239</td><td>155</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rVvmHuoP02sjBMumip9BalBarop.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror</td><td>101471</td><td>Return of the Living Dead Collection</td></tr><tr><td>1021742</td><td>그리고 집</td><td>I'm Here</td><td>ko</td><td>The father, who has been battling a disease for ten years, and the mother, exhausted from caring for him, return home. It looks as though Sujin, who was recently fired and planning to go on a working holiday, would have to stay home. Occasionally she sees a zombie in her father.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-10-10</td><td>NA</td><td>11.229</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>27</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Family, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27346</td><td>Maniac</td><td>Maniac</td><td>en</td><td>A psychotic man, troubled by his childhood abuse, loose in NYC, kills young women and local girl American models and takes their scalps as trophies. Will he find the perfect woman in photographer Anna, and end his killing spree.</td><td>I warned you not to go out tonight!</td><td>1980-11-14</td><td>/aKIBqbUZAEwOML4oMMjZS7m4Gvj.jpg</td><td>11.219</td><td>323</td><td>6.4</td><td>350000.0</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h5X5zO40G0pjPkyyzGh9PBsPI0B.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>823074</td><td>Maniac Collection</td></tr><tr><td>33641</td><td>Frankenfish</td><td>Frankenfish</td><td>en</td><td>When the body of a man is found completely destroyed in the swamps in Louisiana, the medical investigator Sam Rivers is assigned to investigate the murder. He travels with the biologist Mary Callahan to the location where the victim lived in a floating house and he meets his family and friends. They find that Chinese snake-heads genetically engineered that belong to a wealthy hunter are attacking and killing the locals. While the group fights to survive, the hunter Jeff arrives with his team to hunt the predators.</td><td>Welcome to the bottom of the food chain.</td><td>2004-10-09</td><td>/wsz37AAeeghof4DFJZ0FxAeZN2H.jpg</td><td>11.215</td><td>113</td><td>5.8</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3uJhw4tMRodXlZHk2aoRJ9L9qoT.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>455108</td><td>The Little Stranger</td><td>The Little Stranger</td><td>en</td><td>In a dusty post-war summer in rural Warwickshire, a doctor is called to a patient at lonely Hundreds Hall. Home to the Ayres family for over two centuries, the Georgian house is now in decline. But are the Ayreses haunted by something more sinister than a dying way of life?</td><td>These delusions are contagious</td><td>2018-08-30</td><td>/mfLl93043kOHPJfenkawjookil8.jpg</td><td>11.215</td><td>218</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>1824902.0</td><td>111</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eyrUZ6jvg1Qy3jUz5YH8U4UkFLP.jpg</td><td>Drama, History, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>22681</td><td>Homecoming</td><td>Homecoming</td><td>en</td><td>A jealous woman plots revenge after her former beau returns to their hometown with a pretty new girlfriend.</td><td>A girl never forgets her first love...</td><td>2009-07-17</td><td>/ALPTyUklWtULWAzaf0J9vrRfUN.jpg</td><td>11.214</td><td>129</td><td>5.9</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mOWeZlcpdAraOSA3ReYWqu2JJt7.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28043</td><td>I tre volti della paura</td><td>Black Sabbath</td><td>it</td><td>Three short tales of supernatural horror. In “The Telephone,” a woman is plagued by threatening phone calls. In \"The Wurdalak