een met with great controversy. But when a twist of fate puts him back at the scene of the tragedy, Crowley is mistakenly resurrected and Andrew must face the bloodthirsty ghost from his past.</td><td>Return to his Swamp</td><td>2017-09-12</td><td>/lcZtqUStEvS9y0bFZrO80oIUhJk.jpg</td><td>11.152</td><td>202</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zklU4lWkUag3wZDYpHpgkVHTdmt.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>124901</td><td>Hatchet Collection</td></tr><tr><td>33016</td><td>Deadly Blessing</td><td>Deadly Blessing</td><td>en</td><td>After her husband dies of mysterious circumstances, a widow becomes increasingly paranoid of the neighboring religious community that may have diabolical plans for her.</td><td>A gruesome secret, protected for generations, rises to give its...</td><td>1981-08-14</td><td>/mizsEXfRudZLGoqicaauNVvnWvI.jpg</td><td>11.138</td><td>129</td><td>5.5</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/u1lBiR7Tw5AuZGlGkX5RpyjraEt.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>60575</td><td>Prowl</td><td>Prowl</td><td>en</td><td>Amber dreams of escaping her small town existence and persuades her friends to accompany her to find an apartment in the big city. When their transportation breaks down, she and her friends gratefully accept a ride in the back of a semi. But when the driver refuses to stop and they discover the cargo is hundreds of cartons of blood, they panic. Their panic turns to terror when the truck disgorges them into a dark, abandoned warehouse where blood-thirsty creatures learn to hunt human prey, which, the friends realize, is what they now are... Written by Svetlio Svilenov</td><td>She was running from her life,now she's running for it.</td><td>2010-09-04</td><td>/9odMCaQynGfpvclF4PU4sLuzGgs.jpg</td><td>11.136</td><td>100</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sXBBnoL4KsIsbp8MRRklRr64VXw.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>265016</td><td>Extraterrestrial</td><td>Extraterrestrial</td><td>en</td><td>Five friends set out to a cabin in the woods for a fun weekend getaway that is, until extraterrestrial visitors turn it into a fight for their lives. The group is pulled from their reverie when a flickering object crashes deep in the woods. As they investigate, the friends stumble across an alien spacecraft, and its inhabitants have not arrived in peace.</td><td>They do not come in peace.</td><td>2014-10-17</td><td>/mmiG916iIh6w378qBjRfTonqOWb.jpg</td><td>11.134</td><td>419</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/q4tAtvy6EB0fsWRP66muNMFGubA.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>510388</td><td>Villains</td><td>Villains</td><td>en</td><td>When their car breaks down, a couple on the run headed southbound for a fresh start in the Sunshine State break into a nearby house looking for a new set of wheels. What they find instead is a dark secret, and a sweet-as-pie pair of homeowners who will do anything to keep it from getting out.</td><td>Two bad people are about to meet two worse people.</td><td>2019-09-20</td><td>/Arefq9eI1z94Jtrbbuqzg9p5mf8.jpg</td><td>11.132</td><td>263</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/z9Ipktaq5ZF4WAPFkQqnmPugd3I.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13564</td><td>Return to House on Haunted Hill</td><td>Return to House on Haunted Hill</td><td>en</td><td>Eight years have passed since Sara Wolfe and Eddie Baker escaped the House on Haunted Hill. Now the kidnapped Ariel, Sara's sister, goes inside the house with a group of treasure hunters to find the statue of Baphomet, worth millions and believed to be the cause of the House's evil.</td><td>NA</td><td>2007-10-03</td><td>/ipBiyifbFqY0ZduO3R9OPBjc2pH.jpg</td><td>11.124</td><td>241</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</