n</td><td>The true story of Edward Gein, the farmer whose horrific crimes inspired Psycho, The Texas Chainsaw Massacre and The Silence of the Lambs. This is the first film to Gein's tormented upbringing, his adored but domineering mother, and the 1957 arrest uncovered the most bizarre series of murders America has ever seen</td><td>Before DAHMER, Before GACY, There was ED.</td><td>2000-11-17</td><td>/kmgR0RmsFei4Ev3a6GiRojuZwHx.jpg</td><td>11.099</td><td>85</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>5708.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>407620</td><td>Planet of the Sharks</td><td>Planet of the Sharks</td><td>en</td><td>In the near future, glacial melting has covered 98% of earth's landmass. Sharks have flourished and now dominate the planet, operating as one massive school led by a mutated alpha shark.</td><td>WHEN THE WORLD FLOODS WITH WATER ONE SPECIES RISES TO THE TOP</td><td>2016-07-27</td><td>/54hwLfOJONjqOFxGlEixpOHeEnx.jpg</td><td>11.088</td><td>57</td><td>3.8</td><td>5.0</td><td>6.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/d3fAR9lW5Jc4FBNhAGKvDWpiBlY.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>632619</td><td>The Sharks Collection</td></tr><tr><td>602508</td><td>암전</td><td>Warning: Do Not Play</td><td>ko</td><td>A struggling director makes a desperate bid to dig into the urban legend about a film shot by a ghost, at the risk of her own life.</td><td>Watch at your own risk</td><td>2019-08-15</td><td>/1UPRKPq9zcBiK88NLpavMwPuVY2.jpg</td><td>11.072</td><td>40</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gSRPK8Xtwj9by1EnI7qMi0SrX1y.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24099</td><td>Dreamscape</td><td>Dreamscape</td><td>en</td><td>A government funded project looks into using psychics to enter people's dreams, with some mechanical help. When a subject dies in their sleep from a heart attack, Alex Gardner becomes suspicious that another of the psychics is killing people in the dreams somehow and that is causing them to die in real life. He must find a way to stop the abuse of the power to enter dreams.</td><td>Close your eyes and the adventure begins.</td><td>1984-08-15</td><td>/yTx46x6Aa2uNW8fRSyOnro7PISf.jpg</td><td>11.068</td><td>212</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.2145169E7</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tc3ti6qRHDRKLwXBoVltRIkYIbL.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>961427</td><td>Spirit Halloween: The Movie</td><td>Spirit Halloween: The Movie</td><td>en</td><td>A group of middle schoolers discover a Spirit Halloween store is haunted and must survive the night.</td><td>One Spirit. One Store. One Night.</td><td>2022-09-30</td><td>/akWDID6zfsWHJhGCAAcbwbytU55.jpg</td><td>11.062</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9OBBg24zN26R3xdroLNVK5EY68n.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10075</td><td>Blood and Chocolate</td><td>Blood and Chocolate</td><td>en</td><td>A young teenage werewolf is torn between honoring her family's secret and her love for a man.</td><td>The hunt never tasted so sweet.</td><td>2007-01-26</td><td>/5fjyqkMly7L00CsWqoKtFtdeKyW.jpg</td><td>11.056</td><td>249</td><td>5.5</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>6340723.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wHzR9AzN9ePToQbCsz0ZZPpzWZp.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>25438</td><td>Trick or Treat</td><td>Trick or Treat</td><td>en</td><td>Eddie Weinbauer, an metalhead teen who is bullied at school, looks to his heavy metal superstar idol, Sammi Curr, for guidance. When Curr is killed in a hotel fire, Eddie becomes the recipient of the only copy of Curr's unreleased album, which, when played backwards, brings Sammi back to life. As Halloween approaches, Eddie begins to realize that this isn't only rock 'n roll...it's life and death.</td><td>What are you afraid of? It's only rock and roll...</td><td>1986-10-24</td><td>/cXzICSxR6XUH4oN5mAoGZcw4mSC.jpg</td><td>11.055</td><td>124</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>6797218.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ba16Xm2ZurnK3UHQWvYkG5Xcnlk.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>463322</td><td>The Dark</td><td>The Dark</td><td>en</td><td>A murderous, flesh-eating undead young girl haunting the remote stretch of woods where she was murdered decades earlier, discovers a kidnapped and abused boy hiding in the trunk of one of her victim’s cars. Her decision to let the boy live throws her aggressively solitary existence into upheaval, and ultimately forces her to re-examine just how much of her humanity her murderer was able to destroy.</td><td>Your worst fear is your only hope.</td><td>2018-10-12</td><td>/uPUJsR3UJ6AUOKxx0d6dOlLHln4.jpg</td><td>11.054</td><td>153</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3bC3FyK6rmaebYzoT8qX7EoHgah.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>185460</td><td>Willow Creek</td><td>Willow Creek</td><td>en</td><td>A young couple ventures into the woods to capture footage of the elusive Bigfoot.</td><td>Existing Soon.</td><td>2013-05-02</td><td>/8pP4tEeM7R6G4MSyxhFblwCja1P.jpg</td><td>11.042</td><td>246</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/u4QBchp2LtJBc9LJdn210T76pHO.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>311539</td><td>A Christmas Horror Story</td><td>A Christmas Horror Story</td><td>en</td><td>Christmas is supposed to be a time of joy, peace and goodwill. But for some folks in the small town of Bailey Downs, it turns into something much less festive.</td><td>You Better Watch Out</td><td>2015-07-20</td><td>/qdzzFho1wZFvrDFcdg2r3wwMUSJ.jpg</td><td>11.042</td><td>264</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rXUep5x2an32B0njUihJHy65TDp.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>361159</td><td>Navy Seals vs. Zombies</td><td>Navy Seals vs. Zombies</td><td>en</td><td>A team of highly skilled Navy SEALS find themselves embarking on the battle of their lives when they come face-to-face with the undead. After a deadly outbreak occurs in New Orleans, the SEALS must fight for their lives, and the city, against an army of zombies.</td><td>NA</td><td>2015-10-08</td><td>/oTvwjUMXjeKxAXY2Cggy5DZweMn.jpg</td><td>11.041</td><td>143</td><td>4.7</td><td>1181389.0</td><td>56191.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oBsL8VjWMscEBIJJXNsB5j1ok2K.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>990493</td><td>Ang Babaeng Nawawala sa Sarili</td><td>Ang Babaeng Nawawala sa Sarili</td><td>tl</td><td>She gets entangled with three men who want her: her suitor, her ex-boyfriend and her boss. But there's another one who wants to control and turn her into a sex monster.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-07-15</td><td>/xKJaAYkc1nWyFlFVRUtqyvyDjR1.jpg</td><td>11.041</td><td>3</td><td>4.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/A1sycfc3NJj9ty8hpHAjKrq8BD3.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>733156</td><td>Sightless</td><td>Sightless</td><td>en</td><td>After an attack renders her blind, Ellen withdraws from the world to recover. But soon she plunges into paranoia, unable to convince anyone that her assailant has returned to terrorize her by hiding in plain sight.</td><td>You can't escape what you can't see.</td><td>2020-09-29</td><td>/leCkJsZbQDULb0x5EocYs0JEloF.jpg</td><td>11.038</td><td>302</td><td>7.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cMcn5W38E5FVao1FqIZllO11nSF.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14853</td><td>Screamers: The Hunting</td><td>Screamers: The Hunting</td><td>en</td><td>A group of humans arrive on Sirius 6-B to investigate an SOS signal sent out from the planet, which has been supposedly deserted since the destruction of the man-made weapons known as \"screamers.\" Once the squad arrives, they find a group of human survivors eking out an existence in an old military outpost.</td><td>The Perfect Weapon Is Now The Ultimate Killing Machine</td><td>2009-02-17</td><td>/xOOA1BQ3gRjQPXHSKYUlAaAj6oC.jpg</td><td>11.025</td><td>111</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sKPt10dEeawDE6o2utBGNPdsYYE.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>122017</td><td>Screamers Collection</td></tr><tr><td>296065</td><td>Last Shift</td><td>Last Shift</td><td>en</td><td>A rookie cop's world is turned upside down when she comes face to face with Paymon - King Of Hell. Officer Jessica Loren has the last shift at a transitioning police station, assigned to wait for a crew picking up bio-hazard waste from the armoury. But unbeknownst to her, cult leader John Michael Paymon has haunted the department ever since he committed suicide in custody. Jessica is about to find out just how dangerous he still is, all alone on the graveyard shift...</td><td>All Hail the King of Hell</td><td>2014-10-25</td><td>/odgRTKu4zlKEOmoZUfScvvPzOqt.jpg</td><td>11.009</td><td>435</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/inthTqjfmqBjkPJahM0s9J76Q6m.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>18442</td><td>Decoys</td><td>Decoys</td><td>en</td><td>Luke and Roger are just another couple of college guys trying to lose their virginity. But when Luke sees something unusual, he begins to suspect that the girls on campus aren't exactly...human.</td><td>They can seduce anyone... Prey it isn't you!</td><td>2004-02-27</td><td>/nieqSpywIW3J25cFC8mEUXF2FTk.jpg</td><td>11.004</td><td>78</td><td>4.8</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nJ3fpugCXF3AgUUVDUCLfHceuTq.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>140758</td><td>Decoys Collection</td></tr><tr><td>8617</td><td>Prom Night</td><td>Prom Night</td><td>en</td><td>Donna's senior prom is supposed to be the best night of her life, though a sadistic killer from her past has different plans for her and her friends.</td><td>A Night To Die For.</td><td>2008-04-10</td><td>/pKSeyN02R5khphImEIpAdBjQgEP.jpg</td><td>11.002</td><td>581</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.4796236E7</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2mL63XNhA2jcbz4owGdOzhJickD.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13489</td><td>Lost Boys: The Tribe</td><td>Lost Boys: The Tribe</td><td>en</td><td>After moving to a new California town, a young woman learns that her new friends are a pack of vampires.</td><td>Never grow old. Never die. Never know fear again.</td><td>2008-07-29</td><td>/9JNiL8IIvDTs1M4eFw8IUKmItKk.jpg</td><td>10.989</td><td>138</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/22ZK0WrGqKyKVseJQm6MYCPM79P.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>109076</td><td>Lost Boys Collection</td></tr><tr><td>9544</td><td>FearDotCom</td><td>FearDotCom</td><td>en</td><td>When four bodies are discovered among the industrial decay and urban grime of New York City, brash young detective Mike Reilly teams with ambitious Department of Health researcher Terry Huston to uncover the cause behind their violent and inexplicable deaths. The only common factor shared by the victims? Each died exactly 48 hours after logging onto a website called feardotcom.</td><td>The last site you'll ever see.</td><td>2002-08-09</td><td>/phcd5AJvA1S45JMKYoNLhTzFwsE.jpg</td><td>10.98</td><td>299</td><td>3.7</td><td>4.0E7</td><td>1.8902015E7</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1mlos1qMlIWCM9FAAafhTdc9Tys.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</t