ely attacked by terrible life forms.</td><td>Humans are such easy prey.</td><td>1986-10-24</td><td>/yvBRkNA8wiuXupFk0Z7b5NhYW9r.jpg</td><td>10.974</td><td>408</td><td>6.5</td><td>4500000.0</td><td>1261000.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rjc5xPE3Y6JGIFCmVblAmszbcBM.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>224815</td><td>Skinwalker Ranch</td><td>Skinwalker Ranch</td><td>en</td><td>In  2010 “Skinwalker Ranch” gained media attention after experiencing a wide range of unexplained phenomena. Reports ranged from UFO sightings to livestock mutilation, but maybe most notable was the disappearance of ranch owner Hoyt Miller’s eight-year-old son Cody on November 11, 2010. Close to a year later, Modern Defense Enterprises has sent a team of experts to document and investigate the mysterious occurrences, which only escalate upon their arrival. Tensions rise as the team must decide how far they will go to unlock the mysteries of “Skinwalker Ranch.” The group debates whether the answers are worth risking their lives for, or if they should just call off the investigation and leave the ranch—that is, if leaving is actually an option…</td><td>There is a place The Unexplained calls home</td><td>2013-10-30</td><td>/gqEfe007ZEa8WwWZAXl57zu4o0s.jpg</td><td>10.967</td><td>101</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/x3mF2JRMwaKXZBIdiRHrUq2W5ux.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14126</td><td>Catacombs</td><td>Catacombs</td><td>en</td><td>A young woman in Paris goes to a party in the enormous labyrinth of limestone tunnels beneath Paris. When she becomes separated from her friends, she is convinced something is chasing her through the dark tunnels.</td><td>Below the city of lights exists a world of darkness.</td><td>2007-06-01</td><td>/j3LWOKFoeKJDn2dHXoJoRWeakRu.jpg</td><td>10.962</td><td>155</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ny4gMEiBfIj6RpEySSvIKKgkDCl.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12158</td><td>Vampire in Brooklyn</td><td>Vampire in Brooklyn</td><td>en</td><td>Maximillian, the lone survivor of a race of vampires, comes to Brooklyn in search of a way to live past the next full moon. His ticket to survival is Rita, a NYPD detective who doesn't know she's half vampire -- and Maximillian will do whatever's necessary to put her under his spell.</td><td>A comic tale of horror and seduction.</td><td>1995-10-26</td><td>/i8ZD5LsBjwF45MsZ1nCClpvaOcn.jpg</td><td>10.96</td><td>451</td><td>5.0</td><td>1.4E7</td><td>1.98E7</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/puGrHNxFpJWSWwY9OoMjJQXsVYR.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16167</td><td>From Within</td><td>From Within</td><td>en</td><td>When the citizens of a small evangelical town systematically begin committing suicide, a young girl struggling to reconcile her Christian upbringing with her desire to experience the outside world finds her faith put to the ultimate test.</td><td>Death is catching.</td><td>2008-04-25</td><td>/yyAiGq6SycABwV9m9KqqB2i6Ctl.jpg</td><td>10.955</td><td>123</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>66456.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/owoOf2hXNIdIArXFu2QPffU96vb.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>340670</td><td>箱の中の女　処女いけにえ</td><td>Woman in a Box: Virgin Sacrifice</td><td>ja</td><td>1985 Roman Porno released under the \"Roman X\" imprint. A young virgin is captured by an abnormal couple. The girl is kept locked in a wooden box, and subjected to sexual torture and abuse. Loosely inspired by the real-life case of Colleen Stan.</td><td>NA</td><td>1985-09-07</td><td>/gMbrocSN2LSovnHjfQRdV7GAwtB.jpg</td><td>10.953</td><td>4</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nYX5XTOnxtuMauYY8TfBOTBImG4.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11503</td><td>The Serpent and the Rainbow</td><td>The Serpent and the Rainbow</td><td>en</td><td>A Harvard anthropologist is sent to Haiti to retrieve a strange powder that is said to have the power to bring human beings back from the dead. In his quest to find the miracle drug, the cynical scientist enters the rarely seen netherworld of walking zombies, blood rites and ancient curses. Based on the true life experiences of Wade Davis and filmed on location in Haiti, it's a frightening excursion into black magic and the supernatural.</td><td>Don't bury me... I'm not dead!</td><td>1988-02-05</td><td>/f0n0CDxtrBcIow6yzoORVVhRxYT.jpg</td><td>10.952</td><td>374</td><td>6.4</td><td>7000000.0</td><td>1.9595031E7</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/z0ALFPZjhaAQjXThyMO9b3dIrz4.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>931</td><td>Don't Look Now</td><td>Don't Look Now</td><td>en</td><td>Laura and John, grieved by a terrible loss, meet in Venice, where John is in charge of the restoration of a church, two mysterious sisters, one of whom gives them a message sent from the afterlife.</td><td>Pass the warning.</td><td>1973-12-03</td><td>/vIftm9VI0xhiIFEq7dV4YfpTvBb.jpg</td><td>10.95</td><td>784</td><td>7.0</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ncR3qobdIDYEAI1DqKmJQbHE8YA.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>858064</td><td>Night of the Animated Dead</td><td>Night of the Animated Dead</td><td>en</td><td>An animated retelling of ‘Night of the Living Dead’, in which a group of people in a rural farmhouse struggle to survive the threat of bloodthirsty zombies.</td><td>The fear, the terror, the panic will eat you alive.</td><td>2021-09-21</td><td>/mluarGbxZjgvhe5bteR7P24HHAw.jpg</td><td>10.949</td><td>89</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>70</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aJBpwcfIdurKgiCTYYiqtXkRwUR.jpg</td><td>Animation, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>419639</td><td>The Thinning</td><td>The Thinning</td><td>en</td><td>In a post-apocalyptic future where population control is dictated by a high-school aptitude test, two students discover the test is smoke and mirrors hiding a larger conspiracy.</td><td>Only the smartest will survive</td><td>2016-10-12</td><td>/1vgtCoBbBzeoW78g8fHT4EekoM2.jpg</td><td>10.937</td><td>314</td><td>6.9</td><td>100000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/g5sFMDG2i9IWa0eEvE1kE3vt731.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>554930</td><td>The Thinning Collection</td></tr><tr><td>760875</td><td>The Devil Below</td><td>The Devil Below</td><td>en</td><td>A group of four amateur adventurers who specialize in exploring remote and forsaken places pay a visit to Shookum Hills, a town in the remote Appalachian Mountains which was abandoned decades ago due to a mysterious coal mine fire.</td><td>NA</td><td>2021-03-05</td><td>/bKpkB86oJ2IyIlpGLTF66zBPSDp.jpg</td><td>10.934</td><td>67</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nehpjVk7DSh0pw4L4U623Zg1mRs.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>245627</td><td>Abattoir</td><td>Abattoir</td><td>en</td><td>A reporter unearths an urban legend about a home being constructed from rooms where horrific tragedies have occurred.</td><td>He's been expecting you</td><td>2016-11-24</td><td>/sJn5ZJ0hmp2paNAQP1HS8wym1ut.jpg</td><td>10.931</td><td>117</td><td>4.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8A0neY66bXf2jrWAqL0oIRwql3X.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10692</td><td>Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer</td><td>Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer</td><td>en</td><td>Henry likes to kill people, in different ways each time. Henry shares an apartment with Otis. When Otis' sister comes to stay, we see both sides of Henry: \"the guy next door\" and the serial killer.</td><td>He's not Freddy. He's not Jason. He's real.</td><td>1986-04-10</td><td>/3avziywvIkPZR7sGerncZNRXKcm.jpg</td><td>10.926</td><td>527</td><td>6.8</td><td>111000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6J8K5uTcaFwPvG0r87s15f1il3E.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>143755</td><td>Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer Collection</td></tr><tr><td>561166</td><td>素女經之挑情寶鑑</td><td>The Story of Lady Sue</td><td>cn</td><td>Young master Ying Feng is kicked out of home by his father, a master of mystical magic cures, because the \"leader of black religion\" is out to kill his entire family. Honest and stout-hearted, Ying Feng punches three guys who want to screw pretty dancer Miss Fan. Fan gets sweet on Feng and he agrees to let her stay with him. The Fairy comes to town, touting his magic powers to cure the sick for anyone who'll pay his exorbitant fee. Ying Feng has some of the same talent, and cures a sick woman with no money and for no payment, thereby shaming The Fairy into both taking him on as a disciple and agreeing to charge less. Li Quan, the \"leader of black religion\", has not given up trying to find Ying Feng, but his search is greatly slowed down by his assistants being far more interested in screwing each other silly than revenge. Note - Both of the lead characters are actually called \"Fung\" in Cantonese, so I have used the Mandarin forms of their names, to distinguish them.</td><td>NA</td><td>1992-01-30</td><td>/161GE8M5881Oycm3eIz0Zz2AwBZ.jpg</td><td>10.923</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hFk47hmEc3ULovghN8yBITB6JVn.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>927409</td><td>El extraño mundo de Gumball</td><td>The strange world of Gumball</td><td>es</td><td>The Amazing World of Gumball lost chapter.</td><td>(Archive nº6811)</td><td>2021-07-05</td><td>/uEqYimFhzy9w9ZN7aBkJqR29NZW.jpg</td><td>10.919</td><td>1</td><td>2.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>1</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Animation, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>8968</td><td>Boogeyman</td><td>Boogeyman</td><td>en</td><td>Every culture has one – the horrible monster fueling young children's nightmares. But for Tim, the Boogeyman still lives in his memories as a creature that devoured his father 16 years earlier. Is the Boogeyman real? Or did Tim make him up to explain why his father abandoned his family?</td><td>You thought it was just a story.</td><td>2005-02-04</td><td>/5KffN0UcuAKJdUAcOvZ21OrqXc8.jpg</td><td>10.898</td><td>624</td><td>4.9</td><td>2.0E7</td><td>6.7192859E7</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sJEcInnWer58nvYEbZmrx5eAQ7R.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>96937</td><td>Boogeyman Collection</td></tr><tr><td>671725</td><td>Chompy & The Girls</td><td>Chompy & The Girls</td><td>en</td><td>A troubled woman meets her father for the first time and their encounter goes from awkward to alarming when they witness a man swallow a little girl whole.</td><td>Don't bite off more than you can chew!</td><td>2021-09-14</td><td>/mEqsGycEVv6kfsIgH8dyQbnCcaw.jpg</td><td>10.886</td><td>7</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uB9AHNqK76BGXXHdWkD1Ozc8zO6.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13312</td><td>À l'intérieur</td><td>Inside</td><td>fr</td><td>Four months after the death of her husband, a woman on the brink of motherhood is tormented in her home by a strange woman who wants her unborn baby.</td><td>Terror comes calling.</td><td>2007-06-13</td><td>/f9moV5ksoyOjWQvYc13vQZR4hPv.jpg</td><td>10.874</td><td>622</td><td>6.7</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>79</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/e6lU8ixv9xyUKMbqxqOaPIRmSP5.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>355193</td><td>Devil's Gate</td><td>Devil's Gate</td><td>en</td><td>Set in the small town of Devil's Gate, North Dakota, the film examines the disappearance of a local woman and her young son. Schull plays an FBI agent who helps the local sheriff search for answers. Partnering with a deputy , they track down the missing woman's husband and find that nothing is as it seems.</td><td>Every family has its secrets.</td><td>2017-04-24</td><td>/qlguwriLf7PkG6jAzpnClkZKmHi.jpg</td><td>10.873</td><td>197</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cdDwJcE2fH9wEiuswJ0GkPR6hIG.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>530076</td><td>Corporate Animals</td><td>Corporate Animals</td><td>en</td><td>Disaster strikes when the egotistical CEO of an edible cutlery company leads her long-suffering staff on a corporate team-building trip in New Mexico. Trapped underground, this mismatched and disgruntled group must pull together to survive.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-09-20</td><td>/ajnBS9iakB3R5RIWedq6BHvmxFq.jpg</td><td>10.873</td><td>93</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wXi3KtVDiTCXXtf0odDCRDW6pOf.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>63188</td><td>Soulkeeper</td><td>Soulkeeper</td><td>en</td><td>Two thieves (Rodney Rowland, Kevin Patrick Walls) compete with a madman in their search for an ancient relic which can create an army of evil souls.</td><td>NA</td><td>2001-01-01</td><td>/etmSPcaa7cCcc9djD2q9rHqe38W.jpg</td><td>10.854</td><td>20</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>5857</td><td>I Know Who Killed Me</td><td>I Know Who Killed Me</td><td>en</td><td>An idyllic small town is rocked when Aubrey Fleming, a bright and promising young woman, is abducted and tortured by a sadistic serial killer. When she manages to escape, the traumatized girl who regains consciousness in the hospital insists that she is not who they think she is and that the real Aubrey Fleming is still in mortal danger.</td><td>There are two sides to every crime.</td><td>2007-07-27</td><td>/7hz8jYHGNsNsnF0FPngxQEEVyR6.jpg</td><td>10.847</td><td>311</td><td>4.5</td><td>1.2E7</td><td>9620399.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/myjGgD50n9QMGlUYMhXWfhdYxI7.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28325</td><td>Emanuelle - Perché violenza alle donne?</td><td>Emanuelle Around the World</td><td>it</td><td>Famous undercover journalist Emanuelle teams with her friend Cora Norman to uncover a white slave ring.</td><td>Emanuelle's back to take you places you've never been before!</td><td>1977-09-16</td><td>/v5aRSDn97l8Y2CVIuZLg0zs2hfo.jpg</td><td>10.818</td><td>37</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8c5CoSJlMjURb7iYr3K3ztp9EXV.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Drama, Horror</td><td>227140</td><td>Black Emanuelle Collection</td></tr><tr><td>407559</td><td>I Am the Pretty Thing That Lives in the House</td><td>I Am the Pretty Thing That Lives in the House</td><td>en</td><td>A young nurse takes care of elderly author who lives in a haunted house.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-09-10</td><td>/lq8ktDO2uqJFgV0jRlMQlPSmNm8.jpg</td><td>10.816</td><td>496</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vTfQfWUaj4QUJFvtCUHShIxrIuW.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16335</td><td>Walled In</td><td>Walled In</td><td>en</td><td>Having finally secured her first assignment from her family's demolition business, Sam Walczak (Mischa Barton) is sent to supervise the destruction of an apartment house, only to discover a group of tenants still living in the condemned building. One such tenant, Jimmy (Cameron Bright), tells Sam an urban legend about a serial murderer who used to live in the building and entomb his victims in the walls. What's worse, the dead are believed to still harass the residents to this day.</td><td>Some secrets are best left buried.</td><td>2009-02-20</td><td>/Fx6BRXPaO6ZJriVCs08sbpF06D.jpg</td><td>10.804</td><td>160</td><td>4.8</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qT67QJHJHP2mZHUdP25gnTnbIwY.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10722</td><td>El día de la bestia</td><td>The Day of the Beast</td><td>es</td><td>The story revolves around a Basque Roman Catholic priest dedicated to committing as many sins as possible (Angulo), a death metal salesman from Carabanchel (Segura), and the Italian host of a TV show on the occult (De Razza). These go on a literal \"trip\" through Christmas-time Madrid to hunt for and prevent the reincarnation of the Antichrist.</td><td>A devilishly dark comedy</td><td>1995-10-20</td><td>/yEXhgACPIV4PmTgHT2HS3Ko2oS3.jpg</td><td>10.801</td><td>404</td><td>7.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>4367497.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7WBNrwjHrt3YTIbn5vWAJLf9yKD.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Crime, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39158</td><td>Kaw</td><td>Kaw</td><td>en</td><td>On the last working day of Sheriff Wayne, his small town is attacked by blood thirsty ravens that eat human flesh. Meanwhile his wife Cynthia visits a farm where a Mennonite family lives to say farewell to her friend Gretchen and discloses a dark secret about the origin of the fierce ravens.</td><td>Objects in the mirror may be closer and more terrifying than they appear.</td><td>2007-04-07</td><td>/AlG0DTKf12ooGmO5WCocaFAl9jd.jpg</td><td>10.8</td><td>60</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eKneRHZHiiEIZe9RYyv4TWi2t8r.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>811076</td><td>Barbarians</td><td>Barbarians</td><td>en</td><td>A civilized dinner party in a country house sees four friends, Lucas, Adam, Chloe, and Eve, coming together for a birthday celebration. As the night progresses secrets and lies force themselves into the light and polite pretensions are dropped.  A knock at the door reveals three masked intruders with an agenda of their own.  Will their friendship stand the test? Can they survive the night or will their secrets eventually catch up with them?</td><td>The guests have arrived.</td><td>2021-09-23</td><td>/c6Fvq7YWgdYx5rUfwieZMJet3cv.jpg</td><td>10.795</td><td>20</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bKVz9F6SVF4SQ7IvJLpFvrFrdCr.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>411144</td><td>We Have Always Lived in the Castle</td><td>We Have Always Lived in the Castle</td><td>en</td><td>In Shirleyville, Vermont, during the sixties, sisters Merricat and Constance, along with their ailing uncle Julian, confined to a wheelchair, live isolated in a big mansion located on the hill overlooking the town, tormented by the memories of a family tragedy occurred six years ago. The arrival of cousin Charles will threaten the fragile equilibrium of their minds, haunted by madness, fear and superstition.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-05-17</td><td>/2xg0n31TXPULoNuSeRNWPEHIcjF.jpg</td><td>10.79</td><td>236</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fFI2MuuA2gRRFuYVKMdVWojPmHW.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>461955</td><td>Rakka</td><td>Rakka</td><td>en</td><td>A story of broken humanity following the invasion of a technologically superior alien species. Bleak, harrowing, and unrelenting, the humans must find enough courage to go on fighting.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-06-14</td><td>/4wVeP9BHsQul7CRgdrfiUt1Rds1.jpg</td><td>10.785</td><td>246</td><td>7.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>22</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fGQr2maSQIjLw4RET6XzOKKO9bo.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>711715</td><td>The Current Occupant</td><td>The Current Occupant</td><td>en</td><td>Trapped in a mysterious psychiatric ward, a man with no memory comes to believe that he’s the President of the United States and the subject of a diabolical political conspiracy. As the asylum’s soul-crushing forces bear down on him, he fights to preserve his sanity and escape so that he can return to power.</td><td>The institution will change you.</td><td>2020-07-17</td><td>/yf1iNMyHaQbXd65IsrXPwmNsdEf.jpg</td><td>10.756</td><td>19</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/l1uHJL0XhFdxbsLyTPVRCDMkPik.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>294562</td><td>Lavalantula</td><td>Lavalantula</td><td>en</td><td>Giant lava breathing tarantulas – Lavalantulas – erupt out of ancient volcanos in the Santa Monica Mountains, raining death and destruction upon Los Angeles. With the City of Angels on the verge of incineration, only a washed up ‘90s action hero actor stands in the way of this monstrous swarm of bloodthirsty creatures who burn their victims alive.</td><td>Fire Burns... Lava Bites</td><td>2015-08-08</td><td>/fOcUwBJ2eOekwqBtJZncnrshtos.jpg</td><td>10.75</td><td>121</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/t8ns63GWbJcGCWtxLC2rnRzQGv7.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>439596</td><td>Lavalantula Collection</td></tr><tr><td>14458</td><td>Altered</td><td>Altered</td><td>en</td><td>Fifteen years ago, five men were abducted by aliens. Only four returned. Now, these same four men have managed to capture one of the creatures who killed their friend and ruined their lives.</td><td>They will find you.</td><td>2006-12-19</td><td>/dhUA9wCbuZAdl1Nhq4bkwyZKst5.jpg</td><td>10.744</td><td>178</td><td>5.3</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1qZpzoxhT5IBHcDftTm7oqpxyRg.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>190847</td><td>The Last Days on Mars</td><td>The Last Days on Mars</td><td>en</td><td>On the last day of the first manned mission to Mars, a crew member of Tantalus Base believes he has made an astounding discovery – fossilized evidence of bacterial life. Unwilling to let the relief crew claim all the glory, he disobeys orders to pack up and goes out on an unauthorized expedition to collect further samples. But a routine excavation turns to disaster when the porous ground collapses and he falls into a deep crevice. His devastated colleagues attempt to recover his body. However, when another vanishes, they start to suspect that the life-form they have discovered is not without danger.</td><td>The search for life is about to end.</td><td>2013-08-11</td><td>/kxcQkAhpn8cvJTsU8PXblI5Qq8F.jpg</td><td>10.74</td><td>664</td><td>5.4</td><td>1.06E7</td><td>24084.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zZUuNeCzA5W6YJweyFLxBN6xTHx.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29794</td><td>Howling II: Stirba - Werewolf Bitch</td><td>Howling II: Stirba - Werewolf Bitch</td><td>en</td><td>After his sister is turned into a werewolf and subsequently killed, Ben White decides to help the enigmatic Stefan Crosscoe fight the growing population of lupine monsters, along with the lovely Jenny Templeton. Traveling to Transylvania, Ben, Jenny and Crosscoe attempt to hunt down the powerful werewolf queen, Stirba, and must face her furry followers, as well as other supernatural forces.</td><td>It's not over yet.</td><td>1985-08-28</td><td>/tDbhuq0HueljuSo8XIEJbenFEhL.jpg</td><td>10.734</td><td>151</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/57L0i5g66rQ6jzBOmteJaDSfQC2.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>174218</td><td>The Howling Collection</td></tr><tr><td>39858</td><td>美女のはらわた</td><td>Entrails of a Beautiful Woman</td><td>ja</td><td>A nurse investigates a sex trafficking ring after a woman commits suicide in her office.</td><td>NA</td><td>1986-09-23</td><td>/1Mn4oSxGDPvuAewoAsNNvhZhqqA.jpg</td><td>10.731</td><td>17</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>68</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ludx47rqtV91KQbr8IDuAhe8anM.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>395982</td><td>Prevenge</td><td>Prevenge</td><td>en</td><td>A pregnant widow, believing herself to be guided by her unborn child, embarks on a homicidal rampage.</td><td>Killing for two.</td><td>2017-02-10</td><td>/5OWrwvKscVc7Md0IvtTLZmjXbKt.jpg</td><td>10.72</td><td>179</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nMOEd4RkXd2WZTUrUivWYyuXazD.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>25103</td><td>Night of the Demon</td><td>Night of the Demon</td><td>en</td><td>American professor John Holden arrives in London for a conference on parapsychology only to discover that the colleague he was supposed to meet was killed in a freak accident the day before. It turns out that the deceased had been investigating a cult lead by Dr. Julian Karswell. Though a skeptic, Holden is suspicious of the devil-worshiping Karswell. Following a trail of mysterious manuscripts, Holden enters a world that makes him question his faith in science.</td><td>Who will be the next in line to defy the curse?</td><td>1957-11-09</td><td>/ePAjGAhynpwEI5HbpIrB28ML6lg.jpg</td><td>10.719</td><td>201</td><td>7.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3k7GViJ1WN16Py3a7hccE2o4muz.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>433244</td><td>Clinical</td><td>Clinical</td><td>en</td><td>A psychiatrist tries to put her life back together after a violent attack by seeking to repair the life of a new patient, but he has his own terrifying history.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-01-13</td><td>/uFRyXUPqoZ7uORGtV2y8eSdJHuA.jpg</td><td>10.718</td><td>352</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sUKRP2rDqi2Kfh8c2xO8WJKi0sU.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>26953</td><td>Puppet Master</td><td>Puppet Master</td><td>en</td><td>A Jewish puppet maker who's discovered the secret to creating living puppets commits suicide to avoid capture by the Nazis and hides his beloved and harmless puppet children in a California hotel. Years later, a cult of magicians arrive at the hotel under the invitation of an ex-member who betrayed them all, only to find that he's dead - and that the living puppets, under the influence of a new Puppet Master, have turned murderous!</td><td>Evil comes in all sizes.</td><td>1989-10-12</td><td>/kixZHMQmGcRUwgollFcCr4WZ49A.jpg</td><td>10.717</td><td>263</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bGMEESwIvex2Mc1B2iVtuAXbyoE.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>107949</td><td>Puppet Master Collection</td></tr><tr><td>672437</td><td>Brain Freeze</td><td>Brain Freeze</td><td>fr</td><td>A fertilizer used in a rich gated community becomes the source of a genetic mutation that transforms its residents into zombies. Can a teenager and his baby sister break free from the quarantined island before turning into grass?</td><td>NA</td><td>2021-10-29</td><td>/47p7TSZAZK9Rc0FKwAcERPrNxvJ.jpg</td><td>10.717</td><td>6</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1AWFl5YPihXOHHqWUQxT9KPPXTW.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>59762</td><td>Silent Night Deadly Night 4: Initiation</td><td>Silent Night Deadly Night 4: Initiation</td><td>en</td><td>A reporter investigating the bizarre death of a woman who leaped from a building in flames finds herself mixed up in a cult of witches who are making her part of their sacrificial ceremony during the Christmas season.</td><td>If I die before I wake... thank you.</td><td>1990-11-21</td><td>/1Oc6wObXYHThbBGsozL7WuilqOS.jpg</td><td>10.715</td><td>41</td><td>4.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rVVtJfS7jJHBI2dSeK2EWpTsmzQ.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>256296</td><td>Silent Night, Deadly Night Collection</td></tr><tr><td>33518</td><td>Alligator</td><td>Alligator</td><td>en</td><td>A baby alligator is flushed down a toilet and survives by eating discarded lab animals that have been injected with growth hormones. The now gigantic animal escapes the city sewers and goes on a rampage, pursued by a cop and a big-game hunter.</td><td>It lives 50 feet beneath the city. It's 36 feet long. It weighs 2,000 pounds...And it's about to break out!</td><td>1980-07-02</td><td>/f8qY8U9UPdGL3zZw0N6juU3gBXd.jpg</td><td>10.71</td><td>231</td><td>5.9</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lsG8QFlJlgdA6MHMFeepmwYRtRc.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>124934</td><td>Alligator Collection</td></tr><tr><td>68341</td><td>冷たい熱帯魚</td><td>Cold Fish</td><td>ja</td><td>Shamoto runs a small tropical fish shop. When his daughter Mitsuko is caught shoplifting at a grocery store a man named Murata steps in to settle things between the girl and the store manager. Murata also runs a tropical fish shop and he and Shamoto soon become friendly. However Murata hides many dark secrets behind his friendly face.</td><td>He'll make you pick up the pieces.</td><td>2010-06-04</td><td>/669GmEZsyMlPliURX5myHTStslv.jpg</td><td>10.708</td><td>253</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>144</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lCR2wcqu6BBF7vFF3TqqDartccO.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>449684</td><td>Girls with Balls</td><td>Girls with Balls</td><td>fr</td><td>All girls volley ball team The Falcons end up stranded in the middle of nowhere after their mini-van breaks down. Little do they know they landed in degenerate hunters' territory and the hunt is on. Thus begins a very long night where they must run for their lives and test their team spirit. But the girls are more resourceful than it appears. In the heart of the forest, the tables are about to turn between hunter and hunted...</td><td>They're gonna smash the slasher!</td><td>2019-07-26</td><td>/hnJ8H5DvwHG5jktB9CA0n6rmYxs.jpg</td><td>10.701</td><td>203</td><td>4.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>77</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2N391Zp3MwPrpTCp2hdo2zQyzqw.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>531145</td><td>Boarding School</td><td>Boarding School</td><td>en</td><td>When troubled 12-year-old Jacob Felsen is sent away to boarding school, he enters every kid’s worst nightmare: a creepy old mansion, deserted except for six other teenage misfits and two menacing and mysterious teachers. As events become increasingly horrific, Jacob must conquer his fears to find the strength to survive.</td><td>Jacob is having a bad day at school.</td><td>2018-08-30</td><td>/lun3G1IU6AYgXlXP649amULMPpv.jpg</td><td>10.7</td><td>192</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>111</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gzb77BF5SaVJviF10twAdrDGdTc.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27636</td><td>La frusta e il corpo</td><td>The Whip and the Body</td><td>it</td><td>In the 19th century, a sadistic nobleman terrorizes the members of his family. He is found dead, but his ghost soon returns to haunt the residents of his castle.</td><td>The most deliriously romantic horror picture ever made!</td><td>1963-08-29</td><td>/2bGBuB7DxWj9C2tomwMMi8diaqw.jpg</td><td>10.699</td><td>94</td><td>6.4</td><td>66500.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/EGIbG1zVCdlQnyDFkSwScyMzUo.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>572468</td><td>Perempuan Tanah Jahanam</td><td>Impetigore</td><td>id</td><td>A woman inherits a house in her ancestral village, but she's unaware that members of the community have been trying to locate and kill her to remove the curse that has plagued them for years.</td><td>Family can get under your skin.</td><td>2019-10-17</td><td>/dku2KnAPALsi69MnvTV7cXrylWm.jpg</td><td>10.691</td><td>139</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>106</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4JOCooFc5M8w4EoSn3o8hZcKdyO.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>312791</td><td>GirlHouse</td><td>GirlHouse</td><td>en</td><td>In an attempt to make some extra cash while away at College, Kylie moves into a house that streams content to an X-rated website. After a deranged fan hacks in to determine the house's location, she finds herself in a terrifying fight for her life.</td><td>Enjoy the show.</td><td>2014-10-16</td><td>/4zR3QYWoeY2mTwVWnVxUQQptqdM.jpg</td><td>10.688</td><td>241</td><td>6.0</td><td>3150000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aoidrQ7c0Z170EvyoDSMDeq1mUV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>473902</td><td>The Amityville Murders</td><td>The Amityville Murders</td><td>en</td><td>On the night of November 13th, 1974, Ronald DeFeo Jr. took a high powered rifle and murdered his entire family as they slept. At his trial, DeFeo claimed that 'voices' in the house commanded him to kill. This is their story.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-11-05</td><td>/czMYViYqaNrvxaRyhUR0PTPyOig.jpg</td><td>10.677</td><td>104</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gB1QqGDMLgwYCsbXSId8gLPNAvg.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>397842</td><td>The Amityville Collection</td></tr><tr><td>827</td><td>Les Diaboliques</td><td>Diabolique</td><td>fr</td><td>The cruel and abusive headmaster of a boarding school, Michel Delassalle, is murdered by an unlikely duo -- his meek wife and the mistress he brazenly flaunts. The women become increasingly unhinged by a series of odd occurrences after Delassalle's corpse mysteriously disappears.</td><td>See it, be amazed at it, but... BE QUIET ABOUT IT!</td><td>1955-01-29</td><td>/pNcwhz3Eyfn3KQ2XykTozbARMpr.jpg</td><td>10.666</td><td>739</td><td>7.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>117</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oMpX8thZFDVZNS4j240HYSMMvyg.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>5072</td><td>Severance</td><td>Severance</td><td>en</td><td>Members of the Palisades Defense Corp. sales group arrive in Europe for a team-building exercise. A fallen tree blocks the route, and they must hike to their destination. However, a psychotic killer lurks in the woods, and he has a horrible fate in mind for each of the co-workers.</td><td>The Company Is Making Cutbacks</td><td>2006-05-19</td><td>/yg1XRTyH5knwh3Tnij2sUV0ZZ5w.jpg</td><td>10.664</td><td>456</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>5515163.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5xeC9mN6Aq2PmbbglqxiJxSPgvl.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>406107</td><td>Dead Awake</td><td>Dead Awake</td><td>en</td><td>Kate Bowman (Jocelin Donahue) is an average social worker who, after the sudden death of her twin sister, is investigating the mysterious deaths of other people who died in their sleep. Shortly before their deaths, the victims all reported a supernatural force that appeared to them while they were suffering from sleep paralysis. When Kate investigates further into the case, she opens herself up to the creature's wrath and soon finds herself and her family suffering from an ancient evil.</td><td>An ancient evil. Trapped in a world of darkness. Waiting for someone to believe.</td><td>2017-05-12</td><td>/apBhaUivEub9Ghx7sj7UqQCFYH4.jpg</td><td>10.661</td><td>113</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rKmt9wwtRZ971JgqI6M4mfFLiWF.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>942389</td><td>ভূতচক্র Pvt. Ltd.</td><td>Bhootchakra Pvt. Ltd.</td><td>bn</td><td>Three friends plan to start a business of capturing ghosts using a strange instrument. The instrument has been received by one of the friends as the legacy of his grandfather. After getting the instrument they decide to turn as ghost hunters and earn money. But things changed when most of their lies turn out to be true and both the living and the dead chase them for answers. And from here series of the comedy of errors begin to change their lives forever.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-07-04</td><td>/9uc7qwT3OjoGwd96OVQJ4GWj0Qu.jpg</td><td>10.655</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10496</td><td>Bats</td><td>Bats</td><td>en</td><td>Genetically mutated bats escape and it's up to a bat expert and the local sheriff to stop them.</td><td>They will suck you dry</td><td>1999-10-22</td><td>/pZRcf2BwcxWg594X6XT2jkR2qdb.jpg</td><td>10.654</td><td>149</td><td>4.6</td><td>5250000.0</td><td>1.015569E7</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hchZiGTq5fUBYzqhsIGvarLsVCf.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>381396</td><td>Bats Collection</td></tr><tr><td>661289</td><td>The Summers of IT: Chapter Two</td><td>The Summers of IT: Chapter Two</td><td>en</td><td>This documentary focuses on the actors and their journey over two summers to create the remake to the original IT, by Stephen King. The documentary originally released as bonus material, bundled with IT: Chapter Two.</td><td>IT Ends</td><td>2019-12-10</td><td>/tNyUIYsTLtMql2SvQvvGZvWsd23.jpg</td><td>10.636</td><td>52</td><td>7.4</td><td>7.9E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>169</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nXXhswchGwLP13zj5C2f8PA3X3P.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>84194</td><td>Excision</td><td>Excision</td><td>en</td><td>Alienated teen Pauline struggles with the pressures of fitting into high school, pleasing her mother and a burning desire to lose her virginity. With a grotesque curiosity for the darker side of life, Pauline is considered a social outcast by everyone around her. Enticed by flesh, she retreats into her own fantasies and hopes to become a great surgeon - that is, if she doesn't go insane first.</td><td>Heal The Sickness</td><td>2012-09-12</td><td>/3aLgB6FTQlNanER0RpckbKdwyh9.jpg</td><td>10.633</td><td>455</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3zDMhdQHWNJ3NhekmP0qjOpR6CF.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>30931</td><td>Dark Night of the Scarecrow</td><td>Dark Night of the Scarecrow</td><td>en</td><td>Bubba, an intellectually disabled man, is falsely accused of attacking a young girl. Disguised as a scarecrow, he hides in a cornfield, only to be hunted down and shot by four vigilante men. After they are acquitted due to lack of evidence, the men find themselves being stalked one by one.</td><td>The Original Classic</td><td>1983-01-22</td><td>/qLGmL2AFjheZpxRke23943lElsa.jpg</td><td>10.632</td><td>111</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rrVKO2eOq8rABLOghciRfLB6PKv.jpg</td><td>Horror, TV Movie</td><td>977159</td><td>Dark Night of the Scarecrow Collection</td></tr><tr><td>36239</td><td>Slaughtered Vomit Dolls</td><td>Slaughtered Vomit Dolls</td><td>en</td><td>The gruesome tapestry of psychological manifestations of a nineteen year old bulimic runaway stripper-turned prostitute as she descends into a hellish pit of satanic nightmares and hallucinations.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-01-01</td><td>/6aThc82WK9Ss8VR7amjIvHV4oQH.jpg</td><td>10.625</td><td>79</td><td>4.4</td><td>100000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>71</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>331117</td><td>Vomit Gore Series</td></tr><tr><td>135812</td><td>Dracula 3D</td><td>Dracula 3D</td><td>en</td><td>When Englishman Jonathan Harker visits the exotic castle of Count Dracula, he is entranced by the mysterious aristocrat. But upon learning that the count has sinister designs on his wife, Mina, Harker seeks help from vampire slayer Van Helsing.</td><td>The Legend Rises</td><td>2012-11-09</td><td>/n1EsoM2cotsQRmvNnQJlOeC1jNe.jpg</td><td>10.621</td><td>169</td><td>3.3</td><td>7700000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4LVttBbEL1yAAYiPPA9JsvWZhK2.jpg</td><td>Horror, Romance, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12561</td><td>ゴジラvsデストロイア</td><td>Godzilla vs. Destoroyah</td><td>ja</td><td>A burning Godzilla, on the verge of meltdown, emerges to lay siege to Hong Kong. At the same time horrifying new organisms are discovered in Japan. These crustacean-like beings are seemingly born of the Oxygen Destroyer, the weapon that killed the original Godzilla.</td><td>NA</td><td>1995-12-09</td><td>/t28laxbteoyubkGPQZJFmrEEdGl.jpg</td><td>10.612</td><td>182</td><td>7.8</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>1.8E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mTL72rHXjdwQYsfnuJC1Szbcckg.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>374511</td><td>Godzilla (Heisei) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>18573</td><td>House of Wax</td><td>House of Wax</td><td>en</td><td>A New York sculptor who opens a wax museum to showcase the likenesses of famous historical figures runs into trouble with his business partner, who demands that the exhibits become more extreme in order to increase profits.</td><td>You've never been scared until you've been scared in 3-D.</td><td>1953-04-16</td><td>/5Di30K5NzAtYMjBSAABwgZHV0Ro.jpg</td><td>10.612</td><td>253</td><td>6.9</td><td>658000.0</td><td>2.38E7</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9QRJN7GaGIHwdkzDAilIrt1Nf4r.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>103620</td><td>Maniac</td><td>Maniac</td><td>en</td><td>As he helps a young artist with her upcoming exhibition, the owner of a mannequin shop's deadly, suppressed desires come to the surface.</td><td>I Warned You Not to Go Out Tonight.</td><td>2012-12-26</td><td>/sZswHknJ0H871AdsSt1bLzeEnYf.jpg</td><td>10.609</td><td>757</td><td>6.0</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>31081.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pSqpdJj6xEMmiSS7UczIFD7jklR.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>153738</td><td>Frankenstein's Army</td><td>Frankenstein's Army</td><td>en</td><td>Toward the end of World War II, Russian soldiers pushing into eastern Germany stumble across a secret Nazi lab, one that has unearthed and begun experimenting with the journal of one Dr. Victor Frankenstein. The scientists have used the legendary Frankenstein's work to assemble an army of super-soldiers stitched together from the body parts of their fallen comrades -- a desperate Hitler's last ghastly ploy to escape defeat</td><td>What is dead may never die.</td><td>2013-01-24</td><td>/tBDuUfnAyN2OTHhyy4xyUrU8C2A.jpg</td><td>10.606</td><td>206</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4N2Kg5G3xOkzbwKr2af8ATmK7Jb.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9841</td><td>Rest Stop</td><td>Rest Stop</td><td>en</td><td>In Texas, the aspirant actress Nicole Carrow runs away home to Los Angeles with her boyfriend Jess Hilts. They drive through a shortcut in an old road, and when they park in a rest stop, Jess is abducted by the sadistic driver of an old yellow truck. Along the night, Nicole is threatened by the sick maniac, while mysterious things happen to her in the place.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-10-07</td><td>/1qAQWKjfAgxQN4atIMWnssBWHOf.jpg</td><td>10.597</td><td>205</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1XYeqsFgDZYb3GtCPdFbdFk8hto.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>286006</td><td>Rest Stop Collection</td></tr><tr><td>29896</td><td>Never Cry Werewolf</td><td>Never Cry Werewolf</td><td>en</td><td>Jared Martin moves next door to the Hansetts, along with his hot motorcycle and eerie, ill-tempered dog. Although everyone else in the neighborhood takes an instant liking to him, Loren Hansett can't get over the bad vibes her new neighbor gives her. She starts to spy on his nocturnal activities and comes to believe that a recent killing might the work of a werewolf who happens to be her new neighbor. Her internet surfing provides a lot of collaborative detail but everyone but her friend Steven dismiss her story as teen-aged fantasy. Fearing for her life, she convinces Steven to take her to a gun shop to buy silver bullets in a gun shop, where their neighbor's supernatural dog attacks. When she dispatches the beast, her actions get the attention of Redd Tucker, a washed-up TV hunting show host to believe her as well. When Steven is attacked by the werewolf and Loren's brother goes missing, she and Redd team up to kill the lycanthrope before he can finish them both off.</td><td>An Immortal Battle for Survival</td><td>2008-05-11</td><td>/w7jZwDFv2ExZvfmPuh9m7vFF4RW.jpg</td><td>10.59</td><td>76</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qhY6HoFzaV6TTsGrAFtg4BK91r8.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>121248</td><td>Halloween: The Inside Story</td><td>Halloween: The Inside Story</td><td>en</td><td>This feature-length documentary takes a look at one of the most successful film franchises of all time as it goes behind the scenes of John Carpenter’s Halloween, the frightfest that redefined the horror genre in the late 1970s.</td><td>Go behind the scenes of one of cinema's greatest horror movies.</td><td>2010-10-25</td><td>/lgVy4xGC2eOuMKDSGiqtVeGR1zh.jpg</td><td>10.586</td><td>17</td><td>7.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bSYE2tVOwleW7UmJPhLtb9GZ8VD.jpg</td><td>Documentary, Horror, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11336</td><td>The Dead Zone</td><td>The Dead Zone</td><td>en</td><td>Johnny Smith is a schoolteacher with his whole life ahead of him but, after leaving his fiancee's home one night, is involved in a car crash which leaves him in a coma for 5 years. When he wakes, he discovers he has an ability to see into the past, present and future life of anyone with whom he comes into physical contact.</td><td>In his mind, he has the power to see the future. In his hands, he has the power to change it.</td><td>1983-10-21</td><td>/9yTVaeS8eIkOpbwIycVFm7EQrgF.jpg</td><td>10.584</td><td>1262</td><td>7.0</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>2.0766616E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/icvgQHxrKEDx92VQ5WHiEmEAUKH.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>347642</td><td>Bite</td><td>Bite</td><td>en</td><td>While on her bachelorette party getaway, Casey, the bride to be, gets a seemingly harmless bite from an unknown insect. After returning home with cold feet, Casey tries to call off her wedding but before she's able to, she starts exhibiting insect like traits. Between her physical transformation and her wedding anxiety, Casey succumbs to her new instincts and begins creating a hive that not only houses her translucent eggs, but feeds on the flesh of others. As her transformation becomes complete, Casey discovers that everything can change with a single bite.</td><td>NA</td><td>2015-08-15</td><td>/oHoqxVKgXUiz0gGQ23AZPPLgUXd.jpg</td><td>10.583</td><td>126</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hWNtu3ArtSx5GPnQoGjQHvTL0uc.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>214597</td><td>Fright Night 2: New Blood</td><td>Fright Night 2: New Blood</td><td>en</td><td>By day Gerri Dandridge is a sexy professor, but by night she transforms into a real-life vampire with an unquenchable thirst for human blood. When a group of high school students travel abroad to study in Romania, they find themselves ensnared in her chilling web of lust and terror. Charlie and 'Evil' Ed must stop Gerri from drinking and bathing in the blood of a 'new moon virgin', who just so happens to be Charlie’s ex-girlfriend.</td><td>New Blood, New Victims...</td><td>2013-08-31</td><td>/3Is5G28YLNKq22n5Ee2yTmYA3m6.jpg</td><td>10.581</td><td>235</td><td>4.8</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9P0IectpPQktF0mu2nkdihsdTSZ.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>230161</td><td>Fright Night (Reboot) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>289239</td><td>Mostly Ghostly: Have You Met My Ghoulfriend?</td><td>Mostly Ghostly: Have You Met My Ghoulfriend?</td><td>en</td><td>Bella Thorne, Madison Pettis and Ryan Ochoa lead an ensemble cast in this spook-tacular adventure with new ghosts, new thrills, and the return of some old friends. Max (Ochoa) only has eyes for Cammy (Thorne), the smart, popular redhead at school. When Max finally scores a date with Cammy on Halloween, Phears, an evil ghost with plans on taking over the world, unleashes his ghouls and things go haywire. With the help of his ghostly pals, Tara and Nicky, can Max thwart Phears' evil plot, help reunite his ghost friends with their long-lost parents and still make his date with Cammy on Halloween? R.L. Stine's Mostly Ghostly: Have You Met My Ghoulfriend? is a frightful family delight!</td><td>A spook-tacular family adventure!</td><td>2014-09-02</td><td>/eiVY4kKpbo1f7wyNubgJX5ILpxg.jpg</td><td>10.578</td><td>62</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/w04mJW2N44IkplYtEAdnmW2EDvF.jpg</td><td>Family, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>326849</td><td>Mostly Ghostly Collection</td></tr><tr><td>877436</td><td>The Hunt</td><td>The Hunt</td><td>en</td><td>The victims of the Hunt, kidnapped by a dark organisation are forced into sick torture games in an abandoned military base. They face unspeakable horror, unless they can outwit their abductors. The hunt is on: 5 victims, 5 killers, 1 aim... to survive.</td><td>NA</td><td>2021-04-26</td><td>/fDAIJxoW8w