iller</td><td>138706</td><td>The Stepfather Collection</td></tr><tr><td>18498</td><td>Ghoulies</td><td>Ghoulies</td><td>en</td><td>A young man and his girlfriend move into the man's old mansion home, where he becomes possessed by a need to control ancient demons.</td><td>They'll get you in the end.</td><td>1985-01-18</td><td>/yV8z6deULhH4oJAUj2YdhITPwfc.jpg</td><td>10.416</td><td>196</td><td>4.8</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>3.5E7</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/f01AbhKF4GSAxUxxBnXqk1012Ga.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>44913</td><td>Ghoulies Collection</td></tr><tr><td>670426</td><td>Lucky</td><td>Lucky</td><td>en</td><td>May, a self help author with all the answers, suddenly finds herself stalked by a masked man who mysteriously reappears every night. Even when she kills him. May struggles to get help from the people around her as she fights to stay alive. Is this paranoia, or is she doomed to accept her new reality?</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-08-23</td><td>/oKrENAWxa7vd4haYmNxMXyuWxD7.jpg</td><td>10.412</td><td>59</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sdgAVpyAFYKYUM0v14Lki5OOYzY.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>43552</td><td>Vanishing on 7th Street</td><td>Vanishing on 7th Street</td><td>en</td><td>A mysterious global blackout yields countless populations to simply vanish, leaving only their clothes and possessions behind. A small handful of survivors band together in a dimly-lit tavern on 7th Street, struggling to combat the apocalyptic horror. Realizing they may in fact be the last people on earth, a dark shadow hones in on them alone.</td><td>Stay in the light.</td><td>2010-09-11</td><td>/8LkZFmL2UHbmP7UnjlRP5gqvvqh.jpg</td><td>10.403</td><td>459</td><td>5.3</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>1671196.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7uFwTUdm05597nXMgbqiLei5j4G.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>5154