iller loose on the streets, and her sister is one of his victims. There is still hope to save her, but in a dark and mysterious city full of secrets, you can’t trust anyone. Not even yourself...</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-11-29</td><td>/sam9cFSJknPKW4m4fjwj5idRUkf.jpg</td><td>10.166</td><td>33</td><td>7.1</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h5HQziqmBR1mZdYu25m4DyHpY9d.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>4241</td><td>ビジターQ</td><td>Visitor Q</td><td>ja</td><td>In a dysfunctional family where the mother is a heroin addict and prostitute, beaten by her son, and the father is an ex-TV reporter, sleeping with his daughter and filming his son being beaten up, ‘Q’, a complete stranger enters the bizarre family, changing their lives for the better, finding a balance in their disturbing natures.</td><td>The only thing stranger than this family is... Visitor Q.</td><td>2001-03-17</td><td>/veDqVt4oYq6mjFGasdVeEv6RPBg.jpg</td><td>10.163</td><td>381</td><td>6.5</td><td>60400.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nFV71P9O6IsNUjveaeLfmzHR6hL.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9674</td><td>リング０　バースデイ</td><td>Ringu 0</td><td>ja</td><td>Taking place thirty years before the events of Ringu, Ringu 0 provides the shocking background story of how the girl on the video became a deadly, vengeful spirit.</td><td>Discover the secret...</td><td>2000-01-22</td><td>/xZUCTZWblWoQo7kkUTvaTcd5hZs.jpg</td><td>10.163</td><td>192</td><td>6.2</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/noRX8VyyAFK1tt0DQSq5qy1tE10.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>93369</td><td>Ringu Collection</td></tr><tr><td>25752</td><td>Children of the Corn 666: Isaac's Return</td><td>Children of the Corn 666: Isaac's Return</td><td>en</td><td>A girl called Hannah goes back to her hometown (Gatlin) to find her mother but on the way she picks up a