e of the Werewolf</td><td>The Curse of the Werewolf</td><td>en</td><td>A child conceived after a demented beggar rapes a mute servant girl is raised by a wealthy but kindly bachelor gentleman and his woman servant who learn, years later, that he is a werewolf. His only chance for normalcy is to find a woman who will love him for himself, which will release him from the curse.</td><td>HALF-MAN... HALF-WOLF... COMPELLED BY THE HIDEOUS CURSE OF HIS EVIL BIRTH TO DESTROY - EVEN THOSE WHO LOVED HIM!</td><td>1961-05-01</td><td>/nwtxrG9jd5ge1nOWjmIVosBywst.jpg</td><td>10.147</td><td>128</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sLZ7UYHdZxpuMmXPkNIKC7iXPi8.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>412766</td><td>Sam Was Here</td><td>Sam Was Here</td><td>en</td><td>California, Mojave Desert, 1998. A strange glow appears in the sky. Sam, a forty-something door-to-door salesman, travels through the few inhabited zones of the Californian desert in search of clients.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-09-27</td><td>/3M1Mt7dXaiRSOygR9C66DA3sbtt.jpg</td><td>10.146</td><td>139</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>75</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vPlSNGV0JNraoABIvL6dFvmrwQg.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>42196</td><td>The Bad Seed</td><td>The Bad Seed</td><td>en</td><td>Air Force Colonel Kenneth Penmark and his wife, Christine, dote on their daughter, Rhoda -- as does their lonely landlady, Monica Breedlove. But self-centered Rhoda has a secret tendency for selfishness and loves to accumulate gifts, whether given or stolen, in her room. Christine keeps her knowledge of her daughter's darker side to herself, but when a schoolmate of Rhoda's dies mysteriously, her self-deception unravels.</td><td>For little Rhoda, murder is child's play.</td><td>1956-09-12</td><td>/iAgSkpZslQ2s3onL9TaHbyWygtC.jpg</td><td>10.144</td><td>193</td><td>7.1</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>129</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tqiAcUqaXPyL2oo18CIPWUGxkJk.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>18477</td><td>The Hills Have Eyes Part II</td><td>The Hills Have Eyes Part II</td><td>en</td><td>A motocross team on their way to trial a new super-fuel head out across the desert lead by Rachel, who, unbeknownst to the rest of the group, is a survivor of the cannibal clan which menaced the Carter family several years before. Opting to take an ill-advised shortcut, the busload of youngsters drive straight into the path of the remnants of Rachel’s demented cannibal kin - the menacing Pluto, and a hulking, blood-hungry brute by the name of The Reaper.</td><td>So you think you're lucky to be alive...</td><td>1985-08-02</td><td>/ltrK0402vrBMugaNCsUmKpeVDIV.jpg</td><td>10.142</td><td>168</td><td>4.5</td><td>700000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/a9F2cldYpiwyOvR528D66wZ4git.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>267922</td><td>The Hills Have Eyes (Original) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>13550</td><td>The Changeling</td><td>The Changeling</td><td>en</td><td>After a tragic event happens, composer John Russell moves to Seattle to try to overcome it and build a new and peaceful life in a lonely big house that has been uninhabited for many years. But, soon after, the obscure history of such an old mansion and his own past begin to haunt him.</td><td>Whatever you do… Don't go into the attic</td><td>1980-03-28</td><td>/z4nTYj3JZ5jWAhDgrmEhW2GRAzb.jpg</td><td>10.14</td><td>455</td><td>7.0</td><td>7600000.0</td><td>1.2E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/k9C0JUBOlt1bzcqxFwHXNnL8X6q.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>146229</td><td>Kristy</td><td>Kristy</td><td>en</td><td>When a college girl who is alone on campus over the Thanksgiving break is targeted by a group of outcasts, she must conquer her deepest fears to outwit them and fight back.</td><td>Run for your life</td><td>2014-08-07</td><td>/5sT3ZsWbX6VOlgqslJ1l7eWZJqq.jpg</td><td>10.139</td><td>315</td><td>6.0</td><td>6900000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4NBmeG6iqE5BWCHsgOrY8S380T6.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>52454</td><td>Mega Shark vs. Crocosaurus</td><td>Mega Shark vs. Crocosaurus</td><td>en</td><td>When the prehistoric warm-water beast the Crocosaurus crosses paths with that cold-water monster the Mega Shark, all hell breaks loose in the oceans as the world's top scientists explore every option to halt the aquatic frenzy. Swallowing everything in their paths -- including a submarine or two -- Croc and Mega lead an explorer and an oceanographer on a wild chase. Eventually, the desperate men turn to a volcano for aid.</td><td>Whoever wins... we lose!</td><td>2010-12-21</td><td>/Y2nVRQWMjmtdqZ6zzo3CuvVDFa.jpg</td><td>10.129</td><td>144</td><td>4.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9GEVt9xyE48MypCfKcfCcmbuIxi.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>264481</td><td>Mega Shark Collection</td></tr><tr><td>244316</td><td>Into the Grizzly Maze</td><td>Into the Grizzly Maze</td><td>en</td><td>Two estranged brothers reunite at their childhood home in the Alaskan wild. They set out on a two-day hike and are stalked by an unrelenting grizzly bear.</td><td>Hunt or be hunted.</td><td>2015-02-27</td><td>/i5GbFCeZ0fG5xb2ta6B3yNgzIM7.jpg</td><td>10.122</td><td>219</td><td>5.4</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ovFz5YVSVxlkHnroFP7b2Rxiz9H.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>60950</td><td>Scream of the Banshee</td><td>Scream of the Banshee</td><td>en</td><td>An archeology professor unearths a dangerous artifact, unwittingly releasing a creature that is able to kill with the power of its bone-splitting scream.</td><td>She hasn't been out for a thousand years.</td><td>2011-03-26</td><td>/zaMeyJq5jPhXRyVuOg2Ak9mbgZZ.jpg</td><td>10.115</td><td>79</td><td>5.1</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uzywNBnacW0nvmeSu48jEbI99ab.jpg</td><td>Horror, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9964</td><td>Bad Taste</td><td>Bad Taste</td><td>en</td><td>A team from the intergalactic fast food chain Crumb's Crunchy Delights descends on Earth, planning to make human flesh the newest taste sensation. After they wipe out the New Zealand town Kaihoro, the country’s Astro-Investigation and Defense Service (AIaDS) is called in to deal with the problem. Things are complicated due to Giles, an aid worker who comes to Kaihoro the same day to collect change from the residents. He is captured by the aliens, and AIaDS stages a rescue mission that quickly becomes an all-out assault on the aliens’ headquarters.</td><td>NA</td><td>1987-12-01</td><td>/f0QHSGkvgjvXlmPfIaoco1jxLh6.jpg</td><td>10.113</td><td>657</td><td>6.4</td><td>25710.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/HUnVuk7xCe9bZE5YZcVwMV8xea.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>15052</td><td>The Lodger</td><td>The Lodger</td><td>en</td><td>Follows a seasoned detective on the trail of a ruthless killer intent on slaughtering prostitutes along West Hollywood's Sunset Strip. It appears that the murderer's grisly methods are identical to that of London's infamous 19th century psychopath Jack the Ripper – a relentless serial killer who was never caught by police. To make matters worse, the detective soon notices the parallels between the crimes committed by the West Hollywood stalker and those of a serial murderer incarcerated years ago. Could the wrong man be behind bars?</td><td>Everyone is suspect.</td><td>2009-01-14</td><td>/prfQla0ZriFC9PecssAiladiby4.jpg</td><td>10.113</td><td>107</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7JW65OqY4aBQenEVdCcr8LPXFBF.