d>When Eun-soo gets lost in a country road, he meets a mysterious girl and is led to her fairytale ike house in the middle of the forest. There, Eun-soo is trapped with the girl and her siblings who never age. Eun-soo finally discovers a way out which is written on a fairy tale book. But the book tells a story of none other than himself!</td><td>Once upon a time in a dark, dark forest...</td><td>2007-12-27</td><td>/lgubqcerdcykeU9fNO8I1p2Nh6S.jpg</td><td>10.097</td><td>142</td><td>6.7</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>2206625.0</td><td>117</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jDGEow8TLShkM6st9QkvUnTuxr3.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>58428</td><td>The Innkeepers</td><td>The Innkeepers</td><td>en</td><td>During the final days at the Yankee Pedlar Inn, two employees determined to reveal the hotel's haunted past begin to experience disturbing events as old guests check in for a stay.</td><td>Some guests never checked out.</td><td>2011-08-18</td><td>/hHdwqyxNjJzm3qDA7CUKzhdOkGk.jpg</td><td>10.096</td><td>536</td><td>5.4</td><td>750000.0</td><td>78396.0</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yzMFckcoe8m4fPZVslD4A3Ujw34.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>75761</td><td>John Dies at the End</td><td>John Dies at the End</td><td>en</td><td>A new drug promises out-of-body experiences, but users are coming back changed forever, and an otherworldly invasion of Earth is underway.</td><td>Just so you know... they're sorry for anything that's about to happen.</td><td>2013-01-25</td><td>/1IsviP0Tb05xUAFWz5b7FJ0qIHP.jpg</td><td>10.095</td><td>545</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iAmTmSUzpxrxz1KJwhrXsdMFRfi.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29437</td><td>Rabid</td><td>Rabid</td><td>en</td><td>After undergoing radical surgery for injuries from a motorcycle accident, a young woman develops a strange phallic growth on her body and a thirst for human blood—the only nourishment that will now sustain her.</td><td>You can't trust your mother, your best friend, the neighbor next door… one minute they're perfectly normal, the next… RABID!</td><td>1977-04-08</td><td>/jSiyTQZ9AdOOMiMS9gOfOddM78a.jpg</td><td>10.091</td><td>367</td><td>6.5</td><td>530000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yXx26Bvhgp8H7RoW1iybktuF1ZN.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>87436</td><td>The ABCs of Death</td><td>The ABCs of Death</td><td>en</td><td>An ambitious anthology film featuring segments directed by over two dozen of the world's leading talents in contemporary genre film. Inspired by children's educational ABC books, the film comprises 26 individual chapters, each helmed by a different director assigned a letter of the alphabet. The directors were then given free reign in choosing a word to create a story involving death.</td><td>26 Directors, 26 Ways to Die.</td><td>2013-03-08</td><td>/dBSEA6P2bq7apsmORxV0a54puhL.jpg</td><td>10.088</td><td>483</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>23589.0</td><td>123</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gaXkyGrumpTvrQPnHA84umwW7um.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>207632</td><td>The ABCs of Death Collection</td></tr><tr><td>6917</td><td>The Gate</td><td>The Gate</td><td>en</td><td>Three young children accidentally release a horde of nasty, pint-sized demons from a hole in a suburban backyard. What follows is a classic battle between good and evil as the three kids struggle to overcome a nightmarish hell that is literally taking over the Earth.</td><td>Pray it's not too late.</td><td>1987-04-21</td><td>/1yeeSTrQRLlQ9fmj2bjx0Gmpm83.jpg</td><td>10.085</td><td>279</td><td>6.0</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>1.35E7</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vxRUX12ZXoTwffLcqS7RAZqcknj.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>340623</td><td>The Gate Collection</td></tr><tr><td>558655</td><td>Flesh & Blood</td><td>Flesh & Blood</td><td>en</td><td>Kimberly, a teenager suffering from agoraphobia, has not left the house since her mother's unsolved murder. On the eve of Thanksgiving, she begins to suspect that the safe harbor of home and her doting father may be a dangerous mirage.</td><td>This Thanksgiving, carve out some family time.</td><td>2018-11-02</td><td>/vvgWkpGsuCSzNZuqenQZUl9EtXe.jpg</td><td>10.085</td><td>110</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tE2imkf1yQ2lDKqyu8l3RbGH6Mo.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>34814</td><td>Zombi 3</td><td>Zombie 3</td><td>it</td><td>When a terrorist's body, infected with a stolen chemical, is recovered by the US military, the corpse is cremated, unintentionally releasing the virus/bacteria into the atmosphere over a small island. Soon the infected populace mutate into flesh-hungry zombies, and a trio of soldiers on leave must team up with a group of tourists and board themselves up in an abandoned hotel as they try to fend off the agile and aggressive living dead.</td><td>NA</td><td>1988-06-01</td><td>/jawfhUNHp0v11RNc9t4yJUJkcyt.jpg</td><td>10.084</td><td>93</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sYGV4GBS7feI2H95QDB7D6XeSQ6.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>133923</td><td>Zombi Collection</td></tr><tr><td>160070</td><td>Apartment 1303 3D</td><td>Apartment 1303 3D</td><td>en</td><td>A woman uncovers sinister secrets while investigating the apparent suicide of her sister.</td><td>Some rentals are too good to be true.</td><td>2012-12-06</td><td>/zTANZaCUwG6prdRygximOdWKV6U.jpg</td><td>10.081</td><td>264</td><td>3.7</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>3377891.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4bWu9GqAJi7m5PxsPFFwTV79Krl.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>935999</td><td>Hounded</td><td>Hounded</td><td>en</td><td>A stately home robbery takes an evil turn one night when a gang of young thieves are caught by the owners of the house and then hunted across the estate for the proprietor's entertainment.</td><td>Old tradition. New blood.</td><td>2022-10-21</td><td>/1A7VZ12Rlx6qv3uqjVdm5pDsR1S.jpg</td><td>10.08</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eJS9th3igRfB9OAxMADOpHcnztl.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10288</td><td>Fido</td><td>Fido</td><td>en</td><td>Timmy Robinson's best friend in the whole wide world is a six-foot tall rotting zombie named Fido. But when Fido eats the next-door neighbor, Mom and Dad hit the roof, and Timmy has to go to the ends of the earth to keep Fido a part of the family. A boy-and-his-dog movie for grown ups, \"Fido\" will rip your heart out.</td><td>Good dead are hard to find</td><td>2006-09-07</td><td>/btzm8jNgddSn7jLQ6l1WWXs1JI3.jpg</td><td>10.077</td><td>358</td><td>6.5</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>426224.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bWukUgej8vZTRF9YFi2NWmswZie.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>375170</td><td>紅衣小女孩</td><td>The Tag-Along</td><td>zh</td><td>A story about a video of a group of people going hiking and a mysterious little girl in a red dress following them.</td><td>The uninvited can only be seen when you're tagged along</td><td>2015-11-17</td><td>/2AaeSBHS8EhbcOS8cfAUqaPNGHP.jpg</td><td>10.063</td><td>57</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h8oufWe0jtE3BKGj1YqLe9e8di7.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>505857</td><td>The Tag-Along Collection</td></tr><tr><td>709716</td><td>บึงกาฬ</td><td>The Lake</td><td>th</td><td>When a mysterious monster rises from the Mekong River and attacked Bueng Kan, cuts off people from the outside world. Officials and people in the area, including Chinese scientists who accidentally came to conduct research in Thailand, all forces must be mobilized to catch this crazy monster before it's too late.</td><td>A monster will rise.</td><td>2022-08-18</td><td>/2jV8PLAHS9k8NMDFKkigi0qVGlL.jpg</td><td>10.046</td><td>2</td><td>2.5</td><td>2480000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cvHEMN1NW2Re02kH90847YML2gu.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>624779</td><td>VFW</td><td>VFW</td><td>en</td><td>A typical night for veterans at a VFW turns into an all-out battle for survival when a desperate teen runs into the bar with a bag of stolen drugs. When a gang of violent punks come looking for her, the vets use every weapon at their disposal to protect the girl and themselves from an unrelenting attack.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-09-21</td><td>/AnVD7Gn14uOTQhcc5xYZGQ9DRvS.jpg</td><td>10.043</td><td>172</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h5sUE9jqoYrjsFjANJXL0gpZGye.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>97795</td><td>Emergo</td><td>Apartment 143</td><td>en</td><td>A team of parapsychologists sets out to investigate a series of anomalous phenomena taking place in a newly occupied apartment. Telephone calls with no caller, mysterious shadows, extraordinary light emissions, flying objects, and exploding light bulbs are some of the events they will face while recording their every step with state-of-the-art technology. Using infrared filming, digital photography, psychophonic recordings, movement detectors, and magnetic field alteration meters, the group’s attempts to contact the “other side” will grow increasingly dangerous as they near a point of no return.</td><td>The First Real Ghost Story.</td><td>2011-10-11</td><td>/hAXqjMVgF6TS8oa40TIRfrNix5d.jpg</td><td>10.039</td><td>238</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>4132000.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ljIFlIqVbES8p7gtPSYgIMI1alL.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>30384</td><td>Zombies Anonymous: Last Rites of the Dead</td><td>Zombies Anonymous: Last Rites of the Dead</td><td>en</td><td>In an imagined reality where zombies coexist with ordinary mortal folk, the undead are considered second-class citizens. Angela finds this out the hard way when she's shot by her boyfriend and must learn to adjust to her new zombie lifestyle. She tempers her hunger for human flesh with Zombies Anonymous meetings and tries to pass for living in the mortal world.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-10-21</td><td>/cwdXmjMd9WUMwxN4yNT3lNsz5sA.jpg</td><td>10.032</td><td>19</td><td>4.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>118</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>254194</td><td>Starry Eyes</td><td>Starry Eyes</td><td>en</td><td>A hopeful young starlet uncovers the ominous origins of the Hollywood elite and enters into a deadly agreement in exchange for fame and fortune.</td><td>She would kill to be famous.</td><td>2014-07-29</td><td>/t1sIumVCl91XThMoJqUjpERYeAM.jpg</td><td>10.031</td><td>366</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rD05NMOQxt73XzCW4QMKirv9jHL.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>20015</td><td>KM 31: Kilometro 31</td><td>KM 31: Kilometer 31</td><td>es</td><td>While driving through the kilometer 31 of a lonely road, Agata Hameran hits a boy. She leaves her car to help the victim and another car runs over her and she falls in a deep coma. Her twin sister Catalina telepathically feels the pain of Agata and hears her whispering for help. Together with her boyfriend Nuno and Agata's mate Omar, they return to the km 31 of the road, and find out that the place is surrounded by supernatural accidents caused by the ghost of a mother that lost her boy many years ago. Further, Catalina discloses that the spirit of Agata is trapped between the worlds of the living and the dead.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-10-19</td><td>/hI1YBR4afo7zOrJfdaaO9GRKEvj.jpg</td><td>10.022</td><td>107</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ka4PUMFdvzu8x3mgtHC9JGcjrEB.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>691535</td><td>KM 31 - Colección</td></tr><tr><td>553141</td><td>The Head Hunter</td><td>The Head Hunter</td><td>en</td><td>On the outskirts of a kingdom, a quiet but fierce medieval warrior protects the realm from monsters and the occult. His gruesome collection of heads is missing only one - the monster that killed his daughter years ago. Driven by a thirst for revenge, he travels wild expanses on horseback. When his second chance arrives, it’s in a way far more horrifying than he ever imagined.</td><td>Grief. Anger. Vengeance.</td><td>2019-04-05</td><td>/ol0DSLOIN8Rq1BcWDTsk6NNwas6.jpg</td><td>10.016</td><td>234</td><td>5.3</td><td>30000.0</td><td>44652.0</td><td>72</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hgfWu52a8HvC5R4gGbXFRGcC8d4.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11654</td><td>The Hunger</td><td>The Hunger</td><td>en</td><td>Miriam promises her lovers the gift of eternal life, but John, her companion for centuries, suddenly discovers that he is getting old minute by minute, so he looks for Dr. Sarah Roberts, a researcher on the mechanisms of aging, and asks her for help.</td><td>Nothing human loves forever</td><td>1983-04-29</td><td>/fv83BVy6t1dcvPiBX5TBpgLZYcX.jpg</td><td>10.015</td><td>421</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>5979292.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jQrUWPRC4dAfO7nHrK7CDgr7hSs.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29960</td><td>Vampire Circus</td><td>Vampire Circus</td><td>en</td><td>After a spate of murders, the villagers of Schtettel kill the depraved perpetrator, Count Mitterhouse. Fifteen years later the Circus of Nights appeared in the plague-ridden village and its performers include Mitterhouse's mistress, children and cousins. They have come to Schtettel to fulfil the Count's last words, an evil, vicious curse of death and destruction on those who participated in his impaling. The children of Schtettel become the targets for a brutal and devastating revenge as the Vampire Circus rehearses for its most deadly performance.</td><td>Human fangs ripping throats - no sawdust can soak up the torrent of blood!</td><td>1972-04-30</td><td>/sbYsGpPy1JgHjlOb1Onc9xwqr8u.jpg</td><td>10.012</td><td>77</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2R8KO50XgdzxMwjhI5SksZJfo1u.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>480210</td><td>Truth or Dare</td><td>Truth or Dare</td><td>en</td><td>Eight college friends head to a \"Haunted Rental\" in a remote town for Halloween weekend. There, they play the game rumored to have caused the deaths of seven teenagers decades earlier, Truth or Dare. What starts out as vodka induced fun, quickly turns serious when the dares become sickeningly dangerous and the truths threaten to tear the group apart. When players attempt to refuse the increasingly challenging tasks, they're met with deadly consequences, quickly discovering: you must do the dare, or the dare does you. As the death toll mounts, the remaining players must race against the clock to outrun, outsmart and outlast the simple game of Truth or Dare.</td><td>Do the dare.</td><td>2017-10-08</td><td>/l5Dyos3xViHP5ROuCi01P9Q6nZA.jpg</td><td>10.0</td><td>106</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kmG5pmly0X8bB5SLkvm119j4cnk.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>15741</td><td>Dorothy Mills</td><td>Dorothy Mills</td><td>en</td><td>When a gloomy, God-fearing island community is rocked by the assault of an infant, a psychiatrist is called in to examine Dorothy Mills, the teenager accused of the crime. Despite the villagers' hostility to her inquiry, she soon comes to suspect that Dorothy suffers from multiple personality disorder...</td><td>Evil chose her</td><td>2008-08-06</td><td>/oGPRhKj9XRVDGkYQkxmJo4qCL8t.jpg</td><td>9.996</td><td>200</td><td>6.1</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/o62LhJiAi2J1Rhd97VUweEP3Zgk.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1483</td><td>Begotten</td><td>Begotten</td><td>en</td><td>Begotten is the creation myth brought to life, the story of no less than the violent death of God and the (re)birth of nature on a barren earth.</td><td>NA</td><td>1991-06-05</td><td>/qYJh4HESlOyZll77erHcVAKqrbt.jpg</td><td>9.993</td><td>245</td><td>5.9</td><td>33000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>72</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1vSPlCXoiFpk8y19D1UadakS4gn.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>476066</td><td>Begotten Collection</td></tr><tr><td>16307</td><td>The Wicker Man</td><td>The Wicker Man</td><td>en</td><td>Police sergeant Neil Howie is called to an island village in search of a missing girl whom the locals claim never existed. Stranger still, however, are the rituals that take place there.</td><td>Flesh to touch...Flesh to burn! Don't keep the Wicker Man waiting!</td><td>1973-12-01</td><td>/wwtrXRL8SiOWxhwLEvw7iBgYh0g.jpg</td><td>9.989</td><td>1026</td><td>7.3</td><td>810000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xOcVqlNnVUEQhQ3Xqhgh7mqeh9f.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>37865</td><td>Buried Alive</td><td>Buried Alive</td><td>en</td><td>A married woman and her lover plot to kill her husband to make off with the insurance money. However, their attempt to murder him using poisonous fish toxins backfires when he awakens inside his coffin and returns from the grave, hellbent on revenge.</td><td>She planned on her husband's death. But not on his coming back for revenge.</td><td>1990-05-09</td><td>/75X5BCuZIsfZYxWZfhi02v4MudO.jpg</td><td>9.989</td><td>115</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/o1jzMqBiziQILkPVEONuYS4QluX.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>518611</td><td>Buried Alive Collection</td></tr><tr><td>438436</td><td>Most Beautiful Island</td><td>Most Beautiful Island</td><td>en</td><td>An illegal immigrant struggling to begin a new life in New York City is offered a great opportunity, but as day turns to night, she discovers she's been lured into a dangerous game.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-11-03</td><td>/g8RFV3wqigvgXqcVihyz6w0cLLV.jpg</td><td>9.989</td><td>92</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/alIp3GhrLWqK7PXghf1Mk6QJmZO.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>52302</td><td>マタンゴ</td><td>Matango</td><td>ja</td><td>Five vacationers and two crewmen become stranded on a tropical island near the equator. The island has little edible food for them to use as they try to live in a fungus covered hulk while repairing Kessei's yacht. Eventually they struggle over the food rations which were left behind by the former crew. Soon they discover something unfriendly there...</td><td>NA</td><td>1963-08-11</td><td>/7McjdskDGIhgAaEWrNV5zIzK87f.jpg</td><td>9.981</td><td>71</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7Mmp2I9AMmOkOCSoC8jb3w81YjC.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12485</td><td>Candyman: Day of the Dead</td><td>Candyman: Day of the Dead</td><td>en</td><td>The Candyman returns to try to convince his female descendent, an artist, to join him as a legendary figure. To this end, he frames her for a series of hideous murders of her friends and associates so that she has nowhere else to turn to.</td><td>Blood is sharper than the blade</td><td>1999-07-09</td><td>/sqr0imYSvDu8Q5nZLNjgAXppVSt.jpg</td><td>9.974</td><td>175</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5QUQvk4wfJnnR5wc4T61X2wvzwA.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>98580</td><td>Candyman Collection</td></tr><tr><td>498934</td><td>ミスミソウ</td><td>Liverleaf</td><td>ja</td><td>The story follows Nozaki Haruka, a middle school student who transfers to a new school in a small town because of her father's work. Unfortunately, she becomes a victim of horrific bullying, but since the school will be closing in 2 months after graduation, no one is willing to help her.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-04-07</td><td>/4YmCpOIlBr9gvPnHNqQfzSlcbOY.jpg</td><td>9.972</td><td>31</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zKo1MifHltc3rCTcPGo4mnEbHny.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>594482</td><td>Path of Darkness: Making 'Silent Hill'</td><td>Path of Darkness: Making 'Silent Hill'</td><td>en</td><td>6 part behind the scenes feature on making 'Silent Hill'.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-08-22</td><td>/jXlETG0ZInqCrnh6GjqTUI2WQrp.jpg</td><td>9.969</td><td>4</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>59</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Documentary, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>18616</td><td>No Man's Land: The Rise of Reeker</td><td>No Man's Land: The Rise of Reeker</td><td>en</td><td>A sheriff and his son who are tracking down a group of bank robbers on their way to Mexico, only to discover that they are being stalked by a far more deadly enemy — The Reeker.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-05-01</td><td>/1LAjKJ2Xcmb1ixIKq6ZA3LVq871.jpg</td><td>9.967</td><td>57</td><td>4.6</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fbVs0ZZnfGSEPouaxiGcRHUletl.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>297371</td><td>Reeker Collection</td></tr><tr><td>462593</td><td>Los olvidados</td><td>What the Waters Left Behind</td><td>es</td><td>Epecuén was one of the most important touristic villages of Argentina. Thousands of people concurred, attracted by the healing properties of its thermal waters. On November 10th 1985, a huge volume of water broke the protecting embankment and the village was submerged under ten meters of salt water. Epecuén disappeared. Thirty years later, the waters receded and the ruins of Epecuén emerged exposing a bleak and deserted landscape. The residents never returned.  The plot revolves around a group of young people that take a trip to the ruins in order to film a documentary about Epecuén. Ignoring the warnings, and after a brief tour, they get stranded in the abandoned village. Contrary to what they thought, they begin to realize that they are really not alone…</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-10-28</td><td>/tnqblwjW48fkZh99jQYWziMnhr9.jpg</td><td>9.964</td><td>85</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ufyPovbgRKlKTWrlzDFgULfgfyi.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>82505</td><td>House at the End of the Street</td><td>House at the End of the Street</td><td>en</td><td>A mother and daughter move to a new town and find themselves living next door to a house where a young girl murdered her parents. When the daughter befriends the surviving son, she learns the story is far from over.</td><td>Fear reaches out... for the girl next door.</td><td>2012-09-21</td><td>/bgHeZ5g7YyxKcwWw1tgyAMy0czy.jpg</td><td>9.963</td><td>1572</td><td>5.8</td><td>6900000.0</td><td>4.4287131E7</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zqIV1W1TyQbUeqEwfApdo5jXmjF.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>234212</td><td>Demonic</td><td>Demonic</td><td>en</td><td>A police officer and a psychologist investigate the deaths of five people who were killed while trying to summon ghosts.</td><td>Every House Has Its Secrets</td><td>2015-02-12</td><td>/ne0wAvbmzk72svslxjuFySrXEKw.jpg</td><td>9.962</td><td>419</td><td>5.3</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>3387000.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mgGQbf8trfPw7VVI2WmD8svPO7Y.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>43919</td><td>Hatchet II</td><td>Hatchet II</td><td>en</td><td>Picking up right where the original ended, Marybeth escapes the clutches of the swamp-dwelling killer Victor Crowley. After learning the truth about her family’s connection to the hatchet-wielding madman, Marybeth returns to the Louisiana swamps along with an army of hunters to recover the bodies of her family and exact the bloodiest revenge against the bayou butcher.</td><td>Victor Crowley Lives.</td><td>2010-08-26</td><td>/a8Hh6DIOjPE73Hw5ZihDr3k1JDw.jpg</td><td>9.959</td><td>309</td><td>5.5</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>156190.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sh9aRWXveSCeY2TDgNv3UzXAUb9.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>124901</td><td>Hatchet Collection</td></tr><tr><td>84060</td><td>Cruel Jaws</td><td>Cruel Jaws</td><td>en</td><td>A tiger shark bred by the Navy as a killing machine is wreaking havoc in the sleepy tourist town of Hampton Bay.</td><td>This Time It's Even More Personal Than Last Time!</td><td>1995-05-05</td><td>/dHvOI2eyVGwsmAHWT5NJRCrNGHq.jpg</td><td>9.957</td><td>64</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vCQRs9QMADZEbGiS4hJkjAzis36.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>33908</td><td>쓰리, 몬스터</td><td>Three… Extremes</td><td>ko</td><td>An Asian cross-cultural trilogy of horror films from accomplished indie directors: Dumplings, directed by Fruit Chan of Hong Kong, Cut directed by Park Chan-Wook of Korea, and Box directed by Miike Takashi of Japan.</td><td>From the Nightmares of 3 Horror Masters.</td><td>2004-08-20</td><td>/et67QHZlzgbPwU4zC7o2iwRIrcz.jpg</td><td>9.952</td><td>284</td><td>6.8</td><td>77532.0</td><td>516930.0</td><td>125</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gTyVZH8Cipil3G2DW0zBw8cwAlA.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>998794</td><td>Tam Canh</td></tr><tr><td>86330</td><td>Bates Motel</td><td>Bates Motel</td><td>en</td><td>