chaurige Haus</td><td>The Scary House</td><td>de</td><td>When a big-city family moves to a remote town, two young brothers and their new friends try to solve the menacing mystery that haunts their home.</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-10-30</td><td>/1N5KeZaw8bQrt30UaV9qtPLjkwI.jpg</td><td>9.621</td><td>194</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mm1JTSYpaFSTFCEtwRWziGTSvCJ.jpg</td><td>Family, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>47886</td><td>Mil gritos tiene la noche</td><td>Pieces</td><td>en</td><td>A frustrated Boston detective searches for the maniac responsible for mutilating a number of university coeds.</td><td>It's exactly what you think it is!</td><td>1982-08-23</td><td>/t88kc9IDVKUgkIONptu31ZUd7VW.jpg</td><td>9.619</td><td>192</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>1198346.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/n3GAf4i2tGOG083tFZtClkG4UD0.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27214</td><td>Amityville 3-D</td><td>Amityville 3-D</td><td>en</td><td>To debunk the Amityville house's infamous reputation and take advantage of a rock-bottom asking price, skeptical journalist John Baxter buys the place and settles in to write his first novel. But as soon as the ink on the deed has dried, people who have come into contact with John and the house begin to meet with shocking fates. Is it all just coincidence, or is the house really the gateway to hell?</td><td>WARNING: in this movie you are the victim.</td><td>1983-11-18</td><td>/gYvFL6REedBvjTSzVAhyk5imJgq.jpg</td><td>9.618</td><td>168</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>6333135.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xRWwI4l1jYrf0HaoBeMg1LNkstk.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>397842</td><td>The Amityville Collection</td></tr><tr><td>265018</td><td>Indigenous</td><td>Indigenous</td><td>en</td><td>A group of five American friends on the cusp of adulthood travel to Panama to relax and reconnect. They befriend a 