nly to hole up at an Inn run by neo-Nazis.</td><td>What are your boundaries...</td><td>2007-07-01</td><td>/lX5XyaUQ4yXRY1knq5N8IKj6Ua4.jpg</td><td>9.484</td><td>575</td><td>6.1</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eylAS0ll4UvtN2a4UIQRem3AypU.jpg</td><td>Action, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>31909</td><td>Invaders from Mars</td><td>Invaders from Mars</td><td>en</td><td>In this remake of the classic 50s SF tale, a boy tries to stop an invasion of his town by aliens who take over the the minds of his parents, his least-liked schoolteacher and other townspeople. With the aid of the school nurse the boy enlists the aid of the U.S. Marines.</td><td>Their conquest has already begun. . . . He knows they’re here.</td><td>1986-06-06</td><td>/nrOMXSicPD73gtZjobR38nTFbDT.jpg</td><td>9.483</td><td>181</td><td>5.5</td><td>1.2E7</td><td>4884663.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/prXg39FFxNgmab46jS5wkNbjQSt.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Family, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>425094</td><td>Echo Torch</td><td>Echo Torch</td><td>en</td><td>An inventor creates an electrical torch that reveals a hidden world layered upon our own - filled with beautiful spirits, strange creatures, and dangerous phantoms.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-10-21</td><td>/5VHaxWVhF8WlGRn93IqjrdmkUia.jpg</td><td>9.481</td><td>11</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>20</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28667</td><td>The Gorgon</td><td>The Gorgon</td><td>en</td><td>In the early 20th century a village experienced a series of inexplicable murders. All the victims were young men who had been turned to stone. The perpetrator of these deaths was a being so repulsive that she transformed the onlooker using the power of her deadly stare. Much of the time the creature took the form of a beautiful and seductive woman, but during periods of the full moon she becomes a living horror, vicious and deadly. A professor has come to investigate the deaths, bringing with him his beautiful assistant whose knowledge of the Gorgon is more intimate than anyone would ever realise.</td><td>A venture into the deepest, starkest realms of the supernatural...</td><td>1964-10-18</td><td>/yk0hJB3hy3o6cAzv5tjcPoKQd9p.jpg</td><td>9.478</td><td>112</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lAcbmXbJlGL2YcSY1k6uTm1X5Sg.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>284305</td><td>Musarañas</td><td>Shrew's Nest</td><td>es</td><td>Spain, 1950s. Montse's agoraphobia keeps her locked in a sinister apartment in Madrid and her only link to reality is the little sister she lost her youth raising. But one day, a reckless young neighbor, Carlos, falls down the stairwell and drags himself to their door. Someone has entered the shrew's nest... perhaps he'll never leave.</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-09-21</td><td>/7rgorbW4vCzZZHW5sEEczSjNqza.jpg</td><td>9.472</td><td>254</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ivPVtfSF4FVy5w349eTMsM3RPk7.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>30685</td><td>Blood Creek</td><td>Blood Creek</td><td>en</td><td>A man and his brother on a mission of revenge become trapped in a harrowing occult experiment dating back to the Third Reich.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-10-09</td><td>/y2kx7UlkSmwyGbyN1dzm60tLvsE.jpg</td><td>9.47</td><td>205</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rsdAVdaFjF2cUgsd9ctEjula0c8.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9568</td><td>The Dentist</td><td>The Dentist</td><td>en</td><td>Dr. Feinstone has everything, a beautiful wife and a successful career in dentistry; but when he discovers his wife's affair, he realizes that behind every clean, white surface lies the stench of decay.</td><td>It's been six months. Time for your check-up!</td><td>1996-06-07</td><td>/4jKZXQy0OJW3B0tt8AdQ8epI9sU.jpg</td><td>9.468</td><td>234</td><td>5.6</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/25pNPKtYHtZFLsJ71SC5skiXJAe.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>117952</td><td>The Dentist Collection</td></tr><tr><td>7006</td><td>White Noise 2: The Light</td><td>White Noise 2: The Light</td><td>en</td><td>A man's family brought back from the verge of death, he then discovers he can identify people who are about to die.</td><td>Sometimes they don't come back alone.</td><td>2007-01-05</td><td>/7rp6W0Rj7BoopylLnIRsIScDu9W.jpg</td><td>9.465</td><td>211</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1g8u78FExsr4NZjHDOvHDi2uCgq.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>102777</td><td>White Noise Collection</td></tr><tr><td>48871</td><td>Red: Werewolf Hunter</td><td>Red: Werewolf Hunter</td><td>en</td><td>The modern-day descendant of Little Red Riding Hood brings her fiancé home to meet her family and reveal their occupation as werewolf hunters, but after he is bitten by a werewolf, she must protect him from her own family.</td><td>NA</td><td>2010-10-30</td><td>/ldCKvSF1iNmNPRC7PurYwcX7CuG.jpg</td><td>9.465</td><td>48</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aAD4vXiKbWDxZmKi0AZ6xfxDuj5.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14240</td><td>Maniac Cop</td><td>Maniac Cop</td><td>en</td><td>In New York, people are slain and strangled to death brutally on the open street. All witnesses agree that the murderer was in a cop's uniform. Soon the police search and find a suspect in its own ranks: Jack Forrest, suspected of murdering his own wife and the rest of the unfortunate individuals to die by the Maniac Cop’s reign of terror. To prove his innocence, he investigates the case with his partner, Theresa Mallory.</td><td>You have the right to remain silent. Forever.</td><td>1988-05-13</td><td>/kFml1HbZlsekXO0m11UN4oPwZvo.jpg</td><td>9.46</td><td>345</td><td>6.2</td><td>1100000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9GYvt6C9hzoW7tS4kaz00omOTb5.jpg</td><td>Action, Crime, Horror, Mystery</td><td>254636</td><td>Maniac Cop Collection</td></tr><tr><td>765869</td><td>Black Friday</td><td>Black Friday</td><td>en</td><td>A group of toy store employees must protect each other from a horde of parasite infected shoppers.</td><td>They have no idea what tonight has in-store.</td><td>2021-11-19</td><td>/vf9Ex4EwSPlwbva4ZJdljsQQOML.jpg</td><td>9.459</td><td>131</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pinPGZW5r9SOFNlSLugpdLwvdyD.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>121606</td><td>Resolution</td><td>Resolution</td><td>en</td><td>A man imprisons his estranged junkie friend in an isolated cabin in the boonies of San Diego to force him through a week of sobriety, but the events of that week are being mysteriously manipulated.</td><td>NA</td><td>2013-06-27</td><td>/gTZTCMmU7N0qTWJrSUOVBI70ZlA.jpg</td><td>9.445</td><td>296</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5hKaMeWkVgMjeoF0Wz71ohUl2S9.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>23730</td><td>C.H.U.D.</td><td>C.H.U.D.</td><td>en</td><td>A rash of bizarre murders in New York City seems to point to a group of grotesquely deformed vagrants living in the sewers. A courageous policeman, a photo journalist and his girlfriend, and a nutty bum, who seems to know a lot about the creatures, band together to try and determine what the creatures are and how to stop them.</td><td>They're not staying down there anymore!</td><td>1984-08-31</td><td>/8BVw5RIDBTZwdMAR1VKpAkwrMjj.jpg</td><td>9.442</td><td>218</td><td>5.7</td><td>1250000.0</td><td>3412497.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zY9ahWKd9wVgQ6Rj5iL2zo0UvOt.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>257571</td><td>C.H.U.D. Collection</td></tr><tr><td>35979</td><td>Pumpkinhead: Blood Feud</td><td>Pumpkinhead: Blood Feud</td><td>en</td><td>During a bitter family feud, Jodie Hatfield, and her boyfriend Ricky McCoy, decide to leave town to avoid being found out, but are soon caught in the act. Wanting vengeance, he seeks out the monster Pumpkinhead, and resurrects it seek revenge on the family. Despite being warned away by the ghost of Ed Harley, his vengeance plan starts out, and the Hatfield family is soon under siege by the powerful demon. Not accepting the legend of the creature and believing their arch-rivals are the real cause, the two families attempt to go to war, only to be stopped when Pumpkinhead attacks the Hatfield house. Putting aside their differences, they band together to stave off the creature before it's vengeance pact is completed.</td><td>Vengeance Will Be His</td><td>2007-02-05</td><td>/beh3X6LZKd7kai0RaxqeiP5WHHy.jpg</td><td>9.44</td><td>69</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hOxSJmivWspP1IAIuZrjX9Js06g.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, TV Movie</td><td>123256</td><td>Pumpkinhead Collection</td></tr><tr><td>151933</td><td>Dead in Tombstone</td><td>Dead in Tombstone</td><td>en</td><td>An outlaw named Guerrero Hernandez is shot in the back and killed whilst attempting to free his half-brother from a small-town prison. Making a deal with the devil, Hernandez returns from the dead to take his revenge.</td><td>A Blast With Both Barrels Blazing!</td><td>2013-10-01</td><td>/hWQfInQkauNbyZRQRxbM7IXm3DF.jpg</td><td>9.423</td><td>149</td><td>5.0</td><td>5200000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lSfXOMMV4Hp1Axtz1XZXkEYYLE0.jpg</td><td>Action, Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Western</td><td>473185</td><td>Dead in Tombstone Collection</td></tr><tr><td