256</td><td>Castle Freak</td><td>Castle Freak</td><td>en</td><td>John has inherited a castle in Italy and he moves there with his wife Susan and their blind daughter Rebecca. What they don't realize is that there is somebody else in the castle--an abused child left to die in the basement who has now become the castle freak and is out to wreak havoc.</td><td>Hideous. Hungry. And Loose.</td><td>1995-11-14</td><td>/rZv3aUkNngyZeiCgAjOEF5n0tve.jpg</td><td>9.332</td><td>149</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gggdkmSWasCCwtEItnvQw9NpFLi.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>22307</td><td>Sisters</td><td>Sisters</td><td>en</td><td>Inquisitive journalist Grace Collier is horrified when she witnesses her neighbor, fashion model Danielle Breton, violently murder a man. Panicking, she calls the police. But when the detective arrives at the scene and finds nothing amiss, Grace is forced to take matters into her own hands. Her first move is to recruit private investigator Joseph Larch, who helps her to uncover a secret about Danielle's past that has them both seeing double.</td><td>They were joined at birth by the devil and the evil never left them!</td><td>1973-03-26</td><td>/q1nXg56iEKSqlPyC8eEsiEchykj.jpg</td><td>9.332</td><td>276</td><td>6.7</td><td>500000.0</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ghqsfvSRyJzpLASMtRqV4GTCCvp.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39916</td><td>Contamination</td><td>Contamination</td><td>en</td><td>A former astronaut helps a government agent and a police detective track the source of mysterious alien pod spores, filled with lethal flesh-dissolving acid, to a South American coffee plantation controlled by alien pod clones.</td><td>You can feel them in your blood!</td><td>1980-08-02</td><td>/eCUSieEikP6vt0dBbIKnEGpyEK2.jpg</td><td>9.331</td><td>89</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/grGHTlo6U52SF65g04H5LYa86Cs.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>229182</td><td>The Harvest</td><td>The Harvest</td><td>en</td><td>Maryann moves in with her grandparents after she's orphaned. Desperately lonely, she sets out to befriend a neighboring deathly ill, bed-ridden boy, despite the outright disapproval of his mother. Maryann's persistence pays off, however, and during a series of secret visits she gradually uncovers some seriously sinister goings-on in the house.</td><td>First the Fall, then The Harvest.</td><td>2015-04-10</td><td>/he6abiplc1atXbN7OztQAiZoYU.jpg</td><td>9.328</td><td>167</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/g2AVuSgZHuTntU8P4nXYqEYOSXU.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29979</td><td>Highwaymen</td><td>Highwaymen</td><td>en</td><td>James Cray watched as his wife was killed by Fargo, a hit-and-run serial murderer. After severely injuring Fargo and going to prison for several years, James is now determined to avenge his wife's death. He drives across the country looking for Fargo's 1972 Cadillac Eldorado, which the now-disabled killer has turned into a rolling death trap. James' search is helped by a state traffic officer and a singer with her own agenda.</td><td>When murder is no accident, revenge is no crime.</td><td>2004-02-13</td><td>/jJD5UFkIwH8GlLGfc773fQMnAZe.jpg</td><td>9.318</td><td>174</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>371396.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uQO9H0r55AIkvlnzDUzewxnyDfV.jpg</td><td>Action, Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29512</td><td>Bruiser</td><td>Bruiser</td><td>en</td><td>Bruiser is the story of a man who has always tried to fit in. He keeps his mouth shut, follows the rules, and does what he's supposed to do. But one morning, he wakes up to find his face is gone. All the years of acquiescence have cost him the one thing he can't replace: his identity. Now he's a blank, outside as well as in, an anonymous, featureless phantom. Bent on exacting revenge, he explodes. He isn't going to follow the rules anymore.</td><td>Meet the new face of terror.</td><td>2000-02-13</td><td>/4fAXtm11Z7pRzxFzPDDsJWUzwVm.jpg</td><td>9.317</td><td>110</td><td>5.5</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/l7TLxnV6lB9QySMOVcuaOhN4aHC.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>794234</td><td>The Bunker Game</td><td>The Bunker Game</td><td>en</td><td>Laura, 25, is an actress in a L.A.R.P. (Live Action Role Playing) Game, where the participants play the survivors of an atomic war who live underground in a sealed bunker. After several mysterious accidents, the game is interrupted and the players leave the bunker while the staff remain behind to investigate the disappearance of Greg, the mastermind of the game. They soon find themselves trapped inside and in peril as they begin to die in mysterious ways and the group realizes that someone or something paranormal is playing a twisted game with them which quickly plunges into a terrifying fight for survival.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-02-24</td><td>/1FGenj5LnApAsJVLbd5Ehmn16XV.jpg</td><td>9.306</td><td>52</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oLsOL0c1bCgtQahfkiVhUZnhaDY.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17911</td><td>Mega Shark vs. Giant Octopus</td><td>Mega Shark vs. Giant Octopus</td><td>en</td><td>The California coast is terrorized by two enormous prehistoric sea creatures as they battle each other for supremacy of the sea.</td><td>Winner... Eats... All!</td><td>2009-05-19</td><td>/cQsfCkWxK8j9MLrA4ydSMWB2Cpb.jpg</td><td>9.299</td><td>201</td><td>3.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hFjP9xajJNZowgh6ocjOUtKnxml.jpg</td><td>