nnot have children, it causes great distress. To ease his wife's pain, the man finds a piece of root in the backyard and chops it and varnishes it into the shape of a child. However the woman takes the root as her baby and starts to pretend that it is real.</td><td>NA</td><td>2001-01-25</td><td>/86uoXmcgXKZQa35V1AsKVXY3NvX.jpg</td><td>9.284</td><td>108</td><td>7.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>132</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4iThHj4wK5A5Rfbe66y3KpyhD3Z.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1023313</td><td>La Exorcista</td><td>La Exorcista</td><td>es</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-11-02</td><td>/mxeTba8fJYgjmyTEbuEuIcu2uNU.jpg</td><td>9.282</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Post Production</td><td>false</td><td>/rOKKQdzsgFM0iql2xqh5b2VNckE.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>300467</td><td>Dark Was the Night</td><td>Dark Was the Night</td><td>en</td><td>An evil is unleashed in a small town when a logging company sets up shop in the neighboring woods. Isolated and threatened, a mysterious force hidden within the trees outside the small town of Maiden Woods, strikes fear in the townspeople as Sheriff Paul Shields attempts to overcome the demons of his past while protecting those that he loves.</td><td>Evil's Roots Run Deep</td><td>2014-10-17</td><td>/eLJPuZltlAJ9E4OTGYLYh5LDjsB.jpg</td><td>9.281</td><td>209</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8111id3VJF3nKZ5z3Rf1Pca3OvY.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>20481</td><td>Nightbreed</td><td>Nightbreed</td><td>en</td><td>A troubled young man is drawn to a mythical place called Midian where a variety of monsters are hiding from humanity.</td><td>Come meet the dead of night.</td><td>1990-02-16</td><td>/1ChluYH0BEvJo3gtYoFHnMZI660.jpg</td><td>9.272</td><td>354</td><td>6.4</td><td>1.1E7</td><td>8862354.0</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>f