wn doctor learns that the population of his community is being replaced by emotionless alien duplicates.</td><td>There was nothing to hold onto - except each other.</td><td>1956-02-05</td><td>/wVXt7h98sTKhLjq1TdvdGwdyJo8.jpg</td><td>9.236</td><td>809</td><td>7.5</td><td>417000.0</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1qG8TfiE5mCMdaqrFioaGmhBrpY.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>120852</td><td>悪の教典</td><td>Lesson of the Evil</td><td>ja</td><td>Seiji Hasumi is a popular English teacher in a private high school. He is also a violent and sociopathic killer, who slowly takes control of the students and faculty through murder and manipulation. When he is caught in the act during preparations for the school cultural festival, he sees staging a massacre as the only way out.</td><td>Everyone in class, slaughtered.</td><td>2012-11-10</td><td>/aLQeCeQYynSLwq6hsiyJa1bB6t8.jpg</td><td>9.232</td><td>154</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>129</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jcukqOKmduXvrlBJ80uBY2ExVj6.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>928238</td><td>Lesson of the Evil Collection</td></tr><tr><td>140656</td><td>Mamá</td><td>Mamá</td><td>en</td><td>Little Victoria is waken up by her sister Lili who insists on leaving the house because somebody unpleasant has come back.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-10-07</td><td>/2GvRK8b6IfgT3t8QEUAxQu3N9Ev.jpg</td><td>9.231</td><td>104</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>3</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/Xp8P7MU3ZlUHb2szqXy6NHDBjx.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39522</td><td>Mega Piranha</td><td>Mega Piranha</td><td>en</td><td>When a science experiment goes horribly wrong, gigantic fish gain appetites for human flesh.</td><td>They were created to save mankind. Something went wrong.</td><td>2010-04-10</td><td>/vZB82Iqg28c5UxY3maGg1gGr3yF.jpg</td><td>9.224</td><td>125</td><td>3.2</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td>