</td></tr><tr><td>221737</td><td>RoboCroc</td><td>RoboCroc</td><td>en</td><td>When a top-secret unmanned spacecraft disintegrates on re-entry, its mysterious military payload crash-lands in the crocodile habitat of a place called Adventure Land, a combination water park, amusement land, and world-famous crocodile exhibit. Following its pre-programmed instructions, the payload—a next-generation nanotech-based combat drone—finds a host in the form of the park’s prize twenty-foot Australian Saltwater crocodile, Stella. She is the largest saltwater croc in captivity. Immediately upon infecting its host, the drone payload’s nanobots begin to transform Stella from an organic living creature into a lethal killing machine with only a single directive: survival!</td><td>Everybody Out of the Pool</td><td>2013-09-14</td><td>/gsurzan9Ml5OyUR7ybzhqw60yz5.jpg</td><td>9.211</td><td>41</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>77</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/g1o5udFxZ8FPubJiLON7kXw5zIk.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>564176</td><td>Deadsight</td><td>Deadsight</td><td>en</td><td>A man with partial blindness and a young pregnant police officer must work together to escape a deadly virus that has spread across Grey County.</td><td>You'll never see them coming</td><td>2018-11-25</td><td>/nsteY7mL4O8whwgHVZs86FS1Emv.jpg</td><td>9.209</td><td>39</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/j2vB3ao7IDvR4UnCZ0nOcThdV4p.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>101669</td><td>Mother's Day</td><td>Mother's Day</td><td>en</td><td>Crazed members of a sadistic family return to their childhood home to terrorize the new owners.</td><td>Don't Misbehave.</td><td>2010-09-23</td><td>/ykoZhok4DVEJI8q1st7c3VZ5SvD.jpg</td><td>9.206</td><td>336</td><td>6.5</td><td>1.1E7</td><td>863044.0</td><td>112</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4xrt2SCSXmKiAuzCuYQVGkssvWS.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>59421</td><td>김복남 살인사건의 전말</td><td>Bedevilled</td><td>ko</td><td>A woman subject to mental, physical, and sexual abuse on a remote island seeks a way out.</td><td>Nothing is more deadly than a woman seeking revenge.</td><td>2010-08-19</td><td>/uqvG28xhk34ExPZYu2wRGmKB34h.jpg</td><td>9.2</td><td>303</td><td>7.2</td><td>700000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>115</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ca0E776V4Z86Smvvd0842p43hjL.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27274</td><td>Frankenhooker</td><td>Frankenhooker</td><td>en</td><td>A medical school dropout loses his fiancée in a tragic lawnmower incident and decides to bring her back to life. Unfortunately, he was only able to save her head, so he goes to the red light district in the city and lures prostitutes into a hotel room so he can collect body parts to reassemble her.</td><td>A terrifying tale of sluts and bolts.</td><td>1990-06-01</td><td>/s8Oubzkc2pPdOdj4D23ljZSKRbg.jpg</td><td>9.197</td><td>232</td><td>6.1</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>205068.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uuwK1Jc8LKNqNyALKfiP9MTArqw.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>3079</td><td>The Curse of Frankenstein</td><td>The Curse of Frankenstein</td><td>en</td><td>Baron Victor Frankenstein has discovered life's secret and unleashed a blood-curdling chain of events resulting from his creation: a cursed creature with a horrid face — and a tendency to kill.</td><td>The creature created by man and forgotten by nature!</td><td>1957-05-20</td><td>/r9PDkqKhzdo54aqnOL88wUJY49B.jpg</td><td>9.196</td><td>214</td><td>6.8</td><td>270000.0</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5UfnkAPHGWjbWh71CfOJ660HCMx.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>123720</td><td>Frankenstein (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>11594</td><td>Notre-Dame de Paris</td><td>The Hunchback of Notre Dame</td><td>fr</td><td>Paris, 1482. Today is the festival of the fools, taking place like each year in the square outside Cathedral Notre Dame. Among jugglers and other entertainers, Esmeralda, a sensuous gypsy, performs a bewitching dance in front of delighted spectators. From up in a tower of the cathedral, Frollo, an alchemist, gazes at her lustfully. Later in the night, Frollo orders Quasimodo, the deformed bell ringer and his faithful servant, to kidnap Esmeralda. But when the ugly freak comes close to her is touched by the young woman's beauty...</td><td>The timeless tale of the seductive gypsy Esmeralda and the tortured hunchback Quasimodo.</td><td>1956-12-19</td><td>/ds4pCq0GOEarBHI35bYSN2PC0KQ.jpg</td><td>9.193</td><td>75</td><td>6.6</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>115</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uvlBN9lUSlqYoBOnqqfZhs3Vs2I.jpg</td><td>Drama, History, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>44351</td><td>Rabbits</td><td>Rabbits</td><td>en</td><td>A story of a group of humanoid rabbits and their depressive, daily life. The plot includes Suzie ironing, Jane sitting on a couch, Jack walking in and out of the apartment, and the occasional solo singing number by Suzie or Jane. At one point the rabbits also make contact with their “leader”.</td><td>In a nameless city, deluged by a continuous rain, three rabbits live with a fearful mystery.</td><td>2002-01-01</td><td>/7HAGwm3IoiEOx5pqG6acHymZgoy.jpg</td><td>9.192</td><td>215</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>42</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/v18GaWaU12fNXKipi1AIYnYBpDG.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>74336</td><td>조용한 가족</td><td>The Quiet Family</td><td>ko</td><td>A family decides to buy a lodge in a remote hiking area. Their first customer commits suicide and the distraught family buries his body to avoid the bad publicity. But their luck gets worse, the bodies start piling up, and the family becomes frantic to rectify the situation.</td><td>NA</td><td>1998-04-25</td><td>/mqR1EFs1uisdXblSttMCCDnH0l7.jpg</td><td>9.183</td><td>137</td><td>7.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gGqTxNieb7GpntWmo4hlXBDHzCf.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>167575</td><td>Hatchet III</td><td>Hatchet III</td><td>en</td><td>A search and recovery team heads into Victor Crowley’s haunted swamp to pick up the pieces, and Marybeth learns the secret to ending the voodoo curse that has left Victor Crowley terrorizing Honey Island Swamp for decades.</td><td>Some Legends Never Die.</td><td>2013-06-14</td><td>/pxHjfF1MUjWtsEh5qyR0Jj5hWAY.jpg</td><td>9.183</td><td>292</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kNasyakFUSVY3kr3f8d1MrZHAKA.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>124901</td><td>Hatchet Collection</td></tr><tr><td>13557</td><td>The Gravedancers</td><td>The Gravedancers</td><td>en</td><td>After a night of drunken exploits, Allison, Harris, and Kira are chased and terrorized by the ghosts of a child pyromaniac, an ax murderer, and a rapist.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-11-18</td><td>/n4Z1V30BBfe2zP7GkVC4eMg5fdV.jpg</td><td>9.173</td><td>152</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>478535.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/siZcF6a7AZGIGcPCxmzWsaUwR0x.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28090</td><td>Maniac Cop 2</td><td>Maniac Cop 2</td><td>en</td><td>A supernatural maniac killer cop teams up with a Times Square serial killer.</td><td>You have the right to remain silent forever..... Again!</td><td>1990-12-13</td><td>/oxCb0ptp88gDcfAcDUzkPBfc32v.jpg</td><td>9.165</td><td>170</td><td>5.9</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/c6NEPu9EKzk6Ukv0rjzDpcpSg7a.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>254636</td><td>Maniac Cop Collection</td></tr><tr><td>464431</td><td>The Wilding</td><td>The Wilding</td><td>en</td><td>Set in suburban North Carolina, “The Wilding” follows the fractured Hayes family as they attempt to rebuild their lives amidst sinister, supernatural forces. Looking to leave their troubled past behind, George and Margaret try to help their daughter Kayla, a 17-year-old haunted since childhood by strange visions of the dead. Seeking answers for their daughter’s recurring hallucinations, they begin to suspect that she may be a Wilding... possessing untold supernatural abilities.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-01-01</td><td>/exJ34CFoFQmn0np3h3oKwkYmOu1.jpg</td><td>9.165</td><td>15</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fEKEHHvjPn6HN0dVAoGhm6gLYI0.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>31022</td><td>Aftermath</td><td>Aftermath</td><td>es</td><td>When the others leave for the night, the last mortician begins to fondle the corpses. He quickly moves to the corpse of a young woman who died in a car crash.</td><td>NA</td><td>1994-10-08</td><td>/l5MS8hvEVqU0UwCjEWlYhKrNLqI.jpg</td><td>9.162</td><td>185</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>30</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3kaZoOktfCDiuPdBBfAkCEQKVtH.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror</td><td>84785</td><td>La trilogie de la mort – Nacho Cerda</td></tr><tr><td>84204</td><td>Grabbers</td><td>Grabbers</td><td>en</td><td>Something sinister has come to the shores of Erin Island, unbeknownst to the quaint population of this sleepy fishing village resting somewhere off Ireland’s coast. First, some fishermen go missing. Then there is the rash of whale carcasses suddenly washing up on the beach. When the murders start, it’s up to two mismatched cops – an irresponsible alcoholic and his new partner, a by-the-book woman from the mainland – to protect the townsfolk from the giant, bloodsucking, tentacled aliens that prey upon them. Their only weapon, they discover, is booze. If they want to survive the creatures’ onslaught, everyone will have to get very, very drunk!</td><td>For the locals on Erin Island, it's last orders.</td><td>2012-08-10</td><td>/dGAIjxYqP9YBLHeAmaE1NstSnqW.jpg</td><td>9.159</td><td>361</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>427335.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ui4PGuwc9SakCxj0qWbQZ129Uis.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>8461</td><td>Funny Games</td><td>Funny Games</td><td>en</td><td>When Ann, husband George, and son Georgie arrive at their holiday home they are visited by a pair of polite and seemingly pleasant young men. Armed with deceptively sweet smiles and some golf clubs, they proceed to terrorize and torture the tight-knit clan, giving them until the next day to survive.</td><td>You must admit, you brought this on yourself</td><td>2008-03-14</td><td>/2RGiR5yNmxXS8c4Qypmbqn0b63w.jpg</td><td>9.149</td><td>1709</td><td>6.6</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>7938872.0</td><td>111</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aDmI2RFx5ry8QQxLLzYtaROTYqM.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>538858</td><td>तुम्बाड</td><td>Tumbbad</td><td>hi</td><td>India, 1918. On the outskirts of Tumbbad, a cursed village where it always rains, Vinayak, along with his mother and his brother, care of a mysterious old woman who keeps the secret of an ancestral treasure that Vinayak gets obsessed with.</td><td>A Tale of Greed Beyond Fear</td><td>2018-10-12</td><td>/z1xOCxw780WFJC5uCTMfCkQ4Agi.jpg</td><td>9.147</td><td>163</td><td>7.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>113</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ndO0KTkql6zr0u0cQ6gOsqpgpUd.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27726</td><td>Q</td><td>Q</td><td>en</td><td>New York police are bemused by reports of a giant flying lizard that has been spotted around the rooftops of New York, until the lizard starts to eat people. An out-of-work ex-con is the only person who knows the location of the monster's nest and is determined to turn the knowledge to his advantage, but will his gamble pay off or will he end up as lizard food?</td><td>Its name is Quetzalcoatl. Just call it Q. That's all you'll have time to say before it tears you apart!</td><td>1982-09-08</td><td>/hm5mvCN7IMAFjtkQwL4U1qwoJ4c.jpg</td><td>9.146</td><td>201</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/l6hkc0DBjvdrTavmxAP4I55nDzx.jpg</td><td>Crime, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>92182</td><td>Silent House</td><td>Silent House</td><td>en</td><td>Sarah returns with her father and uncle to fix up the family's longtime summerhouse after it was violated by squatters in the off-season. As they work in the dark, Sarah begins to hear sounds from within the walls of the boarded-up building. Although she barely remembers the place, Sarah senses the past may still haunt the home.</td><td>Experience 88 minutes of real fear, captured In real time</td><td>2011-01-21</td><td>/mbkvYlx1scovMi80rOOkNBvgU11.jpg</td><td>9.144</td><td>326</td><td>5.5</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>1.3101672E7</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5lQ1NFHhIlKjGuUhDwhK9xc0mZK.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>82743</td><td>Inbred</td><td>Inbred</td><td>en</td><td>Four young offenders and their workers spend a weekend in the remote Yorkshire village of Mortlake, which prides on keeping itself to itself. A minor incident with locals rapidly escalates into a blood-soaked, deliriously warped nightmare.</td><td>They came in peace but left in pieces.</td><td>2011-09-30</td><td>/jXWU9dWJwJXsFreloh6GcQNokli.jpg</td><td>9.143</td><td>97</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tVR29fndqlTYKzwo4fDm98X4rum.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12591</td><td>Santa's Slay</td><td>Santa's Slay</td><td>en</td><td>Santa Claus is actually a demon who lost a bet with an angel, so he became the giver of toys and happiness. But this year the bet is off, and Santa is about to return to his evil ways.</td><td>He's making a list... pray you're not on it.</td><td>2005-10-25</td><td>/5l53ODRlAUx0gAIIY3QsgCqfNfp.jpg</td><td>9.142</td><td>174</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>78</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4rFNFAOXQHcCYm91rOXk7Edg3uC.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10349</td><td>The Dark Half</td><td>The Dark Half</td><td>en</td><td>Thad Beaumont is the author of a highly successful series of violent pulp thrillers written under the pseudonym of ‘George Stark’, but when he decides to ‘kill-off’ his alter-ego in a mock ceremony, it precipitates a string of sadistic murders matching those in his pulp novels, which are soon discovered to be the work of Stark himself. Looking like a maniacal version of his counterpart, Stark is not so willing to quit the writing game – even if it means coming after Thad's wife and their baby.</td><td>There are very good reasons to be afraid of the dark.</td><td>1993-04-23</td><td>/olTd9a407z9EPrqszt64ZZZWbgq.jpg</td><td>9.139</td><td>308</td><td>6.0</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>1.061116E7</td><td>122</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h5kSM9n8eIec2MzTi2dHIhMbyXP.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>978651</td><td>The Razing</td><td>The Razing</td><td>en</td><td>A group of estranged friends gather for a night of tradition which takes a deadly turn after old secrets and wounds resurface.</td><td>Burn Baby Burn.</td><td>2022-09-26</td><td>/AcApaEuDghZWFxnhlTyhd5aouRx.jpg</td><td>9.136</td><td>2</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/awIkhEtFl88w2FGhcgtrhFur2WG.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>216580</td><td>Savaged</td><td>Savaged</td><td>en</td><td>After thugs brutalize a deaf-mute woman, the spirit of an Apache warrior takes over her lifeless body and sets out on 