se</td><td>en</td><td>When 8 celebrities from around the globe are invited to compete in an online reality show, they soon realize that they are playing for their very lives, as those voted off suffer horrific consequences, broadcast live to the entire world.</td><td>Break the internet - or it breaks you.</td><td>2019-10-25</td><td>/w9k8VvbO7vcFM6NgtgNRNwVmifl.jpg</td><td>9.071</td><td>70</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>110064.0</td><td>106</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7sT5NKw9oMURBZAF5m5zfuMCOpa.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>21151</td><td>My Best Friend Is a Vampire</td><td>My Best Friend Is a Vampire</td><td>en</td><td>A teenager's best friend delivers groceries to a mansion and is bitten by its vampire mistress.</td><td>Vampires and teenagers are a lot alike. They're just misunderstood.</td><td>1987-10-01</td><td>/kfoacxKdHbl2ph2Dj2sAq8Tx8Zy.jpg</td><td>9.069</td><td>73</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>174.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kaqyudZvUsxK6cN0SjOKHqLIoOS.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Family, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>514501</td><td>Luciferina</td><td>Luciferina</td><td>es</td><td>After receiving bad news, Natalia, a young novice, returns home, where her sister Ángela asks her to travel with her and her friends to a mysterious place.</td><td>Seek the Devil, and he will come</td><td>2018-03-15</td><td>/oX4b3aW5mVQWY37SehmLe8vaujC.jpg</td><td>9.066</td><td>48</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>115</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9A1tpDwblGX9Rm6Y4o2TTKRuyJP.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>882216</td><td>The Dream Machine</td><td>The Dream Machine</td><td>en</td><td>A woman experiments with a Dreamachine, hoping to escape trouble. Within the light and dark of the machine, violent emotions awaken.</td><td>Within the light and dark of the machine, violent emotions awaken.</td><td>2022-10-05</td><td>/w3GjnOWWPD5v7ijwyiR9wOws2xd.jpg</td><td>9.063</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100.0</td><td>100.0</td><td>9</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2bgGEsZe6WHP2t9XY1cTq6vJu4W.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28503</td><td>Dementia 13</td><td>Dementia 13</td><td>en</td><td>Shocked by the death of her spouse, a scheming widow hatches a bold plan to get her hands on the inheritance, unaware that she is targeted by an axe-wielding murderer who lurks in the family's estate. What mystery shrouds the noble house?</td><td>Are you afraid of death by drowning? Have you ever attempted suicide? Have you ever thought of committing murder?</td><td>1963-09-25</td><td>/qSfelcriV7J7oOp24QKsry7tylY.jpg</td><td>9.056</td><td>121</td><td>5.6</td><td>30000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>75</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/z2ZiFPibdguCYJBN9rZeHCMHxcO.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>577889</td><td>Hostage Radio</td><td>Hostage Radio</td><td>en</td><td>A radio host is kidnapped on air and forced to tell secrets about his past.</td><td>Your life destroyed on air.</td><td>2019-03-01</td><td>/4ry96PlfzAsO93dZ1Cf1pRmCpNJ.jpg</td><td>9.055</td><td>102</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/f1kb20sXU7YkuHUgdecGuRSjzT0.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11217</td><td>Club Dread</td><td>Club Dread</td><td>en</td><td>When a serial killer interrupts the fun at the swanky Coconut Pete's Coconut Beach Resort -- a hedonistic island paradise for swingers --- it's up to the club's staff to stop the violence ... or at least hide it!</td><td>A vacation to die for.</td><td>2004-02-27</td><td>/9slWyVotwxZNthMcKoeFaK3tgNz.jpg</td><td>9.049</td><td>290</td><td>5.2</td><td>8500000.0</td><td>5001655.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6Mh45I2bE4uEjy19Jk45THEmLd0.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>369196</td><td>I Spit on Your Grave: Déjà Vu</td><td>I Spit on Your Grave: Déjà Vu</td><td>en</td><td>Following her rape, Jennifer Hills wrote a bestselling account of her ordeal and of the controversial trial in which she was accused of taking the law into her own hands and brutally killing her assailants. In the small town where the rape and revenge took place, the relatives of the rapists she killed are furious that the court declared her not guilty and resolve to take justice into their own hands.</td><td>Vengeance thy name is woman</td><td>2019-04-23</td><td>/hrD8fU6tA1Pzh4ybxG4iN5TbVdU.jpg</td><td>9.049</td><td>79</td><td>3.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>148</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qPwGvbhKPel3OHPcby5O7Nwqbhv.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>296429</td><td>I Spit on Your Grave (Original) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>68627</td><td>Hasta el viento tiene miedo</td><td>Even the Wind Is Afraid</td><td>es</td><td>A group of college students, led by Claudia, decide to investigate a local tower that has figured prominently in disturbing reoccurring dreams Claudia has been having. They are suspended from school for their antics, but Claudia learns from one of the female staff members that the person in the dream is a student who killed herself years before and that the headmistress has seen her ghost.</td><td>NA</td><td>1968-05-30</td><td>/je6rko1r6YG7Bi3VKe8Wq7B3mjN.jpg</td><td>9.045</td><td>94</td><td>7.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bhMNud5MNLQjcgez8zRYdyrMiAU.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>31646</td><td>Piranha II: The Spawning</td><td>Piranha II: The Spawning</td><td>en</td><td>A scuba diving instructor, her biochemist boyfriend, and her police chief ex-husband try to link a series of bizarre deaths to a mutant strain of piranha fish whose lair is a sunken freighter ship off a Caribbean island resort.</td><td>It started as a vacation...</td><td>1982-08-14</td><td>/33ubiALsQpBh3hy1x3dNWFQpIlY.jpg</td><td>9.044</td><td>179</td><td>4.4</td><td>145786.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fa7Az2ZWeQTPbZjS5aoEaGIcnvl.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>212279</td><td>Piranha Collection</td></tr><tr><td>58664</td><td>Mostly Ghostly</td><td>Mostly Ghostly</td><td>en</td><td>Based on the successful book series by R.L. Stine, this spooky tale finds 11-year-old Max making a deal with the ghosts who haunt his home. If Max helps them find what was responsible for their parents' disappearance, they'll help him transform from a social nobody to the most popular kid in school.</td><td>From the creator of Goosebumps!</td><td>2008-09-30</td><td>/8wLYv3u9Gg1iF2CAX79nkMBFM71.jpg</td><td>9.039</td><td>42</td><td>6.3</td><td>3600000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tV7nL5IA4QOOJMToFRuwN0gLpcn.jpg</td><td>Family, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>326849</td><td>Mostly Ghostly Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10093</td><td>The Return</td><td>The Return</td><td>en</td><td>Joanna Mills has a successful career but feels her personal life is spinning out of control. She has few friends, an estranged father, and a crazy ex-boyfriend who is stalking her. Joanna begins having terrifying visions of a woman's murder, and it seems that she is the killer's next target. Determined to solve the mystery and escape her apparent fate, Joanna follows her visions to the victim's hometown and finds that some secrets just do not stay buried.</td><td>The past never dies. It kills.</td><td>2006-11-10</td><td>/ywBeNqMJKBowfwrv274blsVXCB5.jpg</td><td>9.036</td><td>485</td><td>5.9</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>1.1992014E7</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/emwiBrI4CjYPicEMPppdQvJGMGu.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>15991</td><td>Bad Biology</td><td>Bad Biology</td><td>en</td><td>Driven by biological excess, a young man and woman search for sexual fulfillment, unaware of each other's existence. Unfortunately, they eventually meet, and the bonding of these two very unusual human beings ends in an explosive and ultimately over-the-top sexual experience, resulting in a truly god awful love story....</td><td>Something is very wrong here...</td><td>2008-02-08</td><td>/yIPDDjtCQv8MPEmTFOD1n9WGOB2.jpg</td><td>9.036</td><td>107</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/boWyYdk4GhZ6bQfQHePH1jhH6Ix.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>25061</td><td>Zombie Nation</td><td>Zombie Nation</td><td>en</td><td>A psycho cop with a weakness for killing his female arrests gets what's coming to him when a pack of zombie women rise from their graves in order to get proper revenge.</td><td>NA</td><td>2004-10-05</td><td>/xJyGsXRqSJhrIi6gVJ3T1B5rrWU.jpg</td><td>9.035</td><td>37</td><td>2.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>63727</td><td>Exorcismus</td><td>Exorcismus</td><td>en</td><td>Fifteen-year-old Emma Evans is like any other teenage girl; she thinks that her parents don´t understand her. She longs for independence and a life free of family ties and responsibilities and she is prepared to do anything to achieve it. But one day she will be forced to face up to the consequences of her actions.Life seems to be carrying on as normal, until one day Emma starts experiencing frightening fits. Her parents are convinced that her problems are either medical or psychological, but when doctors´ tests are unable to draw any conclusions, the family is forced to look elsewhere for answers.It all started off as a bit of fun, Emma never really believed it, but the truth is there is something dark and sinister within her, and it won´t take long to surface.</td><td>NA</td><td>2010-12-29</td><td>/9mNSRW05Y80iS9HdwvP5SIq4oL5.jpg</td><td>9.032</td><td>98</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4KhDnlxNkiKCEoeIMXJIM