vels to China, where he inherits a mysterious ability that allows him to turn into a dinosaur. At first horrified by this new power, a hooker convinces him to use it to fight crime. And ninjas.</td><td>A man of the claw</td><td>2018-09-28</td><td>/trSmNw63luh84MBy5XLH0UiN1BC.jpg</td><td>9.018</td><td>108</td><td>4.8</td><td>35000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>75</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uxvmoirhbve2JkYVCa18msE3f8R.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>116811</td><td>Berberian Sound Studio</td><td>Berberian Sound Studio</td><td>en</td><td>In the 1970s, a British sound technician is brought to Italy to work on the sound effects for a gruesome horror film. His nightmarish task slowly takes over his psyche, driving him to confront his own past.</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-08-30</td><td>/sCrLZYF7TU32Vk5bOIJneVAcoKE.jpg</td><td>9.016</td><td>277</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/y23fv507CBr4i0ODMlJd5JOU4AU.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>253376</td><td>La cueva</td><td>In Darkness We Fall</td><td>es</td><td>Three boys and two girls go backpacking from the city to a paradisiacal island. There they rent motorcycles, travel around the prettiest and most remote spots, camp out in the woods, on a coastal cliff, get drunk and swim in the sea. The following day they enter a deep, maze-like cave to explore it and get lost inside.</td><td>Screaming is not enough</td><td>2014-01-24</td><td>/4OQx9GlkPKFpNSEp4vedPmyC3vU.jpg</td><td>9.015</td><td>127</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>76</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6FNUA7QbugUvUlaxCipqoUjITjZ.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28049</td><td>Operazione paura</td><td>Kill, Baby... Kill!</td><td>it</td><td>A 20th century European village is haunted by the ghost of a murderous little girl.</td><td>Makes You Shiver & Quiver!</td><td>1966-07-08</td><td>/fyGzcMVf8iospgEtBoZkvO9j9Vr.jpg</td><td>9.013</td><td>175</td><td>7.0</td><td>50000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/dfPMlFEOSG6URAJrKyTF8Zkicgj.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>472269</td><td>Possum</td><td>Possum</td><td>en</td><td>A disgraced children’s puppeteer returns to his childhood home and is forced to confront his wicked stepfather and the secrets that have tortured him his entire life.</td><td>Can you spy him deep within? Little possum. Black as sin.</td><td>2018-10-26</td><td>/5QOFKSpE7KacBriU95fxG6hmmvr.jpg</td><td>9.011</td><td>158</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>33225.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/16B59iq7J1UfujZL0hDf3QNJD7m.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>26587</td><td>Dread</td><td>Dread</td><td>en</td><td>Three college students set out to document what other people dread the most. However, one of the three turns out to secretly be a sadistic psychopath who uses this knowledge to gruesomely torture the subjects.</td><td>Your Time Will Come.</td><td>2009-07-14</td><td>/zJvKJ2SKATSRL7cdR2qW2LbaTaS.jpg</td><td>9.01</td><td>183</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/t02XOer9nzMTQwUU62iHDWRbTeF.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>48395</td><td>Rare Exports</td><td>Rare Exports: A Christmas Tale</td><td>fi</td><td>Young Pietari lives with his reindeer-herding father in arctic Finland. On the eve of Christmas, a nearby excavation makes a frightening discovery and an evil Santa Claus is unleashed…</td><td>He knows if you've been naughty. He knows if you've been nice. And he doesn't give a sh*t.</td><td>2010-12-03</td><td>/jzaweEESl54ejxo3EE5uNL8lgTn.jpg</td><td>9.0</td><td>429</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/igFwEFRiEr0CzkQUNTcGYLxTpOi.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>412736</td><td>Rare Exports Collection</td></tr><tr><td>5898</td><td>Brain Dead</td><td>Brain Dead</td><td>en</td><td>A psychological thriller from the writer of the original \"Twilight Zone!\" In a showdown of man vs. machine, Martin plunges into a chaotic nightmare trying to save his mind from the megalomaniacal corporation!</td><td>You have nothing to lose... except your mind.</td><td>1990-01-16</td><td>/eaoGvqROCuJTKKKRUze8ZUSlzba.jpg</td><td>8.996</td><td>76</td><td>5.9</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6DePw8frw8aKunbYIbiXXz8v1Nl.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39987</td><td>L'ultima orgia del III Reich</td><td>Gestapo's Last Orgy</td><td>it</td><td>Lise Cohen is taken to a special prisoner-of-war camp for female Jews, a camp run as a bordello to entertain the German officers and troops going in to battle. The camp is run with an iron fist by Commandant Starker and his minion Alma. Starker becomes frustrated when Lise demonstrates no fear, and devises cruel experiments to scare her, to no avail. Once she realizes her guilt is unfounded, Lise begins to play Starker's game, but even though she begins living a better life, she doesn't forget the atrocities she has seen and experienced.</td><td>The Sickest Entry in the Nazisploitation Genre!</td><td>1977-01-21</td><td>/nBQlTP1Qw3ShRhNuNg8y3RdVMHh.jpg</td><td>8.996</td><td>32</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/r8JnjM80n4zTmeWfnwPgd5MzV2Z.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, War</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>45878</td><td>Return to Horror High</td><td>Return to Horror High</td><td>en</td><td>A few years ago, a mysterious serial-killer caused panic on Crippen High School. The killer was never caught. A movie company, Cosmic Pictures, has decided to make a feature movie about these events - on location, at the now abandoned school. Since members of cast and crew disappear without a trace, it seems as if history is repeating itself...</td><td>School spirit has never been this dead.</td><td>1987-01-28</td><td>/glZ0Wz5u2Vr7TzM6Kj1f4e6EliU.jpg</td><td>8.993</td><td>132</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xaPTEPXPckRbfzCMJ8ylysQEind.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>406817</td><td>Horror High Collection</td></tr><tr><td>43274</td><td>Tower of Terror</td><td>Tower of Terror</td><td>en</td><td>A disgraced reporter investigates an abandoned luxury hotel where five people mysteriously disappeared sixty years earlier.</td><td>Hotel Guest Check In...But They Don't Check Out!</td><td>1997-10-26</td><td>/eZ17PwwacUBMMGWiQUGjwkag5sy.jpg</td><td>8.992</td><td>81</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/logfMF9jvC1qq9Y3pgOneFs74nr.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Family, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29562</td><td>Fascination</td><td>Fascination</td><td>fr</td><td>A thief seeks refuge in a castle owned by two women, Eva and Elizabeth. The women are seductive and teasing, but turn out to be part of a vampiric cult of blood-drinking aristocrats.</td><td>NA</td><td>1979-11-01</td><td>/jLtZoGVeHqivNkuxhG9oov4VJpS.jpg</td><td>8.991</td><td>69</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tuMjazRIINQRGRrNMbl71ktjLVm.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>222911</td><td>The Monkey's Paw</td><td>The Monkey's Paw</td><td>en</td><td>After Jake Tilton is given a mystical \"monkey's paw\" talisman that grants its possessor three wishes, he finds his world turned upside down after his first two wishes result in his malevolent coworker, Tony Cobb, being resurrected from the dead. When Cobb pressures Jake into using the final wish to reunite Cobb with his son, his intimidation quickly escalates into relentless murder - forcing Jake to outwit his psychotic friend and save his remaining loved ones.</td><td>One Wish. A Thousand Regrets.</td><td>2013-10-08</td><td>/q6SNuFQmgun4ne545V36Q8O2rPA.jpg</td><td>8.991</td><td>83</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uWtZ83o4ElZrA4oETKma5II5HPs.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>510284</td><td>Braid</td><td>Braid</td><td>en</td><td>Two drug dealers on the lam seek refuge inside their mentally unstable friend’s mansion. But in order to stay, they have to participate in her elaborate, and increasingly dangerous, game of permanent make-believe.</td><td>Everyone plays. Nobody leaves.</td><td>2019-01-10</td><td>/sp8dzGdwBh3cDU8ygyjtoejfZzI.jpg</td><td>8.991</td><td>119</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lZiV30y7TUDNgY2LzNMOWiy8wQv.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>480100</td><td>Nightmare Cinema</td><td>Nightmare Cinema</td><td>en</td><td>A series of down-on-their-luck individuals enter the decrepit and spine-chilling Rialto theater, only to have their deepest and darkest fears brought to life on the silver screen by The Projectionist – a mysterious, ghostly figure who holds the nightmarish futures of all who attend his screenings.</td><td>The price of admission is your life</td><td>2018-06-21</td><td>/ftdhL4zamDnjSD4TML1ES79DueX.jpg</td><td>8.987</td><td>193</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>119</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8zlo7jnuHM8aFc8th6FY3oAp6JV.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>539364</td><td>Satanic Panic</td><td>Satanic Panic</td><td>en</td><td>A pizza delivery girl is suddenly in for the fight of her young life when encountering a group of Satanists in need of a virgin to ritually sacrifice.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-10-28</td><td>/qnxAGrRwBynkQXCs4Dh6zpEVajN.jpg</td><td>8.987</td><td>91</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7xySmHLRPHy4SyfOLA50IcinewH.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>278316</td><td>Da Sweet Blood of Jesus</td><td>Da Sweet Blood of Jesus</td><td>en</td><td>Dr. Hess Green becomes cursed by a mysterious ancient African artifact and is overwhelmed with a newfound thirst for blood. Soon after his transformation he enters into a dangerous romance with Ganja Hightower that questions the very nature of love, addiction, sex, and status.</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-06-22</td><td>/dUqIwSKX9cEkahmv1lsolT8ouE9.jpg</td><td>8.98</td><td>52</td><td>4.9</td><td>1420000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>123</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mVFFKGb0Iogk0sjP8LCohpyPdKg.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>26811</td><td>Dr. Terror's House of Horrors</td><td>Dr. Terror's House of Horrors</td><td>en</td><td>Five strangers board a train and are joined by a mysterious fortune teller who offers to read their Tarot cards. Five separate stories unfold: An architect returns to his ancestoral home to find a werewolf out for revenge; a doctor discovers his new wife is a vampire; a huge plant takes over a house; a musician gets involved with voodoo; an art critic is pursued by a disembodied hand.</td><td>Acclaimed as \"THE FEAR OF THE YEAR\"</td><td>1965-02-23</td><td>/ccQtFSAGievlTYpuS88PCTHzLu7.jpg</td><td>8.974</td><td>115</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cIVYC9J2iuMpFFuVzBaibsUzhGP.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>193612</td><td>The Quiet Ones</td><td>The Quiet Ones</td><td>en</td><td>A university student and some classmates are recruited to carry out a private experiment -- to create a poltergeist. Their subject: an alluring, but dangerously disturbed young woman. Their quest: to explore the dark energy that her damaged psyche might manifest. As the experiment unravels along with their sanity, the rogue PHD students, led by their determined professor, are soon confronted with a terrifying reality: they have triggered an unspeakable force with a power beyond all explanation.</td><td>A shocking experiment. An unspeakable evil.</td><td>2014-04-01</td><td>/kHiq6WpK0NWeec7zcTswyWRyUo.jpg</td><td>8.974</td><td>584</td><td>5.1</td><td>200000.0</td><td>1.7834867E7</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pGyFaxlhmjPO7G0IKM9QFHfXL61.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>83188</td><td>Camel Spiders</td><td>Camel Spiders</td><td>en</td><td>Based on actual creatures that for years have tormented our armed forces in the Middle East, these creatures have now invaded the southwestern deserts of the United States. The Camel Spiders now freely hunt for prey, unafraid of any predator - including man. No place is safe no one is beyond their paralyzing sting. In the end, a small band of hearty fighters are forced to make one last stand against the creatures.</td><td>They Really Get Under your Skin</td><td>2011-03-04</td><td>/d4kEoQoBrJkVa6MAeB6Lkrttuhn.jpg</td><td>8.973</td><td>40</td><td>4.4</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qMmtm1zHr5j27as82D3PurbIAsb.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>19599</td><td>Book of Blood</td><td>Book of Blood</td><td>en</td><td>Based on the wraparound story penned by Clive Barker in the author's \"Books of Blood\" collection, the story centers on a paranormal expert who, while investigating a gruesome slaying, finds a house that is at the intersection of \"highways\" transporting souls to the afterlife.</td><td>The dead will not be silenced.</td><td>2009-03-07</td><td>/aKgshqVFvuzMl89YMNdO9pd8eFi.jpg</td><td>8.963</td><td>152</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7deObEqUgfdUCL1wXJ5TxB87YFE.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24924</td><td>Night of the Demons</td><td>Night of the Demons</td><td>en</td><