overs that her daughter, Grace, has died in the womb. Ignoring her doctor's warnings that the fetus must be removed from her body, a grief-stricken Matheson demands to carry the child to term -- even if it endangers her own life to do so. Curiously, little Grace emerges undead -- and with a craving for human blood.</td><td>Love. Undying.</td><td>2009-08-14</td><td>/aygXzr6TaeC9jaPC6FfbKxNwZsN.jpg</td><td>8.884</td><td>142</td><td>5.5</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11623</td><td>The Medusa Touch</td><td>The Medusa Touch</td><td>en</td><td>A French detective in London reconstructs the life of a man lying in hospital with severe injuries with the help of journals and a psychiatrist. He realises that the man had powerful telekinetic abilities.</td><td>Richard Burton is the man with the medusa touch... he has the power to create catastrophe.</td><td>1978-04-13</td><td>/sk523UMvmmiFMsGKxerGiwSQWdZ.jpg</td><td>8.881</td><td>131</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>109</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7aY1ji2fVHVTAW9DjkpFvPMyLi9.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13548</td><td>Borderland</td><td>Borderland</td><td>en</td><td>Three college students, Phil, Ed, and Henry take a road trip into Mexico for a week of drinking and carefree fun only to have Phil find himself a captive of a group of satanic Mexican drug smugglers who kill tourists and whom are looking for a group of new ones to prepare for a sacrifice.</td><td>The Devil's Playground is Just Around The Corner</td><td>2007-11-09</td><td>/27DKHSvO9rF17cr7qRuGIYNZvSy.jpg</td><td>8.875</td><td>174</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kaVBHYKI329XiHh8eM5T7sLwPyD.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>78381</td><td>Twixt</td><td>Twixt</td><td>en</td><td