l Brother!</td><td>1972-08-25</td><td>/yLqtFeZfRPoUUzzro3ogCdobB6q.jpg</td><td>8.813</td><td>116</td><td>5.5</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sSIkzQbmjzrThWBaIV3H9YgQ1T9.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>201930</td><td>Blacula Collection</td></tr><tr><td>11380</td><td>Bones</td><td>Bones</td><td>en</td><td>Over 20 years after his death, local legend and benefactor Jimmy Bones returns as a ghost to avenge those who killed him and restore his neighborhood</td><td>Unleash the Dogg.</td><td>2001-10-24</td><td>/7UOHEPTQMaiwaI14CGxd5yFAPMZ.jpg</td><td>8.809</td><td>125</td><td>4.7</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>7316658.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mtgLSNVYWVvyPnASaW5cmcXDvZz.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10988</td><td>Diabolique</td><td>Diabolique</td><td>en</td><td>The wife and mistress of a cruel school master collaborate in a carefully planned and executed scheme to murder him. The plan goes well until the body, which has been strategically dumped, disappears. The psychological strain starts to weigh on the two women when a retired police investigator begins looking into the man's disappearance on a whim.</td><td>Two women. One man. The combination can be murder.</td><td>1996-03-22</td><td>/3sar6ubmUS8I4IGpJYxx9FcgutN.jpg</td><td>8.808</td><td>229</td><td>5.5</td><td>4.5E7</td><td>5.24E7</td><td>107</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5QJyi6fG7YxxLao5HIdrOvwRHaj.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>296130</td><td>Harbinger Down</td><td>Harbinger Down</td><td>en</td><td>A group of grad students have booked passage on the fishing trawler Harbinger to study the effects of global warming on a pod of Orcas in the Bering Sea. When the ship's crew dredges up a recently thawed piece of old Soviet space wreckage, things get downright deadly. It seems that the Russians experimented with tardigrades, tiny resilient animals able to withstand the extremes of space radiation. The creatures survived, but not without mutation. Now the crew is exposed to aggressively mutating organisms. And after being locked in ice for 3 decades, the creatures aren't about to give up the warmth of human companionship.</td><td>Terror is just beneath the surface</td><td>2015-08-07</td><td>/9vmjC5lfEdb26H8hjt73TWTvyNN.jpg</td><td>8.808</td><td>154</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lA3w7ZCiKm2uwKYLgyb0UV1qzFp.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1011679</td><td>Shark Side of the Moon</td><td>Shark Side of the Moon</td><td>en</td><td>Decades ago, the USSR developed unkillable sharks and launched them to the moon. Today, a team of American astronauts will endure the fight of their lives.</td><td>THERE ARE SHARK PEOPLE ON THE MOON</td><td>2022-08-12</td><td>/v5CfpzxoJDkZxjZAizClFdlEF0U.jpg</td><td>8.807</td><td>6</td><td>3.3</td><td>10000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>19166</td><td>House Of 9</td><td>House Of 9</td><td>en</td><td>Nine strangers wake up in a house with no recollection how they got there and no way out. The voice on the PA introduces them to a grisly game they must play. The prize is $5 million and their life.</td><td>Nine Strangers. One House. Only One Will Get Out... Alive.</td><td>2005-06-19</td><td>/3WHQlgb9aKMu35K5UC0DTlUd37n.jpg</td><td>8.805</td><td>180</td><td>4.9</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yNEIo4uwh1vP2yZ8Y23UmNlitpK.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>505060</td><td>The Gallows Act II</td><td>The Gallows Act II</td><td>en</td><td>When Auna Rue transfers to a prestigious new acting school, she encounters a malevolent spirit after participating in a viral challenge.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-10-25</td><td>/e7gpJfzOPbDjs6NclYOuFq7Z1mu.jpg</td><td>8.799</td><td>68</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wPkXmwJLqxtDEKpawrvKFiBWtBH.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>506363</td><td>The Gallows Collection</td></tr><tr><td>806804</td><td>Aileen Wuornos: American Boogeywoman</td><td>Aileen Wuornos: American Boogeywoman</td><td>en</td><td>Based on Aileen Wuornos’s early life, this Is the true story of  America’s most notorious female serial killer, who went on a killing spree in Florida in 1989 and 1990. What few people know, is that back in 1976 a young and beautiful Aileen Wuornos arrived in Florida searching for a new life that would help her escape her tragic past, married a wealthy Yacht Club President and had the chance to start again as part of Florida’s high society….or did she?</td><td>America's most notorious female serial killer.</td><td>2021-09-20</td><td>/9g1ZUcVDEOTsS9U1ifRMCgSVoH6.jpg</td><td>8.795</td><td>37</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yajv4It3IG4aUfWKXCv4D2bhGjZ.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>936268</td><td>Aileen Wuornos Collection</td></tr><tr><td>16093</td><td>Carnival of Souls</td><td>Carnival of Souls</td><td>en</td><td>Mary Henry ends up the sole survivor of a fatal car accident through mysterious circumstances. Trying to put the incident behind her, she moves to Utah and takes a job as a church organist. But her fresh start is interrupted by visions of a fiendish man. As the visions begin to occur more frequently, Mary finds herself drawn to the deserted carnival on the outskirts of town. The strangely alluring carnival may hold the secret to her tragic past.</td><td>She Escaped Death. Now It Wants Her Back!</td><td>1962-11-02</td><td>/AdbQsFB8pS090l0NO3uBtLZy2zw.jpg</td><td>8.786</td><td>352</td><td>7.0</td><td>30000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>78</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zCGwFjnd1KQxWTt7YeLcMHg8iJ8.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29095</td><td>Waxwork</td><td>Waxwork</td><td>en</td><td>Wealthy slacker college student Mark, his new girlfriend Sarah, and their friends are invited to a special showing at a mysterious wax museum which displays 18 of the most evil men of all time. After his ex-girlfriend and another friend disappear, Mark becomes suspicious.</td><td>Stop on by and give afterlife a try.</td><td>1988-06-17</td><td>/ohFgl7yIrnaqptUdsXDXLKPdHGt.jpg</td><td>8.783</td><td>214</td><td>6.2</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>808114.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/x0sEJCg6UsLoGs8r9b4l8rp1oxe.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>126220</td><td>Waxwork Collection</td></tr><tr><td>329020</td><td>Extraordinary Tales</td><td>Extraordinary Tales</td><td>en</td><td>Five tales by Edgar Allan Poe come to life thanks to a pictorical style animation, five tales that exude madness, pestilence, murder and torture.</td><td>NA</td><td>2013-02-28</td><td>/mGETWBPMDHgpdFVsJf8cYGsPWnz.jpg</td><td>8.779</td><td>93</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>73</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h8CkWlbjJ1FZIJhz5BNwyVbKhHb.jpg</td><td>Animation, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12517</td><td>Calvaire</td><td>The Ordeal</td><td>fr</td><td>A few days before Christmas, traveling entertainer Marc Stevens is stuck at nightfall in a remote wood in the swampy Hautes Fagnes region of Liège when his van breaks down. An odd chap who's looking for a lost dog then leads Marc to a shuttered inn.</td><td>NA</td><td>2005-03-09</td><td>/opcj7nv96MwCjC25VJMgAxrYDOk.jpg</td><td>8.778</td><td>228</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uS0scJP83eU0tgyb7GNRSgBkJHa.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11056</td><td>Darkness</td><td>Darkness</td><td>en</td><td>A teenage girl moves into a remote countryside house with her family, only to discover that their gloomy new home has a horrifying past that threatens to destroy the family.</td><td>A house. A past. A secret. Will you dare enter?</td><td>2002-10-11</td><td>/exr5xYRHbj200Y3SxMDGfcT6zla.jpg</td><td>8.776</td><td>313</td><td>5.7</td><td>1.06E7</td><td>1.2241855E7</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oMvuihMuWej5YOskC6y2Zp8dHq9.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>74777</td><td>Absentia</td><td>Absentia</td><td>en</td><td>Tricia's husband Daniel has been missing for seven years. Her younger sister Callie comes to live with her as the pressure mounts to finally declare him 'dead in absentia.' As Tricia sifts through the wreckage and tries to move on with her life, Callie finds herself drawn to an ominous tunnel near the house. As she begins to link it to other mysterious disappearances, it becomes clear that Daniel's presumed death might be anything but 'natural.' The ancient force at work in the tunnel might have set its sights on Callie and Tricia—and Daniel might be suffering a fate far worse than death in its grasp.</td><td>There are fates worse than death.</td><td>2011-03-03</td><td>/6i9mtDV67tRAEYhCsZPNtiwMGN6.jpg</td><td>8.776</td><td>283</td><td>5.9</td><td>70000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hY0BJllNWKQP9BvJu6gCVbUEXVf.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>572</td><td>Naboer</td><td>Next Door</td><td>no</td><td>After Ingrid leaves John, he allows himself to be pulled into a mystical and scary world where it is impossible to separate truth from lies.</td><td>Some doors should never be opened.</td><td>2005-03-11</td><td>/xqS5Y8f6EQy9i9YFuPuTlPRopV4.jpg</td><td>8.772</td><td>157</td><td>6.4</td><td>2400000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>75</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fsghkzQNhOPe3Pmy70iSnWzJWtR.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>72309</td><td>Marquis de Sade: Justine</td><td>Marquis de Sade: Justine</td><td>it</td><td>Without a family, penniless and separated from her sister, a beautiful chaste woman will have to cope with an endless parade of villains, perverts and degenerates who will claim not only her treasured virtue but also her life.</td><td>An erotic fantasy horror from the tortured pen of The Marquis de Sade.</td><td>1969-04-03</td><td>/5EsNDAcBudyFHRCPXdzVGPrrmWV.jpg</td><td>8.764</td><td>34</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>124</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nCJGyJ4VGsg6vZTBxTJCI9sgppO.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>49763</td><td>Bad Moon</td><td>Bad Moon</td><td>en</td><td>One man's struggle to contain the curse he hides within... and his last-ditch attempt to free himself with the love of family. But when it looks as if he is losing his battle, and endangering all he holds most dear, the family dog, Thor, is the last hope for his family's survival... and the end to his Werewolf curse.</td><td>Half man.  Half wolf.  Total terror.</td><td>1996-11-01</td><td>/1RobAQaPIYV2PBmkb4XISbsQZPe.jpg</td><td>8.762</td><td>192</td><td>6.8</td><td>7000000.0</td><td>1100000.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/e7R8jaVCWsHh13y3yO1T59eq7Ns.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17306</td><td>Ice Spiders</td><td>Ice Spiders</td><td>en</td><td>When a young ski team training for the Olympics arrives at the remote and isolated Lost Mountain Ski Resort to focus on training, they're thrilled to find a retired Olympic skier is there to help them train. But their plans are halted when a scientist working at a nearby government lab arrives with the horrifying news that a top secret Government project has produced giant spiders and they have escaped, killing and eating everything in sight.</td><td>Hell Has Just Frozen Over.</td><td>2007-01-01</td><td>/5VgkW9pZoqAVnZdS4Cf1kljeSlJ.jpg</td><td>8.757</td><td>57</td><td>4.1</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Action, Adventure, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29787</td><td>Monkey Shines</td><td>Monkey Shines</td><td>en</td><td>A quadriplegic man is given a trained monkey help him with every day activities, until the little monkey begins to develop feelings, and rage, against its new master and those who get too close to him.</td><td>Once there was a man whose prison was a chair. The man had a monkey, they made the strangest pair. The monkey ruled the man, it climbed inside his head. And now as fate would have it, one of them is dead.</td><td>1988-07-29</td><td>/zbxrAWN2Ss5RXK1uDvMW82xFh0n.jpg</td><td>8.756</td><td>217</td><td>6.2</td><td>7000000.0</td><td>5344577.0</td><td>113</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hTgxcM2aWeTOusZVAEmWyWyfgHo.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>992090</td><td>Jurassic Domination</td><td>Jurassic Domination</td><td>en</td><td>When two military-made, weaponized dinosaurs attack a small mountain town, it's up to the sheriff to figure out a way to stop the creatures before the dinos escape and wreak havoc nationwide.</td><td>A military weapon out of control.</td><td>2022-07-01</td><td>/gg3zQ1FvWPmKV9qTJBUGXm5hMMi.jpg</td><td>8.756</td><td>4</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5pRoq01p4OEk0yxzWdCxLTBT7fp.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>38150</td><td>Heartless</td><td>Heartless</td><td>en</td><td>The story follows Jamie, a troubled young man with a birthmark on his face, which has left him feeling isolated and fearful, hiding from the world outside. He lives in the East End of London, an area notorious for its violent hooded gangs. According to news reports, the gangs are now wearing demon masks. But, one night, Jamie discovers the terrifying truth.</td><td>The darker it gets the more you see</td><td>2009-11-21</td><td>/3kRaWKYqtx9nyqcIkdTf58igzVb.jpg</td><td>8.755</td><td>135</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bPVh5GQCnatWCYxUN8m8lAopyW7.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>429742</td><td>Still/Born</td><td>Still/Born</td><td>en</td><td>Still/Born follows Mary, a new mother who lost one of her twins in childbirth. As she struggles with the loss of one of her children, she starts to suspect something sinister is after her surviving child - a supernatural entity that has chosen her child and will stop at nothing to take it from her.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-02-09</td><td>/kZ1BbnMArbnSISel8dK9mpRwWIB.jpg</td><td>8.755</td><td>127</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nvxj7TwfyY9j2AnQDaNkLawaHAn.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>21597</td><td>Elvira's Haunted Hills</td><td>Elvira's Haunted Hills</td><td>en</td><td>The setting is Carpathia. The year is 1851. When Elvira gets kicked out of an Inn for a slight monetary discrepancy, she is rescued by a local who takes her to stay at the castle in the hills high above the village. The fact that she happens to resemble the count's former \"missing\" wife opens a can of worms or two.</td><td>NA</td><td>2002-10-31</td><td>/tHut5XMtnDRJXTtPexGe5cKhVJT.jpg</td><td>8.753</td><td>80</td><td>5.4</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yo8zp7795GoQuwLjb7jXgQ0WDsy.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>182617</td><td>Elvira Collection</td></tr><tr><td>214209</td><td>숨바꼭질</td><td>Hide and Seek</td><td>ko</td><td>Sung-soo has everything a man could want: a beautiful wife and children, a comfortable home and luxury car, and plenty of money in the bank. When he learns that his estranged brother, Sung-chul, has gone missing, haunting memories of their troubled past urge him to visit his brother’s apartment in search of answers.</td><td>Stop peeping at me.</td><td>2013-08-14</td><td>/z11Dd1r8BQhCLhLfRh1x5QuzMRw.jpg</td><td>8.753</td><td>77</td><td>6.5</td><td>1900000.0</td><td>3.5461505E7</td><td>107</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qgEl6jnzVtpwU6BtTm5DNlCiGZh.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>410126</td><td>Patient Seven</td><td>Patient Seven</td><td>en</td><td>The film centers on Dr. Marcus, a renowned psychiatrist who has selected 6 severe mentally ill and dangerous patients from the Spring Valley Mental Hospital to interview as part of research for his new book. As Dr. Marcus interviews each patient, one by one the horrors they have committed begin to unfold. However, Dr. Marcus soon learns that there is one patient who ties them all together - Patient Seven.</td><td>Try to remain calm.</td><td>2016-10-11</td><td>/m5r7gdj65mfcghrzEob42YRyvAX.jpg</td><td>8.75</td><td>113</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>116</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cRotDg3FZ1Kij0PU0SLp1eS6HMH.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>429727</td><td>Bad Match</td><td>Bad Match</td><td>en</td><td>An internet-dating playboy's life spirals out of control after meeting a woman online.</td><td>Beware of love at first swipe.</td><td>2017-08-25</td><td>/eh7CB7Z9o2HRcKTEYmSLmo6I2hh.jpg</td><td>8.749</td><td>162</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2aHF480ya0CVkgq6D6pBHYw8dO7.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27412</td><td>Hollywood Chainsaw Hookers</td><td>Hollywood Chainsaw Hookers</td><td>en</td><td>Los Angeles private eye Jack Chandler is hired by a worried mother to find her missing runaway daughter, Samantha. As Chandler searches for her whereabouts, he uncovers an evil cult that worships an Egyptian god, whose followers commit human sacrifices with chainsaws to appease their deity. He soon learns that Samantha has revenge in store for the cult leader and his bevy of blood-thirsty, chainsaw-wielding hookers.</td><td>They charge an arm and a leg!</td><td>1988-03-01</td><td>/2IRG18T8Jt6H8oa0dNM01Ikxc5e.jpg</td><td>8.742</td><td>77</td><td>5.8</td><td>23000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>75</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tDUFti8bWKzFrRsse0FIUMW6QgM.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>37527</td><td>Dr. Giggles</td><td>Dr. Giggles</td><td>en</td><td>In 1957, Evan Rendell flees after his father is lynched for killing multiple patients in his effort to find a replacement heart for his ailing wife. After 35 years, Evan escapes from a mental institution and returns to town for revenge, killing off residents one by one. When Jennifer and her friends break into the Rendell house out of morbid curiosity, Evan notices Jennifer has a heart condition similar to his mother and decides to make her his final victim.</td><td>The Doctor is out... of his mind.</td><td>1992-10-23</td><td>/7XpnT0xrFALp3t4aTb34LvDzrSW.jpg</td><td>8.742</td><td>113</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>8403433.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kApk87Nb3tW1ZM99aE3IQxAvTte.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>30901</td><td>Tutti i colori del buio</td><td>All the Colors of the Dark</td><td>it</td><td>Jane lives in London with Richard, her boyfriend. When she was five, her mother was murdered, she recently lost a baby in a car crash and now she’s plagued by nightmares of a knife-wielding, blue-eyed man. Desperate to ease her pain, Jane decides to follow her new neighbor’s advice to attend a Black Mass, only to fan her already horrible visions, making her reality a living hell. Is there an escape from the clutches of the darkest evil?</td><td>Enter a kaleidoscope of psychedelic horror!</td><td>1972-02-28</td><td>/bCZcyrLwZ2X1bSsRmfHQap4i9WS.jpg</td><td>8.741</td><td>95</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/r1cA2duQeinxzEdRqlwjLArIb1W.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>2093</td><td>Amsterdamned</td><td>Amsterdamned</td><td>nl</td><td>A mysterious diver hiding in Amsterdam's canal system embarks on a rampage of gruesome murders, terrifying city officials and leaving few clues for the city's best detective, who doesn't suspect that both his new girlfriend and twelve-year-old daughter may be closer than he is to finding the killer.</td><td>The danger lies just below the surface</td><td>1988-02-11</td><td>/uNPQUEd13n9fIDliOYfOyxfyY4Y.jpg</td><td>8.74</td><td>138</td><td>6.2</td><td>98003.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xxZUVxyagbGwqAdHEzCTBGJry1R.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>54433</td><td>ガメラ 大怪獣空中決戦</td><td>Gamera: Guardian of the Universe</td><td>ja</td><td>A ship runs aground on a mysterious atoll leading to an investigation by insurance representative Kusanagi, who discovers an ancient bead that he gives to his daughter Asagi. Meanwhile, ornithologist Nagamine investigates reports of a new species of large bird named Gyaos. As the Gyaos begin to attack, an ancient guardian with a bond to Asagi emerges.</td><td>A great duel of supersonic speed.</td><td>1995-03-11</td><td>/iZ8yFxavjqsZXfZhkfPqrc4NauY.jpg</td><td>8.725</td><td>108</td><td>7.7</td><td>4500000.0</td><td>1.6E7</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9PhGgvqOLV4ekQIMoeaPgXQ2fsk.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>657313</td><td>Gamera (Heisei) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>36073</td><td>ギニーピッグ2 血肉の華</td><td>Guinea Pig 2: Flower of Flesh and Blood</td><td>ja</td><td>A woman walking home late at night is attacked by an unknown assailant who knocks her out with chloroform. When she regains consciousness, she finds herself tied to a bed in a blood- spattered dungeon, at the mercy of a white-faced man in a samurai helmet who wants to turn her into a \"flower of blood and flesh.\" He then proceeds to slowly dismember and disembowel her as the camera records it all.</td><td>NA</td><td>1985-10-07</td><td>/9EykMoNuMDbsBHlj9X6IdBysVBz.jpg</td><td>8.724</td><td>87</td><td>4.7</td><td>125000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>42</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3gngLp4zgjYLOUKC5MBHfszdvz9.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>476063</td><td>Guinea Pig Collection</td></tr><tr><td>18870</td><td>Minotaur</td><td>Minotaur</td><td>en</td><td>Long ago in the Iron Age, a shadow loomed over a lonely village. For generations, the village youths are stolen from their families and delivered as sacrifice to a mythical beast - the Minotaur, that dwells beneath a great palace. Theo, haunted by the loss of his love in an earlier sacrifice is convinced that the beast isn't real and that his girl still lives as a slave within the palace.</td><td>Curse the God. Slay the Beast. Become a Legend.</td><td>2006-03-11</td><td>/nwSYtZNc42WaqOzkMpSuZ4NElJr.jpg</td><td>8.719</td><td>108</td><td>4.6</td><td>7000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Adventure, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>47518</td><td>The Tortured</td><td>The Tortured</td><td>en</td><td>An upper-middle-class couple's life is destroyed when their only child is kidnapped and killed. Obsessed with revenge, the couple seizes an opportunity to kidnap the killer.</td><td>How far would you go?</td><td>2010-06-15</td><td>/s5kXFJaRYaR0KEROXhWlQaM7Wje.jpg</td><td>8.719</td><td>125</td><td>5.3</td><td>8500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>79</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/A4PlSROl7LMLWgQMgeJXFd5il5U.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39929</td><td>Hello Mary Lou: Prom Night II</td><td>Hello Mary Lou: Prom Night II</td><td>en</td><td>When Hamilton High's Prom Queen of 1957, Mary Lou Maloney is killed by her jilted boyfriend, she comes back for revenge 30 years later. Bill Nordham is now the principal of Hamilton High and his son is about to attend the prom with Vicki Carpenter. However, she is possessed by Mary Lou Maloney after opening a trunk in the school's basement. Now Bill must face the horror he left behind in 1957.</td><td>You Can't Keep a Bad Girl Down!</td><td>1987-10-16</td><td>/vhk8OSJs14dZiM8XtqyaRqn1QCJ.jpg</td><td>8.717</td><td>128</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>2683519.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/e05uOFpxrF4lTgiLonmWhPrRnEk.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>123255</td><td>Prom Night Collection</td></tr><tr><td>14457</td><td>Reeker</td><td>Reeker</td><td>en</td><td>Strangers trapped at an eerie travel oasis in the desert must unravel the mystery behind their visions of dying people while they are preyed upon by a decaying creature.</td><td>If you can't breathe, you can't scream</td><td>2005-03-13</td><td>/aeWGvt1yOMO0hHLDX0dQxtLnUq6.jpg</td><td>8.716</td><td>180</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>2289000.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iY3QBjMz4hlPj6WXMBp8Iq6euKu.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>297371</td><td>Reeker Collection</td></tr><tr><td>29056</td><td>The Raven</td><td>The Raven</td><td>en</td><td>A magician who has been turned into a raven turns to a former sorcerer for help.</td><td>Wits and wizardry run a-fowl!</td><td>1963-01-25</td><td>/r3V9PcOaYqsX9m46lRQVqn95m7O.jpg</td><td>8.715</td><td>179</td><td>6.4</td><td>350000.0</td><td>1499275.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/A0mxPd8UI27p2huAIdDhcWcpSTT.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1698</td><td>Anatomie</td><td>Anatomy</td><td>de</td><td>Medical student Paula Henning wins a place at an exclusive Heidelberg medical school. When the body of a young man she met on the train turns up on her dissection table, she begins to investigate the mysterious circumstances surrounding his death, and uncovers a gruesome conspiracy perpetrated by an Antihippocratic secret society operating within the school.</td><td>Some study. Some are studied.</td><td>2000-02-03</td><td>/hZgnRhrOkmjjod5u3umbw4y08kX.jpg</td><td>8.708</td><td>230</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aI1lLZN55FTGrG5N67yIE2OuJUd.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>8412</td><td>Anatomy Collection</td></tr><tr><td>235046</td><td>Darkroom</td><td>Darkroom</td><td>en</td><td>Michelle kills three of her friends in a horrific car accident while driving under the influence. After rehab, Michelle takes a job recommended by her counselor that lands her trapped in a mansion with three psychotic siblings hell bent on physical torture to purge Michelle of her sins.</td><td>NA</td><td>2013-03-10</td><td>/iyMLYwHHaa20iw3OdXr6Qj7MPUY.jpg</td><td>8.707</td><td>41</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ng54NnEO4uvIdFzUgcpWz8rgZvL.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>177221</td><td>The Battery</td><td>The Battery</td><td>en</td><td>In rural Connecticut, baseball players Ben and Mickey are trying to survive a zombie plague. They are forced to form a battery: a catcher and a pitcher who work together to outwit the batter, the one who hits the ball. And the batter in this case just happens to be a zombie. Tough Ben and gentle Mickey frequently disagree on the best way to go about the situation. Then they suddenly hear a human voice through their walkie-talkies. Is salvation nearby, like Mickey thinks, or is Ben’s suspicion justified?</td><td>In a land ravaged by the undead, Ben and Mickey must learn to survive... each other.</td><td>2012-10-13</td><td>/n7xjDQVdFQr6vNIN4kjKSPZYiMo.jpg</td><td>8.706</td><td>218</td><td>6.2</td><td>6000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1FogeO2Z4nas3D83vC3OShL2GU2.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>4457</td><td>La Casa 4</td><td>Witchery</td><td>en</td><td>The deserted island hotel hides a dark and sinister secret. Hundreds of years ago a witch held sway there, dominating her coven and spreading