t Story II</td><td>cn</td><td>Wutung a sex demon returns in another body where he falls for the mortal girl Hsiao-yen, but heaven thinks otherwise with the girl being burned at the stake and her soul being incarnated in the just born Fang Yu-yin. Anger fills Wutung, and to stop this vengeance the town near his lair promise to offer him a virgin girl at the end of every month to become his sex slave. Ya-Yin is selected; however her lover rescues her from the clutches of Wutung. So Wutung sends his demon concubine to get her back, and to cause havoc on the village for the interference.</td><td>NA</td><td>1991-01-23</td><td>/ighnU4PYk0AQDW9qkD64E5p4hRd.jpg</td><td>8.664</td><td>8</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qOPvylwr2yibx4i2jurMwh9SIRJ.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>363066</td><td>Erotic Ghost Story Collection</td></tr><tr><td>35669</td><td>The Satanic Rites of Dracula</td><td>The Satanic Rites of Dracula</td><td>en</td><td>The police and British security forces call in Professor Van Helsing to help them investigate Satanic ritual which has been occurring in a large country house, and which has been attended by a government minister, an eminent scientist and secret service chief. The owner of the house is a mysterious property tycoon who is found to be behind a sinister plot involving a deadly plague. It is in fact Dracula who, sick of his interminable existence, has decided that he must end it all in the only possible way- by destroying every last potential victim.</td><td>Evil begets evil on the sabbath of the undead!</td><td>1973-11-03</td><td>/4ygMnpDIdmOcBJDG18Xz7ENcWSf.jpg</td><td>8.663</td><td>100</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>544476.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7iHNbmOpNuRN8SFITE7nKlk00qY.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>123724</td><td>Dracula (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>471666</td><td>Resident Evil: Keeper's Diary</td><td>Resident Evil: Keeper's Diary</td><td>en</td><td>A researcher in Umbrella labs leaves behind a disturbing video diary.</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-01-06</td><td>/mpTnZbKRdNMfzXAsYx37jQAvz94.jpg</td><td>8.661</td><td>8</td><td>8.0</td><td>600.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>6</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>587488</td><td>แสงกระสือ</td><td>Inhuman Kiss</td><td>th</td><td>In a far-away village, lived an innocent teenage girl, Sai, who later discovered herself inheriting the curse of Krasue. At night, her head would detach from her body and hunts for flesh and blood. Villagers are terrified by the deaths of their livestocks and that is when the Krasue hunt begins. Jerd, a friend joined the hunt with an unknown reason while Noi, the childhood friend who had just came back to the village decided to stand beside Sai despite knowing the horrifying truth.</td><td>Heart of a girl head of a demon.</td><td>2019-03-14</td><td>/x1IrVoc9Q7Hn6NKP4jq77jN1cUU.jpg</td><td>8.661</td><td>43</td><td>6.3</td><td>1200000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>122</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eA9M56zTaXMD2HPNaJcFptj5FA5.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Romance</td><td>1004692</td><td>Inhuman kiss</td></tr><tr><td>638045</td><td>The Toll</td><td>The Toll</td><td>en</td><td>A socially awkward driver and a weary passenger try to make it to their destination while being haunted by a supernatural threat.</td><td>You gotta pay the troll toll</td><td>2021-03-26</td><td>/q6vV6sSWz9cytmc8L9IEBjjyFmV.jpg</td><td>8.652</td><td>85</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tFOGNL5e7IcOmifu57PTsJMlGl6.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>55723</td><td>ChromeSkull: Laid to Rest 2</td><td>ChromeSkull: Laid to Rest 2</td><td>en</td><td>The game of cat-and-mouse is on as Chromeskull’s assistant, Preston, scrambles to tie up the loose ends left behind after his deranged boss’s last killing spree. He finds that he likes taking care of business—maybe a little too much. One bloody mess leads to another and the bodies pile up in a visual feast of the most spectacular kills ever filmed.</td><td>Death Polished.</td><td>2011-09-20</td><td>/vZSoi9OyOXKoHRevs2T28tZ1Lfz.jpg</td><td>8.647</td><td>80</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zTstjQnXAbA0gHUIqSWQKDoEK6N.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>158643</td><td>Laid To Rest Collection</td></tr><tr><td>14459</td><td>Storm Warning</td><td>Storm Warning</td><td>en</td><td>A couple becomes lost in a massive storm and seek refuge at a nearby farmhouse, only to be captured by deranged killers.</td><td>Survival Can Be Murder</td><td>2007-10-19</td><td>/a52a97dlHjYWnNTzeJJohlPOSLG.jpg</td><td>8.645</td><td>113</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hAsp9DExb515z87H5t1j6xaCBKP.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>19564</td><td>The Prophecy: Uprising</td><td>The Prophecy: Uprising</td><td>en</td><td>There exists an ancient manuscript still writing itself called the Lexicon. It supposedly tells of the coming of the Anti-Christ, and happens to fall into the hands of an unsuspecting woman. Now, she is being pursued by angels intent on obtaining the information from the book.</td><td>Into the war between heaven and hell comes a brand-new enemy.</td><td>2005-06-07</td><td>/xWdpedZ4EtUQ8gcpc6WYGeqsy20.jpg</td><td>8.641</td><td>59</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5upQSxBnkdvKrytu568oF5V48y1.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>9068</td><td>The Prophecy Collection</td></tr><tr><td>681195</td><td>Shifter</td><td>Shifter</td><td>en</td><td>A young woman struggles with the painful and gruesome side effects of an experiment with time travel gone wrong that causes her to lose control and shift through time at random.</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-03-06</td><td>/bljTZsCjm8sZFTKS7Aq4HttDR7k.jpg</td><td>8.637</td><t