on presumed dead.</td><td>He who sheds others' blood will not return... NOT EVEN HIS SOUL...</td><td>2004-08-13</td><td>/93Zn3ews5S0KiChq9mW5TkrhWi9.jpg</td><td>8.615</td><td>94</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>107</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tV4ASlhHNvfvhTuICH8pUOsl0Pr.jpg</td><td>Action, History, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>509679</td><td>Payne & Redemption</td><td>Payne & Redemption</td><td>en</td><td>The story of \"Payne & Redemption\" surrounds the psychological trauma endured by the film's main character, a weathered New York Detective, and his journey to seek redemption, after having to deal with a long line of traumatic incidents that have occurred in his recent life.</td><td>No Cop. A Full Clip. And A Whole Lotta Painkillers.</td><td>2022-10-04</td><td>/npkHrKSkySeWtzw326gOKJEc4f6.jpg</td><td>8.609</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>140000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>120</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/l3UvCMQgf415icjz8ifepAeRneW.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>483686</td><td>東京喰種 : PINTO</td><td>Tokyo Ghoul: Pinto</td><td>ja</td><td>The OVA adapts the third story in the Tokyo Ghoul: Hibi novel when Shuu Tsukiyama and Chie Hori met.</td><td>NA</td><td>2015-12-25</td><td>/kuqopDdoThnBqfh2YBq62a1MYb.jpg</td><td>8.608</td><td>58</td><td>7.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>24</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cvPHd1NZd7IbF2oReygHpImssRQ.jpg</td><td>Action, Animation, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>404584</td><td>From a House on Willow Street</td><td>From a House on Willow Street</td><td>en</td><td>After a young woman is kidnapped, her captors soon come to realize that in fact they may be the ones in danger and this young woman has a dark secret inside her.</td><td>Evil has an address...</td><td>2017-03-24</td><td>/d3aHtMxYUmGAyYrTNk52BqXeOQl.jpg</td><td>8.604</td><td>145</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uegOuTy3aRuLQ7DMAJHVJSsJc29.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10342</td><td>Teaching Mrs. Tingle</td><td>Teaching Mrs. Tingle</td><td>en</td><td>Leanne is salutatorian when she needs to be valedictorian to get her scholarship to Harvard. The only class she is worse than the leader in is history, taught by Mrs. Tingle, and the teacher hates her. When an attempt to get ahead in Mrs. Tingle's class goes awry, mayhem ensues and friendships, loyalties and trust are tested by the teacher's intricate mind-games.</td><td>This summer, the teacher from hell is about to get taught a lesson.</td><td>1999-08-11</td><td>/hHKiifRFrC0IM7Ba2HX3sAjnSBr.jpg</td><td>8.599</td><td>277</td><td>5.5</td><td>1.3E7</td><td>8946237.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/i64i2v5EvY0qmpUkyKs5cSOwdGG.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Crime, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>254193</td><td>Late Phases</td><td>Late Phases</td><td>en</td><td>When deadly attacks from a nearby forest beset a secluded retirement community, it is up to a blind army veteran to discover what the residents are hiding.</td><td>The hunt is on</td><td>2014-11-21</td><td>/7ulbyPajXTNZkki9AtcLI9YYhc2.jpg</td><td>8.595</td><td>203</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/b4LHXb0CPCkXxM0F8yYkSKbXciM.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>573668</td><td>大蛇</td><td>Serpent Of Death</td><td>zh</td><td>In order to save his ill daughter, a biology teacher joins a group of scientists who are searching for a plant called 'the fruit of life' deep in a hidden jungle. However, what they discover is far beyond what they ever imagined</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-09-04</td><td>/lJaVskIfMEcmsdjxFDjgYUbU2Gj.jpg</td><td>8.588</td><td>60</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cXTabdxeELRF40agd2TY4HWJrNn.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>728796</td><