se evil is waiting to be released. A long time ago a witch died as part of a satanic ritual. Every question they ask, they get closer and closer to her. The book will reveal the answers to all your questions… but what if your host is an evil entity with a thirst for blood?</td><td>Every page is a new way to die.</td><td>2022-09-12</td><td>/nk7v4GoS4xUJapeMH4wZaDTkM4N.jpg</td><td>8.582</td><td>3</td><td>8.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eW5VFfqn6IHHpGAZQGrH8bFSfXh.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>354216</td><td>The Devil's Candy</td><td>The Devil's Candy</td><td>en</td><td>A struggling painter is possessed by satanic forces after he and his young family move into their dream home in rural Texas.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-03-17</td><td>/9Yz9DCan4tRfqZgDrCSgzUX1WXV.jpg</td><td>8.581</td><td>549</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>79</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lcix4ZjVsO7YqHohmk0QLcJRRl5.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28902</td><td>In Dreams</td><td>In Dreams</td><td>en</td><td>A suburban housewife learns that she has psychic connections to a serial killer, and can predict this person's motives through her dreams.</td><td>You don't have to sleep to dream</td><td>1999-01-15</td><td>/58CdorR0dTvVXocCfDzOU3e3hZy.jpg</td><td>8.577</td><td>151</td><td>5.4</td><td>3.0E7</td><td>1.2017369E7</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/opESjJxA10pGES8hod8YK2Gi4ug.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>959558</td><td>Moloch</td><td>Moloch</td><td>nl</td><td>Betriek lives at the edge of a peat bog in the North of the Netherlands. When she and her family are attacked by a random stranger one night, Betriek sets out to find an explanation. The more she digs, the more she becomes convinced that she is being hunted by something ancient.</td><td>Family history may haunt you forever</td><td>2022-05-19</td><td>/3jVzYOnylmvo7ZnGerjfoRj2wFz.jpg</td><td>8.577</td><td>21</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>500287.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/or5e8vxfd9Nc0rrLHKjD3YFhhmg.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17287</td><td>Poultrygeist: Night of the Chicken Dead</td><td>Poultrygeist: Night of the Chicken Dead</td><td>en</td><td>When the American Chicken Bunker, a military themed fast food restaurant, builds its latest chain restaurant on the site of an ancient Native American burial ground, the displaced spirits take revenge on unsuspecting diners and transform them into chicken zombies! Now, it’s up to a dimwitted counter boy, his collegiate lesbian ex-girlfriend and a burqa-wearing fry cook to put an end to the foul feathered menace once and for all.</td><td>Humans... the other white meat...</td><td>2006-12-26</td><td>/vSeehH4s274kdZXEMKnPE2tlqco.jpg</td><td>8.575</td><td>123</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jtnFTuRejS925CJkXf3MNCqtT8n.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>872497</td><td>Resurrection</td><td>Resurrection</td><td>en</td><td>A woman’s carefully constructed life is upended when an unwelcome shadow from her past returns, forcing her to confront the monster she’s evaded for two decades.</td><td>Maintain control.</td><td>2022-07-29</td><td>/kfRr8Jm1gaEnLTXCIfHkSw8QW6t.jpg</td><td>8.573</td><td>50</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/s1CDlZlnl1YUNtlBYr9rjejcPTb.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>105397</td><td>灭门惨案2借种</td><td>Daughter of Darkness 2</td><td>cn</td><td>Another gruesome case involving a woman who's a sole survivor of a brutal massacre. A local constable questions the woman about her whereabouts and what might have happened the night before. As he gets the young woman to talk, she spins a tale of debauchery, madness and people so vile that you wished that they'll never see daylight again. Why is this woman so reluctant to talk? Who else might be involved in this ghastly murder? How will this bumbling cop get any solid leads or useful clues from this shell shocked woman?</td><td>NA</td><td>1994-01-01</td><td>/6f7OMEIq2rjxSQYook38Wb6i5cY.jpg</td><td>8.562</td><td>14</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qP2X0AbU3fsnl24ezw7HOyVKk3R.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror</td><td>680729</td><td>Daughter of Darkness Collection</td></tr><tr><td>116979</td><td>Chained</td><td>Chained</td><td>en</td><td>A serial killer kidnaps a young boy after murdering his mother, then raises him to be his accomplice. After years in captivity, the boy must choose between escaping or following in his captor's bloody footprints.</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-10-02</td><td>/4A7t5QmUN0joSZMOSUtbFOrbsTU.jpg</td><td>8.558</td><td>365</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6h9JbK80tj60VUEAKhNR1UT9Mpz.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16180</td><td>The Legend of Hell House</td><td>The Legend of Hell House</td><td>en</td><td>A team consisting of a physicist, his wife, a young female psychic and the only survivor of the previous visit are sent to the notorious Hell House to prove/disprove survival after death. Previous visitors have either been killed or gone mad, and it is up to the team to survive a full week in isolation, and solve the mystery of the Hell House.</td><td>For the sake of your sanity, pray it isn't true!</td><td>1973-06-15</td><td>/xeYY28whCNglT0kuelfh9H0jyAm.jpg</td><td>8.557</td><td>193</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qW4DfQc5y8hOrl04VkiuSurdPsD.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>22172</td><td>Street Trash</td><td>Street Trash</td><td>en</td><td>A group of hobos begin melting into multicolored piles of goo after drinking sixty-year-old liquor. At the same time, the psychotic Vietnam War vet who rules the hobo camp snaps and begins killing at random. Two brothers set out to stop the liquor and the killer.</td><td>Things in New York are about to go down the toilet...</td><td>1987-02-22</td><td>/hSTIN9v4Xh0dKQEtKnYq0j8cGHu.jpg</td><td>8.553</td><td>232</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/owbWSs528xtvL2CTSi3ofMf0rfc.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29077</td><td>The Bride</td><td>The Bride</td><td>en</td><td>After years of research Doctor Frankenstein finally succeeds in creating the perfect woman, who gets the name \"Eva\".</td><td>Here Comes . . .The BRIDE</td><td>1985-08-16</td><td>/a5cCwJEnVSPtTqHgIE9UxHIoWFl.jpg</td><td>8.549</td><td>58</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>3558669.0</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sS7LZKcvdpE9uSYbaZemsemMT1C.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>42591</td><td>Il trono di fuoco</td><td>The Bloody Judge</td><td>it</td><td>Horror icon Christopher Lee, who worked with Jess Franco on several occasions, plays Lord George Jeffreys, the infamous and merciless judge and Lord Chancellor in England torn by strife between the reigning King James II and William of Orange. Convincend of doing what's necessary, the cruel judge mercilessly persecutes 'traitors', who sympathize with the King's opponent William of Orange, as well as 'witches', who are accused of being in league with the devil...</td><td>Horror Will Hold You Helpless!</td><td>1970-02-05</td><td>/fIeZzM9b5tNklBpWCpMArAOgetI.jpg</td><td>8.543</td><td>28</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sw24lv5a6gLi9z3GX0clVDGyooo.jpg</td><td>History, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28679</td><td>La casa sperduta nel parco</td><td>House on the Edge of the Park</td><td>it</td><td>Alex is a darkly sinister thug driving around New York City at night when he spots a young woman driving alongside him. He follows the woman to a nearby park where he cuts her off, gets out of his car, and runs into hers where he throws her into the back seat and proceeds to savagely rape her before strangling her to death. He takes her locket as a trophy to another one of his many killings.</td><td>Anything Could Happen… Everything Did!</td><td>1980-11-06</td><td>/7AHJRJrsSi7KOL5ZtRfPprh0RZL.jpg</td><td>8.542</td><td>96</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wJH14cztFkPsYmReNhvvaWr12On.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28499</td><td>Open Graves</td><td>Open Graves</td><td>en</td><td>One day, Jason finds an unusual board game called Mamba. When his surfer friends start to play, the games unleashes its deadly curse, killing the losers in a gruesome fashion. Supposedly it will grant the winner a wish. As his companions die off, Jason decides that the only way he can reverse the tragedy is by continuing to play. With his girlfriend, Erica, Jason rolls the dice and hopes to make his wish before one of them suffers a horrible fate.</td><td>Curses last forever.</td><td>2009-09-19</td><td>/dgW8IftK7Bi4PitRTjB0HuzO6mQ.jpg</td><td>8.536</td><td>91</td><td>4.7</td><td>6500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7SGIZ1NrZVtuPFlXXNYceKVnt5Y.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27429</td><td>Shivers</td><td>Shivers</td><td>en</td><td>The residents of a suburban high-rise apartment building are being infected by a strain of parasites that turn them into mindless, sex-crazed fiends out to infect others by the slightest sexual contact.</td><td>Going mad is just the beginning of the terror …</td><td>1975-10-10</td><td>/oBn5SeA9J5xexybqqagggmRuJAR.jpg</td><td>8.535</td><td>493</td><td>6.3</td><td>179000.0</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rpKNhD2BqCJZI0DmBeRpIOUyAuo.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>79771</td><td>Chillerama</td><td>Chillerama</td><td>en</td><td>It's the closing night at the last drive-in theater in America and Cecil B. Kaufman has planned the ultimate marathon of lost film prints to unleash upon his faithful cinephile patrons. Four films so rare that they have never been exhibited publicly on American soil until this very night! With titles like Wadzilla, I Was a Teenage Werebear, The Diary of Anne Frankenstein, and Zom-B-Movie, Chillerama not only celebrates the golden age of drive-in B horror shlock but also spans over four decades of cinema with something for every bad taste.</td><td>Drive in, freak out. The ultimate midnight movie.</td><td>2011-10-14</td><td>/eQsZdgCHvPKjLnK30ABVnt9wJcw.jpg</td><td>8.528</td><td>88</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>120</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4rlWLWWw2Ltu2VNxsp0yMRBN4XL.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>242033</td><td>Scorned</td><td>Scorned</td><td>en</td><td>Sadie and Kevin have decided to spend a romantic weekend together at his lake house.  But when an unexpected- and unfortunate- text from her best friend Jennifer to Kevin reveals a lurid love affair between the two, Sadie spirals into a hunger for revenge.</td><td>Hell Hath No Fury</td><td>2013-11-14</td><td>/gb9FVsCTAkfDdM9gpCwjSZwbdfP.jpg</td><td>8.526</td><td>45</td><td>5.2</td><td>1700000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/blcPpUN5aNtkE0M67TNt6NelMaa.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11429</td><td>Beyond Re-Animator</td><td>Beyond Re-Animator</td><td>en</td><td>Once again tampering with mother nature to disastrous results, Dr. Herbert West continues his research while serving time in a maximum security prison for his previous exploits. West's limited prison-cell experiments are suddenly interrupted by the arrival of a new prison doctor and the brother of the girl who suffered from West's experiments 13 years earlier.</td><td>They Thought Prison Would Be The Death Of Him. But For Dr. West, Death Is Only The Beginning.</td><td>2003-04-04</td><td>/6R5s28jsY5rdxiYApbMX2bh3VNL.jpg</td><td>8.525</td><td>224</td><td>5.6</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1eJt8dcoraOUKGH2DOFiBCvEK3f.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>98036</td><td>Re-Animator Collection</td></tr><tr><td>448252</td><td>Be Afraid</td><td>Be Afraid</td><td>en</td><td>Not long after John Chambers and his family arrive at their new home in a small country town of Pennsylvania, John begins to experience sleep paralysis. Lying there paralyzed, trapped within his own nightmare, other-worldly beings visit John. They are entities which exist in the darkest shadows of the night and can only be seen out of the corner of one's eye. These encounters begin to haunt John, transforming to complete terror as he discovers the entities' sole purpose... the abduction of his seven year old son. In the end, John will uncover the town's horrific secret, a portal on his land, and make one last attempt to save his son before the shadow people permanently take him away to their world.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-06-01</td><td>/ytkaL1wZcqgQKHLuU7Go3UxGpON.jpg</td><td>8.525</td><td>100</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kcxtEqC44taMb3CVXYRr6bpZf2M.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>153509</td><td>Zombie Massacre</td><td>Zombie Massacre</td><td>en</td><td>A bacteriological weapon developed by the US Government to create a super soldier - spreads an epidemic in a quiet little town in the middle of Eastern Europe. All citizens have been turned into infected zombies. The plan is to bring an atomic bomb into the city's nuclear plant to pretend a terrible accident occurred. No one has to know the truth. A team of mercenaries is hired to complete the mission. The battle is on. Hordes of monsters against the team. Who will survive?</td><td>There is no hope.</td><td>2013-06-06</td><td>/doMrEAiMte4rD5HRsWga1i0BzTj.jpg</td><td>8.521</td><td>100</td><td>5.1</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9jZZD6CSP1eHS8JZ9lIqgm5UUO2.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>568449</td><td>Zombie Massacre Collection</td></tr><tr><td>9095</td><td>Mary Reilly</td><td>Mary Reilly</td><td>en</td><td>A housemaid falls in love with Dr. Jekyll and his darkly mysterious counterpart, Mr. Hyde.</td><td>The untold story of Jekyll and Hyde</td><td>1996-02-23</td><td>/eAOPWQdwytdRaLK3VXi7JFJFqmj.jpg</td><td>8.516</td><td>261</td><td>5.9</td><td>4.7E7</td><td>1.2379402E7</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mErnrp6gxgSw7eYVnuos3k8EkWf.jpg</td><td>Drama, History, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>41428</td><td>鉄男</td><td>Tetsuo: The Iron Man</td><td>ja</td><td>A \"metal fetishist\", driven mad by the maggots wriggling in the wound he's made to embed metal into his flesh, runs out into the night and is accidentally run down by a Japanese businessman and his girlfriend. The pair dispose of the corpse in hopes of quietly moving on with their lives. However, the businessman soon finds that he is now plagued by a vicious curse that transforms his flesh into iron.</td><td>NA</td><td>1989-07-01</td><td>/zeoILvZbBIdxDSRguP2UuZXCHOy.jpg</td><td>8.516</td><td>423</td><td>7.0</td><td>55500.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>67</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nekOdnyzMXMOYO2u5KjlnHAZC9L.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>182923</td><td>Tetsuo Collection</td></tr><tr><td>332285</td><td>Antibirth</td><td>Antibirth</td><td>en</td><td>In a desolate community full of drug-addled Marines and rumors of kidnapping, a wild-eyed stoner named Lou wakes up after a crazy night of partying with symptoms of a strange illness and recurring visions. As she struggles 