 discover that the real enemy stalks them from below.</td><td>Evil will surface.</td><td>2008-09-09</td><td>/vLUjy4CiPRdbSY8ds8JtBExt2Fh.jpg</td><td>8.42</td><td>170</td><td>5.9</td><td>7000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ofEOYrUfaoG7LQeXwI5CFoMoiy3.jpg</td><td>Horror, Western</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>34996</td><td>The Addiction</td><td>The Addiction</td><td>en</td><td>A vampiric doctoral student tries to follow the philosophy of a nocturnal comrade and control her thirst for blood.</td><td>The dark is their sunlight. What makes them different is what keeps them alive.</td><td>1995-01-10</td><td>/1Yy8H2tKQ16mffLFRfxcBHKBdyF.jpg</td><td>8.42</td><td>205</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wXJAMyI543CdRGcmqpCCaV0dNzz.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>31578</td><td>Body Bags</td><td>Body Bags</td><td>en</td><td>Three tales, each more terrifying than the last. . . . A woman who is stalked by an axe-weilding maniac . . . a man who pays the ultimate price for a beautiful head of hair . . . and a vision of life—seen through the eyes of a killer.</td><td>Zip yourself in tight!</td><td>1993-08-07</td><td>/75S25Uh33Yas15aDaU1uZVnMZdM.jpg</td><td>8.418</td><td>247</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/40a2z21BPfsNjDJbhZ0WshZFDF.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>284270</td><td>Welp</td><td>Cub</td><td>fr</td><td>Over-imaginative 12 year-old Sam heads off to the woods to summer scout camp with his pack convinced that he will encounter a monster...</td><td>Be prepared.</td><td>2014-10-29</td><td>/3kDaj4Fnutbnke5Fe10sATmyH8l.jpg</td><td>8.418</td><td>202</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cBgrdobrGu59xmrzuiEw1An9C7p.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12720</td><td>自殺サークル</td><td>Suicide Club</td><td>ja</td><td>When 54 high school girls throw themselves in front of a subway train it appears to be only the beginning of a string of suicides around the country. Does the new all-girl group Desert have anything to do with it? Detective Kuroda tries to find the answer, which isn't as simple as he had hoped.</td><td>Well then, goodbye everybody.</td><td>2001-10-29</td><td>/pnmP8OdxzzoYskyx7GbO0EGL6Dk.jpg</td><td>8.412</td><td>374</td><td>6.6</td><td>250000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/s8cfX8WdUS4HMvCOtiaL2jpD3YU.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>721280</td><td>Suicide Club Collection</td></tr><tr><td>638985</td><td>KKN di Desa Penari</td><td>KKN, Curse Of The Dancing Village</td><td>id</td><td>Six students were terrorized by a mysterious dancer while running a community service program in a remote village. Apparently, one of them violates the most fatal rule in the village.</td><td>A Terrifying True Story Revealed by @SimpleMan</td><td>2022-04-30</td><td>/63InZxeGgfNQCoWkImR14fB99AY.jpg</td><td>8.411</td><td>12</td><td>5.8</td><td>1100000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>130</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aZ8365UJquswZof2R6LQAoAU04k.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13964</td><td>片腕マシンガール</td><td>The Machine Girl</td><td>ja</td><td>The life of a young, Japanese schoolgirl is destroyed when her family is killed by a Ninja-Yakuza family. Her hand cut off, she replaces it with various machines-of-death, and seeks revenge.</td><td>It's Payback Time!</td><td>2008-01-02</td><td>/qccgrtiVYzEBPIvWz7hEY5a2Aax.jpg</td><td>8.406</td><td>152</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iHwZL5pehrFhSISA9pXFErrLuNf.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>550457</td><td>Machine Girl Collection</td></tr><tr><td>891996</td><td>In Search of Darkness: Part III</td><td>In Search of Darkness: Part III</td><td>en</td><td>The epic conclusion to the In Search of Darkness trilogy. In this epic final chapter, our focus turns to the straight-to-video horror classics that populated the bottom shelves at the video rental store. Imaginative, gory, experimental - but always entertaining - these hidden gems are ripe for rediscovery.</td><td>The final journey into '80s horror.</td><td>2022-12-01</td><td>/gtw5pFVn1S1utvQ5YdZ2mC8sOuU.jpg</td><td>8.405</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>In Production</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Documentary, Horror</td><td>797016</td><td>In Search of Darkness Collection</td></tr><tr><td>254672</td><td>金刚王</td><td>The Wrath Of Vajra</td><td>cn</td><td>In the 1930s , a Japanese cult called The Temple of Hades was ordered to cooperate with the Japanese military to destroy China. They buy so many  young children from poor family , who will be trained as a lethal killing machine and serve the Empire of Japan. One of them is Vajra , who was forced by his captors to fight for the food , and accidentally causing the death of his brother. Several years later , Vajra grown up and become one of the biggest killer in the Hades sect. Vajra escapes to China and joins Shaolin , where he receives spiritual enlightenment and determined to support China against Japan.</td><td>NA</td><td>2013-09-24</td><td>/auxBaa6PjqX7SVrGXedryMHskV2.jpg</td><td>8.4</td><td>44</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>115</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wuzI70IYF89mT3lDF7etsPgAXqE.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>226438</td><td>A Child's Play Story: Chucky's Revenge</td><td>A Child's Play Story: Chucky's Revenge</td><td>en</td><td>Chucky, still trapped in the body of a Good-Guy doll, breaks into a nearby home in a desperate attempt to find a new vessel.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-11-06</td><td>NA</td><td>8.396</td><td>4</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>6</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>580629</td><td>Get Duked!</td><td>Get Duked!</td><td>en</td><td>An anarchic, hip-hop inspired comedy that follows four city boys on a wilderness trek as they try to escape a mysterious huntsman.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-03-08</td><td>/b52nqFj5XrBNA7MhqcnENvFsHtx.jpg</td><td>8.391</td><td>174</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hH1vDR2vz9aCZMm2NfR6Qaar5ZK.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>748853</td><td>In the Earth</td><td>In the Earth</td><td>en</td><td>As a deadly virus ravages the world, Dr. Martin Lowery embarks on a mission to reach test site ATU327A, a research hub deep in the Arboreal Forest. The arduous journey, guided by park scout Alma, is set back by a nighttime attack that leaves the two bruised and shoeless. When they run into Zach, a man living off the grid, they gratefully accept his help. Zach’s intentions aren’t exactly what they seem, however, and a path out of the forest and into safety quickly fades as the line between myth and science blurs.</td><td>Nature is a force of evil.</td><td>2021-04-16</td><td>/lzzUkcZyHbXJayCw8yNAPezdBhq.jpg</td><td>8.389</td><td>284</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>107</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/u9VzNW6Ax7noDXmPFaXR3NbyDip.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>265010</td><td>The Canal</td><td>The Canal</td><td>en</td><td>A man who suspects his wife is cheating on him begins having nightmarish visions of an evil presence that he believes inhabits his house.</td><td>Fear will pull you under</td><td>2014-10-10</td><td>/5c4FFLSUx4ZBqcS2rq5CLVJdY9E.jpg</td><td>8.382</td><td>363</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8OfuPvpLLd9FhVxV7B6bC51JD84.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>33278</td><td>Deadly Friend</td><td>Deadly Friend</td><td>en</td><td>After his friend is killed by her abusive father, the new kid in town attempts to save her by implanting a robotic microchip into her brain.</td><td>There's no one alive who'll play with the girl next door.</td><td>1986-10-10</td><td>/h2lmu6tNqL1LxWFJ73N9WZW7Uba.jpg</td><td>8.379</td><td>190</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>8988731.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/d2tqx6xi8cTnaXXdx0Kg8JWerT3.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>47386</td><td>YellowBrickRoad</td><td>YellowBrickRoad</td><td>en</td><td>In the Fall of 1940, the entire population of Friar, New Hampshire walked together up a winding mountain trail and into the wilderness. Without warning, they left behind everything: their homes, their clothes, and their money. The only clue where they went was a single word etched into stone near the forest’s edge: YELLOWBRICKROAD.</td><td>They went looking for evil in the forest but the forest found evil in them</td><td>2010-01-23</td><td>/p4QniB5ek1DCD2EHZSDvcwyVkrZ.jpg</td><td>8.375</td><td>124</td><td>4.7</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4JiVd7xqClEKTKM9NKm2HkqfUBo.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12576</td><td>Deathwatch</td><td>Deathwatch</td><td>en</td><td>In the brutal trench fighting of the First World War, a British Infantry Company is separated from their regiment after a fierce battle. Attempting to return to their lines, the British soldiers discover what appears to be a bombed out German trench, abandoned except for a few dazed German soldiers. After killing most of the Germans, and taking one prisoner, the British company fortifies to hold the trench until reinforcements can arrive. Soon, however, strange things being to happen as a sense of evil descends on the trench and the British begin turn on each other.</td><td>Deliver them from evil.</td><td>2002-10-06</td><td>/R8qod2CvMi5iH2gfr043dMSM1y.jpg</td><td>8.372</td><td>147</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>2270658.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/j0R1JzJcTIG0bRjARJFthuYA8eZ.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller, War</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29159</td><td>Giallo</td><td>Giallo</td><td>it</td><td>In Torino, Celine, an American model, is abducted by a taxi driver while en route home to meet her sister Linda, visiting at her apartment. The next morning, Linda reports that Celine is missing - the sergeant in charge directs her to F.B.I. agent Inspector Enzo Avolfi. He's from the Special New York City Department investigating a serial-killer that kidnaps foreigners to destroy their beauty. When a Japanese woman is found at nearby a fountain, Enzo and Linda find that the girl is calling the abductor's skin is \"Yellow\" in color and Linda concludes that the guy might have jaundice. They go to the Policlinic di Torino to find the killer.</td><td>To Catch a Killer, You Must Think Like a Killer!</td><td>2010-03-13</td><td>/4T1DfeTROHXDaygI3PdyZqDbMtj.jpg</td><td>8.37</td><td>131</td><td>4.1</td><td>1.4E7</td><td>50113.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uaduFS1X5uOXYw5DYZJDqPa8oXj.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>44028</td><td>Suck</td><td>Suck</td><td>en</td><td>The film follows a petty rock band called the Winners, consisting of vocalist Joey Winner, bassist Jennifer, guitarist Tyler, drummer Sam, and French-Canadian roadie Hugo, along with their sleazy manager Jeff, as they tour across Canada and the USA after Jennifer is turned into a vampire by Queeny. Meanwhile, a vampire hunter who is afraid of the dark named Eddie Van Helsing quickly chases them down.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-09-11</td><td>/w2yq3fsa40ZyaFvjQdm76JsG8Lw.jpg</td><td>8.37</td><td>109</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pmkvTr5haxf77zzkMpHQJnzhQg2.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Music</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>101519</td><td>A Fantastic Fear of Everything</td><td>A Fantastic Fear of Everything</td><td>en</td><td>Jack is a children's author turned crime novelist whose detailed research into the lives of Victorian serial killers has turned him into a paranoid wreck, persecuted by the irrational fear of being murdered. When Jack is thrown a life-line by his long-suffering agent and a mysterious Hollywood executive takes a sudden and inexplicable interest in his script, what should be his big break rapidly turns into his big breakdown, as Jack is forced to confront his worst demons; among them his love life, his laundry and the origin of all fear.</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-06-07</td><td>/sMZyKSo8b47VW1h2zjjGUZIefV1.jpg</td><td>8.365</td><td>244</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mUWjBk12lY0om9iEFK8wdhxj7It.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>392818</td><td>The Transfiguration</td><td>The Transfiguration</td><td>en</td><td>When troubled teen Milo, who has a fascination with vampire lore, meets the equally alienated Sophie, the two form a bond that begins to blur Milo's fantasy into reality.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-04-14</td><td>/b7DWSZeP9Rxbmoase8RaIg6I369.jpg</td><td>8.365</td><td>108</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>22091.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ewWBAWyRGnLMm3kaqqb9XRUi47c.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>207774</td><td>The Borderlands</td><td>The Borderlands</td><td>en</td><td>Vatican investigators are sent to the British West Country to investigate paranormal activity, and they find the events are more disturbing than they first imagined.</td><td>Evil has a new form.</td><td>2013-08-24</td><td>/dNtkysYSyE3FcUGbdkooDckD16Y.jpg</td><td>8.363</td><td>178</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/j6xyaXJO4oaE99QJGxggpeLbJ7j.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>8991</td><td>Undead</td><td>Undead</td><td>en</td><td>A quaint Australian fishing village is overcome by meteorites that turn its residents into the ravenous undead, leaving a small group of those unharmed to find a way out.</td><td>Crazy has come to town for a visit.</td><td>2003-09-04</td><td>/jwXrKFO20FTvA7mHqnTvMXSznDS.jpg</td><td>8.362</td><td>179</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1jWgJwnN3yQNbKQyyJAzflZzOyX.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11345</td><td>The Zodiac</td><td>The Zodiac</td><td>en</td><td>An elusive serial killer known as the Zodiac terrorizes the San Francisco Bay in the late 1960s, while detectives aim to stop him before he claims more victims. Based on a true story.</td><td>NA</td><td>2005-07-31</td><td>/itWcwDga192na5owOO0eTrWNR7D.jpg</td><td>8.358</td><td>103</td><td>5.5</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>86872.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uN5lr3Suvn1zdVeOnWpi0VZkLF0.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>431185</td><td>He's Out There</td><td>He's Out There</td><td>en</td><td>On vacation at a remote lake house, a mother and her two young daughters must fight for survival after falling into a terrifying and bizarre nightmare conceived by a psychopath.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-10-25</td><td>/pi9Zo4uIATSe8cQ96cCOWJ1qdGw.jpg</td><td>8.358</td><td>239</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fYhYMPM8Qw6ZX7IOLpp1sCNMFCP.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16126</td><td>Flight of the Living Dead</td><td>Flight of the Living Dead</td><td>en</td><td>On a flight from Los Angeles to Paris, a mad scientist on the run from the CIA is transporting a coffin containing the body of a colleague infected with a genetically modified virus. While the 747 crosses a violent thunderstorm, the instability of the aircraft allows the corpse to get out of its container.</td><td>At 30,000 feet, there's no where to run.</td><td>2007-04-06</td><td>/ulLuFAX6MK8QRMrhJWPJ1G9qeVH.jpg</td><td>8.357</td><td>101</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mpUPiSXk8cQsDUk3AygUxFqedjN.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>37254</td><td>Mermaid Chronicles Part 1: She Creature</td><td>Mermaid Chronicles Part 1: She Creature</td><td>en</td><td>Two carnies (Sewell and Gugino) abduct a mermaid in Ireland, circa 1900, and decide to transport her to America. As their ship loses its way and heads towards the mythical Forbidden Islands, the mermaid begins to display its deadly side.</td><td>Beatiful, seductive and totally deadly.</td><td>2001-12-20</td><td>/9XujfUiyhNxPG48cQHvJnkMnqSw.jpg</td><td>8.355</td><td>81</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>8875</td><td>Timber Falls</td><td>Timber Falls</td><td>en</td><td>A weekend of camping in the mountains becomes an excursion into hell for a young couple, who become pawns in a grotesque plot hatched by deranged locals.</td><td>NA</td><td>2007-12-07</td><td>/9EIsSXFSIVoT6mQODnUZ62gz4BT.jpg</td><td>8.354</td><td>123</td><td>5.2</td><td>2600000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pjbrBZaWbb98hhZ0xt4Uf9O64Eg.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>26342</td><td>The Terminators</td><td>The Terminators</td><td>en</td><td>A small band of resistance fighters battle the cyborgs that have taken control of the planet.</td><td>Built to protect mankind, now programmed to destroy.</td><td>2009-04-28</td><td>/7LV3sg3bJOGFD6J0gn7Wt1IL5SK.jpg</td><td>8.354</td><td>48</td><td>4.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/puiwodUrPSDTkvlIRr2CdDM1isB.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27381</td><td>Innocent Blood</td><td>Innocent Blood</td><td>en</td><td>A beautiful vampire turns a crime lord into a creature of the night.</td><td>The movie that goes straight for the jugular.</td><td>1992-09-25</td><td>/gnI1dPgo5kEPdXYKIiamZQZ8DDT.jpg</td><td>8.353</td><td>174</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>112</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9NOVijK2ou69d9jtnTrPbljvMlG.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10961</td><td>Behind the Mask: The Rise of Leslie Vernon</td><td>Behind the Mask: The Rise of Leslie Vernon</td><td>en</td><td>The next great psycho horror slasher has given a documentary crew exclusive access to his life as he plans his reign of terror over the sleepy town of Glen Echo, all the while deconstructing the conventions and archetypes of the horror genre for them.</td><td>Freddy, Jason, Michael. We All Need Someone To Look Up To.</td><td>2006-08-29</td><td>/vie8a3z219Zsw81eAsM58B6VFEn.jpg</td><td>8.352</td><td>344</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>69136.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5rD3FElz0xjZp9eIi8jEAx7KJoZ.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>399894</td><td>Daylight's End</td><td>Daylight's End</td><td>en</td><td>Years after a mysterious plague has devastated the planet and turned most of humanity into blood-hungry creatures, a rogue drifter on a vengeful hunt stumbles across a band of survivors in an abandoned police station and reluctantly agrees to try to help them defend themselves and escape to the sanctuary they so desperately need.</td><td>The Dead Rise When Daylight Ends</td><td>2016-04-16</td><td>/sNDodM6si97uhiPhf5dTM6n6aDj.jpg</td><td>8.35</td><td>137</td><td>5.9</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>120</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/33HUOjvtXOVuZ1QIlAHQI0K7GCs.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>123362</td><td>Insensibles</td><td>Painless</td><td>ca</td><td>While searching for a solution to his serious health condition, David, a renowned neurosurgeon, discovers a sinister secret hidden in the past.</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-10-10</td><td>/2UVw0Z1mLcTTnvMmx3EbR18mzZc.jpg</td><td>8.347</td><td>143</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1rjOIYv10BCAkVMOhRHvi0SwHoO.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13549</td><td>Burnt Offerings</td><td>Burnt Offerings</td><td>en</td><td>A couple and their 12-year-old son move into a giant house for the summer. Things start acting strange almost immediately. It seems that every time someone gets hurt on the grounds, the beat-up house seems to repair itself.</td><td>Up the ancient stairs, behind the locked door, something lives, something evil, from which no one has ever returned.</td><td>1976-10-18</td><td>/2ipG69lXOjGMX7F7qxJQzUoiUsd.jpg</td><td>8.346</td><td>180</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>116</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sve315CAjMhSZBKBthDHJI77gmb.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>20606</td><td>Doghouse</td><td>Doghouse</td><td>en</td><td>Six men with mid-life anxiety set out for a weekend in the country in an attempt to reconnect with their masculinity. What they find is a catastrophe so horrible and bizarre that a mid-life crisis turns out to be exactly what they need to survive it...</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-06-11</td><td>/8XBd0TLZRcnSpbeEyoYRxxDCafJ.jpg</td><td>8.344</td><td>295</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oU0qUg19TL0qmOM4HQxKTWu7TEQ.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>560252</td><td>Matriarch</td><td>Matriarch</td><td>en</td><td>A pregnant woman and her husband are taken in by a farmer and his wife after crashing their car in the Scottish countryside. Once inside, they realize their hosts’ daughter is a missing child from the news years earlier. Things take a sinister twist when the farmer and his wife inform the couple they intend to keep their baby once born.</td><td>She wants the life you give</td><td>2018-11-02</td><td>/eQWxzYlqywzxXZ0Njq6XVxnnsDN.jpg</td><td>8.344</td><td>44</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/teTnQfCusUhPznEwElmL885tLFQ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>472226</td><td>Blood Fest</td><td>Blood Fest</td><td>en</td><td>Fans flock to a festival celebrating the most iconic horror movies, only to discover that the charismatic showman behind the event has a diabolical agenda.</td><td>Love horror movies? Try surviving one.</td><td>2018-08-17</td><td>/v7x4P33lZwstVgxlZGze18hBlD.jpg</td><td>8.343</td><td>185</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/e4eeJjON17Cv7Cio3QEyC4xv5uZ.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14098</td><td>100 Feet</td><td>100 Feet</td><td>en</td><td>After Marnie Watson kills her abusive husband in self-defense, she is condemned to house arrest... only to discover that the house is possessed by the enraged and violent spirit of her dead husband.</td><td>Her husband is dead and he's taking the news badly...</td><td>2008-07-22</td><td>/ryocnetNNLWs0Oefkqkea6HccqV.jpg</td><td>8.34</td><td>241</td><td>5.5</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>1415804.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jZu09TyQAiUaQRHa7L18eVBPzdS.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>226458</td><td>Exeter</td><td>Exeter</td><td>en</td><td>During an all-night, drug-fueled party at an abandoned asylum known for the horrific treatment of its patients, a group of ordinary teens decide to experiment with the occult, mysteriously leading to a violent possession. In an effort to find help, the group rushes to escape, only to find themselves locked inside with no means of communication. Tempers flare, trusts are broken and in attempt to save one of their friends possessed by the demon, the amateurs try to perform an exorcism. Instead of solving the problem, and unbeknownst to them, they unleash an even more powerful and vengeful spirit, one with a distinct motive and which wants them all dead. The teen's only chance of survival is to uncover the asylum's deep mysteries and find a way out before it's too late.</td><td>An excellent day for an exorcism</td><td>2015-01-16</td><td>/AwhFI88HW2BE62E6kEsTGPliZKB.jpg</td><td>8.334</td><td>162</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mUDwzbPnSUxoEysYaJZkmdA29qR.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>264397</td><td>El Incidente</td><td>The Incident</td><td>es</td><td>Two parallel stories about people trapped in illogical endless spaces: two brothers and a detective locked on an infinite staircase, and a family locked on an infinite road... for over 35 years.</td><td>If the road never stops, you better keep going.</td><td>2014-05-17</td><td>/idb1ACZCQAsYJCFMfs9vgyBIbP1.jpg</td><td>8.333</td><td>128</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/anvabdHa1iP70ywR1TH0F5g5A8H.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>289732</td><td>屍城</td><td>Zombie Fight Club</td><td>zh</td><td>It's the end of the century at a corner of the city in a building riddled with crime - Everyone in the building has turned into zombies. After Jenny's boyfriend is killed in a zombie attack, she faces the challenge of surviving in the face of adversity. In order to stay alive, she struggles with Andy to flee danger.</td><td>You Only Die Twice.</td><td>2014-10-23</td><td>/u8u3KVq0qfJYmNDsaTVOXy4So6f.jpg</td><td>8.332</td><td>29</td><td>3.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1VqE5z4VIOcNcajJuHLk4fDkY9G.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9439</td><td>Los sin nombre</td><td>The Nameless</td><td>es</td><td>The mutilated body of a six year old girl is found in a water hole. The girl is identified as the missing daughter of Claudia. However, only two peices of evidence could be used to identify her; a bracelet with her name on it near the crime scene, and the fact that her right leg was three inches longer than her left. All other methods of identification were removed from her body. Five years later Claudia, now addicted to tranquilizers, receives a phone call from someone claiming to be her daughter, asking for her mother to come find her before 'they' kill her. Other mysterious clues show up, further indicating that Claudia's daughter is indeed still alive, and very much in danger. Claudia, a run-down ex-cop, and a parapsychology reporter put together the clues to discover Angela's whereabouts</td><td>Trying to reach the limits of evil... But evil has no limits.</td><td>1999-10-08</td><td>/eZRtWQU6EnqBtPc9xKgQ9SM6ICg.jpg</td><td>8.326</td><td>122</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>1069154.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/if6JUkVvC1esqbuBzMA1bk8ReIY.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>486011</td><td>Like.Share.Follow.</td><td>Like.Share.Follow.</td><td>en</td><td>Garrett is a rising YouTube star. Shell is a deeply emotional fan. When they begin a romantic relationship, he's forced to question whether opening your life to strangers online is an invitation to community and rescue... or to stalking, obsession and madness.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-10-31</td><td>/frh6P7hqfIqXhzRcKb5UjYRFfPZ.jpg</td><td>8.321</td><td>116</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/toTfiaJqTn3sJENPEkAeRCLMpIa.jpg</td><td>Horror, Romance, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>18998</td><td>Darkman II: The Return of Durant</td><td>Darkman II: The Return of Durant</td><td>en</td><td>Darkman and Durant return and they hate each other as much as ever. This time, Durant has plans to take over the city's drug trade using high-tech weaponry. Darkman must step in and try to stop Durant once and for all.</td><td>Vengeance strikes hardest in the dark.</td><td>1995-07-11</td><td>/fSI2DIvqidbUzfG04NAqnidC53f.jpg</td><td>8.319</td><td>203</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/OH3MPYE1cn1y6PLEFZqG5of2qd.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>45154</td><td>Darkman Collection</td></tr><tr><td>284711</td><td>Sharktopus vs. Pteracuda</td><td>Sharktopus vs. Pteracuda</td><td>en</td><td>An American scientist up to no good (as usual) by creating the half-pterodactyl, half-barracuda: Pteracuda. When the creature inevitably escapes, it's up to Sharktopus to stop him.</td><td>A Love Story</td><td>2014-08-02</td><td>/d9tL8K2cb77Cj6yDFlILVdgqDmY.jpg</td><td>8.313</td><td>62</td><td>4.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kPZylC2tzyJzjFXmyH2qcSZMwYv.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie</td><td>370374</td><td>Sharktopus Collection</td></tr><tr><td>37530</td><td>House II: The Second Story</td><td>House II: The Second Story</td><td>en</td><td>Jesse has returned to this old family mansion after his parents were murdered when he was a baby. While going through old things in the basement, Jesse finds a picture of his great-great grandfather in front of a Mayan temple holding a crystal skull with jewels in the eyes. In the background is a man Jesse learns is Slim Razor, a former partner of his great-great grandfather turned bitter enemy after a disagreement over who would get to keep the skull.</td><td>It's an all new house with brand new owners</td><td>1987-05-14</td><td>/o58So9NfjKPITUQhQdpCUdTi9Vn.jpg</td><td>8.308</td><td>195</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>7800000.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/r3uHyikGNv5oiRbZvbryhnHk9ql.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>102782</td><td>House Collection</td></tr><tr><td>13797</td><td>Feast II: Sloppy Seconds</td><td>Feast II: Sloppy Seconds</td><td>en</td><td>The monsters have made it into a small neighboring town in the middle of nowhere and the locals have to band with the survivors of the bar' slaughter to figure out how to survive.</td><td>They're BACK ... and STILL HUNGRY</td><td>2008-10-07</td><td>/jSwQ66A3LsoplxuAuoG4hipMpJm.jpg</td><td>8.307</td><td>141</td><td>5.2</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vbr7KrU6l2hvW3s59ti09vrJ33a.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>98430</td><td>Feast Collection</td></tr><tr><td>34335</td><td>Nine Dead</td><td>Nine Dead</td><td>en</td><td>Communication is the key to the survival for nine strangers who have been kidnapped by a masked gunman and told that one of them will die every ten minutes until they discover how they are all connected. Who of the nine lives and who dies?</td><td>Every ten minutes one must die.</td><td>2010-03-09</td><td>/3zAYW3q6gawnV68XdXtkBNBgUEX.jpg</td><td>8.307</td><td>228</td><td>5.4</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>23220</td><td>The Brides of Dracula</td><td>The Brides of Dracula</td><td>en</td><td>A young teacher on her way to a position in Transylvania helps a young man escape the shackles his mother has put on him. In so doing she innocently unleashes the horrors of the undead once again on the populace, including those at her school for ladies. Luckily for some, Dr. Van Helsing is already on his way.</td><td>He Turned Innocent Beauty Into Unspeakable Horror.</td><td>1960-07-07</td><td>/8i0WWZwBh1eQB2KJSSQdYmS2q3C.jpg</td><td>8.297</td><td>164</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9hdHLj5aJ0kQpPnCC2lFHsu9K7K.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>123724</td><td>Dracula (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>24919</td><td>Le notti del terrore</td><td>Burial Ground</td><td>it</td><td>Professor Ayres discovers a secret in an ancient stone and when he opens a crypt, he revives zombies that kill him. He had invited three couples to visit him in his manor to reveal his discovery. However, they never get around to meeting the professor. Out of the blue, the zombies attack them and they seek shelter in the mansion.</td><td>When the moon turns red, the dead shall rise!</td><td>1981-01-23</td><td>/cV86W9mgTuDvwWgKRrnWp8t1LJ7.jpg</td><td>8.294</td><td>108</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yw3x4a4nPgn4SA2K5rFPNAeJN99.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24580</td><td>The Quatermass Xperiment</td><td>The Quatermass Xperiment</td><td>en</td><td>The first manned spacecraft, fired from an English launchpad, is first lost from radar, then roars back to Earth and crashes in a farmer's field, and is found to contain only one of the three men who took off in it; and he is unable to talk but appears to be undergoing a torturous physical and mental metamorphosis.</td><td>You Can't Escape It!</td><td>1955-08-26</td><td>/lm6cQiUjJ0AUUqESI9WWM7veIbp.jpg</td><td>8.292</td><td>145</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ipNzUVfnIW4igmGNoDQsTfOnCb8.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>123726</td><td>Quatermass (Hammer series)</td></tr><tr><td>10299</td><td>Hush... Hush, Sweet Charlotte</td><td>Hush... Hush, Sweet Charlotte</td><td>en</td><td>An aging, reclusive Southern belle plagued by a horrifying family secret descends into madness after the arrival of a lost relative.</td><td>The years will soon erase a lover's lies...the blood on his face!</td><td>1964-12-15</td><td>/hwVGNaVXFblluLwUjGcJ7RgW1rV.jpg</td><td>8.286</td><td>192</td><td>7.3</td><td>2200000.0</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>133</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oe9YRZv9FTtOJ9IKbJxyh23MYO1.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>15543</td><td>Penny Dreadful</td><td>Penny Dreadful</td><td>en</td><td>Young Penny goes on a retreat with her psychologist; the intention is to help her overcome her phobia, an intense fear of cars. Unexpected events find her in a nightmarish situation where her worst fears come true.</td><td>Don't forget to breathe...</td><td>2006-11-10</td><td>/aHAUNz0qg8wUM9UFiT7rq2wiu50.jpg</td><td>8.285</td><td>103</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>70984</td><td>Silent Night, Deadly Night 5: The Toy Maker</td><td>Silent Night, Deadly Night 5: The Toy Maker</td><td>en</td><td>A young boy sees his father killed by a toy that was anonymously delivered to his house. After that, he is too traumatized to speak, and his mother must deal with both him and the loss of her husband. Meanwhile, a toy maker named Joe Peto builds some suspicious-looking toys, and a mysterious man creeps around both the toy store and the boy's house...but who is responsible for the killer toys?</td><td>He's home... but he's not alone.</td><td>1991-11-06</td><td>/dSA5fLdk14CglFluKVMohrjo7L4.jpg</td><td>8.282</td><td>38</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kwbzEB6Mn6yo5YNYt1INTi0BJuH.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>256296</td><td>Silent Night, Deadly Night Collection</td></tr><tr><td>50272</td><td>Somos lo que hay</td><td>We Are What We Are</td><td>es</td><td>After the death of a patriarch, a family must try to continue on with a disturbing, ritualistic tradition.</td><td>Young. Wild. Hungry.</td><td>2010-11-12</td><td>/ufZZGuMC14lWSGYuR7zM6ogxajO.jpg</td><td>8.276</td><td>96</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bsUMIAeMVQ50g7PFofV1AMZbWNU.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>648043</td><td>The Driver</td><td>The Driver</td><td>en</td><td>After a plague of the undead decimates human life on Earth, a former hit man (Mark Dacascos), his wife, and daughter live quietly in a survivalist compound. But when their base is attacked, a massive explosion summons a swarm of the undead. They escape and must seek out the Haven, a rumored sanctuary up north, while the father teaches his daughter to shoot, drive, and survive before time runs out.</td><td>It's a Highway to Hell</td><td>2019-11-25</td><td>/cCO26pPZDnZ4SRuqV2cwyuDKBfs.jpg</td><td>8.271</td><td>54</td><td>6.4</td><td>1300000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hfsWu39M5NFXq6TeqqqGeo58sag.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>759902</td><td>Hunter Hunter</td><td>Hunter Hunter</td><td>en</td><td>A fur trapper leaves his wife and daughter behind to kill a rogue wolf in the remote wilderness, but they soon become increasingly worried when their peaceful existence is disrupted.</td><td>Hunt or be hunted</td><td>2020-12-18</td><td>/j52lKBGoHGmUJNUMsDV5kHOkMfC.jpg</td><td>8.269</td><td>200</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/i2unxIwvGPVNN3egzXnJFPEe9P8.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28859</td><td>Dolly Dearest</td><td>Dolly Dearest</td><td>en</td><td>An American family moves to Mexico to fabricate dolls, but their toy factory happens to be next to a Sanzian grave and the toys come into possession of an old, malicious spirit.</td><td>NA</td><td>1991-09-01</td><td>/fp5o7DIp31R3T7SNzPGVKgyyTpu.jpg</td><td>8.268</td><td>91</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jcWmaL27Dn9YEk9SLYV12jcljBG.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>33020</td><td>Dracula A.D. 1972</td><td>Dracula A.D. 1972</td><td>en</td><td>Set in London in the early 1970's, supposedly for teen thrills, Johnny organises a black magic ceremony in a desolate churchyard. The culmination of the ritual, however, is the rejuvenation of Dracula from shrivelled remains. Johnny, Dracula' s disciple, lures victims to the deserted graveyard for his master's pleasure and one of the victims delivered is Jessica Van Helsing. Descended from the Van Helsing line of vampire hunters her grandfather, equipped with all the devices to snare and destroy the Count, confronts his arch enemy in the age-old battle between good and evil.</td><td>The Count is back, with an eye for London's hotpants . . . and a taste for everything</td><td>1972-06-26</td><td>/rUgVTCBLnXngVlpOaVWZupxwmHZ.jpg</td><td>8.267</td><td>129</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kTW8zg0IqZqnBbbmgLect40Pjcm.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>123724</td><td>Dracula (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>396004</td><td>The Evil in Us</td><td>The Evil in Us</td><td>en</td><td>While on a fourth of July holiday, six best friends fall victim to the insidious plan of a terrorist organization when they unknowingly take a bio-active drug that transforms them into bloodthirsty cannibals.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-08-19</td><td>/5hjpfY7faXYclLRK0DDPPWtShyp.jpg</td><td>8.264</td><td>62</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rkZf8rkXkCR1RK8xqVOormaGpEp.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>46812</td><td>Lost Boys: The Thirst</td><td>Lost Boys: The Thirst</td><td>en</td><td>Vampire hunter Edgar Frog is destitute and nearly friendless, when the beautiful vampire-romance novelist Gwen Lieber offers him a small fortune to go on the vampire hunt of a lifetime and save her brother from an army of newborn vampires who use a new drug called the Thirst, which is a mixture of Ecstasy and vampire blood. Realising he can't do this alone, Edgar turns to his brother, Alan Frog, to help him save Gwen's brother.</td><td>The Frog brothers are back for blood.</td><td>2010-05-12</td><td>/sKeaELcJyoCFzU5QeiIhjbNagIN.jpg</td><td>8.263</td><td>91</td><td>5.1</td><td>4400000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/n31oWJA93fwZiibZt3fSyRKn7pY.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Comedy, Horror</td><td>109076</td><td>Lost Boys Collection</td></tr><tr><td>550148</td><td>The Body</td><td>The Body</td><td>en</td><td>In Los Angeles, on Halloween night, a hitman tries to transport a corpse in plain sight, but people he stumbles upon on the street, believing that his sophisticated appearance is a magnificent disguise, constantly stand in his way to congratulate him.</td><td>On Halloween, finding the right costume can be murder</td><td>2018-09-21</td><td>/1ZJkoWMPGpFqdVplXivjQOYEp4H.jpg</td><td>8.263</td><td>87</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/txf54dz60Hvb4nETdXY1glKa0tV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>643866</td><td>Pilgrim</td><td>Pilgrim</td><td>en</td><td>In an attempt to remind her family of their privilege and help them bond, Ms. Anna Barker invites Pilgrim reenactors to stay with them over Thanksgiving. When the “actors” refuse to break character, the Barker family learns that there is such a thing as too much gratitude.</td><td>This thanksgiving, survival is a blessing.</td><td>2019-11-01</td><td>/uswFh1UtkV2hkvkTfczQXNodjFz.jpg</td><td>8.259</td><td>49</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nwIodFwJl1LjgrhrEUKDbDcap8N.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>265019</td><td>Preservation</td><td>Preservation</td><td>en</td><td>Three family members head deep into the woods for a hunting trip that doubles as a distraction from their troubles at home. When all of their gear is stolen, they turn on each other, but soon realize there are much more treacherous forces at work.</td><td>Man is the only animal that kills for fun</td><td>2014-08-22</td><td>/ppoOXtJZBPXq9Qf2v9pxaa8UeQg.jpg</td><td>8.258</td><td>161</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yZHzTJDP9gWDNfcXNiogxgL7rzn.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>797946</td><td>The Djinn</td><td>The Djinn</td><td>en</td><td>A mute boy is trapped in his apartment with a sinister monster when he makes a wish to fulfill his heart’s greatest desire.</td><td>What is done cannot be undone.</td><td>2021-05-14</td><td>/nJCPWN1NZCKmA4cfJNgGdyC6r9K.jpg</td><td>8.255</td><td>114</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kryYpNFiYyPUVC7SXrHk2pjRj4y.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>73196</td><td>Anime Perse</td><td>The Jail: The Women's Hell</td><td>en</td><td>Three women are sent by steamboat to an undisclosed jungle prison called \"The Home of Lost Souls\". Here they experience the usual beatings, whippings, cat fights and humiliations. The butch warden has a deal on the side with a local pimp who forces them to dance in bikinis at a nightclub and sexually service the patrons. Tired of cages, rape, torture and rats, the girls kill the resident snitch and escape into the jungle.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-05-01</td><td>/ihjD8igyNxFe3VqpRUnKIPuNz7e.jpg</td><td>8.25</td><td>39</td><td>8.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/v2FQ63G4V6hBsERqXsiz2S3XiyL.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>370178</td><td>Scare Campaign</td><td>Scare Campaign</td><td>en</td><td>Popular prank TV show, Scare Campaign, has been entertaining audiences for the last 5 years with its mix of old school scares and hidden camera fun. But as we enter a new age of online TV the producers find themselves up against a new hard edged web series which makes their show look decidedly quaint. It's time to up the ante, but will the team go too far this time, and are they about to prank the wrong guy?</td><td>The best pranks go a little off script, right?</td><td>2016-03-17</td><td>/nX4jNviujO0jn9P4F2w5eUWtoGf.jpg</td><td>8.25</td><td>153</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>76</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uUDcK4Ao4JVyySHGZH3bDOmaCCx.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>848886</td><td>Hellbender</td><td>Hellbender</td><td>en</td><td>A teen and her mother live simply in a home in the woods, spending their time making metal music. A chance encounter with a fellow teen causes her to uncover a connection between her family and witchcraft, which causes a rift with her mother.</td><td>Growing Up is Hell.</td><td>2021-09-28</td><td>/uLDYfeJ9BvrQsC3MBqMUjG4Hgaz.jpg</td><td>8.25</td><td>47</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>67474.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rJcswoyg0pw9oRJarbGC0sIazR1.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28900</td><td>Halloween: 25 Years of Terror</td><td>Halloween: 25 Years of Terror</td><td>en</td><td>A documentary that follows the evolution of the 'Halloween' movies over the past twenty-five years. It examines why the films are so popular and revisits many of the original locations used in the films - seeing the effects on the local community. For the first time, cast, crew, critics and fans join together in the ultimate 'Halloween' retrospective</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-07-26</td><td>/vmayq2Waak7cqmDLNYnB1lzxEiu.jpg</td><td>8.239</td><td>38</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Documentary, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>37793</td><td>Ghosts</td><td>Ghosts</td><td>en</td><td>In the town of Normal Valley, an eccentric magician named Maestro entertains the local children every day in his spooky mansion. One stormy night, the town's mayor leads a group of angry citizens to the mansion in an attempt to run Maestro out of town.</td><td>Are you scared yet?</td><td>1997-09-04</td><td>/yR5XSYPx6paPLPWMcPUHJBm1Vpb.jpg</td><td>8.23</td><td>194</td><td>8.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>39</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7A7Zpru9lldnFsWOZQ8Fg63NUPj.jpg</td><td>Horror, Music</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>84178</td><td>Black Rock</td><td>Black Rock</td><td>en</td><td>Three childhood friends set aside their personal issues and reunite for a girls’ weekend on a remote island off the coast of Maine. One wrong move turns their weekend getaway into a deadly fight for survival.</td><td>Not every island is a paradise.</td><td>2012-01-21</td><td>/dkUDpTgP634Mt7fl2rR5N7P9HRS.jpg</td><td>8.228</td><td>204</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>79</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2qKTX9Hyq4bs61VWHB2HVEfwps2.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28165</td><td>The Toxic Avenger Part II</td><td>The Toxic Avenger Part II</td><td>en</td><td>The Toxic Avenger is lured to Tokyo, Japan by the evil corporation Apocalypse Inc. So while the Toxic Avenger is fighting crime in Tokyo, Apocalypse Inc. spread evil in Tromaville.</td><td>The first Super-Hero from New Jersey is Back!</td><td>1989-02-24</td><td>/5DoPquotxlRqNmYmTkorqiqKcvF.jpg</td><td>8.226</td><td>116</td><td>5.5</td><td>2300000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>109</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fO1RIDcnKg78WPX2hw6IklFatd7.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>32135</td><td>The Toxic Avenger Collection</td></tr><tr><td>38033</td><td>Chain Letter</td><td>Chain Letter</td><td>en</td><td>Six friends receive a mysterious chain letter via text messaging and in their email accounts from a maniac who's hunting down teenagers who fail to forward his online chain letter. Who knew they should take the threats in the chain letter seriously? Or that chain letters using the teens' favorite technologies to track them can kill? This maniacal game pits friend against friend as they race to beat rules that seem impossible to escape. Break the chain,