mQiyaGR3.jpg</td><td>8.105</td><td>36</td><td>6.1</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>3100000.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/n1jX5EuOSCgkNjh596xW8yrQedf.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27135</td><td>Tell-Tale</td><td>Tell-Tale</td><td>en</td><td>A man's recently transplanted heart leads him on a frantic search to find the donor's killer before a similar fate befalls him.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-04-24</td><td>/4j37Dnkl4LD47O0rYUdOTRHWWF1.jpg</td><td>8.103</td><td>114</td><td>5.4</td><td>1.2E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tAesS5XvdKnew1tGUYYtE7VIkgm.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28172</td><td>Blood Feast</td><td>Blood Feast</td><td>en</td><td>In the sleepy suburbs of Miami, seemingly normal Egyptian immigrant Fuad Ramses (Mal Arnold) runs a successful catering business. He also murders young women and plans to use their body parts to revive the goddess Ishtar. The insane Ramses hypnotizes a socialite in order to land a job catering a party for her debutante daughter, Suzette Fremont (Connie Mason), and turns the event into an evening of gruesome deaths, bloody dismemberment and ritual sacrifice.</td><td>You'll Recoil and Shudder as You Witness the Slaughter and Mutilation of Nubile Young Girls - in a Weird and Horrendous Ancient Rite!</td><td>1963-07-06</td><td>/bFnOySJFxJSEzaZ8RHrSsFvXWC6.jpg</td><td>8.102</td><td>132</td><td>4.7</td><td>24500.0</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>67</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/c4Yi0IUIG3sd2gef8HHUzjddWGQ.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>519018</td><td>Blood Feast Collection</td></tr><tr><td>33107</td><td>And Soon the Darkness</td><td>And Soon the Darkness</td><td>en</td><td>When two American girls on a bike trip in a remote part of Argentina split up and one of them goes missing, the other must find her before her worst fears are realized.</td><td>Alone. Stranded. No One to Trust.</td><td>2010-02-25</td><td>/1Z4KG1ImTkvyr1aDenydAOOLNoT.jpg</td><td>8.101</td><td>318</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>177182.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oAQJFXjiVOFrjj2pfNwfnXUcIzR.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>32569</td><td>X: The Man with the X-Ray Eyes</td><td>X: The Man with the X-Ray Eyes</td><td>en</td><td>A doctor uses special eye drops to give himself x-ray vision, but the new power has disastrous consequences.</td><td>Suddenly he could see through clothes, flesh… and walls!</td><td>1963-07-13</td><td>/7YMk1mtTsGYPBC8zj2Kd3K6h3g3.jpg</td><td>8.098</td><td>157</td><td>6.5</td><td>250000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>79</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/epmZ9rrE65OjFGli034RFlzgp52.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10790</td><td>The Abandoned</td><td>The Abandoned</td><td>en</td><td>Marie, a film producer, returns to her native Russia to find her birth parents. She quickly learns they are dead, and she has inherited their long-empty farmhouse. At the farm, she meets Nicolai, who claims to be her twin brother. Events take a terrifying turn when the two spot a pair of ghastly doppelgangers and the house itself seems to propel them toward a fate they should have met 40 years earlier.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-09-11</td><td>/32DhJlTTmLeaPNQeh2oHuDNRmqF.jpg</td><td>8.097</td><td>195</td><td>5.5</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>4529892.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/plsdKhrNZ4vIN1qZJ8ccihiMZI7.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>20034</td><td>Hush</td><td>Hush</td><td>en</td><td>A young couple on a motorway journey are drawn into a game of cat and mouse with a truck driver when they see something disturbing in the back of his vehicle.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-08-13</td><td>/lJH4yVlQuMwqgZM6UOTVzfqFSp4.jpg</td><td>8.095</td><td>121</td><td>5.6</td><td>1.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ggOMmWtYiKt1KQiXarHsSpo1f1d.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39578</td><td>The Monster Club</td><td>The Monster Club</td><td>en</td><td>A vampire attacks a horror author on the street and then invites him to a nearby club as a gesture of gratitude, which turns out to be a meeting place for assorted creatures of the night. The vampire then regales him with three stories, each interspersed with musical performances at the club.</td><td>You'll meet some interesting people and hear some great songs at the Monster Club</td><td>1981-04-11</td><td>/AnNIp3GDXX95nljypGPhcZnEGts.jpg</td><td>8.091</td><td>83</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/exD5f8a6Zv6GWdXz3VltfrzFbRY.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>538227</td><td>Extra Ordinary</td><td>Extra Ordinary</td><td>en</td><td>A driving instructor must use her other-worldly gifts to save a lonely man’s daughter from a rock star looking to use her for Satanic purposes.</td><td>Putting the normal in paranormal.</td><td>2019-09-13</td><td>/z3IRiGKXx2eMhxtV8GktKwvWkhm.jpg</td><td>8.088</td><td>176</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6Rie2qP3R7DCnexj87XGaeCFb70.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>324803</td><td>Hangman</td><td>Hangman</td><td>en</td><td>Returning from vacation, the Miller family find their home has been broken into. After cleaning up the mess they continue with their lives, shaking off the feeling of being violated. But little do they know the nightmare has just begun.</td><td>Who You Fear Is Already Inside</td><td>2015-03-14</td><td>/oFycPIlZahNAodgnOMG9Anv4Hds.jpg</td><td>8.083</td><td>112</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1slbKMn1K491qQPjxZAIi4cieXG.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39468</td><td>ゴジラ×メガギラス G消滅作戦</td><td>Godzilla vs. Megaguirus</td><td>ja</td><td>In an alternate timeline the original Godzilla is never defeated and repeatedly reemerges to feed on Japan's energy sources. A new inter-dimensional weapon called the Dimension Tide is created with the intent of eliminating Godzilla. However, the new weapon might also serve as a gateway to something far more sinister.</td><td>Godzilla disappears.</td><td>2000-11-03</td><td>/8H78ZTr9SVoYYAQzMiFz8CO3TKd.jpg</td><td>8.077</td><td>134</td><td>6.7</td><td>8300000.0</td><td>1.10688E7</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h44PEDYRcnLgYaDYcvD68f0MpZm.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>374512</td><td>Godzilla (Millennium) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>592230</td><td>Blood Quantum</td><td>Blood Quantum</td><td>en</td><td>The dead are coming back to life outside the isolated Mi'kmaq reserve of Red Crow, except for its Indigenous inhabitants who are strangely immune to the zombie plague.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-09-05</td><td>/pQnfrys3nyOpUxktxK2CBnm7Rv8.jpg</td><td>8.076</td><td>126</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xg1adjc8iEsQ4znJNjUQSvuiPjr.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>4240</td><td>Titanic 2000</td><td>Titanic 2000</td><td>en</td><td>The luxury liner Titanic 2000 has set sail on its maiden voyage, and one of the passengers is the vampire Vladamina. Vladamina is searching for a woman she can turn into a vampire queen, and frustrated rock groupie Shari looks to be a perfect target. As various people get seduced and/or killed as the liner continues on its doomed voyage, Shari must chose between eternity as a living dead sex slave or a frigid grave at the bottom of the ocean.</td><td>A Vampire's Lust is Unsinkable.</td><td>1999-01-01</td><td>/91p8xU2nykmw8psADIJOlBLdlXK.jpg</td><td>8.075</td><td>10</td><td>3.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>22007</td><td>Train</td><td>Train</td><td>en</td><td>After a night of wild partying and missing their train, the group of students is invited to board another which happens to be heading their way. Once on board, members of the team begin to go missing, and their would-be saviors claim to have no idea what could have happened to them... When they discover the truth, it is too late to escape and they must fight for their lives against their captors to put an end to their ride to hell.</td><td>You're in for a hell of a ride.</td><td>2008-10-16</td><td>/tX2aNiXhvQGE5nuRrSMxxqEQy4n.jpg</td><td>8.073</td><td>141</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6P8ccGV5aOwao9dGixCvAX7PZdK.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>483737</td><td>Totem</td><td>Totem</td><td>en</td><td>A teen must resort to extreme measures to protect her family from a supernatural entity.</td><td>How far would you go to protect your family?</td><td>2017-10-31</td><td>/2eMZjYxEGXS6xj4hRtxBmaPPi3z.jpg</td><td>8.072</td><td>139</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/88AMo7QXZxQ2Zt4BsTeUiGiQ8jh.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>26912</td><td>Quatermass and the Pit</td><td>Quatermass and the Pit</td><td>en</td><td>An ancient Martian spaceship is unearthed in London, and proves to have powerful psychic effects on the people around.</td><td>World in panic! Cities in flames!</td><td>1967-11-09</td><td>/AvruSt4xRIbXO8gVxPzHupbf5A2.jpg</td><td>8.065</td><td>180</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zqnDSm1Bjcqm69DiVo0sRKWCNCg.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction</td><td>123726</td><td>Quatermass (Hammer series)</td></tr><tr><td>31952</td><td>The Vampire Lovers</td><td>The Vampire Lovers</td><td>en</td><td>In the heart of Styria the Karnstein Family, even after their mortal deaths, rise from their tombs spreading evil in the countryside in their lust for fresh blood. Baron Hartog whose family are all victims of Karnstein vampirism, opens their graves and drives a stake through their diabolical hearts. One grave he cannot locate is that of the legendary beautiful Mircalla Karnstein. Years of peace follow that grisly night until Mircalla reappears to avenge her family's decimation and satisfy her desire for blood.</td><td>An erotic nightmare of tormented lusts that throb in headless, undead bodies!</td><td>1970-10-04</td><td>/6MTiYnp62i2kdweHjhchwJscQrj.jpg</td><td>8.065</td><td>139</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kBQ8axJOtcg6pm58E4pL5pCgPuH.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>960149</td><td>Karnstein (Hammer) Trilogy</td></tr><tr><td>327389</td><td>Cigarette Burns</td><td>Cigarette Burns</td><td>en</td><td>With a torrid past that haunts him, a movie theatre owner is hired to search for the only existing print of a film so notorious that its single screening caused the viewers to become homicidally insane.</td><td>NA</td><td>2005-12-16</td><td>/b3kR49rn7ibKf97ki8Pt0Dsf796.jpg</td><td>8.065</td><td>110</td><td>7.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>59</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oWnYyw06o31SlfvZOCJk6gXB178.jpg</td><td>Horror, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>345468</td><td>Contracted: Phase II</td><td>Contracted: Phase II</td><td>en</td><td>Picking up directly where the previous film left off, the story follows Riley, one of the last people to come in contact with Samantha, as he scrambles to track down those responsible for the outbreak before the highly contagious disease not only consumes his body, but the world as we know it.</td><td>Protection is out of the question</td><td>2015-07-05</td><td>/9Dme51DcfLHRwpAzi1wobF6OzqA.jpg</td><td>8.065</td><td>180</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>78</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bQOhQ4Ch6Yjr4gqlwPTeuiAiZtl.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>358930</td><td>Contracted Collection</td></tr><tr><td>380620</td><td>クリーピー 偽りの隣人</td><td>Creepy</td><td>ja</td><td>After having narrowly escaped an attempt on his life at the hands of a psychopath, detective inspector Takakura quits active service in the police force and takes up a position as a university lecturer in criminal psychology. But his desire to get to the bottom of criminals’ motives remains, and he does not hesitate long when former colleague Nogami asks him to reopen an old case.</td><td>That man isn't my father, he is total stranger.</td><td>2016-06-18</td><td>/hWBLD0lzALjp8Q7oKTBu00XPqEZ.jpg</td><td>8.065</td><td>140</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>130</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/i9iDQ3lrW2mZHnSWWCLeefwurXo.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27259</td><td>Long Time Dead</td><td>Long Time Dead</td><td>en</td><td>A group of British students embark on summoning spirits on a Ouija board after a night of clubbing. But someone breaks the link before they have finished and now a demon is trapped in their world and the only way to banish it, is for all the people who summoned it to die.</td><td>Play It To Death</td><td>2002-01-18</td><td>/d2t90uhX9AYzAMX7Xzo2x7Tefpx.jpg</td><td>8.059</td><td>120</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.3102295E7</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kREtb7FbkZ533iECSinvUZ5Oyjs.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>56811</td><td>Cropsey</td><td>Cropsey</td><td>en</td><td>Realizing the urban legend of their youth has actually come true, two filmmakers delve into the mystery surrounding five missing children and the real-life boogeyman linked to their disappearances.</td><td>The Truth is Terrifying.</td><td>2009-04-25</td><td>/mcmJj11lX8v518rvzYb22LlCjAz.jpg</td><td>8.058</td><td>132</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>35456.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cNogdBHu9qY9DQDMlXhJiW5tnD2.jpg</td><td>Crime, Documentary, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>315205</td><td>As Boas Maneiras</td><td>Good Manners</td><td>pt</td><td>Clara, a lonely nurse from the outskirts of São Paulo, is hired by mysterious and wealthy Ana as the nanny for her unborn child. The two women develop a strong bond, but soon Clara discovers a terrifying secret about the child.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-08-04</td><td>/dFGfmI9tIWCpEZbGUhI40uznL1F.jpg</td><td>8.051</td><td>174</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>136</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/p5fSw5IxeSSjE8M8Am1y3woxwvg.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Music</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13094</td><td>Dance of the Dead</td><td>Dance of the Dead</td><td>en</td><td>With Prom only hours away, the usual suspects of Cosa High (Cheerleaders, geeks, bad boys and the happy-go-lucky student council alike) are preoccupied with the annual rituals of teendom. On the night of the big dance when the dead unexpectedly rise to eat the living, polar opposite groups will be forced to unite in their final chance to save the town from the zombies.</td><td>It's their night to come alive.</td><td>2008-10-14</td><td>/bQuGNO5TwgGHENhVLahKcofkZe1.jpg</td><td>8.049</td><td>167</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/a47QIHxJnLLBDnTOwopZ8YBhxfl.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>523</td><td>Requiem</td><td>Requiem</td><td>de</td><td>Michaela, an epileptic, enrolls in college to study education. She goes off her medication and soon begins hearing voices and seeing apparitions that tell her to avoid religious objects, although she is devoutly Roman Catholic. One priest scoffs at the idea that Michaela could be possessed by demons, but a younger pastor arranges an exorcism for the young woman.</td><td>She claimed she was possessed. There was no way to know for sure.</td><td>2006-03-02</td><td>/m42xNNYk3Nxs3xmucuKjl4zSjMc.jpg</td><td>8.045</td><td>68</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/f95HJq5bwa3RsfJySjIR8mP8kPo.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>249391</td><td>Here Come the Munsters</td><td>Here Come the Munsters</td><td>en</td><td>The Munsters come to America to search for Herman's brother-in-law Norman Hyde, only to find out that he has turned himself into Brent Jekyll, who is running for congress, and Grandpa must make a formula to change Norman back.</td><td>NA</td><td>1995-01-11</td><td>/plJGBsnqEFPGcnUG462JR5Fiuhi.jpg</td><td>8.04</td><td>16</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/y1ec3a5iFycRMJE0q03sizQfOpc.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Family, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>37629</td><td>エンゼルコップ</td><td>Angel Cop</td><td>ja</td><td>In the late twentieth century, the Secret Security Force was formed to stop the actions of the communist terrorist group known as the Red May. Angel, a beautiful, yet cold woman, has recently joined the small anti-terrorist group. But her first mission will be a true test of skill, for members of the Red May are being found dead, murdered by gruesome methods. Who is causing these murders? And why? Written by Chuck \"Dark-Side\" Williamson</td><td>In a nightmare future, violence is the only law</td><td>1989-09-01</td><td>/pNfLYNE5U2tvJidhmsX2nY6LXZY.jpg</td><td>8.039</td><td>12</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>180</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Animation, Crime, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>18029</td><td>Dying Breed</td><td>Dying Breed</td><td>en</td><td>An extinct species, the Tasmanian tiger.\n",
