ion of one of their number involves another altogether more shocking crime. That of a young girl raped and murdered on the same stretch of highway. As one urban legend trumps another, the scared passengers must sort out the facts of both cases before vengeful justice from beyond the grave can be meted out with moody atmosphere, ghostly thrills and supernatural suspense.</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-08-25</td><td>/wHjyhqP4v9srcV5mKYNvfHEnJsM.jpg</td><td>8.037</td><td>85</td><td>4.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6n7CdcIjG4aArhpIQpcHTYl5L6k.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>43950</td><td>Amer</td><td>Amer</td><td>fr</td><td>Ana is confronted with body and desire at three key moments of her life. As a young girl, she brings her dead grandpa back to life. In her puberty, she discovers the power of decay and sexuality. Finally, she wrestles with loss and loneliness when she returns to her parental home, now derelict.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-09-23</td><td>/93XYVtdMvk05WLvjGs5qeyHtFVL.jpg</td><td>8.035</td><td>114</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8pUYTsli5sZd5fsCDqCDEYqvbSQ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>50204</td><td>Burke & Hare</td><td>Burke & Hare</td><td>en</td><td>Two 19th-century opportunists become serial killers so that they can maintain their profitable business supplying cadavers to an anatomist.</td><td>No Job Too Small. No Body Too Big. No Questions Asked.</td><td>2010-10-29</td><td>/gcSbKn6T4JGnaotGD91OMysDyEU.jpg</td><td>8.034</td><td>392</td><td>6.1</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>4791599.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7O93QBu5WanrFA73VdqyNgHM3M6.jpg</td><td>Comedy, History, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1006437</td><td>The Area 51 Incident</td><td>The Area 51 Incident</td><td>en</td><td>An outbreak occurs in the infamous Area 51 leading a group of survivors to an underground bunker.. only to learn.. they are not alone.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-11-01</td><td>/6VZjAOaFmSnQgyjsATWTPw0c1yM.jpg</td><td>8.029</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>In Production</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>60159</td><td>ガメラ3 邪神＜イリス＞覚醒</td><td>Gamera 3: Revenge of Iris</td><td>ja</td><td>With the Gyaos re-emerging, Gamera's ties to humanity have been severed with his bond to Asagi broken. Nagamine and Asagi investigate while an orphaned girl named Ayana discovers a new creature she names Iris. Nagamine and Asagi must reach Ayana before she takes her revenge on Gamera, who she blames for the death of her family.</td><td>I will not forgive Gamera</td><td>1999-03-06</td><td>/lbuXsx8SCGPHpbdKQyMevXUYlZD.jpg</td><td>8.026</td><td>96</td><td>7.6</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7Ul9qKUBpRww25lHdcP1Y9qJ7CF.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>657313</td><td>Gamera (Heisei) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>360551</td><td>검은 사제들</td><td>The Priests</td><td>ko</td><td>To save a girl in danger, a priest and deacon jump into a mysterious case.</td><td>HE is always here.</td><td>2015-11-05</td><td>/mcgvjr9Sb3niTOStwFKWBlPBbyn.jpg</td><td>8.023</td><td>75</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>3.69E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pnpgIdBIeOXcwQcbk71L1RFPv17.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>9306</td><td>The Island of Dr. Moreau</td><td>The Island of Dr. Moreau</td><td>en</td><td>A shipwrecked sailor stumbles upon a mysterious island and is shocked to discover that a brilliant scientist and his lab assistant have found a way to combine human and animal DNA—with horrific results.</td><td>The gates of hell are unlocked.</td><td>1996-08-23</td><td>/hOJeQXve8W9rNRhdgC1WV3GQJyA.jpg</td><td>8.017</td><td>433</td><td>4.8</td><td>4.0E7</td><td>4.9627779E7</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/n5hkgbRtScKgUxvh17NQDH1ps2U.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12683</td><td>Alone in the Dark 2</td><td>Alone in the Dark 2</td><td>en</td><td>When the night falls, and the creatures of the dark are crawling out of the shadows, there is only one man who stands between us and evil: Edward Carnby.</td><td>Evil Returns</td><td>2008-09-01</td><td>/dGKQoqyYnleFrz3DIBANG00QccO.jpg</td><td>8.013</td><td>75</td><td>3.8</td><td>4600000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/v3mBCWQpbTCL8S6dHTJinUfo0or.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>149704</td><td>Alone in the Dark Collection</td></tr><tr><td>812320</td><td>Slapface</td><td>Slapface</td><td>en</td><td>A boy deals with the loss of his mother by creating a relationship with a dangerous monster.</td><td>Where do monsters come from?</td><td>2022-04-21</td><td>/xFR5TrTfhjaKN2z17rP09hoQXXs.jpg</td><td>8.013</td><td>13</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hp34FQVZrOkEGSokJYerwfv9QDN.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>506600</td><td>Фото на память</td><td>Deadly Still</td><td>ru</td><td>A group of friends decide to spend a weekend together at a country house, but an unexpected accident forces them to stop at a strange and remote estate.  In this abandoned and eerie place, a rare antique camera is discovered.  Slowly the camera draws them into a mystical and tragic chain of events that none of them could have seen coming.  Anyone who has their picture taken by the camera sees a photo revealing their death.  Many of them lose their lives in excruciating ways, as they race to solve the mystery of the camera.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-06-14</td><td>/caHVolk6foU5MIqVc78twGbv3Pg.jpg</td><td>8.012</td><td>39</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8Pa0Ls6AeaEPoc59aHp8iSu9IuT.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>83900</td><td>Livide</td><td>Livid</td><td>fr</td><td>It's young Lucy's first day as a trainee in-house caregiver. She visits Mrs Jessel, an old woman who lies in cerebral coma, by herself, in her large desolate house. Learning by accident that Mrs Jessel, a former dance teacher of repute, supposedly possesses a treasure somewhere in the house, Lucy and friends William and Ben decide to search the house in the hope of finding it. At night, they get into the house, which reveals itself to be increasingly peculiar. Their hunt for Mrs Jessel's treasure leads them into a horrifying supernatural series of events that will change Lucy forever..</td><td>NA</td><td>2011-12-06</td><td>/nG9pHct881ZzEBzxAHY5hkLa2Cn.jpg</td><td>8.011</td><td>176</td><td>5.8</td><td>5000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/44Bd2YA5fGIue4jB2GLFUpGd6wH.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24194</td><td>TerrorVision</td><td>TerrorVision</td><td>en</td><td>A family's new satellite TV system starts receiving signals from another planet, and soon it becomes the passageway to an alien world.</td><td>People of Earth, your planet is about to be destroyed...  We're terribly sorry for the inconvenience.</td><td>1986-02-14</td><td>/9s9s2VchHi4gAiVGfFkrQyQLTzH.jpg</td><td>8.01</td><td>151</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>320256.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yQIEl9eYMgQ7BKv0wkISJmC38GM.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>18990</td><td>The Mummy</td><td>The Mummy</td><td>en</td><td>One by one the archaeologists who discover the 4,000-year-old tomb of Princess Ananka are brutally murdered. Kharis, high priest in Egypt 40 centuries ago, has been brought to life by the power of the ancient gods and his sole purpose is to destroy those responsible for the desecration of the sacred tomb. But Isobel, wife of one of the explorers, resembles the beautiful princess, forcing the speechless and tormented monster to defy commands and abduct Isobel to an unknown fate.</td><td>Torn from the tomb to terrify the world!</td><td>1959-08-01</td><td>/w3XEtgi8W9tuPQnLVFCPVxtweyC.jpg</td><td>8.007</td><td>175</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qmdv0scvyQWmIESSMmGBqptAZmn.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>138965</td><td>The Mummy (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>21930</td><td>大怪獣ガメラ</td><td>Gamera, the Giant Monster</td><td>ja</td><td>A nuclear explosion in the far north unleashes Gamera, the legendary flying turtle, from his sleep under the ice. In his search for energy, Gamera wreaks havoc over the entire world, and it's up to the scientists, assisted by a young boy with a strange sympathic link to the monster, to put a stop to Gamera's rampage.</td><td>Striking down jets, grabbing hold of the Tokyo Tower, flying through the air breathing fire, the giant monster of the century!</td><td>1965-11-27</td><td>/iwjp6qJaWNGOLDU9zzar0SMcPjl.jpg</td><td>8.001</td><td>86</td><td>6.1</td><td>360000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>79</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/af2NRHoBUNKrPTQCBQ33yuv4Mw8.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>161766</td><td>Gamera (Showa) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>18274</td><td>Frogs</td><td>Frogs</td><td>en</td><td>Jason Crockett is an aging, grumpy, physically disabled millionaire who invites his family to his island estate for his birthday celebration. Pickett Smith is a free-lance photographer who is doing a pollution layout for an ecology magazine. Jason Crockett hates nature, poisoning anything that crawls on his property. On the night of his birthday the frogs and other members of nature begin to pay Crockett back.</td><td>A tidal wave of slithering, slimy horror devouring, destroying all in its path!</td><td>1972-03-10</td><td>/dF2OlQBMJiggzkjhfaNfx7HzBOU.jpg</td><td>7.999</td><td>98</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qriQFReOySCqxEbAPHIW4BNNYFk.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>32595</td><td>Howling III: The Marsupials</td><td>Howling III: The Marsupials</td><td>en</td><td>A strange race of human-like marsupials appear suddenly in Australia, and a sociologist who studies these creatures falls in love with a female one. Is this a dangerous combination?</td><td>Just When You Thought It Was Safe To Go Down Under</td><td>1987-05-15</td><td>/jzYXHaEe8fnOXC3kn2SZnv2Dv2h.jpg</td><td>7.997</td><td>89</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jpotu1e5Txk5WR5YwgazWLuQAXi.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>174218</td><td>The Howling Collection</td></tr><tr><td>29514</td><td>Due occhi diabolici</td><td>Two Evil Eyes</td><td>en</td><td>Two horror segments based on Edgar Allan Poe stories set in and around the city of Pittsburgh. \"The Facts in the Case of M. Valdemar\" concerns a cheating wife who is trying to scam her dying husband out of millions by having her doctor/hypnotist lover hypnotize the geezer into signing his dough over to her. The old man dies while under hypnosis and is stuck in the limbo between the here and the hereafter. The door to the physical world is opened and the undead attempt to enter it. \"Black Cat\" is the story of Rodd Usher, an alcoholic photographer/artist, who descends into madness after he kills a stray cat that his live-in girlfriend Annabelle brings home. One murder leads to another, and the complex cover-ups begin.</td><td>When I Wake You... You'll Be Dead.</td><td>1990-01-25</td><td>/zVWaQfaSZ7AWE0XqbMT57szVmXo.jpg</td><td>7.994</td><td>204</td><td>6.1</td><td>9000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>120</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/e6yM5sAi6mMbkChMaJz91KSusBJ.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>34592</td><td>ZMD: Zombies of Mass Destruction</td><td>ZMD: Zombies of Mass Destruction</td><td>en</td><td>An idyllic island town is under attack by that most invasive of pests: zombies! Port Gamble is being overrun with braineaters, and the people seem powerless to stave them off. But wait, a rag tag band of rebels is trying to turn the tide and push the invading hordes of undead back.</td><td>They're just like you ... only dead</td><td>2010-01-29</td><td>/3K80OoyUb93qhx5jMUsNuKlV3IT.jpg</td><td>7.993</td><td>69</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>457491</td><td>Alien: Covenant - Prologue: The Crossing</td><td>Alien: Covenant - Prologue: The Crossing</td><td>en</td><td>Aboard a hijacked Engineer vessel, Dr. Shaw repairs David as they make their way to the home-world of the Engineers, whom Shaw believes are humanity’s creators.  'The Crossing' is an official prologue short to 'Alien: Covenant', revealing what happened to crew members Dr. Elizabeth Shaw and the synthetic David after the events of 'Prometheus'.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-04-26</td><td>/v3FHoZB5ExWuILuV3Fy00XRuoqD.jpg</td><td>7.985</td><td>100</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>3</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3Fpc9qVGmnXob8WYbTz7ZI3IXqB.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>697022</td><td>Alien: Covenant Short Film Collection</td></tr><tr><td>522438</td><td>6-Headed Shark Attack</td><td>6-Headed Shark Attack</td><td>en</td><td>What is supposed to be a marriage boot camp on a remote island turns into the ultimate test for survival when a 6-headed shark starts attacking the beach. Trapped with minimal weapons they try to fight off the shark, but quickly discover that no one is safe in the water or on land.</td><td>DON'T MIX WITH THE SIX!</td><td>2018-08-18</td><td>/fS37m9pRBG0QYTeCEtzNBVVVL3H.jpg</td><td>7.985</td><td>46</td><td>4.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bNzoLfbNXNDoNkIZTHAI6pX9ucN.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie</td><td>494838</td><td>2-Headed Shark Attack Collection</td></tr><tr><td>391975</td><td>2 Lava 2 Lantula!</td><td>2 Lava 2 Lantula!</td><td>en</td><td>When an unprecedented amount of sinkholes erupt all over Florida, a new nest of fire spitting LAVALANTULAS is awakened… wreaking their fiery havoc all over the sunshine state.</td><td>Fire Burns... Lava Bites Again!</td><td>2016-08-06</td><td>/e2cFhdk9SVthl6JuUHqSLpY5gME.jpg</td><td>7.984</td><td>67</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gLh2g4Ue4NBrVwXm2uTHBDtvF90.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>439596</td><td>Lavalantula Collection</td></tr><tr><td>515908</td><td>Morto Não Fala</td><td>The Nightshifter</td><td>pt</td><td>Stênio, the nightshifter of a morgue, has the ability to communicate with the cadavers that are brought to him every night.</td><td>The dead don't speak</td><td>2019-10-10</td><td>/tTSt1gKXu1ttBVPAsH9Tl05qEyQ.jpg</td><td>7.977</td><td>84</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5A4AJohV1pVgg4I84CZUR5AveRV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>42466</td><td>Scream Blacula Scream</td><td>Scream Blacula Scream</td><td>en</td><td>After a dying Voodoo queen chooses an adopted apprentice as her successor, her true heir is outraged. Seeking revenge, he buys the bones of Blacula the vampire off of a dealer, and uses voodoo to bring the vampire back to do his bidding. In turn, Blacula turns him into a vampire and makes him his slave. Meanwhile, a police officer with a large collection of African antiques and an interest in the occult investigates the murders caused by Blacula and his vampire horde.</td><td>The black prince of shadows stalks the earth again!</td><td>1973-06-27</td><td>/fNj2dm4YTboK73uNcctP9ABzl6i.jpg</td><td>7.975</td><td>45</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1Y0aFQ24W3BEWnKO9lqGDIRMO08.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>201930</td><td>Blacula Collection</td></tr><tr><td>129743</td><td>アナザー</td><td>Another</td><td>ja</td><td>After a chain of deaths at a junior high school, new transfer student Koichi Sakakibara turns to a mysterious girl who holds the key to the dark mystery.</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-08-04</td><td>/1j4LnkVNlY6v450X19Nx6eSlecj.jpg</td><td>7.975</td><td>40</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>5588517.0</td><td>109</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/36H08rUqY2pzQZOV4R1EtGtpUBN.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27425</td><td>盲獣</td><td>Blind Beast</td><td>ja</td><td>A blind sculptor kidnaps an artists’ model and imprisons her in his warehouse studio – a shadowland of perverse monuments to the female form. Here a deranged passion play of sensual and sexual obsession is acted out in world where sight is replaced by touch.</td><td>NA</td><td>1969-01-25</td><td>/8uhHS2yhCCMfa4p00VBrbT2GK05.jpg</td><td>7.973</td><td>61</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pdEfYMfnsCfxwEnsnMBf3H0A9Cf.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>86759</td><td>Rosewood Lane</td><td>Rosewood Lane</td><td>en</td><td>Radio talk show therapist Sonny Blake moves back to her childhood home on seemingly idyllic Rosewood Lane after her alcoholic father dies. But upon arrival in the old neighborhood, Sonny discovers her neighbors are terrified of the local paperboy. She thinks this is ridiculous, until she encounters the boy himself. It turns out that he is a cunning and dangerous sociopath, one who may have gruesomely killed her father - and others.</td><td>Evil dwells in the most unlikely places</td><td>2011-10-15</td><td>/7iv2Akvi4kO0taSUL0ujewgLJ0l.jpg</td><td>7.973</td><td>80</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fX0b3Q9fM8knq1DgyLumYVbrYa1.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10824</td><td>Candyman: Farewell to the Flesh</td><td>Candyman: Farewell to the Flesh</td><td>en</td><td>The Candyman moves on to New Orleans and starts his horrific murders once more. This time, his intended victim is a school teacher. Her father was killed by the Candyman, and brother wrongly accused of the murders.</td><td>Evil comes when you call his name.</td><td>1995-03-17</td><td>/2rQ6q7PjHrMQALXpPl7ExhQIvb4.jpg</td><td>7.971</td><td>275</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.3940383E7</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5UzXIBh94vmTFHzIBiQZT6WhpOk.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>98580</td><td>Candyman Collection</td></tr><tr><td>27303</td><td>Hideaway</td><td>Hideaway</td><td>en</td><td>Hatch Harrison, his wife, Lindsey, and their daughter, Regina, are enjoying a pleasant drive when a car crash leaves wife and daughter unharmed but kills Hatch. However, an ingenious doctor, Jonas Nyebern, manages to revive Hatch after two lifeless hours. But Hatch does not come back unchanged. He begins to suffer horrible visions of murder -- only to find out the visions are the sights of a serial killer.</td><td>He was bought back from the dead... but he didn't come back alone.</td><td>1995-03-03</td><td>/cYWjgxgIJrak0BTemkij3gOCbMa.jpg</td><td>7.971</td><td>110</td><td>5.2</td><td>1.5E7</td><td>1.2201255E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wDjVua7LmH2yR3fhV2d2oNtrb9G.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>639247</td><td>Dreamkatcher</td><td>Dreamkatcher</td><td>en</td><td>Gail is forced to come to terms with Josh, her new stepson, at a remote country home. After stealing an evil talisman from a mysterious neighbor, Josh has sinister dreams of his dead mother, who commands Josh to murder Gail. When Josh's dad returns, he and Gail suspect that their son has been possessed by an ancient, bloodthirsty spirit. Is it too late to save Josh's life — or their own?</td><td>Let the nightmare begin.</td><td>2020-06-24</td><td>/nD6Vb3qotU1v4J4757OFh5TJ76I.jpg</td><td>7.964</td><td>88</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8Muyk9qcGxdMgQXxsBWMGlu7WIy.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24922</td><td>伊波拉病毒</td><td>Ebola Syndrome</td><td>cn</td><td>A restaurant employee wanted for murder contracts Ebola by raping a woman in South Africa and starts an outbreak there and in Hong Kong when he returns home.</td><td>NA</td><td>1996-06-15</td><td>/8IFSby8dNp6g9gcuDirPsAhGb7i.jpg</td><td>7.962</td><td>79</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ya0MidWbehZZSpup00bTy8Id4II.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Crime, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>734353</td><td>Anything for Jackson</td><td>Anything for Jackson</td><td>en</td><td>A bereaved Satanist couple kidnap a pregnant woman so they can use an ancient spellbook to put their dead grandson's spirit into her unborn child, but they end up summoning more than they bargained for.</td><td>Fear your elders</td><td>2020-04-04</td><td>/r8C0eUGpqiJZqoU84UjXAMS474B.jpg</td><td>7.957</td><td>153</td><td>7.0</td><td>250000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xo0bsMDMKvwxHzI1HWMSW5wXAbP.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>37526</td><td>The Dentist 2</td><td>The Dentist 2</td><td>en</td><td>Dr. Feinstone escapes from the mental hospital where he has been held ever since his wife's adultery sent him on a deranged killing spree. Hoping to resume a normal life, he makes his way to a quiet Midwestern town and establishes himself in a new practice under an assumed name. Things are starting to look up for Dr. 'Caine' – that is, until the day he catches his new love in the arms of someone else. As before, the impact of romantic betrayal sends him over the edge into madness and murder, with his unfortunate patients once again bearing the brunt of his hostility.</td><td>Brace yourself!</td><td>1998-12-11</td><td>/zJ399sCWAxEYa4SETUCBXlBLohZ.jpg</td><td>7.952</td><td>93</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/f3pm84Q7kifwxiycmcm5fC0Fvyy.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>117952</td><td>The Dentist Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10900</td><td>Surveillance</td><td>Surveillance</td><td>en</td><td>An FBI agent tracks a serial killer with the help of three of his would-be victims - all of whom have wildly different stories to tell.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-02-08</td><td>/8CYX53rLeRonQjJOKyHkwAwBIWD.jpg</td><td>7.951</td><td>259</td><td>5.9</td><td>3500000.0</td><td>1138322.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iExOE5nfduuD1rL1flHBhkCffxp.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10263</td><td>Tamara</td><td>Tamara</td><td>en</td><td>Tamara, an unattractive girl who is picked on by her peers, returns after her death as a sexy seductress to enact revenge.</td><td>Revenge has a killer body.</td><td>2005-05-12</td><td>/qvwl9p8UOKeRqVZaVCukFKj9zkf.jpg</td><td>7.94</td><td>200</td><td>5.2</td><td>4750000.0</td><td>206871.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/15hayhWcHumj1jywchgqERBQ98h.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>436494</td><td>Feral</td><td>Feral</td><td>en</td><td>A wild animal attacks six medical students on a weekend hike in the woods. One by one, they become infected with a “feral disease,” turning them into rabid, bloodthirsty creatures, and the vacation becomes a nightmare as they fight to survive each other.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-05-25</td><td>/vZ72SsxEP9XSx3StaazsMwBi9C0.jpg</td><td>7.937</td><td>135</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pfSHa3TBpQ9NNS7VVsybTWT8Um6.jpg</td><td>Action, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24116</td><td>The Skeptic</td><td>The Skeptic</td><td>en</td><td>After the mysterious death of his Aunt, a confirmed skeptic lawyer, Bryan Becket, dismisses reports that her house is haunted and moves in. Immediately occurrences begin he cannot explain. And beyond the occurrences there is something about the house which gnaws at Becket - some strange connection he senses he has with the house's past. Soon, the haunting turns personal.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-05-01</td><td>/x7K5DIDhCwqDD9VIMVCMdDld9pK.jpg</td><td>7.936</td><td>77</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>205585.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bAAQfyzJ3bfa3XPRzQrnJKO4L4g.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>420950</td><td>Seuls</td><td>Alone</td><td>fr</td><td>Five kids wake up in a world where everybody has disappeared.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-02-08</td><td>/6VjlQBcM5573XopM07a07dsI6BM.jpg</td><td>7.935</td><td>453</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4DdYcU8JplSPIgtfstqLQLvkQRk.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>26690</td><td>The Boston Strangler</td><td>The Boston Strangler</td><td>en</td><td>Boston is being terrorized by a series of seemingly random murders of women. Based on the true story, the film follows the investigators path through several leads before introducing the Strangler as a character. It is seen almost exclusively from the point of view of the investigators who have very few clues to build a case upon.</td><td>Why did 13 women willingly open their doors to the Boston Strangler?</td><td>1968-10-08</td><td>/hIVMUQf80zT4PyTMmXA1LXUzmBF.jpg</td><td>7.934</td><td>160</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>116</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h8SB3XrmiwMoKlOnVbWW2Y2OyX6.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>32146</td><td>Body Parts</td><td>Body Parts</td><td>en</td><td>A criminal psychologist loses his arm in a car crash, and becomes one of three patients to have their missing limbs replaced by those belonging to an executed serial killer. One of them dies violently, and disturbing occurrences start happening to the surviving two.</td><td>The transplant was a success. Then the donor came to take it back.</td><td>1991-08-02</td><td>/8hFSFiLMy0wnyVaaJ4EHFlPD1yf.jpg</td><td>7.934</td><td>94</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/liLneLW1kllqWwjS7Wcku5eCEiV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>119517</td><td>Zombies vs. Strippers</td><td>Zombies vs. Strippers</td><td>en</td><td>The Tough Titty is about to go under after losing a lot of money and gaining no customers. After they bring together their staff for the night to declare bankruptcy and lay offs, little do they know that around them the city is being sieged by the walking dead.</td><td>They want to strip your flesh!</td><td>2012-07-09</td><td>/7MwDJAIXnUWa6SdfLBYu3dbd4dr.jpg</td><td>7.933</td><td>21</td><td>3.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>74</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>2182</td><td>Attack of the Killer Tomatoes!</td><td>Attack of the Killer Tomatoes!</td><td>en</td><td>Attack of the Killer Tomatoes is a 1978 comedy film directed by John De Bello and starring David Miller. The film is a spoof of B-movies. Made on a budget of less than USD $100,000, the story involves tomatoes becoming sentient by unknown means and revolting against humanity.</td><td>Aaargh!...</td><td>1978-10-01</td><td>/cpQFOXpi5OlUnX6g3hLIoe6L7MC.jpg</td><td>7.929</td><td>219</td><td>4.9</td><td>90000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/n8jSLMc8zT2p1rELAUyRCc3VN7B.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>47983</td><td>Killer Tomatoes! Collection</td></tr><tr><td>23382</td><td>Dark Country</td><td>Dark Country</td><td>en</td><td>Two honeymooners rescue a mysterious car crash survivor in the Las Vegas desert. But their decision to save the man becomes increasingly regrettable when he turns on them, forcing the newlyweds to do the unthinkable.</td><td>One wrong turn... into the dark</td><td>2009-10-05</td><td>/w3DE4rxX5vY4ybq08zxQWrmbFaU.jpg</td><td>7.926</td><td>82</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7vEIJNKjOwKoMYYQjJGwju7y6ul.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>952813</td><td>The Legend of Johnny Jones</td><td>The Legend of Johnny Jones</td><td>en</td><td>Born in the New Jersey public housing, the young Johnny Jones (Robert Crayton) in his life has known only abuse and poverty. Pushed over the edge, Johnny Jones suffers a mental breakdown and ignites a killing spree never seen in history, leaving a trail of death and carnage everywhere he goes. While the tensions and the murders only get worse, the city calls Detective Cutchin (Tom Sizemore) to solve the case and bring Johnny Jones to justice.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-10-01</td><td>/asoj65nwA5asHKxcyjeeAGZXOwR.jpg</td><td>7.924</td><td>1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cKxscfbUSsN1crM59yTeKfsWcxx.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>992277</td><td>The Loneliest Boy in the World</td><td>The Loneliest Boy in the World</td><td>en</td><td>After losing his mother, a lonely boy decides to (literally) dig up some new friends, but when they mysteriously come back to life, he’s launched into a series of misadventures as he tries to keep their secret safe from neighbors, classmates and social workers alike.</td><td>They're dying to be his friend.</td><td>2022-10-14</td><td>/eCIxLKavQ5L6gThIwBb6cxAfwav.jpg</td><td>7.92</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>In Production</td><td>false</td><td>/772xT14eWxIgTf5LPSk0eV5BkL0.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28319</td><td>Incubo sulla città contaminata</td><td>Nightmare City</td><td>it</td><td>In a nameless European city, a local reporter and his doctor wife try to escape from hordes of blood thirsty zombies, undead people exposed to nuclear radioactivity, while the military leaders fight a losing war of attrition against the relentless atomic zombies.</td><td>Now They Are Everywhere! There Is No Escape!</td><td>1980-12-11</td><td>/jbOkO2kxxfISyBWPCSKsVJS0MFc.jpg</td><td>7.919</td><td>121</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gBq9B17n023WhHZLxYGQXCwwMs1.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>42149</td><td>The Hand</td><td>The Hand</td><td>en</td><td>Jon Lansdale is a comic book artist who loses his right hand in a car accident. The hand was not found at the scene of the accident, but it soon returns by itself to follow Jon around, and murder those who anger him.</td><td>Nothing Will Prepare You For THE HAND.</td><td>1981-04-24</td><td>/p7IBqO4hA8pN9PQ6lLO333xnQN6.jpg</td><td>7.911</td><td>110</td><td>6.0</td><td>6500000.0</td><td>566736.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/25ambHMixc35CVBZlibnfbMABsF.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16146</td><td>Phantasm IV: Oblivion</td><td>Phantasm IV: Oblivion</td><td>en</td><td>Taking off immediately where the last one ended, in this episode Mike travels across dimensions and time fleeing from the Tall Man, at the same time he tries to find the origins of his enemy, and what really happened the night that his brother died. Meanwhile, Reggie battles the spheres and the undead in a quest to find Mike before the Tall Man can complete his transformation.</td><td>You Can't Go Forward Until You've Gone Back.</td><td>1998-07-31</td><td>/y4OmtbCDouhUhh8OyUbRQzg5B9Z.jpg</td><td>7.909</td><td>145</td><td>5.3</td><td>650000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fPXLDESssAsBrjza3ofSB52ve1D.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>47770</td><td>Phantasm Collection</td></tr><tr><td>425384</td><td>El jinete sin cabeza</td><td>El jinete sin cabeza</td><td>es</td><td>A mute phantom hero takes on skull-masked killers, a disembodied living hand and a corpse that won't stay in its grave. This is the first in a trilogy of horror/western hybrids that also includes the films La marca de Satanás (\"The Mark of Satan\") and La cabeza de Pancho Villa (\"The Head of Pancho Villa\").</td><td>NA</td><td>1957-09-18</td><td>/pH6mHzusE2iHQHWo89cER90s4PH.jpg</td><td>7.906</td><td>7</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Western</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>44811</td><td>Mongolian Death Worm</td><td>Mongolian Death Worm</td><td>en</td><td>When an American oil company sets up an experimental drilling plant out in the vast deserts of Mongolia, they awaken a nest. The deadly creatures begin to breed and spread, devouring everyone in their path. The only person who can stop them is treasure hunter and adventure seeker who spent his life searching for a legendary tomb, fabled to be protected by the Death Worms. He knows he must do what he can to kill the creatures, but stopping these monsters may mean destroying his life's work forever!</td><td>NA</td><td>2010-04-08</td><td>/fNOvpMUSGiwS5hWzSBnLVmkk39n.jpg</td><td>7.905</td><td>49</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ndEREISSg6ZZNi3B3cTMHTclfTd.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>513208</td><td>Itsy Bitsy</td><td>Itsy Bitsy</td><td>en</td><td>A family moves into a secluded mansion where they soon find themselves being targeted by an entity taking the form of a giant spider.</td><td>Fear spins its web</td><td>2019-08-10</td><td>/8PS6uPVN2lFwVeNrEnC3j7sv8ed.jpg</td><td>7.903</td><td>58</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tf1geWymDGdViFf3eOw2xxWQmIV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14255</td><td>Pulse 3</td><td>Pulse 3</td><td>en</td><td>Seven years after the last attack by the \"soulless ghosts\" who haunted the human race twice before, the world is left void of all deadly electronics that almost destroyed it... or so we thought. Living a primitive existence on the outskirts of the city, human survivors are surviving without any trace of technology. That is until 16 year old Justine enters the city and, letting her curiosity get the best of her, opens a working laptop and unknowingly unleashes the most terrifying attack the survivors have ever faced. In a world already torn and without hope, can humanity make it through the toughest struggle of all time?</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-12-23</td><td>/pSiJiDTlkwuqGQL3SoDiFYu2h8p.jpg</td><td>7.901</td><td>50</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3zF8rSCFeDq0EXksmetyeuTPRyY.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>124188</td><td>Pulse Collection</td></tr><tr><td>15021</td><td>La habitación del niño</td><td>The Baby's Room</td><td>es</td><td>Juan and Sonia arrive at a large old house, an ideal place to raise their newborn son. When, one night before going to bed, they check the operation of the monitoring device installed in the baby's room, they discover that someone is sitting next to the crib.</td><td>You will never rest quietly again.</td><td>2006-11-04</td><td>/t5BtCJyju9ltoVUV0VmwKUt5N0S.jpg</td><td>7.898</td><td>126</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nm5nC0vKRHSZZoQuhdmVuEML5kO.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>44247</td><td>The Prowler</td><td>The Prowler</td><td>en</td><td>A masked killer, wearing World War II U.S. Army fatigues, stalks a small New Jersey town bent on reliving a 35-year-old double murder by focusing on a group of college kids holding an annual Spring Dance.</td><td>It will freeze your blood.</td><td>1981-11-06</td><td>/4soFiMOul6GRN889FxfDNAt9Woh.jpg</td><td>7.897</td><td>159</td><td>6.0</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/t74YRirKO9Dj2cqiV3A409XZ1gL.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>573106</td><td>Mata Batin 2</td><td>The 3rd Eye 2</td><td>id</td><td>After her sister died, Alia decides to start a new life by living in an orphanage owned by Mrs Laksmi and Mr Fadli as well as doing social work there. But Alia feels something wrong with the orphanage. Moreover, Nadia, one of the orphanage who apparently also has an inner eyes like Alia, can hears mysterious voices asking for help from all over the walls of the house. Alia and Nadia open a mysterious locked room. Since then disasters begin. It turns out that Alia and Nadia had made a big mistake and releases Darmah, a vengeful spirit that was deliberately locked in the room. Together with Mrs Windu, the paranormal and mentor of her inner eyes, Alia must confront Darmah and save the orphanage.</td><td>Fear The Dead</td><td>2019-01-11</td><td>/mdvdjOf3cNEX1dZAbYGQTjTth2X.jpg</td><td>7.897</td><td>29</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>115</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uTbPhjKXiWjRAqmQ5SnX7TKZk7K.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>575778</td><td>Mata Batin Collection</td></tr><tr><td>62132</td><td>Blood Diner</td><td>Blood Diner</td><td>en</td><td>Two cannibalistic brothers kill various young women to make their flesh part of a new special dish at their rundown restaurant while seeking blood sacrifices to awaken a dormant Egyptian goddess.</td><td>NA</td><td>1987-07-24</td><td>/mBCyImai4P4NOGvtc3q95GNRrNm.jpg</td><td>7.893</td><td>96</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gIKm4gzfZzNxaAvNw2xihAh9o3F.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>519018</td><td>Blood Feast Collection</td></tr><tr><td>139933</td><td>Kiss of the Damned</td><td>Kiss of the Damned</td><td>en</td><