r</td><td>102018</td><td>Teke Teke Collection</td></tr><tr><td>81189</td><td>Die Liebesbriefe einer portugiesischen Nonne</td><td>Love Letters of a Portuguese Nun</td><td>de</td><td>16-year-old Maria is forced into Serra D'Aires convent, secretly run by Satanists.</td><td>Satanic lust behind cloister walls...</td><td>1977-03-10</td><td>/9VvhhALJmUfOC5r7Y1eE2eiodWa.jpg</td><td>7.881</td><td>23</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aEZFxWCLF3CUpeZHtIaWvjNKpbN.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29748</td><td>Taste the Blood of Dracula</td><td>Taste the Blood of Dracula</td><td>en</td><td>Three elderly distinguished gentlemen are searching for some excitement in their boring borgoueis lives and gets in contact with one of count Dracula's servants. In a nightly ceremony they restore the count back to life. The three men killed Dracula's servant and as a revenge, the count makes sure that the gentlemen are killed one by one by their own sons.</td><td>DRINK A PINT OF BLOOD A DAY</td><td>1970-05-07</td><td>/3xMrdNnyvYrdJaKq9dWJKkTHGvP.jpg</td><td>7.878</td><td>124</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/k7jof1uh3UcxMVarKpEz5dpJgfs.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>123724</td><td>Dracula (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>718416</td><td>Smiley Face Killers</td><td>Smiley Face Killers</td><td>en</td><td>As a strange wave of mysterious drownings of male college students plagues the California coast, Jake struggles to keep his life together at school. Finding himself stalked by a hooded figure driving an unmarked van, Jake fears he may become the next victim in the killer's horrific spree.</td><td>They only have eyes for you.</td><td>2020-10-29</td><td>/uF2S5BJg418TdpwDSfx5hyTsaHR.jpg</td><td>7.876</td><td>18</td><td>3.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2qV5FvQch2Ix3UP1b2twErd3Zh6.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>614199</td><td>Spiral</td><td>Spiral</td><td>en</td><td>A same-sex couple move to a small town so they can enjoy a better quality of life and raise their 16 year-old daughter with the best social values. But nothing is as it seems in their picturesque neighbourhood. And when Malik sees the folks next door throwing a very strange party, something very shocking has got to give.</td><td>Fear is everywhere</td><td>2019-07-14</td><td>/mkIek8qY0tc8YxSgUs83bkWFihD.jpg</td><td>7.872</td><td>93</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aNRwsM1pZYaD2mXae9p3Ws5iXXS.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>533991</td><td>स्त्री</td><td>Stree</td><td>hi</td><td>Set in the town of Chanderi, Stree is based on the urban legend of Nale Ba that went viral in Karnataka in the 1990s, and features Shraddha Kapoor and Rajkummar Rao in pivotal roles.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-08-31</td><td>/vkbSB8U9uPN18ssXCf8taetBae.jpg</td><td>7.87</td><td>101</td><td>7.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>128</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/f9gUtJtjda7Dy1sw3oJ9yWzjJiC.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1029773</td><td>The Final Rose</td><td>The Final Rose</td><td>en</td><td>A young single mother arrives on a remote island to compete on \"Love at Last\", TV’s number one dating show, and slowly discovers that a mysterious killer is slaying the contestants, one by one.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-10-14</td><td>NA</td><td>7.868</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Post Production</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39868</td><td>Evilspeak</td><td>Evilspeak</td><td>en</td><td>Bullied by classmates, a pudgy military-school student fights back by computer with the devil.</td><td>Remember the little kid you used to pick on? Well, he's a big boy now.</td><td>19