>The Guardian</td><td>The Guardian</td><td>en</td><td>Phil and Kate select the winsome young Camilla as a live-in nanny for their newborn child, but the seemingly lovely Camilla is not what she appears to be...</td><td>Tonight, while the world is asleep... an ancient evil is about to awaken.</td><td>1990-04-27</td><td>/xSlWCbowlxjBLSCOzFgn6asW0FP.jpg</td><td>7.704</td><td>138</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.7037887E7</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8GaYWFNVNXPvsUUGUcgTs8vs1GE.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>59797</td><td>Bad Dreams</td><td>Bad Dreams</td><td>en</td><td>Unity Field, a \"free love\" cult from the '70s, is mostly remembered for its notorious mass suicide led by Harris, its charismatic leader. While all members are supposed to burn in a fire together, young Cynthia is spared by chance. Years later, the nightmare of Unity Field remains buried in her mind. But when those around Cynthia start killing themselves, and she begins having visions of Harris, she may be forced to confront the past -- before it confronts her.</td><td>When Cynthia wakes up. She'll wish she were dead...</td><td>1988-04-08</td><td>/bBAIkVp6fPqnO7PqPdlQzhK0YHZ.jpg</td><td>7.696</td><td>79</td><td>5.7</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>9797098.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hxXngRp1DKhGpsDuZjTAVdTWlWh.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16440</td><td>Tales of the Black Freighter</td><td>Tales of the Black Freighter</td><td>en</td><td>A mariner survives an attack from the dreaded pirates of the Black Freighter, but his struggle to return home to warn it has a horrific cost.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-03-24</td><td>/vpZNACLrZC7EeZc0iCpnCsewZEO.jpg</td><td>7.695</td><td>159</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>26</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/dX93jRQKTtqMV31nP3a28UKCSKi.jpg</td><td>Action, Animation, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>15069</td><td>WΔZ</td><td>WΔZ</td><td>en</td><td>There is something horribly wrong with the bodies found in the dark city streets. Some are mutilated while others have the Price equation (wΔz = Cov (w,z) = βwzVz) carved into their flesh. Detective Eddie Argo and his new partner Helen Westcott unearth the meaning of the odd equation and realise each victim is being offered a gruesome choice: kill your loved ones, or be killed. Before long it becomes clear that the perpetrator has suffered a similar fate and is now coping by seeking a way to solve this philosophical dilemma.</td><td>Would you kill the one you love to save yourself from death?</td><td>2007-05-19</td><td>/bf11TuyZCWUnSDaGxsmq4jBrmwx.jpg</td><td>7.694</td><td>151</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yNlcznKEZWmhZidY5Pd0IMn7fbF.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>68559</td><td>降頭</td><td>Gong Tau</td><td>cn</td><td>CID detective Rockman was sent to Thailand to investigate a case involving the Hong Kong and Thai underground syndicate. During his visit he met a sexy table dancer called Elli, they had a brief but hot steamy affair. Unexpectedly Rockman was ordered to return to Hong Kong. Before leaving he promised Elli he would return. But he never did. Heart broken Elli felt she was deceived. Rockman never expect his affair would bring the worst luck for him and family. Three years later in Hong Kong, when Rockman was busily investigating a murder case one stormy night, a senior policeman was murdered by a most wanted fugitive Lam Chiu. On the other hand, Rockman's wife broke down after their son died mysteriously. All the major newspapers headlined the two cases, saying the murder and the baby's death are related. Frustrated Rockman worked closely with Brother Sum well seasoned detective...</td><td>NA</td><td>2007-05-10</td><td>/bY9nbOTOcZUwa7hyWbs9pfLGFwU.jpg</td><td>7.691</td><td>10</td><td>4.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hiy3Roi24NWFHLaP4VFoMA1bK6Z.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>403643</td><td>Troublesome Night Collection</td></tr><tr><td>18217</td><td>Buried Alive</td><td>Buried Alive</td><td>en</td><td>A college prank at an abandoned house accidentally awakens a frightening spirit.</td><td>NA</td><td>2007-02-07</td><td>/w0ZfCS3dwdPWV6SKr9h5c2C9yJO.jpg</td><td>7.688</td><td>96</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>1558939.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/drk6V6q14u0ksBclhzJ35Q0s3kd.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>55377</td><td>Amityville: The Evil Escapes</td><td>Amityville: The Evil Escapes</td><td>en</td><td>The demonic force lurking in Amityville for over 300 years escapes to a remote California mansion. It encounters a struggling family living together by uncertain means. The beast manipulates a little girl by manifesting itself in the form of her dead father. Soon it will be able to possess her completely... is it too late for a young priest to defeat the demon and end the curse?</td><td>A new home, a new family, the terror returns</td><td>1989-05-12</td><td>/yJeoZK7BIcWESrLkn55vmsYkwcS.jpg</td><td>7.687</td><td>79</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fcJh1gyQSQs5mhmSkSir2745jk4.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>397842</td><td>The Amityville Collection</td></tr><tr><td>506482</td><td>Soy leyenda</td><td>Soy leyenda</td><td>es</td><td>First the atomic war broke out, new machines were made, dead birds appeared. In 1999, a bacteriological warfare began, there were sandstorms and giant locust infestations; the human tissue was transformed and a new being, once legendary, now real, emerged: the vampire. Only Robert Neville, the last man on Earth, remains unpolluted, living in constant struggle with the new inhabitants of the planet.</td><td>NA</td><td>1967-01-01</td><td>/uVslABtSGk5S9I9oZhlVUwbPv1L.jpg</td><td>7.685</td><td>6</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>37</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qenNOHfh8nDfLhIdSyO3mPt731W.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>636891</td><td>Scare Package</td><td>Scare Package</td><td>en</td><td>Chad Buckley is a horror aficionado, and he's lonely. Chad spends his days at his struggling genre video store arguing with his only regular customer, Sam. When an unsuspecting applicant shows up, Chad begins to teach him about the rules of horror and his video store at large, much to the chagrin of Sam. During Chad's on-boarding process, we weave in and out of different hilarious horror shorts, each one geared at a different set of horror tropes. As this new applicant learns the ropes, he begins to suspect Chad of something sinister, but we quickly learn that he may have a secret of his own.</td><td>7 directors. 7 tales of terror.  0 working cell phones.</td><td>2019-10-04</td><td>/1EV8HY2KXavPluOb4TUnnTNTiiY.jpg</td><td>7.684</td><td>93</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>106</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/60w5MmaN69s3FAkKTkbz60EKjQk.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>48669</td><td>Terror Trap</td><td>Terror Trap</td><td>en</td><td>Driving to a weekend getaway, a car breakdown strands young couple Don and Nancy (David James Elliot and Heather Marsden) while passing through a small, rural Louisiana town. Finding the couple on the roadside, the towns inhospitable Sheriff Taylor (Jeff Fahey) tells them therell be no one to repair their car before morning. He directs them to a nearby motel for the night run by Carter (Michael Madsen). Checking into the seedy, rundown establishment, Don and Nancy have no way of knowing how this place deals with outsiders. Badge aside, the Sherriff answers to Carter, as do a gang of twisted, masked kidnappers, torturers, and killers. By the time Don and Nancy realize whats happening, its too late to flee. They must fight to survive the night, or be the next victims of the Terror Trap...</td><td>Once you check in, there's no escape...</td><td>2010-09-22</td><td>/gab9aBrD8fxP2NveitSzOEP4rfV.jpg</td><td>7.682</td><td>48</td><td>5.0</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lIitoSriIAUanELQlMJaJQtJfxL.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>86112</td><td>Vacancy Collection</td></tr><tr><td>30694</td><td>The Resurrected</td><td>The Resurrected</td><td>en</td><td>Charles Dexter Ward's wife enlists the help of a private detective to find out what her husband is up to in a remote cabin owned by his family for centuries. The husband is a chemical engineer, and the smells from his experiments (and the delivery of what appear to be human remains at all hours) are beginning to arouse the attention of neighbors and local law enforcement officials.</td><td>NA</td><td>1991-10-06</td><td>/7QTGL5S0gc72iY28oCDEWB04cFv.jpg</td><td>7.68</td><td>84</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cmtnIYt3l4DgpAAFR5zi4KNnfQN.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>98568</td><td>Enter Nowhere</td><td>Enter Nowhere</td><td>en</td><td>Three strangers arrive one by one to a mysterious cabin in the middle of nowhere after enduring separate life-altering predicaments. Searching for a way out of the woods, frustrated, hungry and battling to stay warm they discover their mysterious connection and realize what they have to do in order to get out of the woods alive.</td><td>Welcome to our nightmare!</td><td>2011-10-22</td><td>/eBWZmjzehYXmVTCsFan9RnzmZ7Z.jpg</td><td>7.677</td><td>161</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/a3g8LjeyreMUwLqamlZHhxrY70r.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>587424</td><td>Infección</td><td>Infection</td><td>es</td><td>Film about an epidemic outbreak of a new rabies virus in Venezuela and a father trying to save his son from contagion.  A Russian man is in Caracas under the influence of the Krokodil drug, when he gets infected with the rabies virus and starts an epidemic of aggressive and cannibalistic beings. Doctor Adam Vargas is in the midst of all this, when he begins a journey within a ravaged Venezuela to save his son from being infected.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-08-11</td><td>/3UtZrXiV7hpf2QvV9qXWoc7LLDX.jpg</td><td>7.677</td><td>154</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vHvEJwTDXFu4E2fC6a1vxdZKHND.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>413100</td><td>Ouija: Summoning</td><td>Ouija: Summoning</td><td>en</td><td>Sara lived a seemingly normal life before she had a Ouija board experience that unleashed a dark spirit. The spirit wants Sara to relive it's tortured past, and compels her to commit murder towards one of her family members or loved ones. Sara resists these threats and tries to stand against the power but she's forced to either watch her loved ones die one after the other, or obey the spirit and kill only one of them herself, as the spirit had done to her own son, long before. Sara must kill only one, and face the regret and pain of committing murder, or watch everyone around her die.</td><td>It has been unleashed. Regret changes nothing.</td><td>2015-01-01</td><td>/2tJH7F4dMp6uGQUV61bNgOxc7dF.jpg</td><td>7.671</td><td>20</td><td>4.3</td><td>150000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>35978</td><td>Pumpkinhead: Ashes to Ashes</td><td>Pumpkinhead: Ashes to Ashes</td><td>en</td><td>He threw their loved ones into a swamp. Now they want revenge... But when a demon does their dirty work, it comes at a price.</td><td>Dead and buried and back with a vengeance</td><td>2010-02-04</td><td>/qN5g3lrljKFEhXAAjAEHQuFfWAo.jpg</td><td>7.668</td><td>67</td><td>5.3</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9ePvWpt1BkPgqkOhDjGXrtFSdJu.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>123256</td><td>Pumpkinhead Collection</td></tr><tr><td>404516</td><td>Let Her Out</td><td>Let Her Out</td><td>en</td><td>Twenty-three years after her hooker mother tried to kill her in the womb Helen remains damaged psychological goods. A mindset that gets worse when she suffers a traumatic head injury in an accident. Awakening in hospital, it’s discovered Helen has a tumour growth in her brain causing her to experience dark visions, disembodied voices and the omnipresence of a strange young woman. Soon, lost in a walking nightmare, in which nothing is what it seems, and her vicious actions barely remembered, it becomes crystal clear that whatever is inside her cracked psyche will stop at nothing to get out.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-08-25</td><td>/ioNGkm4JOzk7FuQ7CojIwTsKzxu.jpg</td><td>7.668</td><td>71</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rolh1jKPxG16EgVLq2KJlHWLtrM.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>47090</td><td>The Pit and the Pendulum</td><td>The Pit and the Pendulum</td><td>en</td><td>Set during the height of Spanish Inquisition. The beautiful and kind-hearted Maria is arrested as a witch when she inadvertently cries out in horror at the public whipping of a child. As Maria’s husband Antonio tries to save her, Torquemada, the Grand Inquisitor, determines to punish Maria with torture for the desire she inflames in him. Loosely based on Edgar Allen Poe's classic short story.</td><td>A bizarre descent into hell from the creator of Re-Animator.</td><td>1991-06-27</td><td>/5aeqRGYuYf5FEV4ENy1iYBFQahR.jpg</td><td>7.665</td><td>89</td><td>5.8</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5DQTIIi4E0sQg6bzKaMfNUwMReP.jpg</td><td>Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>72595</td><td>Jack in the Box</td><td>Jack in the Box</td><td>en</td><td>Find a chair and you can stay, But if you don't you'll go away. The last survives another day... Pop Goes the Weasel. Welcome to Junior's world where six invited guests, trapped in a room, play a deadly game of musical chairs for their lives. Every ten minutes \"Pop Goes the Weasel\" signals the start of another round, and the horrific end of another player. Sit you live, stand you die- this is Junior's simple, twisted rule. Jack in the Box is a gripping study in psychological terror, unfolding in real-time, as Junior's desperate \"guests\" struggle with themselves, and each other, for survival. Seven begin the game, only one will end it. Who will it be? Grab a chair and find out. The answer will shock you.</td><td>NA</td><td>2010-04-12</td><td>/zZeiSLaQTSZRoSRPK27hDxljjvd.jpg</td><td>7.665</td><td>4</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>301325</td><td>#Horror</td><td>#Horror</td><td>en</td><td>Inspired by actual events, a group of 12 year old girls face a night of horror when the compulsive addiction of an online social media game turns a moment of cyber bullying into a night of insanity.</td><td>Death is trending.</td><td>2015-11-20</td><td>/v9pTHwhpSWmPHU8i1pEt9VIG9Kg.jpg</td><td>7.663</td><td>171</td><td>3.5</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/koqX93rQF4xlDTioNDvcqWTjrjx.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>5956</td><td>Joshua</td><td>Joshua</td><td>en</td><td>The arrival of a newborn girl causes the gradual disintegration of the Cairn family; particularly for 9-year-old Joshua, an eccentric boy whose proper upbringing and refined tastes both take a sinister turn.</td><td>The story of a perfect boy who had the perfect plan.</td><td>2007-01-21</td><td>/eujI63zJwdSCi2yzy7wpfjXQajt.jpg</td><td>7.661</td><td>220</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>719968.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/veCjJV6Zk2hRXGfWv73RHca4hAJ.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>20850</td><td>Ilsa: She Wolf of the SS</td><td>Ilsa: She Wolf of the SS</td><td>en</td><td>Ilsa is a warden at a Nazi death camp that conducts experiments on prisoners. Ilsa's goal is to prove that woman can withstand more pain and suffering than men and should be allowed to fight on the front lines.</td><td>The most dreaded Nazi of them all!</td><td>1975-10-01</td><td>/kSB8msWxpqE4YENeKZJqd4CMdWd.jpg</td><td>7.657</td><td>287</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/z992KHHG5Dg5kwbix80bo9JJtjU.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller, War</td><td>123249</td><td>Ilsa, She Wolf of the SS Collection</td></tr><tr><td>551994</td><td>The Shed</td><td>The Shed</td><td>en</td><td>The story of Stan, an orphaned teenager stuck living with his abusive grandfather and tasked with routinely protecting his best friend from high school bullies. When Stan discovers a murderous creature has taken refuge inside the tool shed in his backyard, he tries to secretly battle the demon alone until his bullied friend discovers the creature and has a far more sinister plan in mind.</td><td>Beware the evil within.</td><td>2019-10-25</td><td>/aV9n5MyLZQsoXNfbZG5OOf16IkP.jpg</td><td>7.655</td><td>88</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/y2WqsZYVI0yVdC0hgDmYvzfJzqr.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>648408</td><td>Abigail</td><td>Abigail</td><td>en</td><td>After the death of their infant child, a young couple are tormented by a malevolent, supernatural entity.</td><td>The past never dies.</td><td>2019-11-22</td><td>/3rNWxdsUYDsDxHrEc3OmXZVdKwJ.jpg</td><td>7.655</td><td>4</td><td>7.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>12</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>715370</td><td>Burial</td><