ates</td><td>en</td><td>Two estranged brothers reunite at their missing father's video store to liquidate the property and sell off his assets. As they dig through the store, they find a VCR board game dubbed 'Beyond The Gates' that holds a connection to their father's disappearance and deadly consequences for anyone who plays it.</td><td>Press play... and pray.</td><td>2016-12-09</td><td>/ZK7RJYGVtE6YWq5AsZbVoeHTxM.jpg</td><td>7.559</td><td>155</td><td>5.1</td><td>300000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kpBBPPpcwn9aPwOEr6QRfeRuBNb.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14745</td><td>The Haunting of Molly Hartley</td><td>The Haunting of Molly Hartley</td><td>en</td><td>When teenage Molly Hartley moves to a new town, she's haunted by terrifying visions that may have to do with dark secrets from her past. Something evil lurks just beneath the lush surfaces of her private-school world, and it holds the rights to her very soul. On the eve of her 18th birthday, Molly is about to discover the truth of just who or what she is destined to become.</td><td>Her past is yet to come.</td><td>2008-10-31</td><td>/XSy8BKHIa19yMAt7XyO2s9oIT5.jpg</td><td>7.556</td><td>132</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>15.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hrP03tZLdxiEdkRDqIE3kIWEP29.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>518876</td><td>Molly Hartley Collection</td></tr><tr><td>44932</td><td>Without Warning</td><td>Without Warning</td><td>en</td><td>An alien creature stalks human prey.</td><td>It Preys On Human Fear. It Feeds On Human Flesh.</td><td>1980-09-26</td><td>/hKZ4ZVuHoph9bXZ0v9w9FmM20H3.jpg</td><td>7.555</td><td>89</td><td>5.4</td><td>150000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gwinmVbatxw4jY4jsXrAjCBetsI.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17796</td><td>Freaked</td><td>Freaked</td><td>en</td><td>A vain actor, his best friend, and an activist end up 