><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>32076</td><td>The Believers</td><td>The Believers</td><td>en</td><td>Mourning the accidental death of his wife and having just moved to New York with his young son, laconic police psychologist Cal Jamison is reluctantly drawn into a series of grisly, ritualistic murders involving the immolation of two youths.</td><td>Nothing can stop them, no one can help you. They know who you are.</td><td>1987-06-09</td><td>/wMDOgjHoDdKKj3UNZzjP8AW0wxR.jpg</td><td>7.507</td><td>121</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.8753438E7</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wlu2sDytH49B2Q5pOyO558tjCbW.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28504</td><td>Spider Baby</td><td>Spider Baby</td><td>en</td><td>A caretaker devotes himself to three demented siblings after their father's death. But then money-hungry relatives show up to usurp their inheritance.</td><td>Come into my parlor, said the spider to the...</td><td>1967-12-24</td><td>/60wdF6MWIxxOcBqsqLgrffe6CJ7.jpg</td><td>7.506</td><td>119</td><td>7.0</td><td>65000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/icDYw7BphDSj4OUQH9meWvadphg.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>41419</td><td>Mammoth</td><td>Mammoth</td><td>en</td><td>On a hot summer afternoon in the sleepy town of Blackwater Louisiana, a meteor streaks across the sky and crashes through the roof of the local Natural History Museum. The meteor is actually a spaceship containing an alien life form which animates the museum's partially frozen Woolly Mammoth and begins a rampage. Local authorities and Government Investigators join forces with Frank Abernathy, the Museum Curator, and his father Simon, a B-Movie enthusiast, to bring down the giant mammoth in this alien-invasion flick!</td><td>We hunted it into extinction... Now it's hunting us.</td><td>2006-04-22</td><td>/r6KHt6MXWnLTRZgb9uO6dt0xl3d.jpg</td><td>7.506</td><td>46</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qgykOCD2gj4Hjpv5o0C7bRZ0sbW.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>398588</td><td>Dismissed</td><td>Dismissed</td><td>en</td><td>A straight-edged teacher finds trouble when an honors student is willing to do anything to get an A.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-10-08</td><td>/rMVslLnNSDkIPDnOmPr2CTaqd3J.jpg</td><td>7.504</td><td>242</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/d5fIAGLkC5qheDz0U7qSMkwFaOs.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28055</td><td>Sei donne per l'assassino</td><td>Blood and Black Lace</td><td>it</td><td>Isabella, a young model, is murdered by a mysterious masked figure at a fashion house in Rome. When her diary, which details the house employees many vices, disappears, the masked killer begins killing off all the models in and around the house to find it.</td><td>A Fashion House of Models… Becomes a Terror House of Blood!</td><td>1964-04-10</td><td>/1svQx4zHRjFTwy320O5vk4Re1Hg.jpg</td><td>7.493</td><td>299</td><td>7.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6eW84lUWSJ09OuWTCNOmTY1i2Cm.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>21922</td><td>Sea Beast</td><td>Sea Beast</td><td>en</td><td>In the fishing village of Cedar Bay, terror lies within the water. And now it has surfaced in search of something more substantial to devour than marine life: human flesh. A captain and a sea biologist must wage a terrifying battle against the deadly creatures in order to save mankind from total extinction.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-01-01</td><td>/ta56QLWqHo5G3u9tQw2cS5NEMsF.jpg</td><td>7.482</td><td>32</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/t0GEyPe1hwabsCEdKe1KW5GoIZM.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>1021155</td><td>Maneater Series</td></tr><tr><td>676839</td><td>Animales Humanos</td><td>Human Animals</td><td>es</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-12-12</td><td>/1EPy9y9l94zQyQDnMpcCyzwD4Jp.jpg</td><td>7.48</td><td>58</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5eh3FcbEEK9jyoZr6CApEFwvlwU.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>25834</td><td>Xtro</td><td>Xtro</td><td>en</td><td>Tony's father Sam, abducted by aliens three years earlier, returns to earth and seeks out his wife and son, but Rachel has since been living with Joe and the reunion is awkward. Joe doesn't trust Sam, and Rachel can't quite decide what her feelings are for her two men. Sam is not the same as when he left, and he begins affecting Tony in frightening ways.</td><td>Some extra-terrestrials aren't friendly.</td><td>1982-12-06</td><td>/eLaGTdIHIPoIxm0mdPanmLmXDRF.jpg</td><td>7.479</td><td>156</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jayLkSF1eUPLwk7yxjZJ2HRLbi.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>114915</td><td>Xtro Collection</td></tr><tr><td>26215</td><td>Quicksilver Highway</td><td>Quicksilver Highway</td><td>en</td><td>This film is actually two one hour stories, the first based on a Stephen King story called the \"Chattering Teeth\" about a man who picks up a hitchhiker and the second is based on a Clive Barker story called \"The Body Politic\" about hands that rebel against the body.</td><td>NA</td><td>1997-05-13</td><td>/ktKeyB6yNo81wD60NxZvb7f1nZz.jpg</td><td>7.475</td><td>44</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bMn257wAXIuIDrvtFMxEGSXaRcZ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>612515</td><td>Dark Encounter</td><td>Dark Encounter</td><td>en</td><td>A year after the mysterious disappearance of an 8 year-old girl, we meet her grieving family as they return home from her memorial service in their small town. Later that evening, strange lights appear in the nearby forest and the family is exposed to an inexplicably strange phenomenon that rattles them to the core. The origin of the lights appear to be visitors from another world that seemingly terrorize the family. What they don't realize is that these 'beings' will lead the family to the truth behind the little girl's disturbing disappearance.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-08-23</td><td>/nc18JXQ4yLkClFFJQUYgFahMBhZ.jpg</td><td>7.473</td><td>66</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jzLj7LDbDjk2taHAcC9Geu5jkjQ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>38084</td><td>The Horror Show</td><td>The Horror Show</td><td>en</td><td>Detective Lucas McCarthy finally apprehends \"Meat Cleaver Max\" and watches the electric chair execution from the audience. But killing Max Jenke only elevated him to another level of reality. Now Lucas' family is under attack, his sanity in question, and his house haunted. Aided by a disreputable college professor, can Lucas reclaim his mind, house, and family?</td><td>Go to Hell.</td><td>1989-04-28</td><td>/fVBr6iLWsTwkEwgxH6rUNMj8xTo.jpg</td><td>7.471</td><td>109</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>1738897.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tZcOail3NuHDWUxh77FihNpsnH.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>102782</td><td>House Collection</td></tr><tr><td>27816</td><td>Basket Case 3: The Progeny</td><td>Basket Case 3: The Progeny</td><td>en</td><td>Henelotter up's the ante in the final part of his trilogy by introducing a new member to the family; the potentially monstrous fruit of hideously deformed Belial's loins. With the pair still enjoying relative anonymity and comfort in their new found home (presided over by Granny Roth), things however take a downward turn on a trip to the Georgia Clinic of Uncle Hal, which leads to an encounter with an especially nasty redneck sheriff and his similarly blinkered band of merry men.</td><td>It's Time To Build A Bigger Basket!</td><td>1992-02-21</td><td>/nSh40LxVLIvm4wyATNmS4gq5JMO.jpg</td><td>7.465</td><td>77</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vRTfkvwd1ipzB1G5puN257I7yaU.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>104716</td><td>Basket Case Trilogy</td></tr><tr><td>55890</td><td>Bereavement</td><td>Bereavement</td><td>en</td><td>In 1989, six year old Martin Bristoll was kidnapped from his backyard swing in Minersville Pennsylvania. Graham Sutter, a psychotic recluse, kept Martin imprisoned on his derelict pig farm, forcing him to witness and participate in unspeakable horrors. Chosen at random, his victim's screams were drowned out by the rural countryside. For five years, Martin's whereabouts have remained a mystery, until 17 year old Allison Miller comes to live with her Uncle, Jonathan. While exploring her new surroundings, Allison discovers things aren't quite right at the farmhouse down the road. Her curiosity disturbs a hornet's nest of evil and despair that once torn open, can never be closed.</td><td>There are some evils...so unspeakable...they will scar you forever.</td><td>2010-07-16</td><td>/5Zd0NzvT3x8EhuE5lYMJz5ShcH1.jpg</td><td>7.464</td><td>133</td><td>5.2</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fmPfRSDkdegZ6HHN9yKkHCPwMLQ.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror</td><td>538387</td><td>Malevolence Collection</td></tr><tr><td>49597</td><td>Vampires: The Turning</td><td>Vampires: The Turning</td><td>en</td><td>An American kickboxer in Thailand joins a gang of vampire slayers to rescue his lover from a bloodsucking warlord.</td><td>From the one ... Came the many.</td><td>2005-01-02</td><td>/90sY8r0w8W3gwbP2PdkpD7qF2sT.jpg</td><td>7.461</td><td>40</td><td>4.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/44rup7l7AioBYIN3BuzjFdeG2Z3.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror</td><td>348843</td><td>Vampires Collection</td></tr><tr><td>41848</td><td>The Amityville Curse</td><td>The Amityville Curse</td><td>en</td><td>Five people spend the night in an abandoned house, the Amityville haunted house, and soon find themselves terrorized by assorted ghosts, venomous insects and ghostly apparitions.</td><td>It began with a murder and a hanging. Now, the innocent must pay for the sins of the guilty...</td><td>1990-05-07</td><td>/bGTF4uusklWxN0kBBe3msPKPCrb.jpg</td><td>7.459</td><td>70</td><td>3.7</td><td>750000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2TWYIXG4Bo4bsT7ExD80zfBTTxq.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>397842</td><td>The Amityville Collection</td></tr><tr><td>37529</td><td>The Prophecy V: Forsaken</td><td>The Prophecy V: Forsaken</td><td>en</td><td>In Bucharest, Allison is protecting the mysterious bible, \"The Prophet Lexicon\", where the last chapter about the apocalypse, called Revelations, discloses the name of the Antichrist in its last page. Meanwhile, the evil and jealous leader of the renegade angels Thrones, Stark, forces the hit-man Dylan to kill Allison to get the information about the Antichrist, but Dylan mysteriously feels attracted by the woman, protecting her against the Thrones. Allison seeks John Reigart for help, but Satan tell her that he is interested in the apocalypse to gather millions of souls to Hell. Alone and betrayed, Allison discloses the truth about her origins, while protecting the Lexicon.</td><td>Sometimes the interests of heaven and hell are not so far apart.</td><td>2005-09-06</td><td>/rLZNBe0mow2xbarF3gQJum5PzvW.jpg</td><td>7.457</td><td>59</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>75</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aKy2nQUEiuf6grMvUwz3uXvjq3P.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>9068</td><td>The Prophecy Collection</td></tr><tr><td>16154</td><td>Let's Scare Jessica to Death</td><td>Let's Scare Jessica to Death</td><td>en</td><td>Newly released from a mental ward, Jessica hopes to return to life the way it was before her nervous breakdown. But when Jessica moves to a country house with her husband and a close friend, she finds a mysterious girl living in there who may or may not be a vampire. Jessica's terror and paranoia resurface as evil forces surround her, making her wonder: Are the visions real or is she slipping back into madness?</td><td>Nightmare or sanity... which is which?</td><td>1971-08-06</td><td>/vR8H0KSUYptRjheMjysyidpbPSP.jpg</td><td>7.455</td><td>135</td><td>6.4</td><td>180000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zZaXj91mwktWKlpy6D3CcFarhpH.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17027</td><td>Shuttle</td><td>Shuttle</td><td>en</td><td>When two friends return from a girls weekend vacation in Mexico, they find themselves stranded at the airport. Trying to get home safely, they board an airport shuttle for the short trip. But once their feet cross the threshold of the shuttle, a night that had started like any other turns terrifying, and the ride home becomes a descent into darkness.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-03-08</td><td>/1FZNAJD8hcjzYAMfHL8tIkpNwTZ.jpg</td><td>7.453</td><td>104</td><td>5.3</td><td>2400000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>107</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aIpBYcmf05ivH8xj5mF8Tk6v7uV.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>464757</td><td>Nightworld</td><td>Nightworld</td><td>en</td><td>When former LAPD officer Brett Anderson takes a job as head of security at an old apartment building in Sofia, Bulgaria, he soon begins to experience a series of bizarre and terrifying events. Soon after delving into the building's sinister history and investigate its shadowy owners and past employees, Brett uncovers a malevolent force nestled deep in the bowels of the building that will do anything to be set free into our world.</td><td>The afterlife is darker than you think</td><td>2017-05-29</td><td>/a35L3GnAVEXr8fozEbWcYUcvYEm.jpg</td><td>7.448</td><td>72</td><td>4.4</td><