ruggle to free himself from an evil sorcerer's control in a gripping fight for freedom, friendship and love.</td><td>Everything in this world has its price.</td><td>2008-09-07</td><td>/nCYpa6P6KuBIGmIf7khCLKC91KR.jpg</td><td>7.344</td><td>169</td><td>5.8</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>120</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fJPXCtL9KY5J8WfqwvpzpBio8iK.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16200</td><td>Storm Cell</td><td>Storm Cell</td><td>en</td><td>A brother and sister are torn apart when their parents die tragically in a tornado. While he moves to Seattle to be away from the memory, she devotes her life to studying storms and weather patterns. When she discovers the threat of a powerful series of tornadoes are heading for Seattle, she must convince her brother and the entire city that she is not crazy; and they are in grave danger</td><td>Run For Your Life</td><td>2008-04-26</td><td>/hdfKZzMVyV07kyU30hQbDspsHKc.jpg</td><td>7.342</td><td>41</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6lrMEBk5TNGfag1hg0l602VS0Ck.jpg</td><td>Action, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>61789</td><td>The Hunt</td><td>The Hunt</td><td>en</td><td>Bow hunting enthusiast Jack Hamberg, his eight-year old stepson Clint and former news cameraman Atticus Monroe are on a mission to make a deer hunting video. All that is needed to complete the video is a \"kill\". Jack and Atticus reluctantly decide to trespass onto a nearby property where there may be more abundant prey. Once inside the restricted area, they come upon some frightening realizations. The hunters have become the hunted.</td><td>A great number of hunters - a great number of deer. Statistically something was bound to go wrong.</td><td>2006-03-29</td><td>/xHkUKMzb35kDLFRJ5qMghrd0PXn.jpg</td><td>7.342</td><td>15</td><td>4.3</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Actio