VVNDFshjlbUkS2O.jpg</td><td>7.336</td><td>33</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iOfJGauq9qvfRwWQbwXGoo1OCXT.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>115225</td><td>Children of the Corn Collection</td></tr><tr><td>928015</td><td>Dracula: The Original Living Vampire</td><td>Dracula: The Original Living Vampire</td><td>en</td><td>Detective Amelia Van Helsing is on the desperate hunt for the killer responsible for a string of grisly murders targeting young women. Matters only worsen when all evidence leads to the seemingly untouchable Count Dracula. And when Van Helsing’s girlfriend vanishes, she is forced to question the very existence of monsters in a final showdown with the enigmatic count.</td><td>The classic tale as you've never seen.</td><td>2022-01-28</td><td>/5IEW2ZGKBHrZ1lWZywRVs3pFVyy.jpg</td><td>7.332</td><td>12</td><td>3.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6AV35AE8Pwso6hoZ9LtEePuCW0I.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24789</td><td>Subspecies</td><td>Subspecies</td><td>en</td><td>The evil vampire villain Radu returns to his hometown of Prejnar, after spending years in exile. He steals the precious blood stone which is said to be bleeding from all saints, from his father and kills him. Meanwhile two American schoolgirls team up with a local girl for a work on Romanian culture. Radu becomes attracted to them but runs into trouble when his brother Stephan helps the girls.</td><td>NA</td><td>1991-08-08</td><td>/Aj28ZJNq5zRlCh8UNVqXogPMIwI.jpg</td><td>7.328</td><td>74</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6yfy1KQkBixPxR4fUpm3G6jUKPv.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>103291</td><td>Subspecies Collection</td></tr><tr><td>91549</td><td>The Moth Diaries</td><td>The Moth Diaries</td><td>en</td><td>Rebecca is a young girl who, haunted by her father’s suicide, enrolls in an elite boarding school for girls. Before long, her friendship with the popular Lucy is shattered by the arrival of a dark and mysterious new student named Ernessa, whom Rebecca suspects may be responsible for the rising body count at the school.</td><td>Every girl has her secrets.</td><td>2011-09-06</td><td>/oVoUBnhef1EPTcg7gIOoDUI3Rhu.jpg</td><td>7.328</td><td>117</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>3838.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/v9H1i8oN2c9PPn51MTjdEEi9QSc.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11791</td><td>The Hound of the Baskervilles</td><td>The Hound of the Baskervilles</td><td>en</td><td>When a nobleman is threatened by a family curse on his newly inherited estate, detective Sherlock Holmes is hired to investigate.</td><td>The Most Horror-Dripping TALE EVER WRITTEN!</td><td>1959-05-04</td><td>/gJNscfPsBnQRdIjjdrTIHVCRwvY.jpg</td><td>7.327</td><td>234</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kVZEJSJkcIwNu8zfugHLbcUsbpv.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>294976</td><td>Ouija</td><td>Ouija</td><td>en</td><td>Half-sisters Aileen and Romina, along with first cousins Ruth and Sandra, reunite in Camiguin to bury their grandmother. Accompanied by Sandra's friend, Lucy, the five girls dare to call on the spirits of the dead when they find their old Ouija board from when they were kids. The Ouija board is burned by accident before they are able to finish the ritual, trapping a murderous entity around them. As they begin to realize the terror that they have brought upon themselves, Aileen and Romina's hostile relationship even become more strained, while Lucy's sanity brings a heavy burden on Sandra, and Ruth's boyfriend, Gino, is unknowingly pulled into the danger and horror that await all of them. Confronted by imminent Death, the girls have nowhere to go unless they can identify the spirit and find out where it is buried. It is only by leading the spirit to its buri