td>Botched</td><td>Botched</td><td>en</td><td>Ritchie Donovan is a professional thief whose luck has just run out. The only survivor from a heist that goes terribly wrong, Ritchie is forced to take the rap and is sent to Russia to steal a priceless antique cross locked in a safe on the penthouse floor of a Moscow skyscraper.</td><td>Russian Mafia, insane hostages, twin serial killers... Ritchie Donovan's luck has run out.</td><td>2007-10-04</td><td>/cWW38LAxTGKBeIv9ov1fvSfcYe6.jpg</td><td>7.306</td><td>95</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jtlItXJ2zo3R0CJY4biVfnczye9.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>530157</td><td>Pledge</td><td>Pledge</td><td>en</td><td>Three friends pledge a fraternity that's deadly serious about its secret rituals, turning their rush into a race for survival.</td><td>Few get in. None get out.</td><td>2019-01-11</td><td>/3eol8FnndIY8drMknjUnRCjYaIe.jpg</td><td>7.304</td><td>98</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>77</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aqdjM6chmFlOtt1bzW0uLVIJWan.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>463800</td><td>Firebase</td><td>Firebase</td><td>en</td><td>Set during the Vietnam war, Firebase follows American soldier Hines through an ever-deepening web of science fiction madness.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-06-28</td><td>/e6qVOjp3QKHrA7k2sAbJSlDXkRM.jpg</td><td>7.302</td><td>116</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>27</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pF8WdJq2lzaYpcEgrjNwR9mp0l6.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, War</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>119255</td><td>Gangsters, Guns and Zombies</td><td>Gangsters, Guns and Zombies</td><td>en</td><td>The whole \"zombie thing\" has been hyped up so much that everyone thinks it's the end of the world! Of course, where one man sees the dead rising from the grave, another sees opportunity. Q had a plan: drive the robbery getaway van, deliver everyone to the safe house and get paid - a nice, simple, plan. Unfortunately, life is never really that simple, and to top it all off, this is the first time Q has been a getaway driver. He's coping pretty well though, considering; TONY (the guy who is 'in charge' of the job) is a murderous nut case, DANNY was shot and is now bleeding all over the money in the back of the van, the Sat-Nav has a mind of its own, there's a guy in the back living up to his name \"CRAZY STEVE\", the safe-house already has police at it, and this whole \"zombie thing\" seems to be quickly becoming more of a \"zombie apocalypse thing\"...</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-06-30</td><td>/v6VkEaREnZn6hFMVDj8AHGziX3S.jpg</td><td>7.301</td><td>23</td><td>4.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tyLvYSe1DFua6zvhxu4z1yqcQKx.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28452</td><td>Slugs: muerte viscosa</td><td>Slugs</td><td>es</td><td>People are dying mysteriously and gruesomely, and nobody has a clue what the cause is. Only health worker Mike Brady has a possible solution, but his theory of killer slugs is laughed at by the authorities. Only when the body count begins to rise and a slug expert from England begins snooping around does it begin to look like Mike had the right idea after all.</td><td>They ooze. They slime. They kill.</td><td>1988-02-05</td><td>/rF9PQkZb5UrqHcqx9dwmecRcr8V.jpg</td><td>7.299</td><td>118</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wMfN0ybjTsdWkR7ZfWsJ0SqrYDv.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>434080</td><td>Double Date</td><td>Double Date</td><td>en</td><td>Meet innocent Jim, terrified of girls, and on a reluctant quest to prove his manhood the night before he turns 30. He and his cocky friend Alex think they’ve hit the jackpot when they meet the beautiful siblings Kitty and Lulu, who seem up for anything on a wild party-fuelled night. But little do they know that the femmes fatales want to make Jim lose much more than just his virginity… Getting laid has never been so bloody difficult.</td><td>Paint the town red</td><td>2017-06-30</td><td>/1u51B2HsJRHb38dG5eajgc9uGUY.jpg</td><td>7.298</td><td>52</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gOcE8Z2PvL2tGgKtRTtdYIzK7SN.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>404961</td><td>Ghosthunters</td><td>Ghosthunters</td><td>en</td><td>When one of their own loses his wife and daughter at the hands of a serial killer, a team of ghost hunters is determined to capture the spirits of the loved ones so their spirits can finally rest in peace. But as the team goes deeper into the house, the ghosts become more hostile, and the group discovers the true secrets of the house and its murderer.</td><td>Don't follow too close.</td><td>2016-07-05</td><td>/A5trbZjaureXY7cj7Vpik7upw5R.jpg</td><td>7.292</td><td>57</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4cmxvSNbhMfPP9BVywaYVPVdT6v.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>76681</td><td>Wacko</td><td>Wacko</td><td>en</td><td>Thirteen years after the \"Lawnmower Killer\" killed her sister, high school student Mary Graves and obsessed detective Dick Harbinger are on the lookout for the killer to reappear during the annual Halloween Pumpkin Prom.</td><td>At last! A motion picture made by, for, and about people.... just like you!</td><td>1982-11-12</td><td>/lqvizlTs67bL5N2OwqFxNW8m1Oq.jpg</td><td>7.291</td><td>19</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/siiKOXLZSOB1w8aly3yZ1nHF2T5.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10725</td><td>Wolfen</td><td>Wolfen</td><td>en</td><td>A city cop is assigned to solve a bizarre set of violent murders where it appears that the victims were killed by animals. In his pursuit he learns of an Indian leg