ined at the stomach, are separated, the operation leaves Pim the surviving sister, haunted by Ploy's vengeful ghost.</td><td>We promised to stay together forever.</td><td>2007-03-28</td><td>/vNsCrJSTsSLnldhdpc9koXf2IcO.jpg</td><td>7.091</td><td>164</td><td>7.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>9559978.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h1U4MvMhBGsj3RlA0vrYluBJuUz.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1005772</td><td>Jikirag</td><td>Jikirag</td><td>en</td><td>A pagan village, founded on the bones of both innocent and foul, is deeply rooted within the heart of an ancient Eden. When a balance of flesh and soil decays, the last surviving village elder battles madness and the macabre to save her people from not only themselves, but the monstrous judgement that burrows up from below.</td><td>A pagan horror.</td><td>2022-09-02</td><td>/yhK0h9KTrGSgp0CdsN9UOlg5YQI.jpg</td><td>7.089</td><td>1</td><td>3.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>120</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bUhFtAwSJu3JKWRlLTLrZdAiRkE.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>32250</td><td>呪怨</td><td>Ju-on: The Curse</td><td>ja</td><td>In a jealous rage, a man kills his wife and son in their home, and everyone who visits falls prey to a terrible curse.</td><td>NA</td><td>2000-02-11</td><td>/8jNIhGdA7jEwm4pMcoSNiTnS9W8.jpg</td><td>7.088</td><td>183</td><td>6.9</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>70</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xTtpsP3MsMwcZRGh72PdS2czjAP.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>1972</td><td>Ju-on Collection</td></tr><tr><td>77067</td><td>DeadHeads</td><td>DeadHeads</td><td>en</td><td>Two inexplicably coherent zombies awake amidst a zombie attack and decide to take a road trip to find the one's lost love, unaware they are being chased by the agents of a ruthless company with its own agenda.</td><td>A Road Trip Movie to Die For.</td><td>2011-04-29</td><td>/nQ8goJKYBYC6JrzQC838CVfOqwQ.jpg</td><td>7.087</td><td>81</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0