r Rostov and his assistant Ganin. With each new victim, things are becoming more confused. Suspicion leads Rostov to Olivia, and he decides to turn to her in the hope that her genuine or imaginary ability to summon the spirits of the dead can help to get on the trail of the killer.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-11-07</td><td>/o2Q9kkzkI5LGqP9K7ymmOc9CNRE.jpg</td><td>6.993</td><td>93</td><td>6.7</td><td>7000000.0</td><td>958558.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/odb22pd53XAdk1FvDNKFl0NqKF9.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>40800</td><td>Alligator 2: The Mutation</td><td>Alligator 2: The Mutation</td><td>en</td><td>A giant mutated alligator runs riot in a small town after the sewer system washes it into a lake.</td><td>It crashed out of the sewers... now there's hell to pay!</td><td>1991-12-18</td><td>/lRJgV0tDiGjPLZWvEGySgpleyJk.jpg</td><td>6.987</td><td>48</td><td>4.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jCSBnvHOosWVffi9s3nzZOqwhlV.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>124934</td><td>Alligator Collection</td></tr><tr><td>419548</td><td>Krampus: The Devil Returns</td><td>Krampus: The Devil Returns</td><td>en</td><td>Five years after the murder of his wife and disappearance of his daughter, former police officer Jeremy Duffin is brought back to help in the hunt for a yuletide monster that punishes children that have been \"naughty.\" As the monster becomes more erratic and unpredictable, Jeremy learns the truth about the disappearance of his daughter and the fate that has been bestowed upon him by an unlikely source. Can Jeremy finally end the nightmare Christmas monster that has terrorized this town for years?</td><td>You better be good. For goodness sake.</td><td>2016-10-04</td><td>/ePeedkZX2k38rmBURWV9WKowVlC.jpg</td><td>6.985</td><td>40</td><td>4.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zuNCQqypZG8AVTpuCMKcAkZY9wh.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, 