s never caught.</td><td>1988-05-06</td><td>/6sDHU1B2CuIu2EksFMIFyATTLsw.jpg</td><td>6.844</td><td>53</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uohv1bjTyYSQ1e2q2FfRhb1tSWr.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>363889</td><td>The Funhouse Massacre</td><td>The Funhouse Massacre</td><td>en</td><td>Six of the worlds scariest psychopaths escape from a local Asylum and proceed to unleash terror on the unsuspecting crowd of a Halloween Funhouse whose themed mazes are inspired by their various reigns of terror.</td><td>MURDER IS ALL PART OF THE SHOW</td><td>2015-11-13</td><td>/vKgDw6miuun9ij8H7YSAte7PLZA.jpg</td><td>6.844</td><td>125</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aup58gdd5xZy85TqXkgewtnb6jU.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>167960</td><td>Sanitarium</td><td>Sanitarium</td><td>en</td><td>Malcom McDowell, Lou Diamond Phillips and Robert Englund star in three separate stories set in an eerie mental asylum.</td><td>Locked in insamity</td><td>2013-03-01</td><td>/5GmJJAnNGWMAPdbsZWNvodpQfeH.jpg</td><td>6.842</td><td>63</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>106</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uW2xDlUeQolHw49tvVsXpbfBv7J.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17991</td><td>鉄男II BODY HAMMER</td><td>Tetsuo II: Body Hammer</td><td>ja</td><td>A Japanese salaryman finds his body transforming into a weapon through sheer rage after his son is kidnapped by a gang of violent thugs.</td><td>NA</td><td>1992-10-03</td><td>/w2We4S0SmRP72BKpvtOfyu9cF6H.jpg</td><td>6.839</td><td>80</td><td>6.1</td><td>125000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nHhb8eCVXgIDzZ2BU8DpXBmlZRE.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>182923</td><td>Tetsuo Collection</td></tr><tr><td>279972</td><td>Digging Up the Marrow</td><td>Digging Up the Marrow</td><td>en</td><td>A documentary filmmaker turns his lens on an enigmatic conspiracy theorist who claims he's found the entrance to a vast underground city populated entirely by monsters.</td><td>Believing is seeing.</td><td>2015-02-20</td><td>/xCE04zhX6TSQF1VvViyVTBVqvkr.jpg</td><td>6.837</td><td>121</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3Xcdlmo5GjSSzVVHuyJdtpPSENC.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39899</td><td>Turkey Shoot</td><td>Turkey Shoot</td><td>en</td><td>In the near future, after an unspecified holocaust, survivors are herded into prison camps. There, they are hunted for sport by the leaders of the camp. Paul, one of the newest prisoners, is determined not to go down as quietly as the others.</td><td>Experience The Year 2000...And Hope To Hell You Can Escape!</td><td>1982-03-25</td><td>/837jSfdQYvhqToMPfAGdci6zszG.jpg</td><td>6.836</td><td>73</td><td>5.4</td><td>3.2E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4u4iFWgBifaSIxgk4PTedwtTwp0.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>296503</td><td>Dude Bro Party Massacre III</td><td>Dude Bro Party Massacre III</td><td>en</td><td>In the wake of two back-to-back mass murders on Chico's frat row, loner Brent Chirino must infiltrate the ranks of a popular fraternity to investigate his twin brother's murder at the hands of the serial killer known as \"Motherface.\"</td><td>Don't Let A Bro See It Alone</td><td>2015-06-13</td><td>/9MoZAH9RI6X9npBtklPhceC0ghA.jpg</td><td>6.834</td><td>67</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1QUNfKQJ6ga0YAlpiEArlfBqR8J.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>369202</td><td>Bodom</td><td>Lake Bodom</td><td>fi</td><td>Every camper’s worst nightmare came true at Lake Bodom in 1960 when four teenagers were stabbed to death while sleeping in their tent. As the years passed and the case grew cold, the unsolved mystery turned into an urban legend, a creepy campfire story passed from generation to generation. Now, a group of teenagers arrives at the same campsite, hoping to solve the murder by reconstructing it minute by minute. As night falls, it turns out that not all of them are there to play. Tonight… it’s girls against boys. Let the killing games begin.</td><td>No happy campers here...</td><td>2016-08-19</td><td>/3PZThccJqH2rlkIqaiNWfZO3q2y.jpg</td><td>6.834</td><td>211</td><td>5.3</td><td>1100000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oQIfAd7A8CknhjpTuNpy6QLhK18.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>135368</td><td>The Barrens</td><td>The Barrens</td><td>en</td><td>A man takes his family on a camping trip and becomes convinced they are being stalked by the legendary monster of the New Jersey Pine Barrens: the Jersey Devil.</td><td>The terrifying legend of the Jersey Devil is alive.</td><td>2012-09-28</td><td>/9dTbd20NEgsTDx5glF7dYYAKXKy.jpg</td><td>6.833</td><td>99</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wWtYHBDZZ9eTKyTRkoc9OGTz9N4.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>298096</td><td>The Cleanse</td><td>The Cleanse</td><td>en</td><td>The story of a heartbroken man who attends a spiritual retreat, only to discover that the course releases more than everyday toxins and traumatic experiences.</td><td>We all have our demons.</td><td>2018-05-04</td><td>/wAmCm0pcPFIgzb7FGwfQVVTy2xt.jpg</td><td>6.833</td><td>73</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/s2hiAz6fTGwcrNYwFiu8ZC1mLkv.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27475</td><td>The Slumber Party Massacre</td><td>The Slumber Party Massacre</td><td>en</td><td>An 18-year-old high school girl is left at home by her parents and decides to have a slumber party. Meanwhile, a mass murderer with a propensity for power tools has escaped from prison, and eventually makes his way to the party where the guests begin dropping off one by one.</td><td>Close your eyes for a second... and sleep forever.</td><td>1982-11-12</td><td>/rh65oDy8CNJoEAOf7oudhIt3DM6.jpg</td><td>6.831</td><td>233</td><td>5.6</td><td>220000.0</td><td>3600000.0</td><td>77</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8QCKFcPRVsQmbUaf2MxL3N50LsV.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>138971</td><td>The Slumber Party Massacre Collection</td></tr><tr><td>26962</td><td>Puppet Master vs Demonic Toys</td><td>Puppet Master vs Demonic Toys</td><td>en</td><td>A group of toymakers seek to use Andre Toulon's formula, now in the hands of Toulon's great-nephew Robert, to give life to a line of killer toys that they plan to unleash on Christmas Eve.</td><td>Playtime is over. Now the REAL fun begins.</td><td>2004-12-18</td><td>/pKr5H8GTFouv0t2GqRBmdqJghdJ.jpg</td><td>6.825</td><td>52</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ugUx1mZ8npbBEzapiLxTqZyv4g2.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>264434</td><td>Demonic Toys Collection</td></tr><tr><td>15056</td><td>The Curse of King Tut's Tomb</td><td>The Curse of King Tut's Tomb</td><td>en</td><td>Thousands of years ago, the great Child King Tutankhamen ruled. Few know the details of his life -- No one knows the secrets of his death. All that is about to change.Free -spirited archaeologist Danny Fremont (Casper Van Dien, Sleepy Hollow) is certain that if found, King Tut's Emerald Tablet would hold the power to control the world. Unfortunately, the only one who believes Fremont is his nemesis archaeologist Morgan Sinclair (Jonathan Hyde, Titanic), a member of a secret society who wants the tablet to harness unspeakable evil on the world and will stop at nothing to get it.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-04-11</td><td>/lS8HiWOO7YcezktLKFmBJmitAzo.jpg</td><td>6.822</td><td>36</td><td>5.1</td><td>1.4E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>170</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7Zx029d0X8xN9OSSBtyrmGtx4DH.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>82628</td><td>Alligator X</td><td>Xtinction: Predator X</td><td>en</td><td>When her father seemingly goes missing, divorcee Laura LeCrois is forced to return home after a 20-year hiatus. However, home is not the way Laura remembers it. Her father is in major debt with the bank, her ex-boyfriend is the town sheriff, and her ex-husband has quit his job as a world-renowned professor who is now suspiciously buying up swampland in the area. In an effort to save the swamp and to pass the time, Laura decides to work the dying family business giving boat tours of the Louisiana swamp. But on her first sunset tour, deep in the swamp, Laura and her passengers witness two Bayou swamp rats toss a squirming body into a gator pit, only the gators aren't the ones that feast on the flesh. Instead it's the most terrifying creature Laura has ever seen...(IMDB,com)</td><td>They said it was extinct. They were wrong.</td><td>2010-08-18</td><td>/gBlHqZ4Df9LGZVW35cZzK98opQO.jpg</td><td>6.817</td><td>26</td><td>3.7</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>3127</td><td>The Revenge of Frankenstein</td><td>The Revenge of Frankenstein</td><td>en</td><td>Baron Frankenstein, working under the protective pseudonym Dr. Victor Stein, together with his assistant Dr. Kleve, transplants a dwarf's brain into another body and unleashes a deranged being.</td><td>We Dare You To See It! We Double-Dare You To Forget It!</td><td>1958-06-13</td><td>/iJOBQMX4SaOVfXeXUbi3T3Llb0T.jpg</td><td>6.815</td><td>98</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/loAt9DFDdET7Ano8VvxZ5SHQgPa.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>123720</td><td>Frankenstein (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>10251</td><td>5ive Girls</td><td>5ive Girls</td><td>en</td><td>Five wayward teenage girls are sent to a reformatory and discover they possess unique powers to battle the ancient demon, Legion, which holds thrall over the sinister institution.</td><td>5 Witches. 5 Powers. One Evil.</td><td>2006-01-01</td><td>/9EKL1Ta42cj9rSqopfu3QJFE3G1.jpg</td><td>6.815</td><td>62</td><td>5.2</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9QMbzoO8Xwsjo2Enyvhns6yHDck.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>404713</td><td>Downhill</td><td>Downhill</td><td>es</td><td>Deeply upset by the passing of his best friend, a professional BMX rider accepts to partake in a race in Chile. Everything goes as planned until he stumbles upon a man who is infected by a mysterious virus and becomes the target of local assassins.</td><td>NA</td><td>2016-07-03</td><td>/4tEdLXx2lW3w8SBnsgRyLIwqF0l.jpg</td><td>6.815</td><td>21</td><td>3.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1wZL6gidJ1fsP5lUz3RWG2WVMgk.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>35429</td><td>The Hive</td><td>The Hive</td><td>en</td><td>When ants, displaying never-before-seen behavior, seize an island, the controversial Thorax Team is called in to stop the massive threat, only to discover that the ants are controlled by something beyond this world.</td><td>Death is Their Picnic</td><td>2008-02-17</td><td>/lneplhKpe0ImbZ6WZtbbtMdySxN.jpg</td><td>6.813</td><td>27</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rKpnClqDyYu8QWM07gzUyPqA7xB.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>1021155</td><td>Maneater Series</td></tr><tr><td>59480</td><td>ガメラ2 レギオン襲来</td><td>Gamera 2: Attack of Legion</td><td>ja</td><td>A strange meteor lands in Japan and unleashes hundreds of insect-like \"Legion\" creatures bent on colonizing the Earth. When the military fails to control the situation, Gamera shows up to deal with the ever-evolving space adversary. However the battle may result in Gamera losing his bond with both Asagi and humanity.</td><td>Who will be extinct, Japan, or Legion?</td><td>1996-07-12</td><td>/xPBtoCLUN0raEKywuiSId6SSRAc.jpg</td><td>6.813</td><td>87</td><td>7.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.4E7</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/1ve1TMFBha5Pbp1T81Ro01DmYXh.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>657313</td><td>Gamera (Heisei) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>463364</td><td>The Isle</td><td>The Isle</td><td>en</td><td>1840 and another ship crashes on the rocks of an almost deserted island in Scotland. Three sailors survive the wreck and make it to shore where the few locals take them in as they wait for the mainland boat to come for them. But the sailors' survival story has only just started as they uncover the strange past of the once vibrant island.</td><td>Their song will haunt you</td><td>2019-02-08</td><td>/r4XDWsBWMzpoNm5fUMjr9cyY5rI.jpg</td><td>6.813</td><td>75</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iScbc0y7jeHmJErZyFLTXSyDjKd.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>34312</td><td>Sleepaway Camp III: Teenage Wasteland</td><td>Sleepaway Camp III: Teenage Wasteland</td><td>en</td><td>Psychotic Angela is itching to do what she does best: slaughter dozens of teenage campers. As luck would have it, the previous site of her murders has been renamed and converted into an experimental summer camp meant to bring together privileged and lower-class teens. On the day the youths are boarding the buses to camp, Angela runs over a potential camper with a garbage truck and assumes her identity. Once she has infiltrated the camp, the real terror begins.</td><td>She's back to slash last year's record.</td><td>1989-02-05</td><td>/sSCTJtzT8bhkZTnEqopXDz0Jkob.jpg</td><td>6.807</td><td>157</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.