ly for her child.</td><td>Some secrets should remain buried.</td><td>2021-12-28</td><td>/99PE8haWB7nLky627wJBsWn2awJ.jpg</td><td>6.758</td><td>90</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xHd6rARprd4woZinkziIntiTSZD.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>22135</td><td>Not Forgotten</td><td>Not Forgotten</td><td>en</td><td>Set in a Tex-Mex border town, Not Forgotten is a classic psychological thriller about Jack and Amaya Bishop, a couple who must come to terms with their tortured pasts in order to save their kidnapped daughter. It is a tale taut with intrigue and steeped in Latino mysticism, where the line between what's real and what's imagined becomes hopelessly blurred.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-09-11</td><td>/iDOQjsFzjpZb9o31GXG3fE4QIuH.jpg</td><td>6.757</td><td>67</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vVDEI6hCDSIfFKnBjyGM6qPrrTk.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>40039</td><td>Spiders</td><td>Spiders</td><td>en</td><td>A DNA experiment on a rare breed of spider is taking place on a NASA space shuttle, when a freak meteor shower engulfs the shuttle, causing everything to go horribly wrong. One survivor is found on the ship and watched over in a secret location deep in the California desert. The problem continues, as the survivor isn't alone, as another deadly spiders climbs out of him and goes on a rampage around the ship. Curious reporter Marci Eyre must now survive, escape and warn everyone before the spider reaches outside the desert.</td><td>NA</td><td>2000-01-01</td><td>/k7KU0Lo5eWGApnophGEzEMQm7z8.jpg</td><td>6.754</td><td>67</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eEZTqCtmKGdduQ9pal8BuRG7MIB.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>382113</td><td>Spiders - Collection</td></tr><tr><td>271665</td><td>Deep in the Darkness</td><td>Deep in the Darkness</td><td>en</td><td>Dr. Michael Cayle thought leaving the chaotic lifestyle of New York City behind for the quiet, small town of Ashborough would bring his family closer together. Soon after arriving, however, he discovers the town's deepest secret: a terrifying and controlling race of creatures that live amongst the darkness in the woods behind his home.</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-04-29</td><td>/igJo6txL8k83Y203mJZGkIOD1PU.jpg</td><td>6.754</td><td>68</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/h3m8bmzfiy8k0XSvobVvAN09q2e.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>15711</td><td>The Lost</td><td>The Lost</td><td>en</td><td>A charismatic psycho suspected of killing two innocent campers in a cold-blooded double homicide grows increasingly unstable as his suburban empire starts to crack at the foundations.</td><td>What's the worst thing you've ever done?</td><td>2006-03-11</td><td>/ejIphZdvDN1KMwq3TkyNfaNHz4L.jpg</td><td>6.753</td><td>48</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>119</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>20321</td><td>Doctor Sleep</td><td>Doctor Sleep</td><td>en</td><td>While treating a policewoman for smoking, hypnotherapist Michael Strother has a telepathic vision of a young girl floating beneath the surface of a stream. The escaped victim of a ritualistic serial killer, the girl has become mute, and Michael is called upon by Scotland Yard to unlock the secrets she holds in order to catch a man who believes he has discovered the key to immortality.</td><td>The deeper the sleep. The darker the fear.</td><td>2002-02-01</td><td>/eBRcmhQakzeYPU6AWLP1DtAoLtC.jpg</td><td>6.75</td><td>48</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>108</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ahrY6isV4vfPUzpIF0CO96pjuMw.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28522</td><td>Day of the Dead 2: Contagium</td><td>Day of the Dead 2: Contagium</td><td>en</td><td>In 1968, in the Ravenside Military Hospital in a military facility in Pennsylvania, the army loses control of an experiment of a lethal bacteriologic weapon that changes the DNA and transforms human beings into zombies. A group of soldiers is sent to the hospital to eliminate the infected staff and interns but private DeLuca steals a test tube with the virus and hides it inside a vacuum flask. He is transformed into a zombie and killed but the vacuum flask falls in the grass. In the present days, a group of patients in the mental institution Ravenside Memorial Hospital finds the vacuum flask and later when one of them opens the vessel, the culture tube drops on the floor of a bathroom contaminating the group and their Dr. Donwynn.</td><td>Every Day has a Beginning</td><td>2005-08-10</td><td>/6xemjU8eQmGMhIHJbWmzYa6oP2G.jpg</td><td>6.749</td><td>54</td><td>3.1</td><td>9000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iay8jyeoqckYlL4Q880iiqqDvUw.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>42076</td><td>幻魔大戦</td><td>Harmagedon</td><td>ja</td><td>From the depths of space he is coming... Ancient beyond understanding, his power is immeasurable. He has destroyed half the universe and is on his way here. He is… Genma. Only two people are aware of the imminent catastrophe: Princess Luna, a modern day prophetess and Vega, a cybernetic crusader from a world long since ravaged by Genma. Determined to spare the Earth from a similar fate, Luna and Vega must try to mobilize the most potent psychics in the world. Together, this army of fledging psychic warriors must succeed where billions have tried... and failed. But will they be able to gather their champions in time? Genma’s agents are already on Earth to ensure that their master meets with no opposition!</td><td>NA</td><td>1983-03-12</td><td>/81W3LzsK4DjYrV8ru8kcuZhhn5q.jpg</td><td>6.747</td><td>15</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>131</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rQEU3aDET3vXTCb1uHQgtQ75VZh.jpg</td><td>Action, Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28498</td><td>Theatre of Blood</td><td>Theatre of Blood</td><td>en</td><td>A Shakespearean actor takes poetic revenge on the critics who denied him recognition.</td><td>It's curtains for his critics!</td><td>1973-03-16</td><td>/jh2AYlIAeWyqgTPSqBeO8DleR3J.jpg</td><td>6.744</td><td>165</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jDakpD8ULd6AVkJmqHD4ipLMRew.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>30689</td><td>4 mosche di velluto grigio</td><td>Four Flies on Grey Velvet</td><td>it</td><td>Roberto, a drummer in a rock band, keeps receiving weird phone calls and being followed by a mysterious man. One night he manages to catch up with his persecutor and tries to get him to talk but in the ensuing struggle he accidentally stabs him. He runs away, but he understands his troubles have just begun when the following day he receives an envelope with photos of him killing the man. Someone is killing all his friends and trying to frame him for the murders.</td><td>When the flies start to crawl, so will your flesh...</td><td>1971-12-17</td><td>/hEFlF2M4nJ9OszjZaJ2oaRt9lr0.jpg</td><td>6.737</td><td>285</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/76ZeLcsivMqAUuWO4tGXuOjUFVh.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16182</td><td>The Woman in Black</td><td>The Woman in Black</td><td>en</td><td>When a friendless old widow dies in the seaside town of Crythin, a young solicitor is sent by his firm to settle the estate. The lawyer finds the townspeople reluctant to talk about or go near the woman's dreary home and no one will explain or even acknowledge the menacing woman in black he keeps seeing.</td><td>NA</td><td>1989-12-24</td><td>/7OvRh62jrZA7oTvTDr4gYY4GGqf.jpg</td><td>6.733</td><td>104</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bdlSmGexTiam0Pz4IQsGIoAAvzf.jpg</td><td>History, Horror, Mystery, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>310137</td><td>Bound to Vengeance</td><td>Bound to Vengeance</td><td>en</td><td>A young woman, Eve, fights back and manages to escape a malicious abductor. However, after discovering she may not be the only victim, Eve unravels a darker truth and decides to turn the tables on her captor.</td><td>Escape is just the beginning.</td><td>2015-06-26</td><td>/oVVJSRhG9dcAdzTp83AUD1nBlIc.jpg</td><td>6.728</td><td>235</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2TWhYw7yazG3DLJyCDHLn7Fquny.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>684684</td><td>Shortcut</td><td>Shortcut</td><td>en</td><td>A group of five classmates is trapped inside their school bus after a mysterious creature invade the road. Time runs and every passing minute decreases their survival chances against the constant threats of that unknown entity.</td><td>Not every road leads you home</td><td>2020-09-25</td><td>/5XSbsZS5rQ4VvepXyMBqbpSi2mD.jpg</td><td>6.728</td><td>79</td><td>5.8</td><td>1400000.0</td><td>769563.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sz87Q1oAOqRKrSNiyV1YXsKgxcA.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12171</td><td>The Deaths of Ian Stone</td><td>The Deaths of Ian Stone</td><td>en</td><td>Deaths tells the story of an all-American guy who is murdered each day by horrifying pursuers, only to wake up in slightly different lives to experience the terror of being murdered again.</td><td>Live everyday like it's your last.</td><td>2007-12-05</td><td>/guhprfoix4DCKnbPeVQXuF08rHt.jpg</td><td>6.727</td><td>247</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/hpubF1m4o2GHWT2CnDV