 from a school professor and his father who have dealt with the supernatural before. But as Alexs condition worsens, it becomes apparent that it may already be too late to stop the entity from using Alexs body as a gateway into our world (IMDb.com).</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-05-16</td><td>/zjrDE4agtUL3xGEVAlN0SkCjbuk.jpg</td><td>6.683</td><td>58</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>326446</td><td>Savageland</td><td>Savageland</td><td>en</td><td>When a small town near the Arizona-Mexico border is wiped out overnight, suspicion falls on the lone survivor. But a roll of photos the survivor took that night tells a different story.</td><td>NA</td><td>2015-11-01</td><td>/4mGst1RgMvPNlOLMyyw0cvAubXD.jpg</td><td>6.677</td><td>34</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/FtrwfLziRMeZMMyUEquHs81JMV.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28153</td><td>It's Alive</td><td>It's Alive</td><td>en</td><td>Lenore Davis and her husband Frank are about to have their second child. As she gives birth, the newborn baby vanishes and leaves behind five dead bodies. It's up to the police and Frank to figure out where their mutated child has gone.</td><td>There's only one thing wrong with the Davis baby...</td><td>1974-04-26</td><td>/bhgCVGl6BDXS8BfcUGzWU5EWnMb.jpg</td><td>6.673</td><td>150</td><td>6.0</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iMc1yLUwFgmB4Nj9M0Ax0Yi0OEB.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>256297</td><td>It's Alive Collection</td></tr><tr><td>47894</td><td>Terror in the Aisles</td><td>Terror in the Aisles</td><td>en</td><td>A non-stop roller coaster ride through the scariest moments of the greatest terror films of all time.</td><td>It's a cut above the rest.</td><td>1984-10-26</td><td>/iFmaJ7mAwFJpx5gv6vUMvRKCeFm.jpg</td><td>6.67</td><td>29</td><td>6