n a killing spree in his hometown, targeting anyone who offends his ultra-patriotic views.</td><td>I want you... dead!</td><td>1996-11-13</td><td>/7lksF68Z13ej7H5CPtG4mJBkVfq.jpg</td><td>6.65</td><td>39</td><td>4.8</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/shVXXr8rcL7uFB9DAz1U41KgF7t.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>40074</td><td>Alucarda, la hija de las tinieblas</td><td>Alucarda</td><td>es</td><td>A young girl's arrival at a convent after the death of her parents marks the beginning of a series of events that unleash an evil presence on the girl and her mysterious new friend, an enigmatic figure known as Alucarda. Demonic possession, Satan worship, and vampirism follows.</td><td>They gave their souls to Hell… but the Devil wanted MORE!</td><td>1977-12-26</td><td>/3iWNq4audJN2KRMJxxMmXFTEm8j.jpg</td><td>6.645</td><td>88</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>78</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xOuFz7t8zFEMLmzCHxnSLLkvNST.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27390</td><td>Sorority Babes in the Slimeball Bowl-O-Rama</td><td>Sorority Babes in the Slimeball Bowl-O-Rama</td><td>en</td><td>When three college guys get caught spying on a sorority ritual, they're forced to accompany the pledges on their next assignment: stealing a trophy from a bowling alley. But the token they pinch has a devilish imp who makes their lives a living hell.</td><td>In a bowling alley from Hell, there's only one way to score...</td><td>1988-01-29</td><td>/2I7yv8T9rX1C1cBtJOrdOxoh7W3.jpg</td><td>6.644</td><td>83</td><td>4.8</td><td>90000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/eWK7RcC5h5l98q2LKK68b6R76Ir.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>652379</td><td>Sorority Babes Collection</td></tr><tr><td>19483</td><td>It Came from Outer Space</td><td>It Came from Outer Space</td><td>en</td><td>Author & amateur astronomer John Putnam and schoolteacher Ellen Fields witness an enormous meteorite come down near a small town in Arizona, but Putnam becomes a local object of scorn when, after examining the object up close, he announces that it is a spacecraft, and that it is inhabited...</td><td>Fantastic sights leap out at you!</td><td>1953-06-05</td><td>/zPXff8iRma28YQFApfzuWadZXzP.jpg</td><td>6.642</td><td>154</td><td>6.4</td><td>800000.0</td><td>1600000.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/l3PbIWn1K9cie3GLbomsyaSSwec.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24702</td><td>Shallow Ground</td><td>Shallow Ground</td><td>en</td><td>A naked teenage boy covered in blood appears at a remote sheriff's station one year after the brutal unsolved murder of a local girl. Now Sheriff Jack Shepherd, guilt ridden over the girl's murder, must confront his own demons as he desperately searches for the boy's true identity and possible victims. Little does Jack realize that he has started down a path that will bring him face to face with an unthinkable horror. Before sunrise the living will pay for the pain the dead have suffered.</td><td>Fear your past... it will find you</td><td>2005-06-28</td><td>/cxQtkD2flZmlxMmXjwqZCzDhxxB.jpg</td><td>6.642</td><td>86</td><td>5.0</td><td>72000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cCuT0flLIurv6J7Zc1R4wGQFoqC.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>49958</td><td>Primal</td><td>Primal</td><td>en</td><td>Anja and five friends join anthroplogy student, Dace, on a journey to study a remote, ancient rock painting. Their excitement vanishes when Mel becomes delirious after skinny-dipping in the waterhole. Feverish, bleeding, confused, she physically and mentally regresses to a vicious predatory state. Mel has gone primal. Mel’s lover and friends realise they are the prey as she savagely hunts them down. Before they can escape another one of them starts to regress, posing a hideous choice; kill their friends or be killed by them. Their only hope of survival is through a cave, where Anja learns too late the meaning of the ancient rock art they came to study.</td><td>Evil Lies Within</td><td>2010-08-26</td><td>/mXq7G9GcemHVDpxDmwWDoVULdnQ.jpg</td><td>6.638</td><td>90</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/92MDJlz38DQB2MLnajOXeNNOWq7.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1018518</td><td>Kalian Pantas Mati</td><td>Kalian Pantas Mati</td><td>en</td><td>Rakka has the ability to communicate with the dead. He uses his abilities to stop an evil spirit filled with vengeance against his schoolmates and helps a beautiful ghost to restore his memories.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-10-13</td><td>/hDyz4YpRCIf7LwuPcIrzS4SDN9T.jpg</td><td>6.638</td><td>0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>In Production</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>52728</td><td>大怪獣空中戦 ガメラ対ギャオス</td><td>Gamera vs. Gyaos</td><td>ja</td><td>Unusual volcanic activity in Japan awakens Gyaos, a bloodthirsty flying monster with the power to slice things in half with an ultrasonic ray. While scientists and the military scramble to devise a way to stop this new threat, a young boy forms an alliance with Gamera; a monster no one else seems to trust.</td><td>Giant Monster Dogfight</td><td>1967-03-15</td><td>/sQFFSD4ie6BqbXX7GWre7OikqmD.jpg</td><td>6.637</td><td>55</td><td>6.5</td><td>525000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qwTPtDEtpG00lLl6C93HVz2TKfJ.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>161766</td><td>Gamera (Showa) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>41827</td><td>Red White & Blue</td><td>Red White & Blue</td><td>en</td><td>A woman attracts the attention of a psychotic former Army interrogator and an emotionally fragile young man caring for his ailing mother.</td><td>Three lives... bound together in blood</td><td>2010-10-08</td><td>/wNCsRpkp3lq5qsLFYArjiby1SQN.jpg</td>