 via the wireless internet. Cities are deserted, technology has been destroyed and the few remaining human beings eschew anything electrical in order to avoid a confrontation with the soulless ghosts that now wander the planet. Most of the ghosts are doomed to a repetitive loop of something they did while they were still despairing humans (a man repeatedly hangs himself, for example), but there are some ghosts so locked in denial, they do not know they are dead. They continue to haunt their homes, wrapped in fear that their souls will soon be torn from them.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-09-30</td><td>/z0SGvrvvTlGosfA16yPmp4HpfWg.jpg</td><td>6.625</td><td>60</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fErwA0Vp8r4IQhPAQq2Fhxdkbbg.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>124188</td><td>Pulse Collection</td></tr><tr><td>44510</td><td>The Grandmother</td><td>The Grandmother</td><td>en</td><td>A young boy plants some strange seeds and they grow into a grandmother.</td><td>To live is to die.</td><td>1970-07-01</td><td>/llhiY0rV6RWU1LOdy9Zljhf7cXm.jpg</td><td>6.625</td><td>121</td><td>6.7</td><td>7119.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>34</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3AKQ59TNeaifBoeLqBKp737dOHn.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39436</td><td>Non ho sonno</td><td>Sleepless</td><td>it</td><td>An elderly and retired police detective and a young amateur sleuth team up to find a serial killer whom has resumed a killing spree in Turin, Italy after a 17-year hiatus.</td><td>Creepier than Jack the Ripper</td><td>2001-01-05</td><td>/ihD09Yz6sIhwGHDq0Bo1IZaIeAC.jpg</td><td>6.619</td><td>189</td><td>6.1</td><td>4000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>117</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vyXM2gMBPpTUsRF3XFp8LobErnF.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>19095</td><td>Une vierge chez les morts-vivants</td><td>A Virgin Among the Living Dead</td><td>fr</td><td>A girl arrives from London to visit her estranged relatives in a remote castle for the reading of her father's will. After a while she discovers that they are all in fact dead and her decision to live with them turns into a nightmare. Unable to leave she's drawn into a macabre underworld through visions of nude satanic rituals and her own impending sacrifice.</td><td>NA</td><td>1973-11-15</td><td>/vP6ZC7L8CLawIiTx19tXfIuaIuF.jpg</td><td>6.615</td><td>44</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>79</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kEFMEEE8N7rGetCFcM2hhqNPTpx.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>13511</td><td>Rawhead Rex</td><td>Rawhead Rex</td><td>en</td><td>Ireland will never be the same after Rawhead Rex, a particularly nasty demon, is released from his underground prison by an unwitting farmer. The film follows Rex's cross country rampage, while a man struggles to stop it.</td><td>He's pure evil, pure power, pure terror</td><td>1986-10-01</td><td>/iaUdeKLtKBuZJavToGiRHySXAPA.jpg</td><td>6.614</td><td>89</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oFsNgTzGNz1qOiuLrXtdJ3A14EA.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>605802</td><td>8</td><td>8</td><td>en</td><td>An old man, fated to collect souls for eternity, seeks atonement after trading his daughter's soul.</td><td>Fear the legend</td><td>2020-03-13</td><td>/mEot6Gg88yvIpLI9HTZNPvSkzTd.jpg</td><td>6.614</td><td>62</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5OkVpuGYy1YI07K8xhEOymUYTRk.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12653</td><td>Romasanta</td><td>Romasanta: The Werewolf Hunt</td><td>en</td><td>A terror is stalking the land: people are disappearing daily, their bodies appearing covered in savage gashes coupled with precise surgical cuts. The legend of the 'Werewolf of Allariz' spreads across the land like wildfire. When Barbara (Elsa Pataky) falls in love with travelling vendor Manuel Romasanta, she is at first besotted with him - but soon begins to be suspicious of him. What has happened to her sister, who - after being escorted by Romasanta to the city - seems to have disappeared forever.</td><td>NA</td><td>2004-05-13</td><td>/yMVYoaAHA85fgH7CLKK7rimyPaX.jpg</td><td>6.611</td><td>71</td><td>5.1</td><td>4500000.0</td><td>432671.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cyVJTvrWYEmTNJRV0Fc1iGcUArD.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29559</td><td>Murder-Set-Pieces</td><td>Murder-Set-Pieces</td><td>en</td><td>Set against Sin City, Las Vegas, \"Murder-Set-Pieces\" tells the story of a fashion photographer whose vocation is murder - a voyeuristic nightmare of blood, sex and brutality.</td><td>NA</td><td>2004-12-23</td><td>/nrr4kyNMYVKQXSOMOUBzMuBUYxN.jpg</td><td>6.606</td><td>73</td><td>3.9</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4bOy6bWjzqrEpp8AaEaCaEa60eF.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>21838</td><td>Dead & Breakfast</td><td>Dead & Breakfast</td><td>en</td><td>Six friends on a road trip stop for the night at a bed and breakfast in the sleepy town of Lovelock. After a night that leaves both the inn's owner and chef dead, the gang finds themselves under suspicion by the local sheriff. But that's only the beginning as nearly all of the town's quirky residents become possessed by an evil spirit and pin down the friends inside the B&B.</td><td>It's like a bad horror movie, only worse.</td><td>2004-03-16</td><td>/A10Ce0fJ4RvVvTGm2mbvG08Nc7N.jpg</td><td>6.602</td><td>78</td><td>5.6</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zjnAsOYklsaZBEFEIrgJZrtU2gd.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>28327</td><td>Le foto di Gioia</td><td>Delirium: Photo of Gioia</td><td>it</td><td>This spaghetti horror's storyline revolves around a former hooker (Grandi) running a successful men's magazine. An obsessed admirer systematically slaughters her models (occasionally increasing the magazine's output) and supplies the mistress with pictures of their disfigured corpses taken in front of her semi-nude posters visible in the background. Is she going to be the psycho's next victim?</td><td>NA</td><td>1987-04-02</td><td>/g6Dx2ralriQSFk80oi4C4bB85NS.jpg</td><td>6.601</td><td>57</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/denda0GHTIkelWaakbhQqeHFqMO.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>79550</td><td>Rogue River</td><td>Rogue River</td><td>en</td><td>When a young woman takes a trip down Rogue River, her car mysteriously disappears. Lost without transport or communication, she accepts the hospitality of a stranger who offers her shelter for the night at his cabin. With no other options available, she reluctantly accepts only to forever regret it. The ensuing hours yield nothing but torture, indescribable pain, and horrific agony. If you've seen Misery, you've seen nothing. This movie starts where horror films end and leaves viewers paralysed by fear and disgust.</td><td>You can't outrun family</td><td>2012-01-16</td><td>/pYR2zXWZDL7p0cepmKOfokyVQT3.jpg</td><td>6.599</td><td>68</td><td>5.1</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>466129</td><td>The Hatred</td><td>The Hatred</td><td>en</td><td>Four young women travel to their college professor's new country home for a weekend getaway, only to discover that the house has a malevolent past.</td><td>Your Fears Are Real</td><td>2017-11-29</td><td>/sCuZThFUGycGPwVblKdQO5MWzi0.jpg</td><td>6.599</td><td>64</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4E09YVHvTtf9RVdFAmW81eGZ50t.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>17168</td><td>The Temp</t