ing kept alive on life-support by a slightly crazed doctor experimenting with ESP and other special abilities. Ricky targets a young, clairvoyant blind woman, named Laura, whom is traveling with her brother Chris, and his girlfriend Jerri to their grandmother's house for Christmas Eve, and Ricky decides to go after her, leaving a trail of dead bodies in his wake.</td><td>When your nightmare ends, the real terror begins!</td><td>1989-11-09</td><td>/jZ05JtzuWvZq0FNU5EdHNnjFvsZ.jpg</td><td>6.584</td><td>45</td><td>3.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/x5drWqNlcbqJ342SjXvUqFK0iZY.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>256296</td><td>Silent Night, Deadly Night Collection</td></tr><tr><td>17100</td><td>Trucks</td><td>Trucks</td><td>en</td><td>Based on the short story by Stephen King, this tells the tale of trucks suddenly coming to life and attacking their owners.</td><td>NA</td><td>2000-12-26</td><td>/aJN2BNCUSfrOftshzSginQNILPk.jpg</td><td>6.582</td><td>55</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7ccuPWLIkAVERmvuwzwAP0hQOVU.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>36096</td><td>Lucifer Rising</td><td>Lucifer Rising</td><td>en</td><td>Egyptian gods summon the angel Lucifer, in order to usher in a new occult age.</td><td>NA</td><td>1974-04-10</td><td>/8u8JJDTh5GWnKci3lciXZuyUgPQ.jpg</td><td>6.58</td><td>79</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>29</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wcsbmSEufHJyCxgmZt2Q4hjmopm.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror</td><td>53043</td><td>The Magick Lantern Cycle</td></tr><tr><td>26661</td><td>Abbott and Costello Meet the Mummy</td><td>Abbott and Costello Meet the Mummy</td><td>en</td><td>When the murder of an archaeologist puts a valuable medallion into their hands, Abbott and Costello waste little time in trying to sell it, only to find themselves pursued by police, a slinky adventuress, an Egyptian high priest, a