ape that caused the death of the friend's wife and son, which is haunted by the curse of Sadako, a relentless spirit.</td><td>NA</td><td>1998-01-31</td><td>/8liZWPCzzCsHYCxAKRSHBwrubWR.jpg</td><td>6.479</td><td>94</td><td>5.3</td><td>2900000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lKcnwEruAPjwVUxUqx1r3nCHh1p.jpg</td><td>Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>93369</td><td>Ringu Collection</td></tr><tr><td>37929</td><td>Fortress</td><td>Fortress</td><td>en</td><td>After being kidnapped by four masked men, a teacher and her students rebel by plotting against the criminals.</td><td>For one teacher and nine children, the lesson of the day is kill or be killed.</td><td>1985-11-24</td><td>/a1jHnKnRUEdKi9vkd9LIdmFaj5D.jpg</td><td>6.479</td><td>70</td><td>7.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zxm3D5vISbBo8FOQQom2bDFbmmy.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>320413</td><td>The Greasy Strangler</td><td>The Greasy Strangler</td><td>en</td><td>Ronnie runs a Disco walking tour with his son, Brayden. When a sexy woman takes the tour, it begins a competition between father and son for her love. It also signals the arrival of an oily strangler who stalks the streets at night.</td><td>BULLSHIT ARTIST!</td><td>2016-06-03</td><td>/A6rEKUIDoJebQygLr7hxVCoe8Fz.jpg</td><td>6.479</td><td>146</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/flz1hSZTUl5wNs2i4nmcyX8Tg7n.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>75903</td><td>The Uncanny</td><td>The Uncanny</td><td>en</td><td>Wilbur Gray, a horror writer, has stumbled upon a terrible secret, that cats are supernatural creatures who really call the shots. In a desperate attempt to get others to believe him, Wilbur spews three tales of feline horror.</td><td>They prowl by night...lusting for human flesh!</td><td>1977-08-24</td><td>/oIGVgN4xvu8eit0u3iT4S9V6tkj.jp