ors of a bizarre accident that reduced most of the world's population to zombies. They take refuge in a vacant casino and fight a losing battle against the undead.</td><td>This Town Will Eat You Alive.</td><td>2011-12-06</td><td>/8IxvPu3zfPtZiGbXoQQ5NfkssJD.jpg</td><td>6.463</td><td>71</td><td>5.1</td><td>750000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sTumBA3jMn1B5b8TIpELBO1xbrm.jpg</td><td>Action, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27703</td><td>Sette note in nero</td><td>The Psychic</td><td>it</td><td>A woman with psychic powers has a vision of a murder that took place in a house owned by her husband.</td><td>Suddenly and without warning it's tomorrow... and you're dead.</td><td>1977-08-10</td><td>/a4agndzio4MggkI0CjjuTih6YJF.jpg</td><td>6.462</td><td>174</td><td>7.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mHeyQoYO5zyWLZxsyVzGZLymf15.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39276</td><td>キングコングの逆襲</td><td>King Kong Escapes</td><td>ja</td><td>An adaptation of the Rankin/Bass cartoon, \"The King Kong Show\". King Kong is brought in by the evil Dr. Who to dig for Element X in a mine when the robot Mechani-Kong is unable to do the task. This leads to the machine and the real Kong engaging in a tremendous battle atop Tokyo Tower.</td><td>The electronic monster Mechani-Kong boldly challenges the ruler of the South Seas, King Kong!!</td><td>1967-07-22</td><td>/1Z2fL5ycdVGs83i4iPdliDZVeVM.jpg</td><td>6.461</td><td>73</td><td>6.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iLUqwbtUE2mvECHP51elB8tD9ZH.jpg</td><td>Action, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>12602</td><td>Die Schlangengrube und das Pendel</td><td>The Torture Chamber of Dr. Sadism</td><td>de</td><td>In the Olden Tymes, Count Regula is drawn and quartered for killing twelve virgins in his dungeon torture chamber. Thirty-five years later, he comes back to seek revenge on the daughter of his intended thirteenth victim and the son of his prosecutor in order to attain immortal life.</td><td>UNBELIEVABLE! Until You See It With Your Own Eyes!</td><td>1967-10-05</td><td>/vkXv0vRtHXaYpVCrpwy5qCBJypC.jpg</td><td>6.46</td><td>38</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aWqx6rASnrDMvd3jG3gDFwALnyJ.jpg</td><td>History, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>18443</td><td>Decoys 2: Alien Seduction</td><td>Decoys 2: Alien Seduction</td><td>en</td><td>Sam, a college student in a small Northwestern town, reluctantly joins his roommates in a contest to see who can hook up with the most gorgeous co-eds by the end of the semester. But when men slowly start disappearing around town, he and his friends learn that when it comes to beautiful women, it's what's inside that really matters.</td><td>It's mating season</td><td>2007-03-06</td><td>/29ntxtmUwcA8RPVdEHStsaqrLGq.jpg</td><td>6.46</td><td>40</td><td>5.5</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vr2B7YO2E8EDgkiR3uouPZVCpxQ.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>140758</td><td>Decoys Collection</td></tr><tr><td>31655</td><td>The Terror</td><td>The Terror</td><td>en</td><td>A young officer in Napoleon's army pursues a mysterious woman to the castle of an elderly Baron.</td><td>Trapped in a Haunted Castle... There is no Escape From The TERROR</td><td>1963-06-17</td><td>/7ls64LquXB0nc5MkJFWyWaXlBLj.jpg</td><td>6.459</td><td>106</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yZ0dExpNW44xrpOG6qHwLV8pq3P.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>64568</td><td>Taste of Fear</td><td>Taste of Fear</td><td>en</td><td>A wheelchair-bound young girl returns to her father's estate after ten years, and although she's told he's away, she keeps seeing his dead body on the estate.</td><td>For maximum thrill . . . we earnestly urge you to see this motion picture from the start!</td><td>1961-06-05</td><td>/k1Eq0XpDAsCkoGUGv5rV8c4uQUs.jpg</td><td>6.458</td><td>92</td><td>7.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qgzNkm5W11ocek6GJJamUvXRcmr.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>207475</td><td>The Ouija Experiment</td><td>The Ouija Experiment</td><td>en</td><td>Based on true events, five friends who fall prey to the evil entities of the Ouija board. As they set about filming their experimental session, what starts out as bit of fun, soon escalates into a terrifying series of events as paranoia and personal demons are revealed…. and recorded.</td><td>Cross Her Heart and Hope to Die</td><td>2011-05-05</td><td>/EeqPNq8D4GckMFmWH2hlIpk73R.jpg</td><td>6.456</td><td>130</td><td>4.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pxgAHf0CwzPNVgdcLD32mAyrGh5.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>336557</td><td>The Ouija Experiment Collection</td></tr><tr><td>408490</td><td>It Came from the Desert</td><td>It Came from the Desert</td><td>en</td><td>New Mexico, present day. Brian and Lukas are off to the desert to join a kegger party and to celebrate Lukas’ victory in a motocross competition. His winning prize includes meeting The  Deathinator, the biggest action star in the world. The party  gets started under the hot desert sun, but Brian isn’t in the mood, so he wanders off and is soon joined by his friend, Lukas. They discover something strange in the desert which leads them into a secret military laboratory, where they discover the disturbing truth of what the government has been doing. Secret experiments on ants and spiders using DNA found in a meteorite which fell to Earth in 1951 has given birth to mutated giant ants which have overrun the facility. Now, it's up to Brian and Lukas to save the  world from a giant ant invasion!</td><td>Get ready to scream</td><td>2017-10-29</td><td>/mZsLtCJW1eJabOxlZrZfaalGIki.jpg</td><td>6.453</td><td>76</td><td>5.2</td><td>731000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8x70iUDCfdJ0tdJZlPhxiAv0FSt.jpg</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>1028243</td><td>The Last Of Us : All Gone</td><td>The Last Of Us : All Gone</td><td>fr</td><td>This short fiction film called \"ALL GONE\" is based on the video games \"THE LAST OF US\" & \"THE LAST OF US PART II\". It is intended for entertainment purposes only and is a completely non profit production. All rights reserved by Naughty Dog & Sony.</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-09-24</td><td>/xP7hyPGaAJria6uswkBwXWZYUfV.jpg</td><td>6.452</td><td>0</td><td>8.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>16</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/5RSJCk0PEGJiaURDW1ZirjiaWWY.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>710717</td><td>Good Boy</td><td>Good Boy</td><td>en</td><td>When Maggie gets an emotional support dog to help quell some of her anxiety, she finds him to be even more effective than she imagined... because unbeknownst to her, he kills anyone who adds stress to her life.</td><td>There are no bad dogs, just bad owners.</td><td>2020-06-12</td><td>/iMFAKPH7AaUJ76oLqWz9OxU7s6S.jpg</td><td>6.45</td><td>47</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/dsKDGGEmaD1OlTcHzqSRXlhESVH.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29565</td><td>La Nuit des traquées</td><td>The Night of the Hunted</td><td>fr</td><td>A woman is taken to a mysterious clinic whose patients have a mental disorder in which their memories and identities are disintegrating as a result of a strange environmental accident.</td><td>NA</td><td>1980-08-20</td><td>/k6HshRRxOiZWQcAbD9NhmRywPpd.jpg</td><td>6.448</td><td>42</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rztWik2ujHieCBIs7qeM9kO67v.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>462036</td><td>The Monster Project</td><td>The Monster Project</td><td>en</td><td>When aspiring horror filmmakers post an online casting call looking for \"real life\" monsters to interview for their upcoming documentary called, The Monster Project, they find three individuals claiming to be a skin-walker, a vampire, and a demon. Meeting these monsters at a remote mansion in the woods on the night of a total lunar eclipse, the filmmakers invite the three subjects to share their haunting, personal experiences. Working on the crew is a recovering drug addict who suffers withdrawal and paranoia. As a person of faith, he fears his friends underestimate the dark powers they are summoning. When the interviews turn deadly, he must battle the demons, inside and out, to escape the house and defeat the rise of evil incarnate.</td><td>Do You Believe in Monsters?</td><td>2017-08-18</td><td>/1E0JW9zqFwOO7w0HiuEPo6N7HBl.jpg</td><td>6.448</td><td>109</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nFGAf283klp1PAgX8W1isFk2vIG.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>41374</td><td>The First Power</td><td>The First Power</td><td>en</td><td>A dedicated L.A. police detective and a female psychic must stop a demonic serial killer who was given the powers of resurrection, teleportation and possession.</td><td>NA</td><td>1990-04-06</td><td>/yQwELMAqOVYAvLxnJvQ1OcArtl4.jpg</td><td>6.447</td><td>59</td><td>5.7</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>2.2424195E7</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9VXfor3WR2RORQVmhEViNskQ4OY.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>542787</td><td>Frenzy</td><td>Frenzy</td><td>en</td><td>A group of friends run a popular travel vlog that helps fund their adventures. The leader of the group brings along her younger sister for the next scuba diving trip to an isolated cove. But when their plane crashes, the two sisters must use their strength, resourcefulness and immense courage to survive a pack of great white sharks.</td><td>Survival is her only option</td><td>2018-08-15</td><td>/iQxV2OLz1Y8NiC8HWeD5uYu14iH.jpg</td><td>6.447</td><td>43</td><td>3.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wCLbSw3hSQBB0iwruUzuDvMq37D.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>343284</td><td>Night of the Living Deb</td><td>Night of the Living Deb</td><td>en</td><td>After a one night stand Deb wakes up in the middle of a zombie apocalypse.</td><td>It's a Rom-Zom-Com!</td><td>2015-05-30</td><td>/tM2cjGghcFX0tYrHsIXGxEPI3uz.jpg</td><td>6.443</td><td>119</td><td>5.3</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ziupKeRs39HJf0m6V9F4vPxxCuP.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16313</td><td>โปรแกรมหน้า วิญญาณอาฆาต</td><td>Coming Soon</td><td>th</td><td>What kind of scenes in a horror film scares you the most? When a ghost appears totally unexpectedly? When the main character does not see the ghost sneaking up behind him? When at the very end you find out that the main character was actually a ghost all along? But none of this compares to the feeling of arriving home alone and suddenly being stuck by a feeling of deja-vu.</td><td>When the movie ends it's not really the end.</td><td>2008-10-28</td><td>/9mc1H5Yt3MEU40dbZhJzVGgfDo3.jpg</td><td>6.442</td><td>65</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/k0n1zkpDbLCKWhUE7DfJhqDVIKS.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>409056</td><td>Along Came the Devil</td><td>Along Came the Devil</td><td>en</td><td>After a troubled childhood, Ashley searches for a connection, and unknowingly invites in a demonic force, which leaves her loved ones fighting for her soul.</td><td>An Exorcism film unlike any other.</td><td>2018-08-10</td><td>/tEiu83QxMMWWD8gWUtXR4piF1Iw.jpg</td><td>6.442</td><td>59</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ltKOlYoilem816Y4d41W4PipHQb.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>640395</td><td>Along Came the Devil Collection</td></tr><tr><td>24103</td><td>Haunted Honeymoon</td><td>Haunted Honeymoon</td><td>en</td><td>Larry Abbot, speaker in the radio horror shows of Manhattan Mystery Theater wants to marry. For the marriage he takes his fiancée home to the castle where he grew up among his eccentric relatives. His uncle decides that he needs to be cured from a neurotic speech defect and exaggerated bursts of fear: he gives him a shock therapy with palace ghosts.</td><td>…A Comedy Chiller</td><td>1986-07-25</td><td>/jBCucUiw7Incipok1xvUa9AVhW.jpg</td><td>6.441</td><td>125</td><td>5.4</td><td>1.3E7</td><td>8033397.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3oQbVh2x1V4T2KoMvexykxHKixR.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror, Music, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>464111</td><td>Zygote</td><td>Zygote</td><td>en</td><td>The two remaining crew members of a mining operation in the Arctic Circle fight to survive against an alien creature.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-07-12</td><td>/lowSe0hdmFdtEuIA6aOVfkPjk1c.jpg</td><td>6.441</td><td>133</td><td>7.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>23</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2xpwSUv144J3seVX85BfVYILdFA.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>87874</td><td>Werewolf</td><td>Werewolf</td><td>en</td><td>After an archaeological team in Arizona unearths a werewolf skeleton and one of them develops symptoms of lycanthropy before dying, the dig's foreman, Yuri, tries to infect other townspeople as an experiment. When a science writer named Paul takes up residence in the town to cover the dig and develops a romantic interest in a female team member, Yuri makes Paul his next target.</td><td>REST IN... BEAST</td><td>1997-02-11</td><td>/fpS1AajcFeSlDzbqtbOPbGBDJmz.jpg</td><td>6.436</td><td>33</td><td>2.2</td><td>350000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/j3wFiG535pRNA74s8gxXVDUj4MF.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>361043</td><td>All Hallows' Eve 2</td><td>All Hallows' Eve 2</td><td>en</td><td>A woman finds a VHS tape on her doorstep that shows a series of gruesome tales that could be real. But the true danger is the pumpkin-faced killer that's using the tape to find his next victim.</td><td>NA</td><td>2015-10-06</td><td>/25uddRZKLvfkmrDA56z3ztRZmU1.jpg</td><td>6.436</td><td>71</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>442195</td><td>All Hallow's Eve Collection</td></tr><tr><td>129213</td><td>ゴーストスイーパー美神 極楽大作戦！！</td><td>Ghost Sweeper Mikami</td><td>ja</td><td>Meet Mikami - the SEXY leader of one of Japan's most successful independent ghost-busting agencies. Together with her eclectic team of exorcists, she's prepared to do battle with any supernatural adversary - but only for the right price!  When an ancient spirit enlists her aid to deal with a re-incarnated foe, Mikami gets more than she bargained for. As the wicked Nosferatu - a vampire lord able to absorb the very life essence of his victims - begins to turn the city's inhabitants into mindless zombies, Mikami's team must race against time to save Tokyo from destruction.  Watch The Ultimate Vampire Slayer in this fast, fun and furious supernatural action-adventure!</td><td>The Ultimate Vampire Slayer!</td><td>1994-12-04</td><td>/ratYneTrbgbtvkPXs3cNp98fChQ.jpg</td><td>6.43</td><td>4</td><td>7.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>60</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/s2tL1BZxanAf5JKggQJtKlPuS5k.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>400329</td><td>First Born</td><td>First Born</td><td>en</td><td>A young couples lives are turned upside down when the birth of their first child is accompanied by terrifying entities that threaten their newly formed family.</td><td>A blessing to some is a curse to others</td><td>2016-06-19</td><td>/uI0Fz7vMAcYWnhdDEbNSDl90AaZ.jpg</td><td>6.43</td><td>76</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/t2teCVwBMTQ6D39bk4VFLQX1iwT.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>54075</td><td>Choose</td><td>Choose</td><td>en</td><td>Fiona Wagner, a journalism student, tracks a cold-blooded killer with the help of her detective father and a therapist.</td><td>Who Lives? Who Dies? Are You Ready to Choose?</td><td>2011-01-17</td><td>/4W4plHfj4GN40HOdZPplPLSEiUi.jpg</td><td>6.428</td><td>78</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>45746</td><td>After...</td><td>After...</td><td>en</td><td>Urban Exploration. The practice of investigating areas not designed for public use. But strange things can happen in the dark, closed-off areas of history beneath the streets of Moscow, and what started as a way for Nate to escape his grief quickly turns into a journey that forces him to confront it head-on, with nothing less than his eternal destiny hanging in the balance.</td><td>Getting caught is the least of their fears.</td><td>2006-06-27</td><td>/uakN1L1jX6nLCZ6aHjpEX6DNzpD.jpg</td><td>6.425</td><td>13</td><td>3.2</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>829410</td><td>Sick</td><td>Sick</td><td>en</td><td>In the midst of the pandemic, college student Parker and her best friend Miri decide to self-quarantine at her family's lake house, where they will be alone — or so they think...</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-09-11</td><td>/eSjISPLweLL80jAe55pJivUT4hS.jpg</td><td>6.421</td><td>1</td><td>3.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>83</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/d1tlOyAZ9K5GXGwyCgNU