</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>436387</td><td>Abgeschnitten</td><td>Cut Off</td><td>de</td><td>A coroner finds a capsule in the head of a heavily mutilated corpse, containing a phone number and single word: the name of his daughter.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-10-11</td><td>/927kgdzuNNHX6wubSbqi50kZse0.jpg</td><td>6.398</td><td>182</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>1228051.0</td><td>132</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mlkOIAgd9OfNpKNMQDLYIJus9VV.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>19963</td><td>Bernie</td><td>Bernie</td><td>fr</td><td>Bernie, a 30 years old orphan, decides to leave his orphanage and find his parents. After an investigation, he meets Marion, a young heroin addict and falls in love with her. He believes that his family was victim of a plot and this is why they deserted him.</td><td>NA</td><td>1996-11-27</td><td>/c5jNOFSbUttQZl4CesnpAe1LrPR.jpg</td><td>6.394</td><td>202</td><td>7.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vDlHGqV1FKzXarAoxLaorBB9cPd.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>25088</td><td>The Willies</td><td>The Willies</td><td>en</td><td>Two brothers camping with their cousin try to frighten each other by telling stories. They start with urban legends, but then there are two main narrations: one involves strange happenings at an elementary school; the other, a teenage boy with a peculiar interest.</td><td>You'll Laugh, You'll Cry, You'll Puke, You'll Die!</td><td>1990-12-27</td><td>/vWVE0ne2VeobovFFlw4I9NImIho.jpg</td><td>6.388</td><td>33</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/DMTxCbKcgSDxvmEqW0nmTuxk3s.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>56705</td><td>Crawlspace</td><td>Crawlspace</td><td>en</td><td>A man who runs an apartment house for women is the demented son of a Nazi surgeon who has the house equipped with secret passageways, hidden rooms and torture and murder devices.</td><td>Someone is watching ...</td><td>1986-05-21</td><td>/mQZOp6LUuD3gXbLC02F2Ag7HF3V.jpg</td><td>6.387</td><td>65</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/op9mVoj6OXdNoSx8myklZGd00GG.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>383535</td><td>They're Watching</td><td>They're Watching</td><td>en</td><td>An American TV crew gets trapped in a centuries-old web of revenge, horror, and blood, when their home improvement show is attacked by angry Eastern European villagers out to kill the show's star.</td><td>Which House? Witch House.</td><td>2016-03-25</td><td>/yPLi2PlEEbetgUkaFPESBAMG9Qw.jpg</td><td>6.386</td><td>109</td><td>5.4</td><td>3650000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/c1qDY1l3Cy2AqXNTXNc8a8weu5B.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>411549</td><td>Kuso</td><td>Kuso</td><td>en</td><td>Broadcasting through a makeshift network of discarded televisions, this story is tangled up in the aftermath of Los Angeles's worst earthquake nightmare. Travel between screens and aftershocks into the twisted lives of the survived.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-01-21</td><td>/2Pl3Vptkzaum6FZ5K6iDqybuhp4.jpg</td><td>6.386</td><td>42</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gQkYIg054tXjwjfcyoI79Pz5XMo.jpg</td><td>Animation, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>441647</td><td>The Sound</td><td>The Sound</td><td>en</td><td>A writer who studies the paranormal believes that low frequency tactile sound is the cause for reported ghost sightings in an abandoned subway station. In an attempt to debunk the sightings, she breaks into the station to record evidence.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-09-29</td><td>/swghccaPcYwO2tvf1Wv8mpeNLUn.jpg</td><td>6.386</td><td>37</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/93kwn65NnKX5SaT