i02F0Y2Dr44fkJEcjXFI7OG.jpg</td><td>6.37</td><td>264</td><td>7.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>110</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/leO2a5VsgL6N27tnUeMofXPPEcV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>228496</td><td>Sx_Tape</td><td>Sx_Tape</td><td>en</td><td>From the director of CANDYMAN and the producers of PARANORMAL ACTIVITY comes a found-footage nightmare of lust, possession, and destruction. Jill's an artist. Ian's a filmmaker. And their love life is off the chain. There's no experience too wild, no dare too dangerous—not even when Jill lets Ian strap her to a gurney in the abandoned hospital they're scoping out for their next art show. But he shouldn't have left her alone. Not even as a joke. Now, Jill's hookup with horror has awakened something in that place. Something with a lust for more than flesh.</td><td>Some tapes shouldn't be made</td><td>2013-10-10</td><td>/n484SE5u944nFRw4sJ9kr6IN1O3.jpg</td><td>6.368</td><td>87</td><td>3.6</td><td>600000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sTcdSl3GGb9tsgfpZ2eIgVt982T.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>10593</td><td>Il fantasma dell'Opera</td><td>The Phantom of the Opera</td><td>it</td><td>Gory remake of the Gaston Leroux classic story, only this time, the phantom is not disfigured, but a man who was raised by rats deep under the Paris Opera House.</td><td>NA</td><td>1998-11-20</td><td>/2bFUHQT9AIjbrcihYYVCMZ8v2Ce.jpg</td><td>6.365</td><td>134</td><td>4.6</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iw7WWV96g2mTQWPSRq5DuAdMlZK.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>71853</td><td>Def by Temptation</td><td>Def by Temptation</td><td>en</td><td>An evil succubus is preying on libidinous black men in New York, and all that stands in her way is a minister-in-training, an aspiring actor, and a cop that specializes in cases involving the supernatural.</td><td>A terrifying tale of vampires and lust!</td><td>1990-03-23</td><td>/cC96OjOeYXmBF6RuePlxA709tkz.jpg</td><td>6.359</td><td>34</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>95</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/fTPi0tXFf4BSDDdf7J9pq5V9XyG.jpg</td><td>Horror, Romance, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>38761</td><td>Night of the Lepus</td><td>Night of the Lepus</td><td>en</td><td>Giant mutant rabbits terrorize the southwest!!</td><td>How many eyes does horror have?</td><td>1972-10-04</td><td>/wF8paiOb7E1JWb6mvec0TCTNq5W.jpg</td><td>6.358</td><td>79</td><td>4.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kw56BJUXYTtGH3UFq4Fb1BkPHj0.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>64622</td><td>Hidden 3D</td><td>Hidden 3D</td><td>en</td><td>Brian's mother dies and is surprised when he inherit's The Sanctuary, her controversial experimental treatment center for addictions. When he and his friends are shown around the dilapidated building by a mysterious employee, it is clear that there is a sinister mood. Despite this the group enters a secret underground passage and the terrible reality is revealed. Brian's mother had built a revolutionary machine that cured people of their addiction, but as a side effect to materialize the addictions in a mutated form of children who are addicted to human flesh which have moved into the building.</td><td>NA</td><td>2011-04-21</td><td>/mVJuiBgeHygy6JLh6KVtJTdPeAH.jpg</td><td>6.357</td><td>50</td><td>3.1</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>1670477.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27150</td><td>Silent Rage</td><td>Silent Rage</td><td>en</td><td>A mentally ill man in a small Texas town goes on a killing rampage and is fatally wounded by police. When doctors use an experimental serum to bring him back to life, the killer develops superhuman strength and the town sheriff must pursue him.</td><td>He's an indestructible man fused with powers beyond comprehension. An unstoppable terror who in one final showdown, will push Chuck Norris to his limits. And beyond.</td><td>1982-04-02</td><td>/9LwR6SFLuzbbzYgXdGnVHahBqrO.jpg</td><td>6.355</td><td>126</td><td>6.0</td><td>4500000.0</td><td>1.05E7</td><td>103</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8PKqcN6IREm2Xy43lzhPZ2ORzQi.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Romance, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>44909</td><td>Ghoulies III: Ghoulies Go to College</td><td>Ghoulies III: Ghoulies Go to College</td><td>en</td><td>A college teacher brings the little creatures back to his campus, where they proceed to terrorize the faculty and students.</td><td>Everybody's favorite troublemakers are on the loose again!</td><td>1991-09-18</td><td>/pTqoBx4AHdAmCdkQiIrlEP0uBWf.jpg</td><td>6.35</td><td>65</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>94</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wy9gUNcUQYKXNg7Nrq5ZapaNIxB.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>44913</td><td>Ghoulies Collection</td></tr><tr><td>344593</td><td>Cherry Tree</td><td>Cherry Tree</td><td>en</td><td>Faith’s world is turned upside down after she finds out that her beloved father is dying. When the mysteriously alluring Sissy Young becomes her field hockey coach, Faith finds a compassionate spirit and much-needed mother figure. Little does she know that Sissy is the head of a centuries-old witches’ coven that uses the fruit of an ancient cherry tree in a secret ritual that restores life to the dead and dying. Offering to cure her father in exchange for a child, Sissy strikes a bargain with Faith, who suddenly finds herself pregnant with a baby that’s growing at an alarming rate. But with the clock to the child’s birth ticking down and the true intention of Sissy’s plans for humanity becoming more apparent, Faith and her father must stand together in order to save both their lives.</td><td>Death is just the beginning</td><td>2015-08-04</td><td>/nhLagkPThEz2fqpXQwnEC3VqqIX.jpg</td><td>6.349</td><td>30</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mgLlgP8m93loCY6dvI8V8DsNumC.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>567220</td><td>New Year, New You</td><td>New Year, New You</td><td>en</td><td>A group of old friends gather for a girls’ night on New Years Eve. But as they begin to rehash old memories, many of the gripes they’ve been harboring manifest in murderous ways.</td><td>Ring in the New Year like it's your last</td><td>2018-12-28</td><td>/bJbCqewrw38CSzq62qCksTFjbrx.jpg</td><td>6.348</td><td>52</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7Z93e1UazD6Fmk4dQZhSZ29bgAb.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>37601</td><td>La noche del terror ciego</td><td>Tombs of the Blind Dead</td><td>es</td><td>In 13th century Berzano, a legion of knights known as the Templar were executed for conducting black magic rituals and committing human sacrifices in a quest for eternal life. 700 years later, they rise from the dead and attack a group of vacationing college students who visit the remains of their abandoned monastery.</td><td>Who are these unholy savages who hunt out their victims by sound alone?</td><td>1972-04-10</td><td>/ws5RFrpNkotzbkAShgaDx1D5ANT.jpg</td><td>6.341</td><td>106</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aXPKz2DEY6uDhRhwVVqF5t91qpc.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>108170</td><td>The Blind Dead Collection</td></tr><tr><td>55689</td><td>Baba Yaga</td><td>Baba Yaga</td><td>it</td><td>Carroll Baker stars in this psychedelic shocker about a mysterious witch who casts a spell over attractive, youthful fashion photographer Valentina Rosselli (Isabelle De Funes). Thrust into a world of sadism, Valentina must figure out whether the torture being inflicted on her is because of one woman's twisted agenda … or a curse known as Baba Yaga.</td><td>Is it real or is it a dream.</td><td>1973-09-20</td><td>/pszu4qKt4KKh9SyCko4cSeuwNvs.jpg</td><td>6.341</td><td>54</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/zXWeiuM3Gk5aMlAaXiGaICvSBf4.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>521531</td><td>Followed</td><td>Followed</td><td>en</td><td>Social media influencer, 'DropTheMike', seeks thrills and stardom in the most horrific places. When he’s offered the possibility of a lucrative sponsorship, he takes his online channel to one of the most haunted hotels in America. What begins as a fun challenge accompanied by friends descends into a personal hell, begging the timely question: how far would you go to pursue internet fame?</td><td>Who's following you?</td><td>2020-06-19</td><td>/3B2twt8I02cLAPHG6dkDpTFbgz5.jpg</td><td>6.34</td><td>65</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>548608.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2jzaFlLVG63W1lcu5kExypLey9T.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>21766</td><td>เด็กหอ</td><td>Dorm</td><td>th</td><td>When 12-year-old Ton transfers to an all-boys boarding school, he's taunted by his peers and terrified by their tales about the ghosts that inhabit the school. Ton is utterly miserable until he befriends a mysterious fellow pupil.</td><td>Every dorm has a tale but this tale you will never forget.</td><td>2006-02-23</td><td>/nLgtBM9yP1kONVNtnvX9Qs3vWXq.jpg</td><td>6.339</td><td>78</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>111</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/6eJ8ch6F2S09TBzb0d0JopAHUN0.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>117978</td><td>In Their Skin</td><td>In Their Skin</td><td>en</td><td>A couple and their young son retreat to their woodland vacation home, only to face sinister neighbors who intend to kill them and steal their identities.</td><td>Yours is the life they've chosen.</td><td>2012-11-09</td><td>/uzkaPVmspEoz3t7JEzoUzY8PaUM.jpg</td><td>6.339<