>en</td><td>A troubled woman on the edge of divorce returns home to her younger sister after years apart. But when her sister and brother-in-law betray her trust, she embarks on a vicious crusade of revenge.</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-09-14</td><td>/9W2UhhdQFFvWvuIyOgkG92Z6bFz.jpg</td><td>6.279</td><td>93</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>107</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ba1z6lodrv84EamrxWPKWEUyp1m.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>31965</td><td>Witchfinder General</td><td>Witchfinder General</td><td>en</td><td>England, 1645. The cruel civil war between Royalists and Parliamentarians that is ravaging the country causes an era of chaos and legal arbitrariness that allows unscrupulous men to profit by exploiting the absurd superstitions of the peasants; like Matthew Hopkins, a monster disguised as a man who wanders from town to town offering his services as a witch hunter.</td><td>He'll hang, burn, and mutilate you. He's the Witchfinder General</td><td>1968-05-17</td><td>/ra83NoGOZ9hWhQZCXqh6wQBgdkd.jpg</td><td>6.278</td><td>170</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/d0kkv3CzlSClEF11O2SIpCvMKyR.jpg</td><td>Drama, History, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>138372</td><td>Bad Kids Go To Hell</td><td>Bad Kids Go To Hell</td><td>en</td><td>On a stormy Saturday afternoon, six students from Crestview Academy begin to meet horrible fates as they serve out their detentions. Is a fellow student to blame, or perhaps Crestview's alleged ghosts are behind the terrible acts?</td><td>Daddy's money can't save them now.</td><td>2012-12-07</td><td>/dVzEumXyiQ13VJOrHxFolGmMyEq.jpg</td><td>6.272</td><td>76</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3AxqQUNC6d3PpbDHQLYX2UKgzUD.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>436483</td><td>Bad Kids Collection</td></tr><tr><td>46885</td><td>Visiting Hours</td><td>Visiting Hours</td><td>en</td><td>A deranged, misogynistic killer assaults a journalist. When he discovers that she survived the attack, he follows her to the hospital to finish her off.</td><td>In this hospital your next visit may be your last.</td><td>1982-05-21</td><td>/caqqCAlRtcWhfmTmUTga0HwDzmj.jpg</td><td>6.27</td><td>77</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>1.325867E7</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/y6jONTTkVv8vI5ZKYRE4VxXKenS.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>62761</td><td>The Cars That Ate Paris</td><td>The Cars That Ate Paris</td><td>en</td><td>After the death of his brother on the road, unemployed and unstable drifter Arthur Waldo stays for a while in the rural Australian town of Paris as the guest of the mayor, who hopes he will become a permanent member of the Paris population. Arthur soon realizes the quaint hamlet has a sinister secret: they orchestrate car accidents and rob the victims. Survivors are brought to the local hospital, lobotomized, and used for a local doctor's experiments.</td><td>148 people live in the township of Paris and every one of them is a murderer.</td><td>1974-10-10</td><td>/1jAbfwNPSGgCZ68FjGD39XpXsrB.jpg</td><td>6.268</td><td>64</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/LhNAYzoYqJssVojll2eyKLonu6.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>713924</td><td>La casa acecha</td><td>La casa acecha</td><td>es</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td><td>2020-06-11</td><td>/oVGhkh4tT3j86CNFYWWErSYQWs7.jpg</td><td>6.267</td><td>14</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>77</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rHid1iE9OXV4t6teozuP3vjwmq.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>371193</td><td>愛的精靈</td><td>The Spirit of Love</td><td>cn</td><td>Judging by her lavish home, a model is making a fortune doing TV commercials. When her boyfriend/boss comes over and tries to get romantic, the model begins seeing weird and scary visions. Visions of blood flooding her floor, and a three year old boy ghost. It seems that, three years earlier, she was pregnant and caught her husband athletically knocking off a blonde. Husband kicked her down the stairs, which causes her to abort. The ghost is evidently the aborted baby grown up. Back to the present day, hubby has teamed up with a new girl, and is trying to get back into the house and kidnap the boy ghost.</td><td>NA</td><td>1993-04-17</td><td>/z5gAdrfvLeO8rNTZobjLYPHyNB8.jpg</td><td>6.266</td><td>1</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/azzoBKN2mfPURWkcoVnqoRqn6yo.jpg</td><td>Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>5421</td><td>Rosso sangue</td><td>Monster Hunter</td><td>it</td><td>A priest-doctor chasing a man with supernatural regenerative abilities, who has recently escaped from a medical lab, reaches a small town where the mutant goes on a killing spree.</td><td>Pray you survive the hunt.</td><td>1981-10-01</td><td>/dI7QAlwCaWkzBGa3z466Cm1u6Jb.jpg</td><td>6.262</td><td>64</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3o0R2TDAyTaBsd0hS78NMj6cuvF.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>21619</td><td>King of the Ants</td><td>King of the Ants</td><td>en</td><td>A young drifter, struggling to makes ends meet, accepts a job to kill a prominent accountant. When he isn't paid for the hit, revenge is now his path.</td><td>They wanted a Fall Guy. They created a Monster.</td><td>2003-07-28</td><td>/bFsxsZlEDo1rMemCLZiR06z9YlF.jpg</td><td>6.262</td><td>52</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>102</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qjtrdukBRxjamfF93TqwBerWqBW.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>51215</td><td>The Breed</td><td>The Breed</td><td>en</td><td>Vampires have come out of the shadows and are living as normal citizens. Two policemen, one a vampire, are assigned to track down a serial killer who tears the throat of his victims and drains their blood.</td><td>NA</td><td>2001-07-19</td><td>/9oLpJMfJ7NtfQX9yNbG8GjyGexL.jpg</td><td>6.262</td><td>48</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jQ1OnD4CIrWjCcdQSCWs2ME5tEz.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>440397</td><td>A Demon Within</td><td>A Demon Within</td><td>en</td><td>A skeptical, small town doctor is forced to confront his personal demons in order to save the life of a teenage girl who has become possessed in his family's old house.</td><td>NA</td><td>2017-04-03</td><td>/1PdRPaUWyTu7Gn5UdhwxxSNLMH4.jpg</td><td>6.262</td><td>28</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3k1z50F7D8g7RUWgNhsPkCO8HrJ.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>53335</td><td>Candy Stripers</td><td>Candy Stripers</td><td>en</td><td>Thanks to an auto accident, a parasitic alien manages to get into a hospital. It quickly moves from the crash victim into a candy striper. Among the patients at the hospital are some rather short high school basketball players. It is through them that we watch the events unfold. The infected, or inhabited, candy striper becomes predatory. She goes after men for sex and after women to spread. Infected women develop an incredible sweet tooth and devour anything sweet they can find. The horror then spreads. As the horror takes over more of the hospital and the CDC locks it down, the basketball players and a few friends do everything they can to try and get out of the hospital. But soon it becomes evident that the problem has spread too far. Now if they manage to escape it will only be to delay the inevitable if they cannot halt the spread of aliens before they get out and take over the whole world.</td><td>They're running out of patients.</td><td>2006-06-27</td><td>/6RtNbXjAm6MAPaGz0JtlzPrwOU4.jpg</td><td>6.256</td><td>40</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/neu8M7iKr6gDNHwgIT9HWHkympe.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>254188</td><td>At the Devil's Door</td><td>At the Devil's Door</td><td>en</td><td>When ambitious young real estate agent Leigh is asked to sell a house with a checkered past, she crosses paths with a disturbed girl whom she learns is the runaway daughter of the couple selling the property. When Leigh tries to intervene and help her, she becomes entangled with a supernatural force that soon pulls Leigh's artist sister Vera into its web - and has sinister plans for both of them.</td><td>It's looking for a home.</td><td>2014-03-09</td><td>/veJ20fCOlKN60zWcNygmLkdu6EJ.jpg</td><td>6.256</td><td>208</td><td>4.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9BR1P9BsHltzi5V2CQEzZeUZbgh.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>74860</td><td>화이트: 저주의 멜로디</td><td>White: Melody of Death</td><td>ko</td><td>Pop band Pink Dolls emerges to stardom after releasing a remake of “White”, written by an anonymous composer. The more popular the members become, however, the more they become torn by jealousy and rivalries. But as the girls each take turns to become the lead vocalist, mysterious incidents occur.</td><td>Do not dare sing that song.</td><td>2011-06-09</td><td>/fcWrg1MS8U9gCiXwcRc8Jjjw4Td.jpg</td><td>6.255</td><td>68</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>106</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tbGcGpwSnl3XYUZdzQRrz9r3nuy.jpg</td><td>Horror, Music, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>267268</td><td>Más negro que la noche</td><td>Darker Than Night</td><td>es</td><td>When four women move into an old house left by one woman's aunt, strange things begin to happen. Bizarre voices, visions of ghosts, and mysterious noises lead them to discover the darkest powers of evil and a horror and agony beyond terror.</td><td>How many lives do you have?</td><td>2014-09-05</td><td>/la4Rq013z1UPnX5WNR14LAhzvsT.jpg</td><td>6.255</td><td>41</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/92bdC9l48sQdQmvQfkHL3M9Lsvn.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>347944</td><td>Anguish</td><td>Anguish</td><td>en</td><td>A new girl in a quiet town, Tess tries to manage her psychosis while adjusting to her new life with her mom. After stumbling upon the shrine of Lucy, a hit and run victim, Tess finds herself overwhelmed by hallucinations of the dead girl and starts to question her sanity again.  When the spirit possesses Tess’s mind and soul, mother and daughter are at a loss for where to turn next for salvation: religion or medicine?  Both institutions have failed them to date but faith leads them to the house of Sarah, Lucy’s mother, who has been despondent since the accident.  All together with time working against them, Sarah is desperate to believe that Lucy is still alive in Tess but neither parent wants to give up on their daughter.  Now that she understands what is happening to her, ultimately Tess must decide whether she wants to keep fighting or succumb to her affliction.</td><td>Her nightmares come when she's awake.</td><td>2015-07-21</td><td>/o8B3CIbIuxWhPf0G19lse4mJrLI.jpg</td><td>6.255</td><td>79</td><td>4.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/c1CjIhI75zzHgnVlx2SPpeSsuj6.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>90118</td><td>A Little Bit Zombie</td><td>A Little Bit Zombie</td><td>en</td><td>Infected by a virus, a mild mannered HR manager attempts to fulfill his overwhelming desire for brains, all while trying to keep it together so as not to incur the wrath of his bridezilla-to-be.</td><td>Dead or Alive, They're coming for Steve</td><td>2012-02-03</td><td>/bNDx7PrxTuagvRlVcVxAIfwPXI4.jpg</td><td>6.248</td><td>55</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lLOMTFCunQxLFDrxsf3AqKa6ywU.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>3117</td><td>Frankenstein and the Monster from Hell</td><td>Frankenstein and the Monster from Hell</td><td>en</td><td>Dr Simon Helder, sentenced to an insane asylum for crimes against humanity, recognises its director as the brilliant Baron Frankenstein, the man whose work he had been trying to emulate before his imprisonment. Frankenstein utilises Helder's medical knowledge for a project he has been working on for some time. He is assembling a man from vital organs extracted from various inmates in the asylum. And the Baron will resort to murder to acquire the perfect specimens for his most ambitious project ever.</td><td>Your blood will run cold when the monster rises.</td><td>1974-04-01</td><td>/pX5nLWXkxDGGMVAGflweRCKWbtQ.jpg</td><td>6.247</td><td>70</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tZby2Dnou723w4jFAb2Nlp3x8iC.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>123720</td><td>Frankenstein (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>44340</td><td>Wendigo</td><td>Wendigo</td><td>en</td><td>A family from the city decide to spend a weekend away at a friend's country farmhouse. But a fluke accident sets off a chain of events that alters their lives forever and conjures up the ferocious spirit of the Wendigo.</td><td>NA</td><td>2001-01-23</td><td>/bykeJiJuRnJYLj7cAlDvN28xemj.jpg</td><td>6.247</td><td>65</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tj0KX9pqoRuFzvIkHVx8Hyk9DV1.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>40729</td><td>Gate II</td><td>Gate II</td><td>en</td><td>It's been five years since Terry's friend Glen discovered The Gate to hell in his backyard. Glen has now moved away and Terry begins practicing rituals in Glen's old house and eventually bringing back demons through The Gate and leading to demoniac possession and near world domination.</td><td>There's only one thing more terrifying than the first visit. The second.</td><td>1990-05-24</td><td>/3XyBlFPfr1mAeplN1deQfQ3oHmb.jpg</td><td>6.245</td><td>63</td><td>5.5</td><td>6500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/23zVoKThY3zrlZbsBYXLLbhahEx.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>340623</td><td>The Gate Collection</td></tr><tr><td>190899</td><td>Dead Mine</td><td>Dead Mine</td><td>id</td><td>The legend of Yamashita's Gold lures a treasure hunter and his group deep into the Indonesian jungle. Once they are trapped in an abandoned World War II Japanese bunker, they face the terrifying reality that the only way out is to go further in.</td><td>Some things are better left buried.</td><td>2012-09-27</td><td>/qs1eHTW1VjYwEKN5vfGeyC4793U.jpg</td><td>6.24</td><td>91</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/3EwzGnrZQGUT1Z43Xq1mAKgbGwE.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>421848</td><td>Recovery</td><td>Recovery</td><td>en</td><td>The night before their high school graduation, Jessie and her friends are guided by a 'Find My iPhone' app to recover her lost device from a house whose demented tenants are hell bent on making her a flesh and blood member of the family.</td><td>Who's following you?</td><td>2016-10-27</td><td>/7uIuw63NgUwXQKVtshIwLQP1sX0.jpg</td><td>6.237</td><td>74</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2u3MmN9ezNxYCZvJPX2IdlpWCJK.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29797</td><td>Ed Gein: The Butcher of Plainfield</td><td>Ed Gein: The Butcher of Plainfield</td><td>en</td><td>Inspired by the true story of one of the most gruesome killers in American history. Now, years after inspiring \"Psycho's\" Norman Bates, \"The Silence Of The Lambs'\" Buffalo Bill and \"The Texas Chainsaw Massacre's\" Leatherface, the story of real life serial killer Ed Gein is told once again. Nicknamed \"The Butcher Of Plainfield,\" Gein was responsible for a rash of gory murders that sent shock waves through his rural Wisconsin town, and across America, in the late 1950's. Prepare to enter the evil mind and twisted world of \"The Butcher Of Plainfield.\"</td><td>NA</td><td>2007-03-06</td><td>/zzbNKEH8pLypYv0uDfGqih38L3z.jpg</td><td>6.235</td><td>24</td><td>3.6</td><td>1500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/52bKjFHSRtslOPO0lG9d9v2Dv0z.jpg</td><td>Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>42251</td><td>Forbidden World</td><td>Forbidden World</td><td>en</td><td>In the distant future, a federation marshal arrives at a research lab on a remote planet where a genetic experiment has gotten loose and begins feeding on the dwindling scientific group.</td><td>Part alien … part human …  all nightmare.</td><td>1982-05-07</td><td>/8hAz9mIEgbFg2t4EfM4ANI3uacY.jpg</td><td>6.233</td><td>97</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>77</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4EGOn4oRcfw8wOfNXtHLxbRCEKc.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>323694</td><td>Nina Forever</td><td>Nina Forever</td><td>en</td><td>Holly loves Rob and tries to help him through his grief – even if it means contending with his dead girlfriend Nina, who comes back, bloody and broken, every time they make love</td><td>A fucked up fairy tale</td><td>2015-03-14</td><td>/l6fIaMjMx4bCHLvgCcnNfWctfm2.jpg</td><td>6.233</td><td>124</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/muwhcC5NJlFtSLkDk9EVdc9jgwm.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>3037</td><td>Yella</td><td>Yella</td><td>de</td><td>Yella flees her hometown in former East Germany for a new life in the West to escape her violent ex-husband. Just as she begins to realize her dreams, buried truths threaten to destroy her newfound happiness.</td><td>NA</td><td>2007-09-13</td><td>/axC6pBrFc7Y2I6pFzvvte9uRf9x.jpg</td><td>6.232</td><td>66</td><td>6.2</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4GeaiLZkVtCDMoPHPsDEXVQSGjB.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Romance, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>11376</td><td>The Pool</td><td>The Pool</td><td>en</td><td>International students at an elite Prague school are stalked and murdered by a masked killer while holding a party in an abandoned water park.</td><td>Evil has surfaced.</td><td>2001-10-04</td><td>/nTsnm6cEP9wiSggBByQ05EVusw.jpg</td><td>6.232</td><td>73</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>14795</td><td>Baby Blues</td><td>Baby Blues</td><td>en</td><td>On a secluded family farm, a mother suffers a psychotic break due to postpartum depression, forcing the eldest son to protect his sibling from the mother they have always known and loved.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-08-05</td><td>/8w9n4fSKXXbZTi2jKC5f5pw39gL.jpg</td><td>6.229</td><td>71</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jIQpY0P9I5h8dm2HkbzJSKfDpXR.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>40969</td><td>Terror Train</td><td>Terror Train</td><td>en</td><td>A masked killer targets six college kids responsible for a prank gone wrong three years earlier and who are currently throwing a large New Year's Eve costume party aboard a moving train.</td><td>The boys and girls of Sigma Phi. Some will live. Some will die.</td><td>1980-10-03</td><td>/jeDVKkeCk9U75a0TZ4mezylXy3j.jpg</td><td>6.228</td><td>189</td><td>5.9</td><td>3500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nxEjIKPPuP1X58kja6J0Qtmkeus.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>48131</td><td>The Shout</td><td>The Shout</td><td>en</td><td>Bored while officiating a