ased</td><td>false</td><td>/t0FBdpxoAVFKL8Wb6er0Uvzz73F.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>84577</td><td>7 Below</td><td>7 Below</td><td>en</td><td>The story centers on a group of strangers trapped in a time warp house where a terrible event transpired exactly 100 years prior.</td><td>Evil has found a new home.</td><td>2012-04-16</td><td>/qP7tRnSpuQngVD7MPnHH3yqewiO.jpg</td><td>6.08</td><td>73</td><td>3.5</td><td>6000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/rhMIrfCQpz8CEZGlW17302su9h5.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>603945</td><td>The La Llorona Curse</td><td>The La Llorona Curse</td><td>en</td><td>A paranormal television show crew investigates a home where alleged paranormal sightings of La Llorona (The Crying Woman) have occurred. Soon, the group finds themselves in a life or death fight as one of the world's oldest urban legends comes to life before their eyes.</td><td>HIDE THE CHILDREN</td><td>2019-04-08</td><td>/5TlQSWf9sdiWstDyUsBBsqwbwmP.jpg</td><td>6.079</td><td>6</td><td>7.0</td><td>15000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>78</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/2loHXVCbKRcZpUbMrAMovN20dfo.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>422708</td><td>Laissez bronzer les cadavres</td><td>Let the Corpses Tan</td><td>fr</td><td>With a heavy haul of 250 kilograms of gold bullion, the grizzled criminal mastermind, Rhino, and his ruthless gang of cutthroats, head to a ramshackle retreat somewhere in the Mediterranean to lay low on a scorching day of July. However, the unexpected and rather unwelcome arrival of the bohemian writer, Bernier, his muse, Luce, along with a pair of no-joke gendarmes further complicates things, as the frail allegiances will soon be put to the test.</td><td>Who shall live and who shall die?!</td><td>2017-10-18</td><td>/gpX8cHuwlQ6anmxkVZXG2oTt9Lv.jpg</td><td>6.077</td><td>92</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false