nd at their remote country home - a large wooden crate containing a gun, a female zombie and an instruction sheet telling them not to feed her meat. The family is concerned, of course, but she seems harmless enough. Perhaps she can help clean up outside?</td><td>NA</td><td>2013-09-14</td><td>/qK3KGQoAqx7V38FGgNO8IMHUZDU.jpg</td><td>6.003</td><td>33</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/inSBNjjHZIwdABucsBTijmmXzQJ.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>50515</td><td>Todd McFarlane's Spawn 3: The Ultimate Battle</td><td>Todd McFarlane's Spawn 3: The Ultimate Battle</td><td>en</td><td>Spawn is still on his quest to return to his love, Wanda, but is still in trouble. He is guided though by Cogliostro, who is the only one who can give him his humanity back.</td><td>NA</td><td>1999-08-17</td><td>/yRH4gR4IKG8LfvhWT1BxeZVOvsM.jpg</td><td>6.002</td><td>21</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>140</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Action, Animation, Horror</td><td>184225</td><td>Todd McFarlane's Spawn</td></tr><tr><td>58864</td><td>The Boneyard</td><td>The Boneyard</td><td>en</td><td>Children turned into zombies wreak havoc in a coroner's building with just a burned-out psychic, an experienced cop and two coroners to stop the madness.</td><td>NA</td><td>1991-06-12</td><td>/2wGgo3Rue2rnnE0QezWRgPwV54e.jpg</td><td>6.002</td><td>26</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wd3LaNaPuwONQ0LjRLDDqOKoG47.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>37227</td><td>Of Unknown Origin</td><td>Of Unknown Origin</td><td>en</td><td>A man who recently completed rebuilding a townhouse becomes obsessed with a rat infestation until it becomes an interspecies duel.</td><td>Two forces have claimed the house. Only one will survive.</td><td>1983-11-24</td><td>/wAp9xKPnJIgxz7IosnrleABnyh5.jpg</td><td>6.0</td><td>66</td><td>5.8</td><td>40