/td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>226269</td><td>13/13/13</td><td>13/13/13</td><td>en</td><td>It's the 13th month of the 13th year of the new millennium.</td><td>On that day... we are demon.</td><td>2013-09-30</td><td>/3WcsPCnLYAVzNSsmhLiw3Wj0IKi.jpg</td><td>5.983</td><td>38</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sf9jzho2kyzCEeoYs58C8ywDIT.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>25241</td><td>Squirm</td><td>Squirm</td><td>en</td><td>At the beginning of the film, we learn from one of the characters that earthworms can be called to the surface with electricity, but somehow it turns them into vicious flesh-eaters. Sure enough, a storm that night causes some power lines to break and touch the ground, drawing millions of man-eating worms out of the earth, and into town where they quickly start munching on the locals.</td><td>This was the night of the CRAWLING TERROR!</td><td>1976-07-30</td><td>/1Gp2Q5DzGmn23cJXVMKsTL5tdoJ.jpg</td><td>5.978</td><td>84</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/pv6hyhnCTBRO0hx2eI6ebNAkPeV.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>54013</td><td>Stridulum</td><td>The Visitor</td><td>en</td><td>An ancient intergalactic warrior arrives on Earth to put a stop to a demonic child's plot to reproduce Satan's next generation of evil.</td><td>They know we are here...</td><td>1979-03-14</td><td>/nO6pEHO2bewFPgDxxdRI2taKLir.jpg</td><td>5.975</td><td>72</td><td>5.2</td><td>800000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>109</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bVsGMzJ1jpJpxCzzGbXjvrd4Hcq.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>463022</td><td>The Super</td><td>The Super</td><td>en</td><td>A man becomes the superintendent of a large New York City apartment building where people mysteriously go missing.</td><td>He has your keys</td><td>2018-11-08</td><td>/mDBehHmeelcJm53shZto74BTFjA.jpg</td><td>5.974</td><td>121</td><t