 personal problems, including alcoholism.  He is recruited by the archbishop to perform a series of exorcisms.  This is the apparent true account of the last exorcism known to have been done by the catholic church.</td><td>NA</td><td>2000-10-22</td><td>/lksgBRKSmi0quAx1X9c9l4IJhpm.jpg</td><td>5.961</td><td>28</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/t1EnlBK2AbrkyAqfUltgbWpeU46.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>30785</td><td>Evil Toons</td><td>Evil Toons</td><td>en</td><td>Four sexy young girls are to clean an old house for the new owners. They get delivered an old book full of magic incantations, and while reading it they accidentally bring a cartoon character to life. The cartoon character likes the blood of young girls...</td><td>First they undress you, then they possess you!</td><td>1992-01-08</td><td>/bseeUdbDcZpc8MXZmFF3Q1YcbXD.jpg</td><td>5.958</td><td>76</td><td>4.8</td><td>140000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/myegxFpJJoKFUnNcJbrduM5smw2.jpg</td><td>Animation, Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>43099</td><td>Mothman</td><td>Mothman</td><td>en</td><td>A group of friends band together to hide the truth about a mutual friend's tragic death. They soon discover that an evil entity is in pursuit of them.</td><td>NA</td><td>2010-04-24</td><td>/kjkV7US2Js4kRlEjAnBuLzDEl0D.jpg</td><td>5.953</td><td>26</td><td>3.8</td><td>2000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>548257</td><td>Alien Predator</td><td>Alien Predator</td><td>en</td><td>A black ops reconnaissance team is sent to investigate the crash of an unidentified aircraft. When they arrive, they find strange markings and residue visible only in infrared. As the team gets deeper in and tries to figure out the source of the markings, they discover that they are being hunted by an alien expedition to Earth.</td><td>Join the hunt</td><td>2018-09-11</td><td>/jxHWPPNXhegzZHCUSgjlPwnuQ2C.jpg</td><td>5.95</td><td>27</td><td>4.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kc20ajqICqsLjvgbfHNnWhDVc85.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>996067</td><td>Marerittet</td><td>The Nightmare</td><td>no</td><td>Mona moves into a big apartment in an old building with her boyfriend Robby, who has just landed his dream job, and soon falls pregnant with their first child. She is plagued by bad dreams, and when the new-born baby next door dies, her crippling nightmares intensify - night after night, the same demon attacks her in her sleep. Mona begins to believe that the creature is very real and that it is seeking to enter our world through her unborn child. Soon she will realize that not all nightmares are over when you wake up.</td><td>Are you awake?</td><td>2022-10-01</td><td>/rB58Y7K1jJQ9btFHTjpbDiE9SkW.jpg</td><td>5.948</td><td>1</td><td>10.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ussW0Ljn10DEwigYrQG0OiJLV4.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>369032</td><td>Carnage Park</td><td>Carnage Park</td><td>en</td><td>Part crime caper gone awry, part survival horror film, this 1970s set thriller depicts a harrowing fight for survival after a pair of wannabe crooks botch a bank heist and flee into the desert, where they inexplicably stumble upon Carnage Park, a remote stretch of wilderness occupied by a psychotic ex-military sniper.</td><td>Out here, God don't pick no favorites</td><td>2016-07-01</td><td>/v5PNynq0yMJOWyu0WbZYHiU3Ez7.jpg</td><td>5.946</td><td>98</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>81</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gJZgXTFQjkHh2ndd80RLJhoI7Fr.jpg</td><td>Action, Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>459068</td><td>Darkness Rising</td><td>Darkness Rising<