g pretty grisly going on under London in the Tube tunnels between Holborn and Russell Square. When a top civil servant becomes the latest to disappear down there Scotland Yard start to take the matter seriously. Helping them are a young couple who get nearer to the horrors underground than they would wish.</td><td>Beneath Modern London Lives a Tribe of Once Humans. Neither Men Nor Women… They Are the Raw Meat Of The Human Race!</td><td>1972-10-13</td><td>/kXrFXtJRQ2qR6Z45fozdj8tKeTu.jpg</td><td>5.848</td><td>83</td><td>5.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/vVF9gIGrjrIqbvwPoOty8cBOm8t.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>171540</td><td>מי מפחד מהזאב הרע</td><td>Big Bad Wolves</td><td>he</td><td>Tel Aviv, Israel. The twisted paths of three very different men brutally collide due to a chain of unspeakable murders: a grieving father who has been doomed to seek vengeance and a police detective who boldly crosses the narrow boundary between law and crime meet a religion teacher suspected of being the murderer.</td><td>Some men are created evil</td><td>2013-04-21</td><td>/7SEdoH6qBIYNhIV7H9cFSRe3wO1.jpg</td><td>5.848</td><td>301</td><td>6.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>33232.0</td><td>106</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/wfPuo9AhLAjRWHzrvpBm9Imcmlw.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>34084</td><td>I Bury the Living</td><td>I Bury the Living</td><td>en</td><td>A newly appointed cemetery chairman believes that, merely by inserting a black plot-marking pin into a wall-sized map of the cemetery, he can cause the deaths of that plot's owner.</td><td>Out of a Time-Rotted Tomb Crawls an Unspeakable Horror!</td><td>1958-07-01</td><td>/3qBNVDbdXNRsexZ5mLvMcvItayH.jpg</td><td>5.846</td><td>52</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>76</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/nlkH0ogQMrc6U1hSihmkcGcWTDt.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>40218</td><td>The Beast Must Die</td><td>The Beast Must Die</td><td>en</td><td>Wealthy big game hunter Tom Newcliffe has tracked and killed practically every type of animal in the world. But one creature still evades him, the biggest game of all - a werewolf.</td><td>One of these eight people will turn into a werewolf. Can you guess who it is when we stop the film for the WEREWOLF BREAK? See it ... solve it ... but don't tell!</td><td>1974-04-01</td><td>/fNJLiSDHjQdoZzB1EfjSORZE1ra.jpg</td><td>5.845</td><td>54</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>93</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4HneEoZhVrxgqG4PODxxdf9EwSB.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>35862</td><td>Vase de noces</td><td>Wedding Trough</td><td>fr</td><td>Alone on a farm, a man spends his days tending to his animals, with a particular love for his sow. After an illicit encounter between the two creatures, the pig gives birth. However, tragedy strikes when the man tries to force the newborn piglets to love him as he loves them.</td><td>He prefers a sow. And he will know the enjoyment and the joys of fatherhood.</td><td>1974-12-26</td><td>/dEogkoYgFgVChu2fcaA8KhJXiJI.jpg</td><td>5.844</td><td>44</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qxocP27gvQ1tJEwD5saIsEHhR4b.jpg</td><td>Horror, Romance</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>41235</td><td>Ritual</td><td>Ritual</td><td>en</td><td>An American doctor encounters members of a voodoo cult when she is summoned to Jamaica to treat a wealthy man's brother.</td><td>Older than bones. Darker than blood. Stronger than science.</td><td>2002-01-01</td><td>/ps1sv6oDel3CHIs1SsRf4gjYoKK.jpg</td><td>5.843</td><td>51</td><td>4.6</td><td>1.0E7</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xgY06VjTlPNBrlejlViI8L70V6j.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>115142</td><td>Tales from the Crypt Collection</td></tr><tr><td>64624</td><td>La residencia</td><td>The House That Screamed</td><td>es</td><td>Southern France, 19th century. Teresa, a young girl, arrives at an isolated female boarding school that is tyrannically mastered by Mrs. Fourneau, the strict headmistress, whose protective shadow haunts Luis, her weak son.</td><td>One by one they will die!</td><td>1969-12-01</td><td>/miAtPmHRfJWMqv9UelRqM0viMZ2.jpg</td><td>5.841</td><td>65</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>100</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sklCLzusOGzyraEmVoKVkizLEFA.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16179</td><td>Breathing Room</td><td>Breathing Room</td><td>en</td><td>Thrown naked into a desolate room with thirteen strangers, Tonya discovers that she is the final contestant in a deadly game. Restrained by lethal electronic collars, the players must utilize hints and tools from a box marked \"pieces\" to find both an exit and the reason for their abduction. One by one the players are eliminated as their \"curfew\" begins and the lights go out. With each dead body comes another clue, which they use to discover that one of them is the killer. The question is ... which one?</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-08-25</td><td>/aaz4rgsEjApkUz87OrFT6sNZDks.jpg</td><td>5.84</td><td>69</td><td>4.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/xWu4JOltqruhxRicgLutbAqkG5c.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>87852</td><td>Microwave Massacre</td><td>Microwave Massacre</td><td>en</td><td>Construction worker Donald is having a hard time getting anything good to eat since his wife has decided to only cook gourmet foods. That and her constant harping causes him to snap, so he whacks her. Somewhere in the confusion he comes up with a new use for the microwave oven, and begins to eat much better. Soon he's experimenting with different recipes. And different meats.</td><td>MAY'S IN THE MICROWAVE!</td><td>1983-08-31</td><td>/4nzXjtfeOQqoLK2ZuUwI5SpRgGV.jpg</td><td>5.839</td><td>62</td><td>4.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>76</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7vTBwovqe8fupbtI1oYjHfeBpPV.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>34288</td><td>The Last Broadcast</td><td>The Last Broadcast</td><td>en</td><td>Bristling with equipment, two enthusiastic local access cable TV producers recruit an assistant and venture into a forest in search of the mythical and horrifying Jersey Devil. Days later, only one of the trio emerges. He becomes the prime suspect in the disappearances of the other two. However, a local filmmaker examines extensive footage found at the scene and arrives at a different conclusion.</td><td>What actually happened that night in the woods?</td><td>1998-10-23</td><td>/wexVSBnfx4fggSmLxzn1kc51Q5.jpg</td><td>5.837</td><td>80</td><td>5.1</td><td>900.0</td><td>12097.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qbCFTFSrCiQJwR7mYDt8jvmq8ez.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>786110</td><td>Jakob's Wife</td><td>Jakob's Wife</td><td>en</td><td>Bodies start to pile up when a woman discovers a new sense of power and an appetite to live bigger and bolder than ever before.</td><td>Who's Your Master?</td><td>2021-04-16</td><td>/hsOSdY9ALwBLP41c6tAF5UXkpc0.jpg</td><td>5.837</td><td>77</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>30000.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/82nMlTXtXiexSGKpYpEIsnGzebK.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>880260</td><td>Las Brujas</td><td>The Witches</td><td>es</td><td>In the 1990s, in a region of Colombia, men are disappearing mysteriously. A commander of the armed group that controls the region accuses a group of mothers, victims of violence, who are said to bewitch the men. When the commander burns one of them alive, the women decide to go into hiding.</td><td>NA</td><td>2021-10-08</td><td>/v4nDfeNUexHcuFT6zezJDOH1TcX.jpg</td><td>5.837</td><td>1</td><td>2.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>14</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>29852</td><td>Night of the Dark Full Moon</td><td>Silent Night, Bloody Night</td><td>en</td><td>On Christmas Eve 1950, Wilfred Butler dies in a burning accident outside his mansion in East Willard, Massachusetts. The residence is bequeathed to his grandson, Jeffrey. Twenty years later, lawyer John Carter arrives in East Willard on Christmas Eve with his assistant and mistress Ingrid, having been charged by Jeffrey (now registered as a patient in a mental asylum) to sell the house. The house, the town, even Jeffrey himself — all hold dark secrets that will be brought to light.</td><td>The mansion… the madness… the maniac… no escape.</td><td>1972-11-01</td><td>/yNHK5ln8K815S1zNeUyqEG8lqC2.jpg</td><td>5.836</td><td>62</td><td>5.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/201QQCqdrYh2fuPYWRAxB3hSBw.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>323366</td><td>Pod</td><td>Pod</td><td>en</td><td>A family intervention goes horrifically awry within the snowy confines of an isolated lake house.</td><td>NA</td><td>2015-03-16</td><td>/bL3wnFJ9mbsEsYyFC5bHhuJCft9.jpg</td><td>5.835</td><td>99</td><td>4.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>76</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/gyF9fCmphLbP19fhkli1L3jEj7F.jpg</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>43085</td><td>Dead and Deader</td><td>Dead and Deader</td><td>en</td><td>Lt. Bobby Quinn is a Special Forces commando killed during a recon mission in the Cambodian jungle. But when Quinn interrupts his own stateside autopsy, he discovers that the rest of his dead squad has been resurrected with a ravenous apetite for human flesh. Now with the help of a wisecracking cook and a sexy film geek, the part-zombie Quinn must stop the plague before it can infect the entire nation. Who holds the shocking secret behind this blood-crazed carnage? And what happens when Quinn stops gnawing on raw steak and starts chomping on the hot chick?</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-12-16</td><td>/bZpdTgpd1teT2J3H9b5SXKuMjFk.jpg</td><td>5.833</td><td>22</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Action, Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>52788</td><td>Sisters</td><td>Sisters</td><td>en</td><td>A reporter witnesses a brutal murder, and becomes entangled in a mystery involving a pair of Siamese twins who were separated at birth, one of them forced to live under the eye of a watchful, controlling psychiatrist.</td><td>NA</td><td>2006-11-10</td><td>/pX8bZUk4dZbHB2FMDCpVQpQwqWd.jpg</td><td>5.831</td><td>53</td><td>3.8</td><td>60000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>46959</td><td>36.15 code Père Noël</td><td>Game Over</td><td>fr</td><td>Thomas, a very intelligent and resourceful child, is left alone with his beloved and fragile granddad on Christmas Eve, when a psychopath dressed as Santa Claus breaks into their mansion and starts chasing them. Thomas will do whatever he can to save himself and his granddad, leaving much of his childhood innocence behind.</td><td>When the World of Childhood Encounters That of Horror</td><td>1990-01-17</td><td>/sFbHQyEmrJeSEFDOCdSybeDYWGY.jpg</td><td>5.829</td><td>66</td><td>6.2</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/y0UUSKi6b5uTRSZ4cZ6Np3nwl5U.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>274477</td><td>Snakehead Swamp</td><td>Snakehead Swamp</td><td>en</td><td>A horrifying hybrid of genetic science and nature has taken over the Louisiana bayou, leaving terror in its wake! In the heat of the summer, what began as an day of boating and bikinis changes drastically when a school of genetically enhanced snakehead fish finds their way into Black Briar Swamp.</td><td>When you're in the bayou, you're dead in the water.</td><td>2014-06-28</td><td>/jDfjRI1F81fgdqqcHxeIidM8kT9.jpg</td><td>5.825</td><td>32</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8ko6WTiJCXEYU7Srg4c8coSHLR2.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>7988</td><td>The Island</td><td>The Island</td><td>en</td><td>David Nau leads a band of modern day pirates who raid yachts and sail boats of people on vacation in the Caribbean. When reporter Blair Maynard and his son arrive to investigate the mystery of the disappearing boats, Nau and his band of raiders decide to induct them into their tribe.</td><td>For three hundred years a terrifying secret has been kept from the outside world.</td><td>1980-06-13</td><td>/1sRdwKeWAfXEThF8v3Oz9qMUhIM.jpg</td><td>5.824</td><td>64</td><td>5.2</td><td>2.2E7</td><td>1.57E7</td><td>114</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9MVGH5OR9DzWu7foCSHQBWcGztv.jpg</td><td>Action, Adventure, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>67740</td><td>Butcher, Baker, Nightmare Maker</td><td>Butcher, Baker, Nightmare Maker</td><td>en</td><td>Rejected by her lover, the only man left in Cheryl's life is the orphaned nephew she has raised as her own son. She'll stop at nothing to keep Billy with her. When her plans misfire, she is swept up into an insane frenzy that means death to anyone who comes between her and her obsession. But the investigating detective is convinced that Billy is the real killer - and determined to prove it. Madness and fanaticism work together to drag all concerned into a terrifying vortex of blood-letting that adds a nightmarish twist to the classic Oedipus story.</td><td>She was lonely. He was all she had. No-one would take him from her - and live...</td><td>1981-11-20</td><td>/a1EpGJRGSxsM8HKOSFpSJYbbZOI.jpg</td><td>5.824</td><td>87</td><td>6.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/mkYQZ0P75jDNPe6YQoh1B2Qk14f.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>114003</td><td>Jersey Shore Shark Attack</td><td>Jersey Shore Shark Attack</td><td>en</td><td>Many years ago, hundreds of locals and tourists were massacred by giant man-eating sharks in the infamous 1916 Jersey Shore attacks. But that's just a legend... or is it? It's a holiday weekend on the Jersey Shore and, unbeknownst to anyone, underwater drills have attracted dozens of albino bull sharks to the pier. When a man goes missing, TC (The Complication), Nookie and friends fear the worst and plead with the police chief to close down the beach. It isn't until a famous singer is eaten alive during a performance on the pier that the shark hunt begins. Now, the Preppies must work together with the Guidos in order to save the Jersey Shore and its inhabitants from another vicious slaughter.</td><td>NA</td><td>2012-06-09</td><td>/6MN2a4pGCdWiEtOAz15MYGIGcSc.jpg</td><td>5.819</td><td>28</td><td>5.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Action, Comedy, Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>3023</td><td>Abbott and Costello Meet Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde</td><td>Abbott and Costello Meet Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde</td><td>en</td><td>Abbott and Costello, two bumbling American cops on exchange in London, hunt for Mr. Hyde—the monster that has been terrorizing the city.</td><td>All New ! All Wild ! All Fun !</td><td>1953-08-01</td><td>/spZzSuujqiYHMK5pIvJOS5LDYD0.jpg</td><td>5.817</td><td>57</td><td>6.6</td><td>724805.0</td><td>1200000.0</td><td>76</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/aM81XfMvYyb1Qpig5rp8tOodRjt.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>403100</td><td>Scared Topless</td><td>Scared Topless</td><td>en</td><td>A group of unsuspecting college students explore a haunted house and get more than they bargained for when the sexual frenzy of the paranormal world reveals itself.<