aining a terrible secret, a creature that will kill everyone else in his family unless he passes it on to someone he loves to continue its never-ending circulation.</td><td>Big things come in small packages</td><td>2017-01-11</td><td>/tsTzpzL1qrh6PSP8kX8f6HDRulo.jpg</td><td>5.693</td><td>45</td><td>4.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8NJga8sxf3t4O5xQXWJVxrv8OmV.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>40258</td><td>Baby Blood</td><td>Baby Blood</td><td>fr</td><td>A cruel circus owner beats and abuses his pregnant wife. One day the circus receives a leopard newly captured in Africa, but the animal soon dies. However, an evil creature that was inside the leopard bursts out of the animal's body, burrows into the wife's body and takes over her fetus. It soon starts demanding blood, and the woman goes searching for victims for her new \"baby.\"</td><td>It's time to feed the baby.</td><td>1990-01-24</td><td>/hSPq7k7rbxAH7KTVxRmy98OIsq7.jpg</td><td>5.692</td><td>38</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>82</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/oudiWD59jcZaldeSevx4lAeyBYK.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>745329</td><td>... Blood Collection</td></tr><tr><td>42872</td><td>Alien 2 - Sulla terra</td><td>Alien 2: On Earth</td><td>it</td><td>A group of cave explorers are confronted in an underground cavern by a mysterious living rock. Little do they know that it bears home to deadly, flesh-eating creatures, intent on wiping out the entire human population. An ultra low-budget, unofficial and unauthorized sequel to the 1979 film Alien, although the plot has little connection to the original film.</td><td>NA</td><td>1980-04-11</td><td>/3LLfieDmGmfQ0PTJfNIaLR2y69C.jpg</td><td>5.692</td><td>43</td><td>3.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8pBcRyi6cZnUC48Gd4nksr3ZHOX.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>99099</td><td>徳川女刑罰史</td><td>Shogun'