orror tales all loosely linked together. In this one, all the stories involve tourists from Hong Kong visiting the Philippines on holiday.</td><td>NA</td><td>1998-08-22</td><td>/8ZEvceIMhLsmCkJpvMTFdEmDtnK.jpg</td><td>5.612</td><td>3</td><td>2.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qldFUVlZpS2XgsHUNp6vbkBtGlH.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror</td><td>403643</td><td>Troublesome Night Collection</td></tr><tr><td>50173</td><td>地獄</td><td>Jigoku</td><td>ja</td><td>A group of sinners involved in interconnected tales of murder, revenge, deceit and adultery all meet at the Gates of Hell.</td><td>NA</td><td>1960-07-30</td><td>/ehiMOuKE7i9WHgvs7dSIZelsHwA.jpg</td><td>5.61</td><td>76</td><td>6.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>99</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/4ZVAAGCGDYncbZhjEgnfU1v2iQD.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>300790</td><td>Don't Hug Me I'm Scared 3</td><td>Don't Hug Me I'm Scared 3</td><td>en</td><td>During a chicken picnic, Yellow Guy gets upset after Green Bird kills a butterfly. Yellow Guy then meets a butterfly that takes him on a journey to discover his concept of love.</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-10-31</td><td>/52EaZOsohAxO2URGC1cO6JSo7rk.jpg</td><td>5.61</td><td>53</td><td>7.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>7</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/cJDSgiLfO8uqSeprHY88rCAMq6g.jpg</td><td>Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Music</td><td>559735</td><td>Don't Hug Me I'm Scared Collection</td></tr><tr><td>43065</td><td>Nightmares in Red, White and Blue</td><td>Nightmares in Red, White and Blue</td><td>en</td><td>An exploration of the appeal of horror films, with interviews of many legendary directors in the genre.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-08-06</td><td>/lI1MdPIr8zghXVGvOX7J2k3YJt5.jpg</td><td>5.609</td><td>61</td><td>6.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>96</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qXDWHIdY5N4dLbOEmzHzXEmPbDs.jpg</td><td>Documentary, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>69272</td><td>Grim</td><td>Grim</td><td>en</td><td>A team of spelunkers, when investigating a system of caves beneath a small town, come across a hideous creature that can move through walls.</td><td>This ain't no fairy tale...</td><td>1995-01-01</td><td>/siMKGThzvw5kbbmsVG16Rximu2r.jpg</td><td>5.608</td><td>13</td><td>4.0</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>66892</td><td>Tale of the Mummy</td><td>Tale of the Mummy</td><td>en</td><td>Centuries ago, under the sands of ancient Egypt, a Prince was buried and his tomb eternally cursed so that no man would ever again suffer from his evil ways. But hundreds of years later on a greedy search for treasure, a group of archaeologists break the cursed seal of the tomb. Every man vanishes without a trace, leaving behind only a log book, and a deadly warning of the legend of the bloodthirsty Talos.</td><td>The curse is legend. The terror is real.</td><td>1998-03-19</td><td>/tauZsCSZ9a5IvzBZmsX1sl1vDrQ.jpg</td><td>5.605</td><td>79</td><td>4.4</td><td>8000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/em4nfgXczAUXuuyT6kJc4llwONw.jpg</td><td>Adventure, Fantasy, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>32173</td><td>분신사바</td><td>Bunshinsaba: Ouija Board</td><td>ko</td><td>Yu-jin and her blind mother move to a small village from Seoul. On her first day at the new school, Yu-jin gets picked on by her classmates. Along with other victims of hatred, Yu-jin puts a curse on the four girls tormenting them through a Ouija Board. On her second day at school, one of the spellbound bursts into flames and dies just as she sits down where Yu-jin used the board. The next day, another victim burns to death, and now the school is enclosed by horror.</td><td>NA</td><td>2004-08-05</td><td>/24DnruFa2Jr5j9ay6J7XiI8GOvv.jpg</td><td>5.604</td><td>55</td><td>6.2</td><td>2500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>92</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><