ased</td><td>false</td><td>/7N5SlVfbQcpTvdCx5hCBAD0DSLA.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>93369</td><td>Ringu Collection</td></tr><tr><td>5485</td><td>Gli orrori del castello di Norimberga</td><td>Baron Blood</td><td>it</td><td>A young man, Peter, returns to Austria in search of his heritage. There he visits the castle of an ancestor, a sadistic Baron who was cursed to a violent death by a witch whom the Baron had burned at the stake. Peter reads aloud the incantation that causes Baron Blood to return and continue his murderous tortures.</td><td>He sought the ultimate in HUMAN AGONY... with instruments of TORTURE ghastly beyond belief!</td><td>1972-02-25</td><td>/62uQ7UABPvTbPnSBwz3tOgCHdNm.jpg</td><td>5.597</td><td>94</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8ikAaI3jxHevWGlaaGtcjQ45dq9.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27711</td><td>Killjoy</td><td>Killjoy</td><td>en</td><td>Deep in an inner city hell, a ghastly figure is killing off the bad guys. A vigilante, or a demon? For the beautiful high school student, Jada, that's the question that will bring her face to face with the killer clown Killjoy.</td><td>He's playing for life... he's not playing for laughs...</td><td>2000-10-24</td><td>/s576k2BjMnT7wKx3so0sRXZDzmK.jpg</td><td>5.596</td><td>42</td><td>2.9</td><td>150000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/tSjMGRDNzVj519bnChXvfuiYq7o.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>416305</td><td>Killjoy Collection</td></tr><tr><td>58903</td><td>Creature</td><td>Creature</td><td>en</td><td>A crew of scientists arrives on a far, cold planet to examine archaic artifacts of unknown origin. They discover that their German enemies already have a ship there. When they seek their help after a failed landing, they only find the Germans’ bodies, obviously slaughtered by one of the archaic creatures, awoken to new life. Now the alien is after them.</td><td>It's been sleeping peacefully on a moon of Saturn for 2000 centuries ... until now!</td><td>1985-05-08</td><td>/tv4xMEUqYvfJAW9BtUF25JnCHqS.jpg</td><td>5.594</td><td>71</td><td>4.6</td><td>750000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/kLYYE04tobczLNYsKWZE5SdkoJc.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>120253</td><td>ジェノサイバー</td><td>Genocyber</td><td>ja</td><td>As the nations of the world begin to merge, world peace is threatened by the private armies of individual corporations. The Kuryu Group has just discovered a weapon that will tip world power in their favor. The Genocyber: a nightmarish combination of cybernetics and psychic potential. Many desire to control this monstrosity, but can its hatred be contained... Battle erupts, and the cyberpunk world of the future is about to explode with violence.</td><td>NA</td><td>1994-03-02</td><td>/wOkkhlHW2tZIGxRnRMagYmpgMhP.jpg</td><td>5.594</td><td>20</td><td>4.9</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>145</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/jpN0SWrhcKUbkjiP1Rt2qPOdxO6.jpg</td><td>Animation, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>39176</td><td>The Awakening</td><td>The Awakening</td><td>en</td><td>When a British archaeologist violates an Egyptian queen's tomb, her evil spirit enters his daughter.</td><td>They thought they had buried her forever!</td><td>1980-07-31</td><td>/3nHKBehsbgWMff79ICGtVpO7TJt.jpg</td><td>5.592</td><td>61</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/l4HQOJ1f0LyVinEMTMqNL2S9QBe.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>3124</td><td>The Evil of Frankenstein</td><td>The Evil of Frankenstein</td><td>en</td><td>Once hounded from his castle by outraged villagers for creating a monstrous living being, Baron Frankenstein returns to Karlstaad. High in the mountains they stumble on the body of the creature, perfectly preserved in the ice. He is brought back to life with the help of the hypnotist Zoltan who now controls the creature. Can Frankenstein break Zoltan's hypnotic spell that incites the monster to commit these horrific murders or will Zoltan induce the creature to destroy its creator?</td><td>He's never been more shocking! shocking! shocking!</td><td>1964-05-08</td><td>/2lrrmS0G1rc6dXk3vWTJnTl3jeL.jpg</td><td>5.586</td><td>73</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>86</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bmZNXRwM7P0YSkSJIkLDd7nb309.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>123720</td><td>Frankenstein (Hammer) Collection</td></tr><tr><td>933415</td><td>Deep Fear</td><td>Deep Fear</td><td>fr</td><td>Three students celebrate their graduation with a visit of the Paris catacombs. When they discover a bunker, little do they know it's not the only thing that Nazi have left behind...</td><td>NA</td><td>2022-07-10</td><td>/pB3Mlvh8jfz2CvqLlZBB10BnBvn.jpg</td><td>5.583</td><td>10</td><td>4.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bR5acjvDf7Mw04FDm0nHW0alOHl.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>281869</td><td>The Bunnyman Massacre</td><td>The Bunnyman Massacre</td><td>en</td><td>Joe and Bunnyman's adventure continue in a rural ghost town. Bunnyman's blood lust knows no bounds, as he slaughters indiscriminately anything that crosses his path. Joe is all too happy to encourage his behavior, selling the dead victims as beef jerky in his local store. In addition to Joe's body disposal problem, the local sheriff becomes suspicious with the disappearance of a few of his deputies. His investigation crosses paths with two persistent sisters, that refuse to die at the hands of Joe and Bunnyman. Some will live, and some will die, but all will be damaged..</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-04-18</td><td>/yXI0A0PODQ00qU89WX5OLszLBy9.jpg</td><td>5.576</td><td>36</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>643610</td><td>Bunnyman Collection</td></tr><tr><td>20323</td><td>Long Weekend</td><td>Long Weekend</td><td>en</td><td>Peter and Carla, a couple whose marriage is faltering, decide to go on a camping weekend. When they become lost, the pair sets up camp on a remote beach that doesn't seem to be on any map. At first the trip is the romantic getaway they imagined – then slowly things begin to go wrong. After Peter disrespects the unspoiled habitat, it seems as if the surroundings are exacting revenge on the couple, as insects, animals, and then nature itself become the enemy.</td><td>NA</td><td>2009-08-14</td><td>/szfiY3ycr0SBAjb81og8tIzKgGj.jpg</td><td>5.573</td><td>115</td><td>5.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>87</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/y1OcayHujFSFIbUGR7tt2rW81JX.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>148636</td><td>The Hunchback</td><td>The Hunchback</td><td>en</td><td>Based on the novel, a young gypsy becomes a Minister's obsession in 1483. Only the bell ringer and her husband and the court of miracles can save her.</td><td>NA</td><td>1997-03-16</td><td>/xch2lgon3mGYT9jT0SMFpBPdSPv.jpg</td><td>5.57</td><td>35</td><td>5.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>98</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/i0ASC3UImFvXHoktdqHLZrP5P6B.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Romance, TV Movie</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>354924</td><td>The Dead Room</td><td>The Dead Room</td><td>en</td><td>When a terrified family flees a desolate southern New Zealand farmhouse, two cynical scientists and a young psychic are sent to investigate their claims of a haunting. There they encounter a powerful spirit that will protect the house's secrets at all costs.</td><td>There is an intruder. It's you.</td><td>2015-10-01</td><td>/ptGTI1LbvvVKJToYxtzZpFfVyDh.jpg</td><td>5.566</td><td>92</td><td>5.1</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>80</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/uVFpy126L3JiFSu69hyGxR0tRLM.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27084</td><td>Invasion of the Bee Girls</td><td>Invasion of the Bee Girls</td><td>en</td><td>Neil Agar, a security agent with the State Department, is dispatched to Peckham, California to investigate the death of a bacteriologist working at government-sponsored Brandt Research. His investigation is soon complicated by a growing number of deaths, all men who died of congestive heart failure caused by sexual exhaustion.</td><td>They'll Love The Very Life Out Of Your Body!</td><td>1973-06-01</td><td>/wIE6Fsq9KHTwBUOWwy1q9HwOXz3.jpg</td><td>5.565</td><td>47</td><td>4.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8A0spwCdHvII4EYAryvIiT9nBxV.jpg</td><td>Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>257117</td><td>Blood Punch</td><td>Blood Punch</td><td>en</td><td>Milton, a college dropout, was only supposed to cook meth for one day. Broken out of rehab by a brash young woman and her trigger-happy (\"ex\") boyfriend and driven to a remote cabin the woods, Milton finds himself drawn into a dangerous love triangle gone haywire. The couple's deadpan half-truths spin around Milton like a song on repeat. They seem to read him like an open book, until a mysterious message opens his eyes to his cursed existence. With unlimited ammunition, any hunting tool they could desire, and an ever-growing body count, for what did Milton really sign up?</td><td>NA</td><td>2014-02-21</td><td>/qQZkm86UV5qiRPbcWQOPN6iF6HN.jpg</td><td>5.565</td><td>89</td><td>6.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/69kwyBRuR2S3uEttJpb6ALc0MkH.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>704630</td><td>Asylum: Twisted Horror & Fantasy Tales</td><td>Asylum: Twisted Horror & Fantasy Tales</td><td>en</td><td>Brandon prepares to give his last stand-up comedy show. As his stories and jokes pass, the public begins to cheer up. But at that precise moment Brandon will realize that these stories have a strong relationship with his past. More than he imagines.</td><td>Madness has no limits</td><td>2020-07-02</td><td>/3rxKic2PDrheSXMCG82vm9LAm8e.jpg</td><td>5.565</td><td>25</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/lenWA6m7LQqviAwrv1bl48q4QuN.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>879917</td><td>Jack and Jill</td><td>Jack and Jill</td><td>en</td><td>A horror retelling of the nursery rhyme Jack and Jill. A group of friends grieving a recent loss meet up with one another only to discover they are being hunted by Jack and Jill.</td><td>Bodies Come Tumbling After</td><td>2021-09-17</td><td>/d1EZ3EAxPxCZbZnj8s32fqW8Z4D.jpg</td><td>5.559</td><td>27</td><td>5.6</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>90</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/iJDIkQbfOzJpwUvBmCMBI10K0Wi.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror</td><td>980782</td><td>The Legend of Jack and Jill Collection</td></tr><tr><td>21910</td><td>I Sell the Dead</td><td>I Sell the Dead</td><td>en</td><td>18th century justice catches up with a pair of grave robbers. With only a few hours to go before his date with the guillotine, Arthur Blake tells his life story to Father Francis Duffy. Before long, Arthur spills the beans on how he got started in the grim corpse peddling business with seasoned ghoul Willie Grimes.</td><td>Never trust a corpse.</td><td>2008-08-07</td><td>/1KjIGzUho6NCE7dDJP1QyRnMRRK.jpg</td><td>5.557</td><td>134</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/9lPCj5JIgw5UJhtMOJ3L09vmS0H.jpg</td><td>Comedy, Drama, Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>24198</td><td>AVH: Alien vs. Hunter</td><td>AVH: Alien vs. Hunter</td><td>en</td><td>A journalist named Lee Custler (William Katt) is out jogging when a flying object passes behind him and crashes. Sheriff Joel Armstrong (Collin Brock) picks him up and they go to check it out. They find an abandoned caravan close to where the object crashed. As they discover the object and realize it is a spaceship, an Alien emerges. The Alien (resembling a giant spider with a lizard-like head and torso) then chases them, after which Lee flees to the car. However Armstrong makes a stand, trips, falls and is killed by the Alien that then leaves. A terrified Tammy finds Lee and they call the local authorities but their car is destroyed by the Alien.</td><td>NA</td><td>2007-12-18</td><td>/46whh6JCDqRFxHfKssePScUvD8D.jpg</td><td>5.557</td><td>31</td><td>2.3</td><td>500000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>85</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/52PBC5h3wWYM7rhSD2ipTW0xk4U.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror, Science Fiction</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>30155</td><td>Naked Fear</td><td>Naked Fear</td><td>en</td><td>Diana arrives in a town to start a new job. She's threatened into working as an exotic dancer. She's later kidnapped and let loose naked in the wilderness as prey for the psycho hunter, like many women before her. Will she survive?</td><td>Hunting Humans is the Ultimate Thrill</td><td>2007-04-01</td><td>/niJO1FhGO5rjBHJgrht0xAve1QU.jpg</td><td>5.556</td><td>50</td><td>5.3</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/sNBMe2hyJA6SqQ94hBGhQNe1s4V.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>110041</td><td>Naked Fear Collection</td></tr><tr><td>131689</td><td>The Wicked</td><td>The Wicked</td><td>en</td><td>A Group of teenagers test the legend of an immortal witch and get more than they bargained for. It's almost Halloween and six young people, spooked but not undaunted by the folklore surrounding an old haunted house, make their way to the abode of the legendary Wicked, perhaps hoping to provoke the malevolent witch, but clearly not prepared for what they've certainly unleashed.</td><td>The Wicked Will Get You...</td><td>2013-03-20</td><td>/tpkdYglyMhTi1UkmgFn3jTAwPLz.jpg</td><td>5.555</td><td>77</td><td>4.2</td><td>800000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>105</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/s6aWP0DEaNdIYCz5n55GNwNN40F.jpg</td><td>Fantasy, Horror, Th