on Dr Jekyll experiments on newly deceased women determined to discover an elixir for immortal life. Success enables his spectacular transformation into the beautiful but psychotic Sister Hyde who stalks the dark alleys of Whitechapel for young, innocent, female victims, ensuring continuation of the bloodstained research. With each transformation Sister Hyde becomes the more dominant personality, determined to eventually suppress the frail, ineffectual Dr Jekyll forever.</td><td>PARENTS: Be sure your children are sufficiently mature to witness the intimate details of this frank and revealing film.</td><td>1971-10-17</td><td>/mm3cm6hLHYwuB5bRim1PIM6guvN.jpg</td><td>5.515</td><td>67</td><td>6.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>97</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/bz8ZdPk44rbOzke6YZ0iRvTk6Lr.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>464805</td><td>Narcosatánicos Diabólicos</td><td>Narcosatánicos Diabólicos</td><td>es</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td><td>1991-03-07</td><td>/f2FYGsJPJWLnsnzI3wHO6vQP7LM.jpg</td><td>5.515</td><td>43</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>0</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>NA</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>27122</td><td>The Attic</td><td>The Attic</td><td>en</td><td>Emma has a strong aversion towards her family’s new house, especially the attic. After moving in, she becomes miserable and reclusive. The rest of her family also seems unhappy and unsettled. The situation escalates one day when Emma is in the attic alone. All of a sudden someone who looks exactly like Emma attacks her viciously.</td><td>NA</td><td>2008-01-15</td><td>/lFUtefvTdSTlxaEQBcKh0AQ2Lwt.jpg</td><td>5.514</td><td>34</td><td>3.5</td><td>700000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>88</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/euA1SmMrHbqaiPjYAWwHvVZc2gK.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>537476</td><td>I Trapped the Devil</td><td>I Trapped the Devil</td><td>en</td><td>A man descends into paranoia after trapping what he believes to be the devil in his basement, but things take a dark turn when his family unexpectedly arrive for Christmas.</td><td>NA</td><td>2019-04-26</td><td>/95ioOrJWlUTKskXpGLDlOpahu8.jpg</td><td>5.513</td><td>69</td><td>5.0</td><td>1000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>84</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qZGSs3kR9D8rHuzMfVGxzuOuXjk.jpg</td><td>Drama, Horror, Mystery</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>156597</td><td>Stage Fright</td><td>Stage Fright</td><td>en</td><td>A snobby musical theater camp is terrorized by a blood-thirsty killer who hates musical theater.</td><td>Sing Your Heart Out!</td><td>2014-04-03</td><td>/vrS2t2Pz4jO2qV1cY9of4CqQBP6.jpg</td><td>5.511</td><td>119</td><td>5.5</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>89</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/7YUB91f71QEBsccsQuIeqHvIrxy.jpg</td><td>Horror</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>204260</td><td>더 웹툰: 예고살인</td><td>Killer Toon</td><td>ko</td><td>A web-comic artist finds that a series of murders are occurring that have a disturbing resemblance to the images in her work.</td><td>Spirits Never Forget</td><td>2013-06-27</td><td>/9ojbUahh8McTbR92Qf69ocWnggE.jpg</td><td>5.511</td><td>73</td><td>6.8</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>104</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/yDESXMpxa9Z29qqKcw9DTfePevu.jpg</td><td>Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>522246</td><td>Eerie</td><td>Eerie</td><td>tl</td><td>The unexpected and gruesome death of a student threatens the existence of an old Catholic school for girls. Pat Consolacion, the school guidance counselor, involves herself with the students in the hopes of helping them cope, and at the same time uncover the mysteries of the student’s death. Most students suspect of the strict and borderline abusive Mother Alice, who also threatened Pat’s tenure in the school because of her continuous meddling with the case. But Pat’s unusual talents lead her to knowing Eri, a former student who's been watching the whole school for years. Piece by piece, Pat uncovers the secret of the school and the monster that it nurtured for the past century.</td><td>NA</td><td>2018-12-03</td><td>/duEI37Qjtt1WaiOzZzVlkI6JO2z.jpg</td><td>5.51</td><td>69</td><td>5.4</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/qPTEsaY7MIg2OJyrO2xEG6lxG4X.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>16371</td><td>텔 미 썸딩</td><td>Tell Me Something</td><td>ko</td><td>In Seoul, parts not matching of severed copses of three men are found in cars and bags left in public spaces.</td><td>Crimes This Horrible... Are Better Left Unsolved.</td><td>1999-11-13</td><td>/jRyGUU4WiK8EOQqeIUvhutITFlr.jpg</td><td>5.508</td><td>45</td><td>6.1</td><td>0.0</td><td>68416.0</td><td>118</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/NzeQT7T1ofj0HwadV348ImCmgU.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr><tr><td>100183</td><td>Outpost: Black Sun</td><td>Outpost: Black Sun</td><td>en</td><td>A pair of investigators team up with a Special Forces Unit to venture deep inside a war raging between the military and a massive army of Nazi Zombie Stormtroopers. Their mission is to fight their way behind enemy lines, locate the technology at the source of this growing threat and prevent the seemingly inevitable rise of the 4th Reich.</td><td>War in Hell</td><td>2012-01-01</td><td>/7RY2KyEsBB68qLDiheRN8bm45Ku.jpg</td><td>5.508</td><td>84</td><td>5.1</td><td>3000000.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>101</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/ek1LnoYGUsGOm7MYriJq0jzVkYk.jpg</td><td>Action, Horror</td><td>108804</td><td>Outpost Collection</td></tr><tr><td>40528</td><td>Giallo a Venezia</td><td>Giallo in Venice</td><td>it</td><td>Venice:  The bodies of a married couple, Flavia and Fabio, are discovered on the dockside.  She has drowned and he has been stabbed to death with a large pair of scissors.  Marzia, Flavia's best friend, is questioned by the police and a chain of slaying is set in motion.  The victims include a prostitute who is stabbed in the crotch; Marzia's lover, who is shot in the kneecaps before being doused in petrol and set alight; and Marzia herself, tied to a kitchen table and dismembered, before being stuffed in a fridge.  Meanwhile, extended flashbacks  reveal that Fabio gained perverse pleasure from forcing his young wife to take part in degrading sexual acts...</td><td>NA</td><td>1979-12-31</td><td>/ty5K5c4PfBWYRbUkxMcb9VSh04O.jpg</td><td>5.507</td><td>23</td><td>5.7</td><td>0.0</td><td>0.0</td><td>91</td><td>Released</td><td>false</td><td>/8YTiljWlstrl4sODZBFNU9RsQjW.jpg</td><td>Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller</td><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr></tbody></table>Showing the first 3775 rows.</div>"
